window.AKK_FORENSIC_PSYCHOLOGICAL_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_FORENSIC_PSYCHOLOGICAL_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1,"title":"Chapter 1: The Cat Pregnant Woman Case: The Woman with a Cat in Her Womb","paragraphs":["Meow, meow~","As dawn broke, the sky gradually turned a pearly white, and the piercing sound of a cat's cry echoed intermittently from next door.","At first listen, it almost sounded like a baby wailing at the top of its lungs.","Meow, meow~","The sound grew increasingly shrill and miserable.","Was it that annoying pregnant woman next door torturing a cat? But she didn't even own a cat!","Mu Mian got up and walked to the neighboring apartment. Just as she was about to knock, she noticed the door was ajar.","\"Ms. Li, please stop making noise, and kindly keep your cat quiet too!\"","There was no response, only the cat's continued cries, mixed with the faint sound of sharp claws scratching against something. In the silent early morning, it felt somewhat spine-chilling.","A familiar scent wafted faintly through the air.","The metallic smell of fresh blood.","\"Is anyone there?\"","The voice echoed in the hallway.","In the dim light filtering through the cream-colored lace curtains, she could see the pregnant woman lying on the wooden floor.","The floor had already been stained a dark red with blood.","Her expression was contorted, her body twisted in an unnatural position. Her mouth was tightly sealed with black duct tape, and her hands were bound behind her back with rope.","Meow, meow~","The pitiful cat's cries were coming from inside her round, slightly quivering belly.","Her stomach bulged and pulsed, the centipede-like wound stitches on it trembling as something inside struggled to break free.","Woo~ Woo~","The wail of police sirens shattered the early morning tranquility of Ziweili Residential Area.","Ziweili was a middle-class neighborhood in the old town of Jiangzhou City. While property prices were quite high, the infrastructure was outdated. Some buildings didn't even have elevators installed, let alone security cameras.","The complex was arranged with four units per building, two households per unit. The crime scene was in Room 541, Unit 3, Building 8.","The closed layout of the complex meant there were no onlookers gathered at the crime scene. It was eerily quiet.","Several police officers pushed open the door. The first thing they saw was the woman lying in a pool of blood. Her face was contorted, her bloodshot eyes bulging, as if she had endured immense suffering before death.","The woman's top was pulled up, revealing her cut-open belly. Her internal organs were fully exposed, as if savaged by a ferocious beast. The everted flesh was covered in scratch marks.","Next to the corpse lay a toolbox containing a full set of dissection instruments. The scissors and scalpel were stained with blood.","The furniture and items in the room were neatly arranged, with no signs of a struggle.","On the fabric sofa curled a small figure. Her entire body was scrunched up into a ball. She wore bloodstained plastic gloves on her hands and a white fluffy pajama with SpongeBob SquarePants prints, spattered with blood stains. In her arms, she cradled a blood-covered kitten. On her feet were disposable shoe covers.","Meow~","Hearing the noise, the little cat with a notched ear struggled slightly and let out a cry.","\"Didn't the caller say there was only one victim?\" Zhang approached the sofa, about to check the \"body\" when suddenly, he found himself staring into a pair of jet-black eyes.","Zhang stumbled back several steps in fright. \"Ah, it's come back to life!\"","The other officers rolled their eyes at him. \"Zhang Xiaoqiang, what are you yelling about? Can't you see that's a living person?\"","Zhang watched in disbelief as the \"corpse\" sat up. Her movements were slow, pausing after each action as if she needed to gather strength for the next.","Zhang asked confusedly, \"Who are you?\"","She glanced at them briefly before quickly averting her gaze, looking down at the cat in her arms. \"Hello, I'm the one who called the police. My name is Mu Mian.\"","All the officers present stared at Mu Mian in surprise.","She looked like a high school student, with shoulder-length short hair and a small stature. Her skin was deathly pale, and her expression was blank. The blood-stained white pajamas made her look like a killer from a horror movie, and a mentally unstable one at that.","\"Miss Mu, you're incredibly brave to sleep at a crime scene!\" Zhang was utterly baffled. \"What if the killer had come back? It's too dangerous.\" Though she looked more like the killer herself.","Mu Mian didn't respond to him. She kept her head down and continued her statement mechanically:","\"This morning at 4:21 AM, I was awakened by the sound of my neighbor's cat. At 4:35 AM, I came over to knock on my neighbor's door—the victim's door. The door wasn't closed, so I glanced inside and found my neighbor lying on the floor...\"","Her voice sounded like it was generated by AI, flat and emotionless.","Zhang couldn't help whispering to Wang, who was crouched on the ground collecting footprints:","\"Wang, do you think she's lying? Advisor Lin said that when witnesses or suspects recall case details, they usually follow emotional cues and start with the most important parts. But she's narrating in chronological order, and with such precise times. It's very likely she prepared this in advance.\"","Wang nodded in agreement and whispered back, \"I think her mental state is off too. Look, she can't even make eye contact with us. She must be feeling guilty. We should take her back to the station and let Captain Fang's team question her.\"","Mu Mian seemed not to hear their whispered conversation and continued her mechanical narration of the events:","\"I heard the cat's cries coming from her stomach. At that time, the corpse still had some warmth—about 34.5°C. Within 10 hours after death, the body temperature drops by 1°C per hour. Although it's early spring, we're having a cold snap, and there's no air conditioning in the room. So we need to use winter data, with a coefficient of about 0.7. Roughly estimated, her time of death should be between 3:30 and 4:00 AM...\"","Zhang pointed at the victim's stomach, his mouth agape. \"Wait, what did you say? Where did you say the cat's cries were coming from?\"","Everyone present felt a chill run down their spines as they looked at the victim's mutilated abdomen, all thinking of something terrifying.","\"At 4:37 AM, I dialed the emergency number. At 4:39 AM, I put on gloves and used scissors to cut open the stitches on the victim's stomach, rescuing this poor little kitten. I recorded the entire process on video. I tried my best to protect the crime scene. If you need it, I can send you the video.\"","Finally finished, Mu Mian let out a sigh of relief.","These people were so rude, constantly interrupting her. Fortunately, she had strong resistance to interference and was able to describe the course of events fluently and clearly.","Meow~ The dirty little cat meowed loudly, as if agreeing with her words.","Zhang repeated incredulously, \"You're saying the killer stuffed a cat into the victim's stomach?\"","\"Could it be that the killer, not satisfied with just murdering the victim, stuffed a cat inside to further desecrate the corpse?\"","Amidst their shock, those present began to discuss the killer's motive.","\"It wasn't to desecrate the corpse,\" Mu Mian corrected, looking at the victim. \"She was still alive at that time.\"","\"Still alive?\"","\"She's right.\" Old Qin, the forensic expert, had already conducted a preliminary examination of the victim's body.","He explained, \"The victim was about 8 months pregnant. The killer removed the fetus along with the placenta from the victim's womb, then stuffed a live animal into her uterus before stitching up her belly.\"","Old Qin glanced at Mu Mian and the kitten in her arms, then used tweezers to extract a cat hair from the victim's abdominal cavity.","\"It must have been a cat. Look, most of the wounds on the inner abdomen show vital reaction, which proves the victim endured immense torture while still alive.\"","Mu Mian glanced at Old Qin, then quickly averted her gaze, muttering softly, \"The cause of death was hypovolemic shock.\"","\"That's correct.\" Old Qin suddenly felt that this Mu Mian looked familiar, as if he had seen her somewhere before.","Zhang exclaimed, \"My God, how cruel can the killer be?\"","Mu Mian agreed, \"Yes. But his killing method is very creative.\"","Creative... Zhang felt a chill run down his spine. How deranged must the killer be to stuff a live cat into a pregnant woman's belly?","Zhang turned to Mu Mian and asked puzzledly, \"What about the victim's baby? When you cut open the victim's stomach, didn't you see the baby inside?\"","\"The killer took it away,\" Mu Mian said, her eyelids drooping as she struggled against sleep. \"Maybe they ate it, kept it as a souvenir, or threw it away. You should ask the killer about that.\"","\"How perverted!\"","\"I've told you all the information I know,\" Mu Mian placed the cat in Zhang's arms. \"I need to go to work now. It's my first day on the job, and I can't be late.\"","Zhang's expression was somewhat troubled. \"But you can't leave now. You need to come back to the police station with us to give a statement.\"","\"Is it to the City Police Bureau?\" she asked.","\"Yes.\"","Mu Mian thought for a moment, then conceded, \"Alright.\"","Zhang had expected to have to \"pressure\" her a bit to get her to cooperate properly. He didn't anticipate she would be so agreeable.","\"It's on my way anyway,\" Mu Mian flashed him a stiff smile, her tone carrying a hint of excitement.","Zhang shuddered.","This girl looked quite cute, but when she smiled, why was it so eerie? Her smile was rigid, resembling the forced grin of a puppet doll from a horror movie.","Moreover, why did she seem so happy about going to the police station?"]},{"number":2,"title":"Chapter 2: Case of Human Cat Litter: Can You Donate Your Body to Me","paragraphs":["The police conducted a thorough search of Room 541. This apartment was likely the scene of the first crime.","There were no signs of forced entry on the door lock, and no suspicious traces were found inside. Only the victim's fingerprints were discovered in the apartment.","The deceased was Li Yan, 28 years old, unmarried, without a steady job, living alone, and 8 months pregnant.","Squeak~","A very soft sound of the door opening came from behind, and Mu Mian, who was sprawled on the table, immediately opened her eyes.","She wasn't sure how long she had been in this quiet interrogation room, but fortunately, she had managed to get a rare good sleep.","She decided to renovate her bedroom, modeling it after this interrogation room. Maybe then she could sleep this soundly every night.","The door was pushed open, and two people walked in.","The first person Mu Mian saw was the talkative young police officer from this morning. Behind him was a tall man wearing a black leather jacket, with sharp features and a fierce expression.","Mu Mian had seen his photo before; he was Fang Rui, the leader of the Special Crime Unit. Her eyes lit up slightly. This man had an excellent physique, with well-proportioned muscle lines, originally very suitable to be a human specimen.","Mu Mian stared at him intently, her burning gaze like a sharp scalpel. In her mind, she had already begun to dissect him, separating all the organs and muscles from his body—it would make a perfect skeleton.","Mu Mian liked bones. She had already collected many beautiful bones, but this was the first time she had seen such a perfect human skeleton.","What a pity, she thought, that this was a living person, and he would probably live for a very long time.","Zhang noticed that Mu Mian's previous dejection had disappeared and was a bit surprised.","Why had Mu Mian's empty eyes suddenly become so bright and focused? Zhang glanced at Fang Rui again, wondering if it was their boss's good looks that had captivated her.","Ignoring Mu Mian's intense gaze, Fang Rui pulled out a chair and sat opposite her, forcing Mu Mian to meet his eyes.","Although she had practiced for many years, Mu Mian still found it difficult to maintain eye contact with others.","\"Hello.\"","Mu Mian forced herself to look into his eyes, thinking this would make her expression appear more sincere.","\"May I ask if you'd be willing to donate your body to me after you die? I would take very good care of it...\"","The air seemed to freeze for a moment.","Fang Rui's expression showed a hint of bewilderment, but he quickly adjusted back to his cold, expressionless mode.","If it weren't for the fact that this was an interrogation room and Zhang was sitting beside him, he would have very much liked to pick Mu Mian up and throw her out.","She looked so small, he could lift her with one hand.","\"Miss Mu, please understand that this is an interrogation room. Be serious!\" Zhang tapped the table, quickly interrupting Mu Mian's words, afraid she might say something even stranger.","Zhang cautiously glanced at Fang Rui, who remained composed.","As expected of their boss, having seen many things, his emotions were quite stable. There were quite a few girls who pursued Fang Rui, and many who desired his body, but this was the first time Zhang had seen someone coveting his corpse.","Mu Mian corrected Zhang, \"I was asking very seriously.\"","\"...\"","\"Then I'll answer you very seriously,\" Fang Rui refused, \"I currently have no plans to donate my body.\"","\"Alright.\" Mu Mian slowly shifted her gaze, landing on Zhang.","Zhang immediately glared at her fiercely, about to prevent Mu Mian from setting her sights on his body, when he heard Mu Mian say softly, \"Weren't you going to take notes?\"","So... had he been overthinking?","\"Your name?\" Zhang opened his notebook.","\"Mu Mian.\"","\"Age?\"","\"I'll be 25 in 106 days.\"","\"No need to be so specific. How was your relationship with the deceased?\"","\"Not good.\"","Zhang's pen paused slightly, \"Can you elaborate on that?\"","\"I don't understand her interpersonal relationships,\" Mu Mian thought for a moment, then frankly said, \"Her relationships seemed very complicated, beyond my comprehension.\"","Zhang's eyes lit up: \"For example?\"","\"She wasn't married, but she was pregnant. Her boyfriend was someone else's husband. Her child might not be her boyfriend's...\"","Zhang was speechless. All these relationships could be summed up as \"the deceased was having an affair.\" How was that complicated?","Zhang continued asking, \"Did you see anyone enter your neighbor's house last night, or hear any unusual sounds from next door?\"","\"Not before I fell asleep.\"","Mu Mian lowered her head and stared at the table surface. This table had seen some years; its surface was peeling in places, looking pitted and uneven. She felt inexplicably irritated.","She emphasized, \"I went to sleep at ten. I'm used to going to bed early.\"","\"What about after you fell asleep?\" Fang Rui suddenly interjected into their conversation.","Mu Mian looked up at him for a moment, then quickly averted her gaze, shrinking her head into her scarf like a quail.","Silence, a long silence.","Fang Rui asked, \"Is this question difficult to answer?\" His tone was calm, not at all aggressive.","Mu Mian's lips moved, and with an expression of \"trying hard to conceal something, but not succeeding very well,\" she explained slowly:","\"It's very difficult for people to notice outside sounds after they fall asleep. That's common sense.\"","\"Just now you were sleeping deeply, but our soft door opening still woke you up. This proves that you're very sensitive to sound. You dislike noise, don't you?\"","When she heard the word \"noise,\" Mu Mian unconsciously nodded in agreement with his words. She really did hate noise.","\"The soundproofing in your apartment complex isn't very good. Many residents reported hearing noises from the deceased's apartment last night.\"","Fang Rui's fingers lightly tapped the table, as if tapping on Mu Mian's psychological defenses. \"So why didn't you, as the deceased's neighbor who is sensitive to sound, hear those noises last night?\"","The soundproofing in that apartment complex was very poor. Even if the killer had been as quiet as possible while dissecting the victim in the room, it would have been impossible not to hear any sound at all.","Zhang and his team had interviewed the residents above and below the deceased's apartment. They all mentioned that around 2 AM last night, they had heard the sound of objects being dragged across the floor from Room 541. But because the deceased often made noise in the middle of the night and had a bad temper, they didn't go to complain.","Yet Mu Mian said she hadn't heard any sounds last night. It was obvious that Mu Mian might be lying.","\"Miss Mu, what were you doing last night? Is there something you're uncomfortable talking about?\"","Mu Mian's fingers traced the scratches on the table surface. She wanted to hide the scratches, but doing so only made them more apparent.","Just when Fang Rui thought Mu Mian wasn't going to speak, she suddenly looked at him and said, \"I'm not the killer.\"","\"I believe you.\"","Mu Mian smiled at him, \"Thank you for your trust.\"","Zhang looked at their conversation in confusion, wondering if he had missed something. Why did he suddenly not understand what was going on?","\"But how can you prove you're not the killer?\"","Mu Mian quickly wiped the smile off her face. She didn't intend to speak anymore. She could prove it, but doing so would reveal her secret. So she decided to remain silent.","At this moment, a knock on the door interrupted their conversation.","The person knocking was Officer Chen, who was in charge of personnel. She looked at Zhang, \"Captain Fang, sorry to interrupt you.\"","\"Sister Chen, what's the matter?\"","\"The chief held a welcome party for the new colleague who joined today. The new forensic pathologist, Dr. Mu, said she was trapped here and asked me to rescue her. I don't quite understand what she meant; I think she might be lost. So I wanted to ask if you've seen her come by?\"","\"We don't have any Dr. Mu here.\"","\"Strange, she said she was right here and asked me to come find her around 9 o'clock.\"","Fang Rui pointed at Mu Mian, who was sitting obediently across from them: \"I think she's the Dr. Mu you're looking for.\"","Zhang stared at Mu Mian with wide eyes, \"You're actually a forensic pathologist?\" Wouldn't that make her professionally qualified to kill someone?","\"I,\" Mu Mian raised her hand high, \"I'm here.\"","Officer Chen frowned slightly. Didn't the chief just say he had recruited a top talent? How come it's a young girl? She couldn't still be in college, could she?","Fang Rui said, \"Officer Chen, don't new employees need to undergo a physical examination? Why don't you take her for one first?\"","\"Alright.\" Officer Chen agreed casually, then thought, didn't she already have a physical before being hired? But this young girl did look a bit sickly, so it might be necessary to check her again.","Fang Rui insisted, \"Take her now, please.\"","Officer Chen glanced at Mu Mian's dazed state and said, \"Alright then, the hospital is just next door anyway.\"","Mu Mian's smile stiffened. She looked at Fang Rui very seriously, then casually averted her gaze.","After Mu Mian left, Zhang asked curiously, \"Boss, why do you keep pressing that question? Maybe she was just really tired yesterday and slept deeply?\"","Zhang felt that this question wasn't particularly helpful for solving the case.","\"I just want to confirm my suspicions,\" Fang Rui replied, his gaze fixed on Mu Mian's retreating figure with an inscrutable expression.","Zhang furrowed his brow. Their boss rarely focused so intently on anyone—except for the most vicious criminals in prison.","So—","\"Boss, you're not suspecting she has a split personality, are you?\" Zhang had a sudden realization. He speculated, \"Is it like this? After Mu Mian fell asleep yesterday, her other personality emerged and killed the victim. And her current personality has no memory of what happened last night.","No wonder she's so tired today. It's probably because she was exhausted from killing someone last night. Plus, she's a forensic expert, so she should be skilled at killing and dissecting.\"","Zhang felt his deduction was brilliant, logically sound, and entirely plausible. He felt he hadn't let down the police academy's careful training.","However, he saw Fang Rui looking at him with a puzzled expression.","Zhang began to lose confidence. \"Boss, did I say something wrong?\"","Fang Rui said, \"Very imaginative.\" His tone shifted slightly, \"Why don't you quit and become a novelist?\"","Zhang: \"...\" That was certainly impossible. He had worked so hard to become a civil servant!"]},{"number":3,"title":"Chapter 3: Case of the Cat Embryo Man: Psychological Test","paragraphs":["The Jiangzhou City Police Department had recruited many new talents this year through their talent introduction program. To show their importance to these new hires, the department specifically held a simple welcome party for them.","Because most of the positions were for police technical roles with low physical requirements, this batch of new recruits was generally quite slim and weak-looking.","Even so, Mu Mian stood out prominently among them.","She was like a solitary island, having almost zero interaction with others.","\"Fang Rui, Consultant Lin, what do you think of this forensic expert Mu?\"","Chief Wang Yong and Fang Rui stood outside the hall, watching Mu Mian through the window.","Next to them stood a young man named Lin Sen, a criminal psychology expert. He frowned slightly as he observed Mu Mian.","Mu Mian was staring blankly at a fake tree, completely out of place in the lively environment.","\"Chief, is she really a forensic expert?\" Zhang, who was passing by with some documents, couldn't help but chime in when he heard Wang Yong talking about Mu Mian. \"I doubt she's even graduated from university. Did she get in through the back door?\"","Wang Yong glanced at Zhang, who immediately shut up, but his eyes still sparkled with gossip.","Fang Rui reprimanded him, \"Go deliver your documents!\"","\"These documents aren't urgent,\" Zhang muttered under his breath. \"Chief, is this forensic expert Mu really the talent you headhunted?\"","\"Indeed she is. Several police departments were competing for her, but luckily I acted fast and got her first,\" Chief Wang boasted proudly, then handed Mu Mian's file to Fang Rui. \"Take a look at her resume. She's a Ph.D., you know.\"","In recent years, Jiangzhou City had experienced several serial killing cases. Wang Yong had established a Special Crime Unit specifically to investigate such cases.","However, he was having trouble choosing the right members for the team. The older detectives, though experienced, were still using outdated methods to solve cases and often found themselves at a loss when faced with unusual cases.","So he wanted to select some new blood to join this special unit.","Mu Mian was one of the talents he had his eye on.","Fang Rui casually flipped through Mu Mian's resume:","Mu Mian, 25 years old, graduated from S University with a major in Clinical Medicine, holding two Ph.D. degrees in Neuroscience and Pathology...","Fang Rui's gaze fell on the self-introduction page:","\"After dissecting my first corpse at the age of twelve (an adorable little squirrel flattened by a car wheel), I was determined to become a forensic expert. As of the day you received this resume (February 10th), I have dissected 103 human corpses: 58 Black, 35 White, 5 Asian. (Notice that 5 are missing? This proves you've read my resume carefully. I'll tell you why they weren't included once you hire me). This clearly shows how much I need this job to increase my understanding of the internal structure of my fellow countrymen's bodies...\"","Fang Rui's mouth twitched slightly. This self-introduction was indeed quite strange.","But then again, Mu Mian was strange in every aspect. This resume suited her personality perfectly.","Chief Wang said, \"We've pretty much selected all the members for our Special Crime Unit, except for a forensic expert. Old Qin would have been the best choice, but unfortunately, he's retiring next month. This Mu Mian is the one I'm most satisfied with among the new recruits.\"","Fang Rui glanced at Mu Mian again. Her gaze had finally left that aesthetically unpleasing plastic tree, only to fixate on a pot of fake flowers.","He really couldn't understand what the Chief found satisfying about this young girl. She was like a little robot, and a malfunctioning one at that. Was it because of her impressive academic credentials?","Fang Rui said with dissatisfaction, \"Chief, I don't accept her joining our Special Crime Unit!\"","\"Why not?\"","\"Because she's got her eye on the boss's...\" Zhang was about to explain for Fang Rui but was silenced by his glare.","\"She doesn't look like she'll be easy to manage,\" Fang Rui rubbed his brow. \"I can't handle a team member like that.\"","\"But she looks quite obedient.\"","\"Looking obedient is useless. She's not here to be looked at. Choose someone else!\" Fang Rui insisted.","\"I don't agree with her joining either,\" Lin Sen chimed in.","\"Why? Because she looks young and you think she's incapable? Or are you discriminating against women?\"","Lin Sen explained, \"She's likely an autistic individual.\"","Wang Yong frowned, \"That's impossible, right? Aren't autistic people unable to take care of themselves? She looks quite...\"","Wang Yong didn't finish his sentence. Just by observing Mu Mian a little more closely, one could notice that she seemed to never make eye contact with others.","\"She avoids eye contact, has difficulty communicating with others, and exhibits stereotypical behaviors,\" Lin Sen explained. \"She might be a high-functioning autistic individual who has recovered well. But even so, she probably can't work normally. So I don't recommend hiring her.\"","\"Lin Sen, are you sure she's autistic?\" Fang Rui was a bit surprised. \"I've never seen an autistic person who talks so much!\"","Lin Sen gave him a cold look.","Wang Yong was also skeptical of Lin Sen's judgment.","\"When we selected new recruits, we did an initial psychological screening... Look at page seven of the file, there are test results.\"","Lin Sen turned to page seven, which contained a psychological test report:","Subject: Mu Mian","[Mental Health Dimension:","Scale: SCL-90","Scores for each indicator (scores over 2 require attention):","Somatization: 1.34; Obsessive-Compulsive: 1.82; Interpersonal Sensitivity: 1.41; Depression: 1.02; Anxiety: 1.29; Hostility: 1.54; Phobic Anxiety: 1.13; Paranoid Ideation: 1.01; Psychoticism: 1.21; Additional Items: 1.32.","Mental State Evaluation: All indicators normal, no symptoms of depression or anxiety... High level of mental health.]","[Personality Dimension:","Scale: Big Five Personality","Scores for each indicator:","Openness: 48 (High); Conscientiousness: 45 (High); Extraversion: 43 (High); Agreeableness: 49 (High); Neuroticism: 19 (Low)","Personality Evaluation: Extroverted, helpful, reliable, emotionally stable, skilled at independent thinking.]","[Ability Dimension:","Scale: Wechsler Adult Intelligence Scale","IQ Test Score: 186.","Ability Evaluation: Intelligence at an exceptionally high level.]","Lin Sen said, \"According to this psychological test result, this forensic expert Mu is an extroverted, helpful, friendly genius. Do you think this describes her?\"","Wang Yong looked at Mu Mian and remained silent for a while. \"I still believe we shouldn't be prejudiced against autistic individuals. We should give her a chance to prove her abilities, shouldn't we?\"","The welcome party lasted exactly 1 hour, 32 minutes, and 17 seconds.","Mu Mian found it excruciating. She desperately wanted to rush to the autopsy room and continue dissecting her unfortunate neighbor.","She had been too tired this morning and only got halfway through the autopsy before falling asleep from exhaustion.","There was no dispute about the cause of death, but the method of death was so unique.","So Mu Mian was eager to figure out how the killer had come up with such a creative method of murder.","She even thought that if she were the killer, she could have done it more perfectly. She could have made the kitten stay quietly in the victim's belly, then be \"born\" like a baby.","Mu Mian vividly imagined the scene in her mind:","Accompanied by a series of meows, an adorable kitten crawls out of a human woman's body.","\"According to our department's tradition, all new recruits need to complete a psychological test. Please follow me to the computer room to complete the test,\" Officer Chen's voice interrupted Mu Mian's fantasy.","Mu Mian looked at her, momentarily stunned.","Another psychological test?","Mu Mian felt a bit irritated. She disliked psychological tests and despised those self-righteous psychological experts even more."]},{"number":4,"title":"Chapter 4: The Cat Pregnancy Case: Is She a Genius","paragraphs":["\"This test will take about half an hour. Please patiently complete the questions on your computers,\" Officer Chen briefly introduced the content of the test before letting everyone begin.","At first, there were standard self-assessment scale questions. Everyone clicked through them listlessly, selecting the \"correct\" answers that were obvious at a glance.","Later, some images and meaningless words appeared.","People started whispering to each other: \"How is this different from previous psychological tests? What are these images and word groups testing us for?\"","\"Do we just need to press the F and J keys? What happens if we press the wrong one? They won't fire us right after we've just been hired, will they?\"","\"This is a variation of the Implicit Association Test, used to assess our cognitive tendencies,\" Mu Mian kindly explained to those around her. \"It's based on a neural network model which assumes information is stored in a series of nodes connected by neural pathways organized hierarchically according to semantic relationships. Therefore, by measuring the distance between two concepts along these neural connections, we can measure the association between them...\"","The people sitting next to her gave her strange looks.","Mu Mian stopped her explanation.","The social guide said not to force knowledge onto others, even if they particularly lack \"common sense.\"","One of them asked, \"What specific aspects does it test?\"","\"Whether we have violent tendencies; if our worldview is positive or negative; sexual orientation... things like that. This psychological paradigm is used to test our subconscious cognitive tendencies, so it doesn't let us easily perceive the purpose of the test.\"","\"So there's no way to fake this kind of test?\"","Mu Mian paused for a moment, then said quietly, \"The real indicator of the test is the difference in reaction times. An average person can't perceive the purpose of the test and choose answers that don't align with their cognition within a few seconds. It requires a very high level of brain processing power.\"","\"...\" They couldn't understand at all!","As they progressed further into the test, everyone became more focused because they had no idea what these questions were testing.","Mu Mian also became increasingly concentrated, but when she saw a series of questions about social norms, she couldn't help but wonder:","Was this psychological test specifically designed for her? But why would they need to test her? She had been acting perfectly normal!","As soon as the test ended, Mu Mian's results appeared on the psychological testing system's backend.","\"Are her test results satisfactory?\" Fang Rui looked at the mass of data, feeling a headache coming on. \"Explain it to me in layman's terms, no theory please.\"","\"The test subject is extroverted, has a positive outlook, dislikes violence, is kind and enthusiastic, emotionally stable, and has strong social skills,\" Lin Sen shrugged. \"Pretty much the same as the previous test results.\"","\"Didn't you say these test results couldn't be faked?\"","Fang Rui couldn't associate any of these descriptors with Mu Mian. In fact, Mu Mian seemed to be the complete opposite of what these words described.","\"I said it's very difficult to fake, not impossible,\" Lin Sen said. \"Clearly, this Dr. Mu is trying hard to conceal her psychological issues. And she's quite successful at it—if you don't observe her in person, that is.\"","Lin Sen paused, then continued, \"I don't object to her joining us.\"","\"You've changed your stance so quickly? Just because she passed your unreliable test?\" Fang Rui was somewhat surprised.","Lin Sen pointed to the IQ score section on the screen, \"A genius like me needs a genius colleague to work with.\"","\"...\"","Fang Rui had to admit that Lin Sen had a talent for criminal psychology, which was why he could tolerate this egomaniac. But right now, he still very much wanted to throw Lin Sen out.","After completing the psychological test, Mu Mian reported to the forensic department. By the time all the formalities were done, it was time to leave work.","Two other new forensic doctors had joined along with Mu Mian, a man and a woman. The man was called Zhang Xiaolin, and the woman was Chen Xue.","Chen Xue was outgoing, and since she had interned there for half a year, she got along well with everyone. After work, she enthusiastically invited everyone out for dinner.","Mu Mian, uncomfortable with eating with large groups, declined Chen Xue's invitation.","Outside the City Police Bureau, Mu Mian stood by the roadside, using her phone to call a taxi.","It was rush hour, and Mu Mian had particularly high standards for drivers, so she stood in the cold wind for over an hour but still couldn't get a ride.","When Zhang drove by, he saw Mu Mian huddled in her scarf, looking pitifully at the traffic.","\"Boss, since we're heading to the crime scene anyway, should we give Dr. Mu a lift?\" Zhang turned his head to look at Fang Rui in the back seat. \"She seems lost.\"","\"Whatever.\"","Zhang pulled up next to Mu Mian. \"Dr. Mu, want a ride with us?\"","\"No!\" Mu Mian refused without hesitation.","\"Why not?\" Zhang was puzzled. Was she refusing a free ride?","Mu Mian glanced at his car—a black, somewhat old and poorly maintained vehicle of an unknown brand with low safety ratings. She then eyed the tires—severely worn, and the bumper was dented.","There was absolutely no safety guarantee in riding in such a car.","But the social guide said not to directly point out others' shortcomings, so she asked tactfully, \"Have you passed your driving test?\"","\"Of course I have. How could I drive without a license?\"","The hint failed. Mu Mian began to ponder how to more tactfully refuse his unreasonable offer to give her a ride.","Zhang also caught on and turned to Fang Rui in the back seat, incredulous. \"Boss, she... what does she mean? Is she questioning my driving skills?\"","Fang Rui got out of the car and walked to the driver's side, telling Zhang to sit in the back. \"I'll drive.\"","Seeing that Fang Rui was now driving, Mu Mian promptly got into the front passenger seat and fastened her seatbelt.","Zhang watched in disbelief as Mu Mian got in the car. This Dr. Mu was so hypocritical! His boss was the truly unsafe driver. The car's sorry state was largely thanks to Fang Rui.","However, he didn't dare say it out loud and silently took the blame.","It was now the evening rush hour, and the main roads were severely congested. Feeling bored, Zhang tried to make conversation.","\"Dr. Mu, what did you think of today's psychological test? It was specially...\"","\"Zhang, you talk too much,\" Fang Rui interrupted coldly.","Zhang quickly made a zipping motion across his mouth.","Mu Mian, however, felt her heart stop and her breath catch. She stared blankly at Fang Rui.","Had her secret been discovered so quickly?","Rumor had it that Fang Rui was a famous detective with keen observational skills. Had he seen through her disguise at a glance?","This man not only had a perfect skeletal structure but also a brilliant mind—such a brain would be worth studying as a specimen.","At this thought, Mu Mian felt a bit dejected. How could she legally obtain his body?"]},{"number":5,"title":"Chapter 5: Case of Cat Embryo: Cat Abuse","paragraphs":["Perhaps Mu Mian's gaze was too intense, as Fang Rui turned his head to look at her. \"This is a tradition in our City Police Bureau. All new employees have to take a psychological test. It's not targeting anyone specifically.\"","\"May I ask if I passed your psychological test?\" Mu Mian inquired.","\"What do you think?\" Fang Rui countered.","\"I should have passed,\" Mu Mian replied confidently. She had read all the psychology books on her sister's bookshelf by the time she was 12, and since then, she could pass any psychological test.","\"You're quite confident,\" Fang Rui remarked.","Although Mu Mian's ability to read facial expressions was rather weak, she had a feeling that Fang Rui's smile hinted that he already knew she was an autistic patient. Otherwise, there would have been no need to specifically have her take such a psychological test.","Mu Mian quickly regained her composure. She took out a bank card she had prepared earlier from her pocket and handed it to Fang Rui.","Fang Rui looked at her in surprise. Every action of this forensic pathologist Mu was unexpected.","\"This is all the money I have. It's yours,\" she said.","\"Why are you giving this to me?\" Fang Rui asked, puzzled.","\"You should know why,\" Mu Mian replied, mindful of Zhang's presence in the car and not wanting to make her \"bribery\" attempt too obvious.","Fang Rui frowned, his expression stiffening. \"You're not planning to buy my corpse with money, are you?\"","Fang Rui wanted to kick Mu Mian out of the car immediately, but considering she was an autistic patient, he could only suppress his anger.","Mu Mian's eyes widened, her tone somewhat excited, \"Oh, so it's possible to buy it with money?\"","A moment later, she lowered her head dejectedly and said, \"But I'm very poor now, I only have this much money.\"","More than Fang Rui's corpse, she now wanted to protect her secret—she didn't want others to know she was an autistic patient because that would mean she'd be fired. She really needed this job right now.","\"Absolutely not!\" Fang Rui snapped, \"Don't even think about it! From now on, you're not allowed to mention the word 'corpse' in front of me!\"","Fang Rui was a staunch materialist, but nobody would like the feeling of having someone covet their corpse while they were still alive.","\"Alright,\" Mu Mian conceded. Having been interrupted like this, she didn't know how to steer the conversation back to asking Fang Rui to keep her secret. She'd have to find another opportunity to \"bribe\" him in private.","After dropping Mu Mian off at home, Fang Rui and Zhang first questioned Old Chen, the security guard of the residential complex.","Zhang handed Ms. Li's photo to Old Chen. \"Uncle, do you recognize this person?\"","\"Of course,\" Old Chen glanced at the photo, \"Isn't this Ms. Li from Building 8, Unit 3? How could I not know her!\"","\"Has she made any enemies recently?\"","\"This Ms. Li is a notorious shrew in our complex! She has an extremely bad temper, and there are countless people who've had conflicts with her. Put it this way, delivery men would rather pay compensation or get fired than deliver packages or takeout to her home. Oh, and she's also a mistress. Her boyfriend's wife even posted notices at the entrance of our complex... Wait, the person you carried away this morning wasn't her, was it?\"","Fang Rui interrupted him, \"Don't make baseless accusations.\"","Old Chen suddenly seemed possessed by the spirit of a detective, excitedly saying, \"Officer, you don't need to investigate this case. The killer must be that young lady from Room 542, Unit 3, Building 8. Her name is Mu... Mu something.\"","\"Mu Mian,\" Zhang said with a start. \"Why do you think she's the killer?\"","\"Everyone in the complex knows. This young lady isn't right in the head.\"","\"Why do you say that?\"","\"She moved in three months ago. She's very strange. At first, she didn't speak, but she smiled at everyone. However, her smile was extremely stiff, as if someone was forcing her to smile. We thought she was mute and tried to take care of her, but when it came to Ms. Li, she spoke more sharply than anyone else.\"","Fang Rui seemed to understand what Mu Mian was doing. She was trying hard to disguise herself as a normal person, but this only made her appear stranger.","Realizing this, Fang Rui felt guilty for arbitrarily refusing to let Mu Mian join the Special Crime Unit earlier.","\"Later, Old Liu from our property management went to fix the plumbing in her apartment and saw a wall full of bones hanging there, all sorts of shapes... She even threatened to turn Ms. Li into a specimen and hang her on her wall as a mural.\"","Fang Rui was speechless. This indeed sounded like something Mu Mian would do, considering she asked him about donating his body the first time they met.","His fleeting sense of guilt vanished instantly.","Fang Rui then showed Old Chen the photo of the cat.","\"Uncle, do you recognize this cat?\"","\"How could I possibly recognize it?\" Old Chen glanced at it, immediately stating he hadn't seen it before.","But then he looked more closely, muttering, \"This cat is so skinny, it must be a stray, right? There are plenty of stray cats around our complex, they all look the same. But this one is a bit too thin. In theory, we have several cat lovers in our complex who feed them cat food every day, it shouldn't be this skinny!\"","Fang Rui immediately seized on the key point in his words: \"Where do these stray cats mainly gather?\"","\"In the small park next to our complex,\" Old Chen pointed to a nearby square. \"There are quite a few stray cats and dogs lurking in the bushes over there. We can't drive them away, and we can't kill them, so we just let them stay there.\"","\"When do these cat lovers usually feed the cats?\"","\"Generally early in the morning or at dusk, mainly because that's when they have free time. You know what, the cat food those strays eat is even better than what some pets get. No wonder they refuse to leave.\"","\"Alright, if you remember any clues, please contact us immediately.\"","\"Ah, I remember now, this Ms. Li once beat a cat to death, it looked a bit like this one...\"","Zhang and Fang Rui exchanged a glance. This Ms. Li had a history of animal cruelty?","Fang Rui and Zhang grabbed a quick bite for dinner and then went to investigate around the park.","It was unseasonably cold for spring, and the park was nearly empty at night. They asked several people, but no one had seen this cat or encountered any of the people who feed the strays. They decided they would have to come back another day to continue their investigation."]},{"number":6,"title":"Chapter 6: The Cat Embryo Case: He Wanted the Deceased to Give Birth to a Live Cat","paragraphs":["Mu Mian and another girl, Chen Xue, were temporarily assigned as assistants to Forensic Doctor Qin to familiarize themselves with the work procedures.","Chen Xue had a sweet appearance and was very enthusiastic. She had graduated from the local medical university and had interned at the City Police Bureau earlier in the year, so everyone in the forensics department knew her. All morning, she kept talking to Forensic Doctor Qin and even bought coffee for all her colleagues in the forensics department.","Chen Xue was a very popular girl.","Mu Mian felt somewhat irritated. According to social guidelines, Chen Xue's behavior was normal and could help build relationships with other colleagues. However, Mu Mian couldn't interact with others as enthusiastically as Chen Xue did. She could only offer a polite smile to everyone she encountered.","However, the responses she received were strange looks.","Mu Mian had seen too many such looks before. She could only conclude that it was some kind of social behavior signal from \"normal humans\" that she couldn't understand yet.","\"Mian Mian, have you heard? One of us will be transferred to the Special Crime Unit,\" Chen Xue said.","Mu Mian shook her head, \"I haven't heard. Is it important?\" Mu Mian didn't mind where she was assigned as long as she could keep her job.","\"Did you come here in Captain Fang's car this morning?\" Chen Xue pretended to be making casual conversation, but her expression was somewhat tense. \"Did you know Captain Fang before? You two seemed quite familiar.\"","\"He gave me a ride since we were going the same way. I didn't know him before, and we're not very close,\" Mu Mian thought for a moment and added, \"He doesn't seem to like me. He's never smiled at me.\"","\"I see...\"","Chen Xue breathed a sigh of relief and was about to continue probing when Forensic Doctor Qin interrupted their chat.","\"Little Mu, you were the one who reported the case in Ziweili, right? Come with me to the case analysis meeting later.\"","Mu Mian happily replied, \"Okay.\"","\"Forensic Doctor Qin, may I apply to come along too?\" Chen Xue asked. \"I'd like to learn as well.\"","\"Alright, Little Xue can come too.\"","On the way to the conference room, Chen Xue continued chatting with Mu Mian: \"Mian Mian, were you the one who reported that case about the pregnant woman being tortured with a cat? You were late for the welcome ceremony yesterday, was it because of the case?\"","\"Yes, the deceased was my neighbor. I was the first to discover her body.\"","\"What a coincidence.\" Chen Xue looked at Mu Mian with a complex expression.","Originally, Chen Xue's position at the City Police Bureau was assured, but Mu Mian was a variable. Mu Mian's resume was impressive. She had heard internal news that the City Police Bureau only needed one forensic doctor, and the other two would be sent to various local branches after training at the City Police Bureau.","Mu Mian couldn't quite read Chen Xue's expression. It might have been sadness, or perhaps envy.","Mu Mian could only comfort her: \"Chen Xue, you don't need to envy me for encountering such a special corpse. It's all about luck, and I've always been particularly lucky in this aspect.\"","Chen Xue: \"...\" What normal person would consider encountering such a horrifying corpse as lucky?","She suddenly felt that staying might not be so difficult after all.","This Mu Mian didn't seem very smart.","At the case analysis meeting.","The spacious conference room was full of people. Mu Mian sat in the back row with Forensic Doctor Qin and Chen Xue.","By this time, the meeting had already begun.","On the electronic screen was a photo of the deceased in life - she had a sexy figure and long, wine-red curly hair. Next to it was her autopsy photo.","The deceased was named Li Yan, twenty-eight years old, unmarried, and lived alone.","This case was originally being investigated by the Special Crime Unit led by Fang Rui, but considering the severity of the case and the urgency to solve it, it was transferred to the more experienced Major Crime Unit, with Fang Rui's team assisting in the investigation.","The head of the Major Crime Unit was Chen Dongyang. He briefly introduced the case: \"Li Yan, a local, 28 years old this year, freelancer, worked as a shopping guide in a mall half a year ago. She was unmarried but eight months pregnant. According to the investigation, the father of the child is her former colleague - Zhu Minghui, the manager of a luxury goods store. At the time of the incident, he was at a drinking party and has an alibi.\"","Forensic Doctor Qin distributed the autopsy report to everyone and began to report the autopsy findings:","\"A small amount of anesthetic was detected in the deceased's body; there were several bruises on her elbows and wrists, likely caused by intense struggle. Four cuts were made on the abdomen, two of which were very shallow, test cuts. The killer opened the deceased's abdomen, cut open the uterus, and removed the entire placenta. Then he put a live kitten into the deceased's uterus and sutured the belly.\"","Forensic Doctor Qin pulled up an autopsy photo on the electronic screen: the deceased's abdominal cavity was opened, and the internal organs were covered with claw marks.","\"The incisions on the deceased's body are very uneven. Judging from the size of the incisions, the murder weapon was likely a Swiss Army knife. The wound sutures are crooked, and there are two test cuts, which indirectly proves that the killer might not be skilled in dissection and probably isn't a medical professional. We also found some plastic film in the deceased's abdominal cavity, on which we also detected traces of anesthetic.\"","Forensic Doctor Qin said, \"That's all we found from the autopsy.\"","Everyone took a deep breath.","Someone speculated, \"This killer must have really hated the victim. Could the killer be Zhu Minghui's wife?\"","\"We've already ruled out her suspicion. On the night of the incident, her son was hospitalized, and she stayed in the hospital all night. She had no time to commit the crime.\"","Zhang couldn't help but brainstorm, \"Have you guys seen 'The Legend of Zhen Huan'? There's a cat torture in it, right? They put people in a bag full of live cats and let them be clawed to death. Ah, could the killer have gotten inspiration from this TV series?\"","Li rolled his eyes at him, \"You might as well say the inspiration came from the story of 'The Racoon for the Prince'.\"","\"Oh right, the killer took away the victim's fetus. Could they really be reenacting 'The Racoon for the Prince'? But in the TV series, they switched babies to fight for the throne. What's the killer's purpose?\"","\"An 8-month-old fetus, if delivered through surgery, could it survive? Could the killer's purpose really be to switch the victim's child?\"","Everyone was discussing animatedly, and the conference room suddenly became noisy.","The air was densely packed with different voices. Mu Mian felt irritated and wanted to cover her ears to block out their voices.","But she was worried that others would notice her abnormality, so she could only lower her head and draw in her notebook, trying to shift her attention elsewhere.","However, the noise became even more amplified.","\"The killer designed a surgery. He wanted the deceased to give birth to a cat,\" Mu Mian suddenly stood up and said with certainty, \"A living cat.\"","The previously noisy conference room instantly fell into dead silence."]},{"number":7,"title":"Chapter 7: The Cat Embryo Case: Flaws in Your Reasoning","paragraphs":["After a moment of silence, everyone turned to look at Mu Mian.","Feeling the weight of their gazes, Mu Mian's scalp tingled. She wanted to flee from the room.","Fang Rui came to her rescue: \"Dr. Mu, why do you think that?\"","Fang Rui's voice seemed to have a magical quality, making Mu Mian feel less agitated.","\"Theoretically, it's possible,\" Mu Mian said, not directly answering his question. \"If you create an artificial placenta, add enough oxygen, place an anesthetized cat inside, replace the deceased's placenta with it, then inject the pregnant woman with sufficient oxytocin while maintaining the deceased's strength, she could give birth to the cat.\"","Mu Mian held up a drawing to cover her face. \"Like this. In fact, this is what he attempted, but his design was too crude, and he failed. So he's likely to try again until he succeeds.\"","Mu Mian's drawing was simple yet impactful—it depicted a pregnant woman with her abdomen cut open, inside which lay a small cat wrapped in a spherical object. The image was both harmonious and eerie.","Forensic Doctor Qin interrupted, \"But the toxicology report didn't find any traces of oxytocin in the deceased.\"","\"That's why he failed!\"","The conference room fell into a brief silence.","Mu Mian's theory was too absurd, completely unfounded. How could there be a killer who wanted someone to give birth to a cat? It made no sense.","Unless the killer was a psychopath!","Everyone couldn't help but look at Mu Mian, wondering if this was the killer's idea or Mu Mian's.","\"Captain Chen, Mu Mian is a suspect in this case. Why is she allowed to participate in our case analysis meeting?\" one of the police officers suddenly said. \"Many residents in the apartment complex reported that Mu Mian behaved strangely and had arguments with the deceased. She's also a forensic expert skilled in dissection. She's currently one of the suspects.\"","Forensic Doctor Qin looked a bit displeased. \"She's the one who reported the case, and there's no evidence proving she's the killer.\"","\"But there's no evidence proving her innocence either. According to procedure, she shouldn't be involved in this case, right?\"","Fang Rui interrupted, \"I can prove that Mu Mian is not the killer!\"","\"Detective Fang, all the current evidence points to Mu Mian as the prime suspect. How can you prove she's not the killer?\"","\"This is Mu Mian's blood test report,\" Fang Rui transferred a document to the conference room computer and opened it. \"The sample was taken yesterday at 9:35 AM. The report shows a large amount of sleeping pill components in her blood.\"","Zhang suddenly understood why Fang Rui had insisted on Mu Mian getting a medical examination yesterday. It was for this test.","\"And this proves she's not the killer?\"","Fang Rui explained, \"Based on the metabolism of the sleeping pills in her system, we can deduce that during the time of the murder, she was in a state of deep unconsciousness. She had no ability to commit the crime.\"","\"Ah, no wonder she looked so drowsy that day. The drug effects hadn't worn off!\" Zhang chimed in. \"I can testify that when we arrived at the crime scene yesterday, she looked like she hadn't fully woken up.\"","Zhang felt that Mu Mian's previous strange behavior now had a reasonable explanation: her stiff behavior and speech were due to autism; her overall lack of energy was because she had taken sleeping pills the night before.","Zhang wondered, \"Could the killer have drugged her? If so, the killer must know Mu Mian quite well.\"","\"No, this dosage far exceeds the normal amount. And she's a forensic expert, she wouldn't have failed to notice this condition,\" Forensic Doctor Qin frowned. \"Little Mu, you're so young, how could you...\"","For a normal person, this dosage would be close to lethal, yet Mu Mian was fine. It's very likely that she had been taking this medication long-term and had developed a strong tolerance.","Mu Mian lowered her head, staring at the wood grain on the table, completely zoned out, as if the topic they were discussing had nothing to do with her.","The social guide said that when faced with questions you can't answer, it's appropriate to lie a little. But she hadn't learned how to lie yet, so she could only remain silent.","\"You probably couldn't sleep due to nervousness about your new job, so you took sleeping pills to help you sleep,\" Fang Rui looked at Mu Mian, helpfully explaining on her behalf. \"It's normal for people to experience this, isn't it?\"","Mu Mian finally snapped back to reality. She looked at Fang Rui in surprise and nodded, \"Yes. Most people feel nervous and have trouble sleeping when entering a new environment.\"","The person who had questioned Mu Mian fell silent. Mu Mian's suspicion was temporarily cleared.","But because of his interruption, everyone chose to selectively ignore Mu Mian's earlier speculation and returned to the motive of revenge killing.","Captain Chen believed that the killer had used such a novel method to conceal their true motive for murder, thereby misleading the police investigation.","So he summarized, \"We'll approach this from the following angles: First, investigate the deceased's social relationships. Second, search the garbage bins near the apartment complex to find the infant's body that the killer took away. Third, review all surveillance footage from the complex during the time of the incident to see if we can identify any suspicious individuals. Let's implement these steps immediately.\"","After the meeting ended, Mu Mian caught up with Fang Rui as he was about to leave. He was walking with Lin Sen, and the two seemed to be discussing something.","Mu Mian remembered Chen Xue mentioning that this Lin Sen was a criminal psychology expert who could even read minds, and was extremely capable. Many of the cases Fang Rui had handled were solved with Lin Sen's assistance.","Mu Mian glanced at Lin Sen, using her eyes to hint that he should leave, but Lin Sen thought she was greeting him and obliviously stood there, even returning a smile.","Mu Mian decided to be more direct: \"Consultant Lin, can you read minds?\"","Hearing Mu Mian's words, Lin Sen looked bewildered, \"You... are you asking me?\"","Seeing that he still hadn't left, Mu Mian was disappointed: \"Well, you can't.\" Otherwise, he should have been able to hear her thoughts and obediently walk away.","Lin Sen's mouth twitched. Although Mu Mian's expression showed no malice, he still felt that she was blatantly mocking him.","Who said that psychology experts must be able to read minds!","However, Lin Sen could see that Mu Mian seemed to want to speak to Fang Rui alone, but having just been mocked by her, he stubbornly refused to leave.","Seeing this, Mu Mian could only try to ignore his presence and said to Fang Rui, \"Detective Fang, your evidence earlier doesn't completely prove my innocence.\"","Fang Rui responded with little interest, \"It doesn't matter, as long as they believe it.\"","Mu Mian continued to explain, \"You overlooked one factor: drug tolerance.\"","\"Even if I took a large amount of sleeping pills, I might still have been capable of action because I've developed a strong tolerance to that medication. If I really wanted to kill my annoying neighbor, I probably could have succeeded. But I wouldn't choose this method. Because I lack imagination, I couldn't come up with such a creative way of killing.\"","Fang Rui countered, \"So what? Are you trying to prove to me that you lack imagination?\"","Mu Mian looked at him sincerely, \"I just wanted to point out that your earlier reasoning has a significant flaw.\"","\"Are you the killer?\" Fang Rui's blood pressure shot up, as he struggled to resist the urge to pick Mu Mian up and throw her out.","Why had he done all this if not to quickly clear her of suspicion?","He had kindly helped her out of a difficult situation, and she had the audacity to criticize his reasoning for not being rigorous enough!","Mu Mian shook her head, \"Of course not!\"","\"Then you should say thank you to me.\"","\"Alright. Thank you.\" After expressing her gratitude, Mu Mian looked hesitantly at Lin Sen again, and seeing that he still had no intention of leaving, she regretfully departed.","\"I didn't expect you to have so much patience with this Dr. Mu,\" Lin Sen teased. \"It seems you're planning to have her join the Special Crime Unit.\"","\"We'll see,\" Fang Rui changed the subject. \"I think Mu Mian's analysis makes some sense. Could the killer really have wanted the pregnant woman to give birth to a live cat? I previously investigated and found that the deceased had a history of cat abuse. She had killed a cat. Is the killer trying to make the deceased's child pay for that cat's life? If so, the killer might believe in the concept of karmic retribution.\"","Lin Sen countered, \"But his actions are also a form of cruelty to cats. If the killer's intention was to punish those who abuse cats, why would he resort to such a cruel method towards cats himself?\"","Fang Rui pinched the bridge of his nose and said, \"Logically, this type of home invasion murder should be easy to solve. I never expected the killer to be so well-hidden.\"","\"I suspect we're dealing with a serial killer,\" Lin Sen's expression turned serious. \"This type of criminal generally selects targets based on their own criminal fantasies, which introduces a certain element of randomness. That's why it's so difficult for us to catch them using conventional investigative methods.\"","Lin Sen paused for a moment before continuing, \"With only one victim so far, I can't create a criminal profile yet.\""]},{"number":8,"title":"Chapter 8: The Cat Embryo Case: Has the Real Culprit Been Captured","paragraphs":["Fang Rui and Zhang arrived at the edge of the square early in the morning.","There were quite a few elderly people doing their morning exercises, creating a bustling and lively atmosphere. However, Fang Rui immediately spotted Mu Mian among the crowd.","She was still wearing a thick scarf, her entire body huddled within it, staring blankly at the trees in the flower bed.","Zhang followed Fang Rui's gaze and also saw Mu Mian.","\"Dr. Mu, what are you doing standing here? Morning exercises?\" Zhang was a bit surprised, as Mu Mian didn't seem like someone who enjoyed physical activity.","\"I'm waiting for a car.\"","\"They don't allow parking here. How could you possibly be waiting for a car here? You should be standing by the roadside to wait.\"","Mu Mian glanced at Fang Rui, then averted her gaze. \"I've found it now.\"","Zhang felt puzzled, \"Where's the car? I don't see any.\"","\"You can wait for us in the car,\" Fang Rui handed Mu Mian the keys, \"Zhang and I still have a task to complete.\"","Zhang suddenly understood. So Mu Mian wanted to hitch a ride with them. But how did she know they would be coming here this morning? No, wait, how did the boss know she was waiting for them?","Zhang felt like he was being left out!","Mu Mian didn't take the keys. \"I'll go investigate with you. I'm very familiar with this area. When I first moved here, I would patrol the surroundings of the neighborhood every day. Although I've reduced it to once a week now, it shouldn't affect anything.\"","Zhang listened in astonishment. Was Mu Mian a former secret agent? Or had she offended someone? Why on earth would she need to patrol her living environment every day?","Fang Rui had recently been studying up on autism, and he knew that many individuals with autism are very averse to unfamiliar environments. They need to familiarize themselves with their surroundings repeatedly to adapt. So he wasn't surprised by Mu Mian's behavior.","\"Do you know who might be knowledgeable about the stray cats around here?\"","\"Her,\" Mu Mian pointed to a girl crouching at the edge of the lawn, \"According to my statistics, she feeds the stray cats here most frequently.\"","The girl was young, with sweet features, and several skinny kittens were clustered around her feet.","\"Hello, I'm Zhang Qiang from the City Police Bureau. We'd like your cooperation in our investigation,\" Zhang showed his badge. \"Have you seen this cat before?\" He showed the photo to the girl.","The girl's name was Bai Jing, a recent college graduate who worked as a social worker in the neighborhood. She first looked at Mu Mian with a slightly surprised expression, then took the photo. After examining it carefully for a moment, she said, \"Yes, I know this cat. I used to feed it.\"","Bai Jing pointed at the photo, \"Look at its ear, there's a small piece missing. I used to feed it sausages often. But I haven't seen it much lately.\"","\"How long has it been since you last saw it?\"","\"About four or five days.\"","\"Are there many people who feed cats around here?\"","\"Quite a few. There's a university town nearby, and many students come here to feed cats. Many people in our neighborhood occasionally feed them too.\"","\"Do you all know each other?\"","\"Most of the regular cat feeders know each other. We have a group chat with many cat-loving friends like me.\"","\"Can you add us to this group?\"","\"Sure.\" Bai Jing opened her phone and added Fang Rui and Zhang to the group. \"This group is mainly for discussing cat care tips, nothing special.\"","\"Among the people who feed cats with you, has anyone been behaving unusually lately?\"","\"I don't think so. We only chat briefly when feeding cats, so we don't really know each other that well. Oh, I just remembered, there's someone in our neighborhood who comes to feed cats every morning, and he uses really expensive cat food. That's why I remember him so clearly. I think his name is Zhu...\"","Bai Jing seemed to have trouble recalling, but she quickly called out to a passing delivery man, \"Chen Hui, come here for a second.\"","The delivery man named Chen Hui stopped his scooter. He was tall, slightly chubby, with fair skin, wearing a pair of stiff black-framed glasses, but had a smile on his face.","\"Bai Jing, what's up?\"","\"That guy who used to feed cats with us, the one who liked to feed imported cat food, what's his name? The one surnamed Zhu, who always wore blue shirts?\"","\"Zhu Yaming,\" Chen Hui immediately said the man's name.","Zhang quickly jotted down the name.","Fang Rui then asked if they knew Li Yan.","Upon hearing this name, both Bai Jing and Chen Hui showed expressions of disgust. Bai Jing angrily said, \"She's a crazy woman, always losing her mind and causing trouble for anyone she encounters!\"","She pointed to a nearby bush, \"Right there, she almost kicked a stray cat to death, just because the cat rubbed against her. Such an evil woman, she'll surely get her comeuppance.\"","\"What happened to the little cat?\"","\"A kind person took it to the vet and got it treated, and then adopted it. Oh, I think that person was Zhu Yaming.\"","Fang Rui asked, \"Do many people know about this incident?\"","\"Quite a few. It happened on a weekend, and many people saw her abusing the cat. Someone even uploaded a video of it online.\"","\"Alright, thank you for your cooperation.\" After finishing the questions, Fang Rui was about to leave when he noticed Mu Mian staring intently at the delivery man, Chen Hui.","Chen Hui also felt Mu Mian's gaze and scratched his head awkwardly, \"Miss Mu, there's still no international package from your sister today. If there is one, I'll contact you immediately.\"","Mu Mian's expression became a bit dejected, \"She used to send me the medical journal I needed on time. She wouldn't forget.\"","Zhang said, \"Why don't you give your sister a call and ask?\"","Mu Mian lowered her head and remained silent.","Chen Hui helped explain, \"Miss Mu had a falling out with her sister, so she refuses to contact her sister proactively.\"","Fang Rui was a bit surprised; this delivery man named Chen Hui seemed to know quite a bit about Mu Mian.","Once they got in the car, Fang Rui indulged in some rare gossip: \"Are you close with that Chen Hui?\"","\"Not really. He's a good person because he was the first one to respond to my smile after I moved here.\"","\"Is he your friend?\"","\"No, I don't have friends,\" Mu Mian was still in low spirits, \"I'm very troublesome, no one wants to be my friend.\"","Her sister was her therapist, one of the few people who could accept her unconditionally, but now it seemed even her sister had abandoned her.","Mu Mian felt a bit defeated and somewhat regretted arguing with her sister.","Back at the bureau, Fang Rui immediately asked Zhang and his team to investigate Zhu Yaming.","In less than half a day, Zhang had uncovered Zhu Yaming's situation: \"Boss, this Zhu Yaming works at a foreign trade company. His financial situation used to be quite good, but he lost a lot of money in the stock market in recent years. His wife divorced him, and he had to sell his house, so he had to move back in with his parents. He's known to be petty, and his reputation in the neighborhood isn't great, but he hasn't done anything particularly bad or has any criminal record. His neighbors mentioned that he seems to have come into some money recently and has become quite lavish.\"","Zhang paused, then continued, \"Oh, and he's also a pet blogger. He was the one who uploaded the video of Li Yan abusing the cat online, which made him briefly famous.\"","\"Let's go talk to him,\" Fang Rui said.","Fang Rui and Zhang arrived at Zhu Yaming's home. When his parents saw the police at their door, they immediately became nervous. Zhu's father asked in a low voice, \"Officers, are you here because our Xiao Ming has done something illegal?\"","Zhang reassured them, \"Uncle, Auntie, don't be nervous. We're just here to gather some information. Please just answer our questions truthfully.\"","\"I... we'll certainly cooperate fully. Please, have a seat,\" Zhu's father exchanged a glance with his wife, then said urgently, \"You old woman, why aren't you making tea? Quick, go to Yaming's room and bring out that imported red tea he brought back to serve the officers.\"","Zhang quickly waved his hand, \"Uncle, there's no need to be so formal. We don't need tea. We just want to ask Zhu Yaming a few questions. At this time, he should be getting off work soon, right?\"","Zhu's mother stood frozen, unsure whether to go or stay, looking extremely awkward.","Seeing this, Zhu's father started berating her, \"You useless old woman, you can't even make tea properly! You stay here and entertain the officers, I'll go find the tea! Useless old thing!\" With that, he strode into the room on the left.","Fang Rui and Zhang exchanged glances, both noticing that the behavior of the elderly couple seemed rather peculiar.","Fang Rui smiled and, pretending to make a casual joke, said, \"I've only heard that foreign coffee tastes good. I wonder if foreign tea might also be better than what we have here?\"","The mother, who was arranging a fruit platter, suddenly changed her expression upon hearing this and dropped the plate she was holding onto the floor.","Sensing that something was amiss, Fang Rui and Zhang immediately rushed into the room, only to find the father pouring water over a laptop.","As a bottle of mineral water was emptied onto it, the laptop was effectively ruined.","At that moment, the mother outside the room suddenly shouted, \"Yaming, run! There are police in the house!\"","Fang Rui and Zhang immediately gave chase, quickly apprehending a middle-aged man at the stairwell. He was wearing a shirt and glasses, looking rather scholarly and refined."]},{"number":9,"title":"Chapter 9: The Cat Pregnancy Case: A New Victim","paragraphs":["\"Let me go! I haven't done anything wrong, why are you arresting me?\" Zhu Yaming struggled, twisting his body.","\"If you haven't done anything wrong, why were you running? Come on, let's have a chat back at the station,\" Fang Rui said as he handcuffed him. He noticed several scratch marks on the back of Zhu's hands. Though they had scabbed over, they were clearly made by claws.","Zhang followed Fang Rui's gaze and also spotted the scratches. He exclaimed, \"Boss, look! There are cat claw marks on his hands. He might be the culprit!\"","\"Officer, that's slander! These scars are from when my girlfriend scratched me during a fight, not from a cat,\" Zhu Yaming immediately retorted, but a flicker of panic flashed in his eyes.","Fang Rui, not interested in his excuses, patted Zhu's shoulder. \"No worries, I'll have the forensic team examine it later to determine the true origin of these wounds.\"","Zhu Yaming's face instantly turned pale.","In the interrogation room, Zhu Yaming hunched in his chair, his forehead beaded with sweat, though he struggled to maintain a composed expression.","Fang Rui slid the test results across the table to him. \"The forensic report is in. The expert says the scratches on your hands were indeed made by a cat, and they're recent. Care to explain?\"","\"Officer, I'm sorry. I lied. The scratches are from a cat. I was feeding some strays when one of them scratched me. You were so intimidating earlier, I thought I might be involved in some major case, so I panicked and lied.\"","\"Oh, so you lied because you were nervous? I wonder if your nervousness made you conceal anything else?\"","\"No, I really haven't done anything illegal.\"","\"Nothing illegal? Well, maybe you'll start telling the truth once our Technical Department recovers the data from your computer hard drive.\"","\"I...\"","Fang Rui tapped the table, his tone growing impatient. \"Forget it. I won't waste time interrogating you. Once we've gathered all the evidence, you can explain yourself to the judge!\"","\"I'll talk. I'll tell you everything. Animal cruelty isn't illegal, right? It's my own cat, my private property. I can treat it however I want, can't I?\"","Fang Rui raised an eyebrow. \"You're just admitting to animal cruelty?\"","\"I also recorded videos of it.\"","Fang Rui's gaze urged him to continue.","\"And I uploaded the videos to foreign websites. I made quite a bit of money from it.\"","The Technical Department quickly recovered the data from Zhu Yaming's computer. Fang Rui watched a short clip. In the video, a faceless man viciously stabbed a kitten's head with a high heel's stiletto. Within moments, the kitten was beaten to a bloody pulp. This wasn't just animal cruelty; it was utterly depraved!","Although they hadn't caught the real killer, they had uncovered a sadistic animal abuser. Fang Rui felt it wasn't a complete waste of effort.","After working for over ten days straight, Mu Mian gradually adapted to her new job.","The investigation into the case had made no progress. The police hadn't found the fetus taken by the killer, nor could they identify any suspects based on the available clues.","The case had reached a deadlock.","Mu Mian left her apartment complex as usual but noticed a large crowd gathered near the nearby square.","\"My God, that woman secretly gave birth to a cat in the bathroom! It was this big,\" someone said, gesturing with their hands. \"It's terrifying!\"","\"Don't be ridiculous. How could a person give birth to a cat? You can't just make up stories like that.\"","\"Uncle Chen saw it with his own eyes. The woman died from complications while giving birth to that cat. There are even photos!\"","\"Stop spreading rumors! You'll get arrested for that. The killer murdered the pregnant woman and then dumped a dead cat on her body!\"","Mu Mian overheard their whispered conversations and suddenly had an ominous feeling.","\"Excuse me, could you let me through?\" Mu Mian called out to the crowd, but no one paid her any attention, remaining tightly packed. Mu Mian grew anxious. She disliked touching others, so she couldn't push her way through the dense crowd.","\"Mu Mian, why are you standing there in a daze?\" Fang Rui spotted Mu Mian from a distance and called out to her.","\"Is there another victim?\"","\"See for yourself.\" Fang Rui cleared a path through the onlookers and led Mu Mian to the crime scene—an abandoned public toilet.","Yellow police tape cordoned off the toilet entrance, with officers already maintaining order and keeping the crowd at bay.","The toilet had been abandoned for a long time. It was dimly lit, and the air was thick with an unpleasant odor. Mu Mian entered and saw the victim wearing a loose maternity dress, but her belly was deflated like a popped balloon. The victim's face was pale, her hands bound behind her back.","An IV line was inserted into the back of her left hand, connected to an empty drip bottle. It seemed the killer had attempted to maintain the victim's vital signs through an intravenous drip.","\"Forensic Mu, come take a look at this,\" Zhang greeted Mu Mian. \"The victim is another pregnant woman, and she, she...\"","Forensic Doctor Qin and his team hadn't arrived yet, so no autopsy had been performed on the victim.","Mu Mian put on the gloves Zhang handed her. She gently lifted the victim's nightgown, glanced briefly, then carefully rearranged the woman's clothes before quietly finishing Zhang's sentence: \"She seems to have actually given birth to a cat.\"","Between the victim's legs was a small red ball, quietly curled up there. Upon closer inspection, it was clearly a blood-covered kitten.","The kitten was no longer breathing.","\"The killer has refined his method this time,\" Mu Mian said, looking at Fang Rui, \"but he still failed.\"","Failure meant he was likely to try again.","In less than an hour, the case had gone viral online.","The first witness to discover the body had taken photos and videos of the deceased and posted them on social media. As the victim had been a minor internet celebrity with a considerable following, these images and videos spread rapidly online and became a hot topic.","Details of Li Yan's previous case had also been leaked. With such brutal and bizarre cases occurring one after another in the same neighborhood, panic had set in among the residents.","Meanwhile, some internet users who enjoyed stirring up trouble had given the killer a nickname: the Cat Fetus Man.","The fermentation of public opinion brought this case under intense scrutiny."]},{"number":10,"title":"Chapter 10: Case of the Catkin: New Clues","paragraphs":["In the autopsy room.","Forensic Doctor Qin had already placed the body on the autopsy table and was about to begin examining its external features when he felt a burning gaze upon him.","He turned his head to see Mu Mian looking at him with bright, sparkling eyes.","He suddenly paused and said to Mu Mian, \"Little Mu, why don't you examine this body? Xiao Xue, you'll be her assistant and help her out.\"","Chen Xue, who was also interning there, had a slight change in expression but replied, \"Alright.\"","Mu Mian first examined the external features of the body. The deceased had quite a few abrasions, which Mu Mian photographed and documented in order, measuring the length of each wound with a ruler.","At first, Forensic Doctor Qin was impressed by how meticulous and serious Mu Mian was despite her young age. However, when Mu Mian spent half an hour just examining the superficial external wounds, he began to think she was being overly thorough.","\"Little Mu, the purpose of our autopsy is to determine the cause of death. There's no need to record those minor wounds in such detail.\"","\"But every wound could be related to the cause of death,\" Mu Mian replied earnestly. \"If we don't examine each one, we might overlook important details.\"","Forensic Doctor Qin found himself unable to argue with Mu Mian, especially when faced with her serious, intense gaze.","But how could that frostbite scar on the deceased's leg possibly be related to the cause of death? Was it really necessary to record its size so meticulously?","When it came time for the actual dissection, Mu Mian's speed increased. She skillfully opened the deceased's abdominal cavity, which had quite a few scratch marks inside, but it wasn't as bloody and mangled as the previous victim.","Mu Mian examined the deceased's internal organs and took samples.","Now all that remained was to wait for the toxicology report.","However, Mu Mian and Forensic Doctor Qin were already able to determine that this victim's cause of death was likely the same as the first victim's.","After finishing the autopsy on the second victim, Mu Mian asked, \"Dr. Qin, can I also examine Cat No. 2?\"","\"Cat No. 2? Oh, you mean the cat found at the crime scene today. There's no need to waste time dissecting it, right? We already know the cat's cause of death was asphyxiation, probably due to its head being compressed during a difficult birth.\"","Mu Mian persisted, \"I promise I'll finish quickly.\"","Forensic Doctor Qin thought it was a good thing that young people were willing to do extra work, so he said, \"Alright then, carry on. I'll go write up the report first.\"","Seeing that Forensic Doctor Qin had left, Chen Xue tactfully asked Mu Mian if there was anything else she needed help with.","Mu Mian shook her head, so Chen Xue left as well.","Before leaving, she saw Mu Mian enthusiastically dissecting the small cat, her eyes full of light, a complete change from her usual lethargic state.","What a strange person, Chen Xue thought, shaking her head. Although Mu Mian's dissection skills were very proficient and her work meticulous, she was better suited for research than forensics. Mu Mian was too fixated on unnecessary details.","When Mu Mian finished the dissection, restored the cat's body, and stitched it back up, she suddenly realized how hungry she was. She glanced at the clock on the wall – it was already past 1 PM.","She hurried to the cafeteria to eat, but unsurprisingly, the cafeteria staff had already cleared away the food.","Mu Mian was at a loss. She was very hungry and needed to eat, but her social guidebook didn't tell her how to handle this situation.","\"Dr. Mu, why are you still here after lunch?\"","Mu Mian saw Zhang and Fang Rui approaching. Zhang greeted her.","Fang Rui glanced at her and then looked away in disgust. He just couldn't understand why Mu Mian was always spacing out.","Mu Mian didn't respond. Not having eaten on time made her anxious, and she didn't have the energy for social interaction at the moment.","Zhang walked up to the cafeteria window. Before he could speak, the auntie who was cleaning inside handed him several lunch boxes, a warm smile on her face.","\"Xiao Zhang, it's a good thing you messaged me on WeChat to save some food for you. Otherwise, you would've missed out on today's braised pork.\"","\"That's right, good thing I was quick-thinking. Otherwise, I'd be stuck with takeout for lunch today.\"","\"That young lady over there doesn't seem to have eaten either. You and Captain Fang probably can't finish all this food. Why don't you share some with her?\"","Zhang had a sudden realization and turned to Mu Mian, \"Dr. Mu, so you haven't eaten yet? Come on, let's eat together. We can discuss the case while we're at it.\"","Mu Mian wanted to refuse because, apart from her family, she had never eaten with anyone else. But her growling stomach made the decision for her.","\"Dr. Mu, you don't have any dietary restrictions, do you?\"","Zhang opened the lunch boxes one by one, intending to share some of the delicious braised pork with Mu Mian as a friendly gesture towards his new colleague.","\"I'm not picky about food,\" Mu Mian said. She pointed at the dishes in the lunch boxes, \"I just don't eat this kind of sticky, fatty meat, or carrots cut into cubes, or cooked cucumbers.\"","Zhang's expression turned awkward. \"Oh... well, then there's nothing here you can eat.\"","What a troublesome person! Fang Rui didn't bother to humor her. He scooped a bowl of white rice, poured some braised pork sauce over it, and handed it to Mu Mian. \"Here, eat this!\"","Mu Mian didn't say anything. She took the bowl and started eating silently.","Zhang was bewildered. So Mu Mian only likes to eat plain rice?","Halfway through the meal, Zhang couldn't keep quiet any longer. \"Dr. Mu, did you find anything during the autopsy?\"","Mu Mian put down her chopsticks and said seriously, \"This killer is likely a doctor with clinical experience, or at least used to be one. And he really likes cats.\"","Zhang exclaimed, \"How do you know he's a doctor?\"","\"How can you prove he likes cats?\" Fang Rui had also suspected the killer might be a doctor. Although the killer's dissection skills were terrible, the fact that he could stuff a cat into the victim's uterus proved he had at least some medical knowledge. So he was more interested in Mu Mian's second conclusion.","\"Do you want to know the answer?\" Mu Mian looked at Fang Rui, excitement in her eyes. \"If you agree to do one thing for me, I'll share it with you right now.\"","\"I'm not going to donate my body to you!\"","The light in Mu Mian's eyes instantly went out, and the rice in her bowl no longer seemed appetizing.","She took out her phone and showed Fang Rui some photos. \"Is this enough proof?\""]},{"number":11,"title":"Chapter 11: Case of Cat Embryo People: Devotees Obsessed with Mother's Womb","paragraphs":["The case received high-level attention, and the bureau established the 317 special task force, now led by Fang Rui as the team leader, with the mandate to apprehend the killer within seven days.","Fang Rui's pressure suddenly increased.","As the meeting began, Fang Rui briefly introduced the victim's situation.","Since the victim was an internet celebrity, various information had already been exposed by netizens.","The police quickly investigated and identified the victim as Lu Yaoyao, who was once a streamer in the dance section of a certain platform. A few months ago, she was exposed for being a mistress and frantically insulting and doxxing netizens. Combined with her pregnancy preventing her from livestreaming dance performances, her career took a major hit, and she hadn't been streaming much for a long time, causing her popularity to plummet.","Fang Rui pointed to the information of the two victims on the screen and summarized:","\"The two victims have very obvious commonalities: both were mistresses; both were pregnant women around eight months along, and they were carrying illegitimate children. This should be the killer's criteria for selecting victims.","From the current investigation, there is no overlap in the social circles of the two victims, and they did not know each other previously.","Although the body of the second victim, Lu Yaoyao, appeared in the Ziweili Residential Area, she usually resided in the Lijing Residential Complex in the city center, more than 20 kilometers away from the crime scene.\"","Forensic Doctor Qin also reported on the autopsy findings:","\"The modus operandi in the second case is almost identical to the previous one, with the cause of death still being hypovolemic shock.\"","Forensic Doctor Qin continued: \"However, the killer seems to have learned from the first experience. He used hemostatic drugs to reduce the victim's blood loss. At the same time, we detected an abnormally high concentration of oxytocin in her body, suggesting she was likely injected with a large amount of oxytocin before death.\"","\"The test results for the liquid in the IV bag have come back. It's a regular glucose solution, probably used to maintain the victim's strength.\"","After hearing this, the others turned to look at Mu Mian. Could it really be as Mu Mian had said, that the killer intended to have the victim give birth to a live cat?","Feeling the gaze of everyone, Mu Mian thought it was her turn to speak. She stood up and said seriously, \"The killer is likely a doctor with clinical experience, or at least used to be one.\"","Forensic Doctor Qin immediately refuted, \"That's unlikely! The incisions on the victim's body are crooked and uneven, with several tentative cuts. The suturing technique is also very crude. This doesn't seem like the work of someone with a medical background.\"","Mu Mian inserted her USB drive into the device, and two photos of the abdominal wounds on the corpses appeared on the screen.","\"The curved shapes of these two incisions are almost identical, and both victims have three tentative cuts on their abdomens.\"","\"What does that prove?\" someone questioned.","Forensic Doctor Qin quickly understood Mu Mian's point. \"Tentative cuts occur when the killer is nervous or unable to accurately locate the incision point. For them to be so consistent in both cases, along with the consistent angle of the crooked incisions, suggests that the killer isn't incapable of dissection, but is deliberately disguising their skill.\"","Seeing that she had convinced everyone, Mu Mian brought up several images of the kitten's corpse, showing its body, paws, and a cut-open stomach.","Pointing to the stomach photo, Mu Mian said, \"I analyzed the food in the stomach of kitten number 2. It consists of granular cat food and some kind of minced meat, which I suspect is canned cat food.\"","She then pointed to the cat's paw, \"The claws of kitten number 2 have been carefully and evenly trimmed. Despite being a stray cat, it has no parasites, and I detected deworming medication in its fur, suggesting it had been recently dewormed. In conclusion, this cat received very good treatment before its death.\"","\"How does this help us solve the case?\" someone questioned.","\"This proves that the killer is very knowledgeable about cats and may have experience in raising them.\"","Everyone fell silent. This made the killer's motive seem even more bizarre. The killer likes cats, yet stuffs them into the victims' bellies. The purpose became incomprehensible.","Even if it was as Mu Mian had previously suggested, that the killer wanted the victim to give birth to a live cat, what would be the significance of doing so? Cats are already alive, so why make them be born again?","Mu Mian didn't look at everyone's reactions. After finishing her report, she returned to her seat.","She wasn't interested in analyzing the killer's motive, nor did she care much about whether the killer would be caught. She simply enjoyed uncovering the secrets hidden in the victims' bodies.","Fang Rui quickly found a direction:","\"Although the two victims' social circles don't overlap, they are both pregnant women, so their travel routes likely intersect. We should focus on investigating whether they visited the same obstetrics and gynecology hospitals, maternity stores, and other such places.","Wang, Li, check what brands the cat food and canned cat food are, and see if there's any breakthrough there.","The killer might be a doctor, so screen the major hospitals to see if any doctors have shown unusual behavior recently.\"","While the police investigation was in full swing, discussions about the case were also intense online. Suddenly, the comments of internet celebrity psychological consultant Professor Bai spread across the network.","He gave the killer a nickname: the Cat Fetus Man, and used psychoanalytic theory to provide a detailed interpretation of the killer's psychological motives—the killer has an Oedipus complex, using this cruel method of killing to attract his mother's attention and to take revenge on the mother who abused him.","Based on the victims' personalities, he deduced that the killer has a mother with a volatile temper and extremely strong controlling tendencies. Therefore, the killer is likely physically weak, timid and introverted, with a history of animal abuse.","Finally, Professor Bai contemptuously described the killer as a \"pervert obsessed with the maternal womb.\""]},{"number":12,"title":"Chapter 12: Case of the Cat-Fetus People: Criminal Profile","paragraphs":["\"A depraved person obsessed with the womb... I think this professor's analysis makes some sense,\" Zhang said as he played Professor Bai's video during the morning meeting.","\"No matter how reasonable the analysis is, it's useless if it doesn't help us catch the killer!\" an old policeman complained. \"It's all just for show, trying to attract attention.\"","Fang Rui felt irritated. The professor's comments were undoubtedly a provocation to the killer. This could potentially stimulate the killer to strike again or take some action to retaliate against Professor Bai.","\"That's true. I've heard this Professor Bai isn't such a good person himself. He not only has a history of academic fraud,\" Zhang perked up at the chance to gossip, \"but it's said he's had unclear relationships with quite a few female students. He's even going through a divorce because of his infidelity. What a person of poor character!\"","Fang Rui instructed, \"Old Chen, take two people and keep a close watch on this Professor Bai for the next few days. Prevent any accidents from happening to him.\"","\"Ah, these people just create more trouble for us!\"","Fang Rui turned to Lin Sen, \"Consultant Lin, can you profile the killer now?\"","But Lin Sen looked towards Mu Mian instead: \"Medical Examiner Mu, why do you think the killer designed a surgery to make those pregnant women give birth to a cat?\"","Mu Mian, who had been absentmindedly drawing, looked up at Lin Sen in confusion when she heard her name called.","After a few seconds, she spoke softly, \"To answer that question is very simple.\"","Everyone in the meeting room turned their gaze towards Mu Mian.","Only Fang Rui remained calm, sipping his water.","\"We just need to catch the killer, interrogate him harshly, and make him tell us the answer!\"","\"...\"","Lin Sen handed Mu Mian two pieces of paper: \"Medical Examiner Mu, could you please draw the crime scenes of the two murders for me?\"","Lin Sen had noticed that Mu Mian wasn't particularly skilled at analyzing criminal psychology, but her thinking was pure, allowing her to objectively interpret the information left by the killer at the crime scenes.","\"Alright.\"","Mu Mian had been forced to take various psychological tests since childhood, one of which was a drawing test, so her drawing skills were excellent and she could draw very quickly.","Although her photorealistic style of drawing was a major obstacle for psychological experts trying to analyze her mind, it now vividly recreated the bloody crime scenes, even more impactful than photographs.","\"We may have been looking at this from the wrong angle before. We've been focusing on the victims and the cats, but what if we shift our perspective to the children...\"","Fang Rui asked, \"You think the killer's real targets are the children in the victims' wombs?\"","Lin Sen continued his analysis, \"From the children's perspective, both victims were unfit mothers. They had unstable marriages, were easily angered, and had poor interpersonal relationships. All of this suggests their children wouldn't have had happy childhoods.\"","Fang Rui pondered for a moment, \"So, the killer likely had an unhappy childhood and is using his own mother as a template to select targets?\"","\"Yes. The killer probably imagines himself as a savior. He hopes those unhappy children can be born as cats instead. For some reason, he believes being a cat would be happier than being human.\"","Zhang exclaimed, \"How is that possible?\"","Lin Sen explained, \"The killer's desire to kill stems from an abnormal need system and a long-term, distorted fantasy that continues to develop. This kind of fantasy is difficult for normal people to understand or empathize with.\"","\"This killer belongs to a special category of serial killers that we generally call 'mercy angels.' This type of killer usually murders victims with the purpose of saving them or releasing them from suffering. This type of serial killer is likely to be a medical professional.\"","Lin Sen provided a psychological profile of the killer:","\"The killer is male, around 25-35 years old, has worked in the medical field, likely in obstetrics and gynecology, but has recently stopped working or resigned for some reason.","He grew up in a single-parent family. His mother was the other woman in an affair, had a volatile temper, and may have frequently abused him, resulting in a very unhappy childhood. His family likely kept cats. His mother probably passed away within the last year, causing him to have a mental breakdown.\"","Fang Rui quickly discovered that both victims had prenatal check-ups at the same hospital, but they had different attending physicians and their check-up times didn't overlap, so there was no connection between them.","Fang Rui and Zhang immediately went to investigate at Anqi Obstetrics and Gynecology Hospital.","The hospital was very cooperative, quickly producing the prenatal records of both victims and bringing in the two attending physicians to assist with the investigation.","\"Lu Yaoyao initially had her prenatal check-ups at the Provincial Hospital. Why did she suddenly switch to your hospital five months ago?\" Fang Rui quickly spotted the discrepancy.","Lu Yaoyao's attending physician laughed awkwardly, \"Maybe she felt our private hospital offered better service.\"","\"Please answer truthfully!\"","\"Lu Yaoyao came to our hospital wanting an abortion. Our hospital is known for its expertise in this area. The surgery was even scheduled, but she changed her mind later. Perhaps she felt our hospital's service was better, so she continued her prenatal care with us.\"","\"Did Li Yan also consider having an abortion?\"","\"Yes! I remember her very clearly. She kept scheduling abortion procedures and then canceling them. This happened several times.\"","\"Why did they want abortions?\"","\"How would we know?\"","\"You're doctors. Don't you ask why they want to terminate their pregnancies?\" Fang Rui stared at the two doctors. \"Please answer honestly.\"","\"Well... it might be because they were carrying girls. They both wanted to have sons, but when they found out they were having daughters, they wanted to abort. Later, for some reason, they both changed their minds.\"","The doctor, seeming to remember something, hastily added, \"Our hospital didn't disclose the gender of the fetuses. I don't know how they found out.\"","Fang Rui requested a list of all medical staff from the hospital, including those who had left in recent years.","After verifying one by one, most of the people on the list had alibis. The small portion without alibis were still being investigated.","\"Boss, why do you think they suddenly decided not to abort? Could the killer's mother have also favored boys over girls? Could the killer be a woman?\" Zhang followed behind Fang Rui, chattering like a sparrow.","Fang Rui interrupted Zhang's rambling: \"I suspect the killer persuaded them to change their minds, which means the killer is likely a medical professional from this hospital. We need to screen the people on the list again.\""]},{"number":13,"title":"Chapter 13: The Cat Embryo Human Case: Light in the Darkness","paragraphs":["Mu Mian noticed that Fang Rui had been very busy lately, as she hadn't seen him for several days, and even Zhang was nowhere to be found.","The forensics department, however, was quite idle, so today she left work on time and then spent two hours trying to hail a cab that met her requirements.","When she arrived at the residential complex, Mu Mian saw a delivery van parked by the roadside. The courier, Chen Hui, was humming a cheerful tune while loading parcels into the delivery lockers.","\"Excuse me, do I have any international packages today?\"","\"Miss Mu, I'm afraid not. There haven't been any packages for you recently.\"","\"Are you sure there's nothing?\"","\"No, there isn't. I wouldn't lie to you. If there were any, I'd contact you right away.\"","\"Alright then.\"","Mu Mian glanced at him, then quickly averted her gaze.","At that moment, the sound of an argument could be heard from nearby.","\"Bai Jing, are you the one spreading those rumors online? Are you trying to ruin my reputation? If my name is tarnished, do you think you'll be better off as my daughter? Can't you think straight?\"","A middle-aged man was gripping Bai Jing's arm, emotionally accusing her.","Mu Mian recognized the man; he was the internet-famous professor who had referred to the killer as a \"cat fetus person.\"","So he knew Bai Jing.","\"Bai Jing, I'm talking to you. What kind of attitude is this? My divorce from your mother is between her and me. Why are you getting involved? I'm warning you, you'd better behave yourself!\"","\"I've told you, I didn't do it! I have nothing to do with you now, so stop harassing me!\"","Slap! Professor Bai struck Bai Jing hard across the face. \"Is this how you talk to your father? Don't you have any manners?\"","Bai Jing looked at him with cold eyes. \"That's right. I don't have a family anymore, so where would I learn manners?\"","Chen Hui dropped the package he was holding and ran over, forcefully pushing Professor Bai away and standing between him and Bai Jing.","\"Chen Hui, this is none of your business. Stay out of it.\"","\"Is this your boyfriend? Bai Jing, look at how low you've sunk. It's bad enough that you're working in this dump, but now you're dating this bottom-feeder. Don't ever tell anyone you're my daughter in the future. I'd be too ashamed!\"","Chen Hui raised his fist, ready to punch Professor Bai, but Bai Jing held him back tightly. \"Chen Hui, don't do anything rash. It's not worth it to fight with someone like him. Let's just ignore him!\"","\"Bai Jing, I'm warning you one last time. Delete those rumors you've been spreading online, or you can forget about getting a penny of my money!\" Professor Bai cursed a few more times before driving away in his car.","The crowd of onlookers buzzed with discussion.","Bai Jing collapsed on the ground, covering her face and sobbing uncontrollably. \"Why do I have to have a father like this...\"","Chen Hui patted Bai Jing's back, comforting her silently.","Mu Mian was shocked. In her understanding, parents were supposed to love their children unconditionally. Just like her adoptive parents loved her sister.","She remembered her sister's words: \"Mu Mian, have you ever considered that your mother might not want to be found?\"","Mu Mian took out a tissue and handed it to Bai Jing.","Both Bai Jing and Chen Hui were surprised. They hesitated for a moment before Bai Jing accepted the tissue. \"Mu Mian, thank you!\"","Mu Mian didn't respond to them and turned to go home.","Fang Rui had pulled an all-nighter and only managed to doze off at his desk as dawn was breaking.","\"Captain Fang, we've investigated Anqi Obstetrics and Gynecology Hospital. Only a few doctors' situations are uncertain,\" Zhang reported. \"Shen Yuanyuan and Zhang Linyang went to work at hospitals in the north and haven't been back to the city for nearly half a year. Chen Jian, Li Qiang, and Ye Wenwen are said to have gone abroad for further studies, but we haven't been able to contact them yet, so we're not sure if they've returned recently.\"","\"Chen Jian? Is that his real name?\" Fang Rui frowned as he flipped through Chen Jian's file.","\"Boss, you also think this name is strange, right? I suspected it was a fake name at first, so I quickly checked his identity information. It turns out that's really his name. Man, his parents must have been heartless to give their child such a name.\"","Fang Rui looked at Chen Jian's photo, feeling oddly familiar with the person.","In Chen Jian's file, only his mother's information was filled in the parents' section, while the father's section was blank.","\"Find out where he is now.\"","\"Boss, do you suspect him?\" Zhang suddenly had a revelation. \"Chen Jian's parents must have really hated him to give him such an insulting name. Doesn't this match the profiler's description?\"","The police quickly found out Chen Jian's whereabouts.","It turned out that Chen Jian hadn't gone abroad to study. Half a year ago, he had been treated at a psychiatric hospital in the city. After that, he never contacted his former friends or colleagues again. There were no records of transactions on his bank card, and his ID card hadn't been used either.","The house he lived in was rented, and the landlord reported that he had moved out half a year ago. The house now had new tenants.","Chen Jian had suddenly vanished without a trace.","Fang Rui had planned to work overtime again tonight, but when he saw Mu Mian standing by the roadside lost in thought, he decided to drive her home first.","\"Why don't you rent a place nearby?\" Fang Rui couldn't help but suggest.","\"That's a good idea,\" Mu Mian thought Fang Rui's suggestion was excellent. This way, she wouldn't have to get up early or take unsafe taxis.","But she quickly became dejected: \"But I don't have money to rent a place.\"","\"Didn't you have plenty of money when you wanted to buy my corpse last time? Did you spend it all in less than two weeks?\" Fang Rui was surprised; Mu Mian didn't seem like the type to splurge.","\"I didn't spend it.\"","\"Then where did the money go?\"","Mu Mian wanted to change the subject, but she wasn't good at lying, so she had to be honest: \"I was scammed!\"","Fang Rui was shocked. He couldn't believe someone with Mu Mian's intelligence could be scammed, but then again, it wasn't impossible.","\"I wanted to find my long-lost mother, so I posted online looking for her. Someone contacted me, saying she was my mother, but that she had been in a car accident and needed a large sum of money for treatment. So I transferred all my money to her.\"","Mu Mian's tone was a bit dejected, \"After she received the money, she never contacted me again. Chen Xue told me I had been scammed.\"","After her parents' divorce, Mu Mian never saw her mother again. She had returned to China this time specifically to find her mother, even having a big fight with her sister over it.","\"Why didn't you report it to the police?\"","\"Why should I report it?\" Mu Mian looked confused. \"Even though she's not my mother, she was in a car accident and really needed the money.\"","\"Is it possible that she wasn't in a car accident at all?\" Fang Rui looked at her incredulously. \"That person might not even be a woman. Can you trust what a scammer says?\"","Mu Mian was dumbfounded. Her social guide hadn't told her that lies could be nested within lies.","\"How much money did you lose?\" Fang Rui pulled over to the side of the road and took out his phone, intending to make a call. \"I'll contact the anti-fraud department and see if they can help you recover it.\"","\"Five hundred and thirty-one yuan and ninety cents.\"","\"You were only scammed out of five hundred yuan?\"","\"Yes. I'm very poor now.\"","This was... too poor.","\"Forget it, it's not even enough to file a case!\" Fang Rui sighed in relief. \"Don't trust people so easily. There are too many scammers these days. Be careful, or you might end up being sold without even realizing it.\"","\"I've already learned my lesson.\"","After dropping Mu Mian off at the entrance of the residential complex, Fang Rui planned to canvas the neighborhood and ask residents if they had seen Chen Jian.","Old Chen, the security guard, looked at the photo and shook his head. \"Never seen him. Not to brag, but I remember everyone I've ever seen. I haven't seen this young man before, so he probably hasn't been to our complex.\"","\"Alright, thank you. If you remember anything, make sure to contact me.\"","Mu Mian glanced at the photo and felt strangely familiar with the person, but when she tried to recall, she couldn't place him.","\"Do you know this person?\"","\"I'm not sure. My memory is very good, so if I had seen him before, I wouldn't forget. Maybe some feature of his was familiar to me, that's why he seems familiar.\"","Just then, Mu Mian's phone rang.","She received an email from her sister:","Little Mian, I noticed that your bank account balance was low, so I've transferred some money to you. I've also mailed you this month's new issues of NATNED and NEJM. Please keep an eye out for them.","Looking at the email, Mu Mian finally had a definitive answer to a question that had been troubling her.","\"Fang, don't you think this person looks like Chen Hui?\" she asked.","\"Chen Hui? You mean the delivery guy?\" Fang Rui tried to recall Chen Hui's appearance.","In the photo, Chen Jian was very thin. He wore a T-shirt, had a lanky build, and looked very much like a student, but with a depressed and gloomy demeanor.","Chen Hui, on the other hand, was much heavier, with a large body and round face. He looked like an ordinary delivery worker who had been in the job for years, and his personality seemed outgoing and gentle.","The two men had no similarities in appearance or demeanor. At first glance, they looked like completely different people.","\"Fang, do you remember how you helped clear my name?\" Mu Mian asked.","\"Yes, I do,\" Fang Rui replied.","\"Actually, what I was taking back then wasn't sleeping pills. It was a medication to reduce anxiety associated with autism. It contained sedatives, so it also had a good sleep-inducing effect.\"","\"I had guessed as much.\"","\"I only need to take this medication when I'm in a state of intense anxiety. For example, when entering a new environment or when a routine is disrupted. At that time, my sister suddenly stopped sending me the medical journals I wanted to read. I thought she was going to abandon me, and I fell into an anxious state. That's why I needed a large amount of medication to help me sleep.\"","\"Are you saying the killer knew you were using this medication?\" Fang Rui inquired.","\"I just called my sister, and she said she had been sending me magazines every week, and my end shows they were signed for. Obviously, someone deliberately created conditions to make me take that medication.\"","\"Because you're sensitive to noise, if the killer had committed the crime next door, you would have certainly noticed,\" Fang Rui analyzed. \"Looking at it this way, Chen Hui does seem very suspicious.\"","\"They both have a black mole on the left corner of their mouth,\" Mu Mian pointed at the photo. \"The size and position are exactly the same.\"","Fang Rui took out his phone to contact Zhang and the others to come over.","\"I won't go with you to catch the killer,\" Mu Mian said softly. \"It's a very dangerous thing to do!\""]},{"number":14,"title":"Chapter 14: The Cat Embryo Case: Hostage","paragraphs":["Police cars approached from different directions, stopping at the base of the building. Curious onlookers peered down from their windows to observe the commotion.","Fang Rui quickly led his team to Chen Hui's apartment, kicking the door open with one forceful blow.","The room was pitch black and eerily quiet. A strong scent of incense permeated the air, mingled with a faint but unmistakable odor of decay.","There was no one inside.","With a sharp click, Fang Rui flipped on the lights.","Zhang sighed, \"Chief Fang, you don't think that guy's already fled, do you?\"","\"Chief, come quick! You need to see this,\" someone called out in alarm. \"Good God, what are these things?\"","\"Stop being so jumpy. How bad could it possibly be—\"","The voice trailed off as everyone stood frozen, stunned by the horrifying sight before them:","On the left side of the living room stood an enormous metal rack. Arranged on it were rows upon rows of transparent glass jars of varying sizes. Each jar contained an infant.","Some held shapeless masses of flesh, others embryos beginning to take form, and still others fetuses with discernible limbs... All suspended in formaldehyde solution.","Fang Rui did a quick count—there were at least forty or fifty jars.","\"Dear Lord, how many children did he kill?\"","\"This is beyond cruel!\"","Lin Sen examined the infant specimens on the shelves. Each jar bore a label with a date and number.","The earliest date was from three years ago.","\"I don't think he killed all these infants himself,\" Lin Sen explained. \"He's an obstetrician. These are likely fetal remains he collected during his work.\"","The police searched the entire apartment but found no trace of Chen Hui. The place was immaculate, with no signs of a struggle.","Fang Rui and his team staked out Chen Hui's home for hours, but there was no sign of him.","Just then, an officer on surveillance outside the complex called in: \"Boss, we've spotted Chen Hui. He's in Building 8 of the complex. He's taken a hostage and is heading for the roof...\"","Mu Mian glanced down at the scalpel pressed against her throat, recalling Chen Xue's words.","\"Mian, your Leo sign is in retrograde this month. You need to be careful—you might have some bad luck.\"","Indeed... very bad luck!","She had simply been heading home after work as usual, never expecting to encounter Chen Hui at the third-floor stairwell landing and end up as his hostage.","\"Move faster!\" Chen Hui had a black backpack slung over his shoulder, bulging with its contents.","He shoved Mu Mian hard, causing her to stumble. If she hadn't grabbed the railing, she would have fallen.","\"The correct escape route should be downstairs. The roof is upstairs—you'll have nowhere to go once you're up there,\" Mu Mian couldn't help but advise. \"Plus, I'm a bit afraid of heights!\"","Chen Hui ignored Mu Mian's suggestion and dragged her upstairs.","When they reached the sixth floor, Mu Mian sensed something was different. The sixth floor had always been vacant, with a persistent musty odor in the hallway. But today, the smell was off.","Mu Mian habitually scanned her surroundings repeatedly to ensure her living environment was safe. She had already inspected this building 101 times, so she was certain the hallway smell was different from the last time she'd been there.","\"Hurry up!\"","The roof access was on the sixth floor. The door was unlocked. Chen Hui kicked it open forcefully. Outside was pitch black, and a gust of cold wind rushed in, instantly tousling Mu Mian's short hair.","\"Are you planning to commit suicide? Could we perhaps choose a different method? This way is rather unsightly. Also, I have severe acrophobia.\"","Chen Hui pressed the scalpel against Mu Mian's neck, muttering incoherently, \"For you, this is a dead end. For me, it might be a rebirth.\"","Mu Mian made a sour face. \"I don't want to die right now!\"","Chen Hui reacted as if he'd heard a joke, asking in confusion:","\"Why don't you want to die? Isn't it exhausting for someone like you to live in this world? You try so hard to disguise yourself as normal, desperately trying to please others, but they still look at you strangely. They mock you, even ostracize you. Don't you feel hopeless?\"","As he spoke, his tone grew increasingly agitated. His hand began to shake, waving the sharp scalpel and leaving several thin, long cuts on Mu Mian's neck.","Mu Mian's eyes widened. She protested softly, \"I'm a normal person now. My sister said so, and she's an excellent psychotherapist. She loves me very much, so I can't die. It would make her very sad.\"","\"She's lying to you, you fool! Your sister surely sees you as a burden. She'd be happier if you were dead.\"","Mu Mian's gaze instantly dimmed. Her lips moved, but she swallowed the words she was about to say.","Her sister's friend had once said something similar—that because of caring for Mu Mian, her sister had lost both her career and her love life.","\"No one loves you!\" Chen Hui looked at her with pity. \"Let me help you find release.\"","The moment Chen Hui first saw Mu Mian, he knew they were the same—both outcasts, rejected by society.","He had wanted to befriend Mu Mian, to ease her loneliness, but she had sided with the police instead.","\"Can we at least choose a different method of death? My brain has significant research value, and it would be damaged if I fell. So please don't let me die from falling. Don't stab me either, because I've already pledged to donate my internal organs. If you damage them, they can't be given to others who need them. Strangulation won't work either—I hate the feeling of suffocation...\"","\"Shut up! Say one more word and I'll stab you a few times before throwing you off!\"","Mu Mian immediately closed her mouth.","Just then, they heard soft footsteps behind them. Chen Hui saw that Fang Rui had led his team to the roof.","As Fang Rui burst onto the roof, he saw Chen Hui holding the scalpel to Mu Mian's throat. Mu Mian, however, seemed lost in thought, her expression remarkably calm.","\"Stay back! All of you, back off! Don't come any closer!\" Chen Hui immediately dragged Mu Mian to the edge of the roof. \"Come any closer, and I'll push her off.\"","The roof's edge had no railing—one small push, and Mu Mian would fall.","\"Alright, we're backing up. Don't harm the hostage.\" Fang Rui signaled his team to retreat a few steps.","\"Keep backing up!\"","The sensation of hanging in midair snapped Mu Mian back to reality. Suddenly, as if she'd had an epiphany, she asked, \"Chen Hui, were you talking about yourself earlier?\"","\"What?\"","\"No one loves you!\" Mu Mian said. \"You're the outsider. You can't fit into this world. You're the one who feels hopeless!\"","\"Shut up! You're the unloved waste. Someone like you shouldn't be alive. I'll help you find peace!\" Chen Hui's emotions flared. Just as he was about to push Mu Mian off the roof, he heard someone say to him:","\"Chen Hui, your mother loves you.\""]},{"number":15,"title":"Chapter 15: Case of the Cat Human: It's Not Over Yet","paragraphs":["The voice was soft yet firm, almost drowned out by the howling wind, but it reached Chen Hui's ears clearly.","Chen Hui's body froze.","\"No, my mother doesn't love me! She can't possibly love me!\"","Chen Hui's attention was immediately drawn to Lin Sen. His expression was angry, his eyes bloodshot, as he shouted hysterically:","\"If I didn't exist, she would be happier. She hates me, I ruined her life!\"","\"Chen Hui, your mother does love you, she just doesn't know how to express it.\"","Lin Sen approached Chen Hui step by step.","\"Did she ever hold your hand and take you to the amusement park?\"","Chen Hui instinctively wanted to deny it, but he couldn't control the image that floated into his mind—his mother taking him on a merry-go-round, a warm scene he had imagined countless times but knew could never have happened.","\"Did she ever hold an umbrella for you on rainy days?\"","\"Did she always like to tell you bedtime stories?\"","Tears fell unconsciously as countless images flashed through Chen Hui's mind, the painful reality intertwining with the beautiful scenes he had imagined.","\"Mom... Mom...\" Chen Hui held his head, trying to collect more memories of his mother in his mind.","Did his mother love him?","Fang Rui cautiously approached Chen Hui. Just as he was about to reach out and pull Mu Mian away, Chen Hui suddenly regained his composure and pressed the knife against Mu Mian's neck again. \"Step back, all of you!\"","He looked at Lin Sen and said coldly, \"Are you a hypnotist? Don't waste your effort, hypnosis doesn't work on me.\"","Lin Sen was slightly stunned. He rarely failed.","\"Because I've hypnotized myself countless times, but I still can't find any trace of my mother's love in my memories,\" Chen Hui's expression was tragic, \"No one loves me...\"","\"I can't find any trace of my mother's love either,\" Mu Mian suddenly started crying too, \"My mother doesn't love me either, she abandoned me!\"","Chen Hui was startled by this. He steadied his emotions and realized it was Mu Mian speaking.","\"My sister says it's not our fault. Some mothers just don't love their children.\" But Mu Mian cried even harder.","\"It's not... our fault?\" Chen Hui muttered.","No one had ever said this to him in all these years. Everyone around him, his grandparents, his uncle, including his mother, had repeatedly blamed him, accused him, as if his very existence was the biggest mistake.","He tried hard to study, tried hard to meet their demands, but still no one would love him.","\"Of course not. We were so young then, what could we have done wrong?\" Mu Mian's tone was firm, as if trying to convince Chen Hui, and also herself.","Chen Hui's gaze searched around for something, a bit urgently, \"It's my fault, I wasn't good, that's why my mother doesn't like me...\"","At this moment, the bell for the end of evening self-study rang from the nearby school.","\"Mu Mian, I'm luckier than you, I know how to make my mother love me!\"","Chen Hui suddenly showed a strange smile. He let go of Mu Mian and leaped down from the building.","Mu Mian almost fell with him, but fortunately, Fang Rui grabbed her hand in time and pulled her into his arms. Chen Hui, however, fell straight down.","At the moment of impact, Chen Hui showed a relieved smile.","If I become a cute little cat, would Mom like me a bit more?","This thought had been rooted in Chen Hui's mind for a long time.","His mother hated him, beating him every time she saw him, or using him to extort money from his biological father.","His mother had said many times that if he didn't exist in this world, she would be very happy.","However, his mother was very good to the pet cat at home. She would groom its fur, feed it the best cat food, hug it while sleeping, and talk to it affectionately.","Chen Hui had always wished in his heart that it would be so good if he could become a cat.","As he grew up, by chance, he became an obstetrician and was assigned to perform abortions for pregnant women. Every day, he had to send away many children. They were so small, some hadn't even had the chance to grow eyes to see this world before their lives were taken away.","Those children were unfortunate because they were unwanted children who lost their lives; but they were also lucky because they didn't have to face a world full of malice in their long lives ahead.","They wouldn't have to repeat his miserable life like he did.","No one in this world loved him.","Including his mother.","In the next life, he'd be a little kitten. Whether raised in a warm home or wandering the streets, even if he was ugly, missing an ear, or had a broken leg, there would still be passersby who would feed him ham sausages, people who would call him cute.","No one would dislike a little kitten.","With a loud thud, Chen Hui fell heavily to the ground. His backpack also burst open, dropping out a transparent glass jar.","Blood flowed from his mouth and nose, staining his smile red.","\"Isn't that little Chen? Why did he jump off the building? Quick, call an ambulance!\" The crowd of onlookers immediately gathered around.","Old Chen, the security guard, also squeezed into the crowd, muttering, \"Isn't that little Chen the criminal who killed using cats? Impossible, how could such a kind young man be a criminal?\"","\"That's right, did the police make a mistake? Little Chen is such a kind-hearted boy.\"","\"You never really know a person, who would have thought that the honest and simple little Chen was this kind of person.\"","\"Aiya, from now on we shouldn't let couriers come to our doors anymore, who knows what they might do!\"","\"That's right, now that the economy is bad, people easily become perverted, everyone should be careful!\"","Bai Jing squeezed through the crowd. When she saw Chen Hui's body on the ground, she rushed over: \"Chen Hui, what happened to you? Didn't you tell me you would live on bravely? How could you leave first...\"","She turned to the surrounding crowd, \"Please, someone call an ambulance quickly!\"","The police on the rooftop also had a sense of unreality.","\"Chen Hui died just like that, he got off too easy!\"","Fang Rui didn't even bother to look at Chen Hui who had fallen. He was holding Mu Mian, who had turned pale, seemingly shocked into a daze.","He gently patted Mu Mian's face, \"Forensic Mu, are you alright?\"","Mu Mian came to her senses and suddenly started crying again, \"Wuwu...\"","\"Even if your mother doesn't love you, you don't need to cry like this. Stop the tears!\"","Fang Rui was at a loss, he hadn't expected Mu Mian to cry uncontrollably. She didn't seem like an emotionally expressive person.","\"Just now... I was so scared. It's so high, I almost fell down too.\"","\"So you're crying because you were scared?\"","\"Yes, I'm afraid of heights. I don't know if my mother loves me or not, I was lying to him earlier!\"","\"Not bad, you've mastered the skill of lying.\"","\"It was a white lie,\" Mu Mian corrected.","Mu Mian's limbs were limp, her whole body dizzy. She remembered there was something important and gestured to Fang Rui: \"Six... six...\"","\"Has she been shocked into confusion?\" Fang Rui looked at Lin Sen, \"Do people talk nonsense after being stimulated?\"","However, Mu Mian had already fainted. Fang Rui quickly had someone take Mu Mian to the hospital.","Lin Sen stood on the rooftop, looking down at Chen Hui lying in a pool of blood, and the broken glass jar.","The glass shards reflected a dazzling light.","Chen Hui didn't jump off the building immediately, but negotiated with them for a while before resolutely committing suicide. Was he waiting for some opportunity?","Zhang sighed, \"My goodness, this case is finally over! Let's wrap it up! I need to rest for a few days!\"","Others also chimed in. They had been working day and night for the past few days and were exhausted.","\"Wait a minute,\" Lin Sen poured cold water on the crowd preparing to celebrate, \"It might not be over yet.\"","\"No way, isn't Chen Hui the killer? Did we catch the wrong person?\"","\"There might be another victim.\"","\"That can't be, there haven't been any pregnant women reported missing recently!\"","\"That's right, the killer is dead, where would a victim come from?\"","\"He didn't want those children to be reborn as cats. He longed to become a cat and be reborn himself,\" Lin Sen spoke softly, \"He didn't jump to commit suicide, but to... be reborn.\"","At this moment, Fang Rui's phone rang.","\"Fang Rui, we've received a report that a pregnant woman named Zhang Xueling has gone missing. She's been out of contact for two days now,\" the voice on the phone sounded panicked. \"Do you remember Professor Bai, the one who insulted the killer before? It seems this pregnant woman might be his lover!\""]},{"number":16,"title":"Chapter 16: The Cat Embryo Human Case: Psychological Manipulation","paragraphs":["The police conducted a search around Chen Hui's residence but found no trace of the pregnant woman, nor any clues.","Time was ticking away second by second.","Fang Rui felt increasingly restless and asked the meditating Lin Sen in the car, \"Where could Chen Hui be hiding the pregnant woman?\"","Holding the drawing made by Mu Mian, Lin Sen muttered, \"If I were Chen Hui, and I wanted to be reborn as a cat, I would...\"","\"If he were to be reborn, he would definitely choose a zodiac date, at an auspicious place.\"","\"Rebirth means returning to the starting point. Time...location... where was his birth location?\" Lin Sen abruptly asked, \"Where was Chen Hui born?\"","Fang Rui immediately understood Lin Sen's intention, \"Good, I'll have someone look it up right away.\"","Rebirth, to return to the time and place of birth.","Time can't be turned back, but we might return to the place.","However, connecting it to Chen Hui's birthplace is extremely difficult due to the long time span, and they lacked the necessary time to look for it carefully.","Then Fang Rui received a call, \"Captain Fang, the forensic investigator Mu says, go check the sixth floor of the previously mentioned building. She says the environment there has changed and wants your assistance.\"","Fang Rui and Lin Sen exchanged glances, intuition told them that the pregnant woman might be there.","Fang Rui and his team searched the entire floor, ultimately discovering a pregnant woman in the room at the very back.","The pregnant woman was still breathing but seemed to have received a large dose of anaesthetic, lying calmly on the bed. Two bottles of medicine were hanging beside the bed, being injected into her body through the drip tube, preserving her life.","Fang Rui promptly got the pregnant woman onto an ambulance.","Because she was sent to the hospital in a timely manner, the doctors were able to successfully extract the dead cat from inside the pregnant woman through surgery. The pregnant woman’s life was saved, but her uterus was severely damaged, and it seemed she would never be able to conceive again.","\"Eh, it's all because of that Professor Bai, if not for his video shaming the criminal online, this girl wouldn’t have been targeted,\" Zhang, couldn’t help but sigh, \"Also, it’s her own fault, of all things, she had to become a third party.\"","Reminded by Zhang, Fang Rui suddenly thought of something.","\"Zhang, check for me, does this Professor Bai have a daughter?\"","\"Why do you want to check this?\"","\"Just go check!\"","The police conducted a thorough search of Chen Hui's house and found 132 jars containing preserved fetal embryos. These embryos had been specially processed and had not decomposed.","Fang Rui found a number of mystical books on Chen Hui’s bedside, all related to the reincarnation of the soul.","Among them was a crime novel. In the novel, to attract media attention, the criminal stuffed live cats into the stomachs of pregnant women. Chen Hui had scribbled notes throughout this book. It seemed to have acted as a reference for his crime.","There were many bottles filled with common medications for treating schizophrenia in Chen Hui’s drawer.","In the drawer, there was a diary, carefully detailing Chen Hui's criminal plans, and how his mind twisted step by step, eventually fostering the malevolent idea of being reborn as a cat.","Fang Rui quickly discerned Chen Hui's process of crime.","Originally, Chen Hui was an obstetrician-gynecologist. Half a year ago, he was fired due to frequent mistakes in his work. It was at this time he was diagnosed with schizophrenia but did not seek hospital treatment.","Three months ago, he started implementing his rebirth plan.","He applied for a job as a delivery man, taking advantage of his work pretext to enter the home of his first victim, Li Yan, and commit a crime.","Using the excuse of parcel collection, he tricked the second victim, Lu Yaoyao, to his delivery van, drugged her, and transported her to the crime scene in the same van.","Thanks to his deliveryman's identity, he managed to avoid police investigation several times.","His diary presented the entire process of the crime, clear as daylight.","\"Boss, Professor Bai does indeed have a daughter,\" Zhang paused for a moment, creating suspense. \"We know this person. Can you guess who it is?\"","\"Bai Jing!\"","\"You guessed it. Bai Jing is from the psychology department of A University. Half a year ago, she applied to be a social worker in the Ziweili Residential Area. Her psychology studies were wasted; she didn't see that Chen Hui was a psychopath.\"","A suspicion was growing in Fang Rui's mind, but he had no evidence to support it.","The next morning, the sunshine was bright and cheerful.","Early in the morning, Fang Rui drove to Ziweili Residential Area. As soon as he arrived at the plaza, he spotted Mu Mian standing near the flower beds.","She was still lost in thought.","\"Forensic Mu, are you waiting for a ride again?\" Fang Rui approached her and asked teasingly.","\"Waiting for you.\"","As she spoke, Mu Mian looked again towards the lawn not far away, where Bai Jing was feeding a cat.","\"I once thought she was a good person,\" Mu Mian murmured. \"After I arrived here, she was the second person to return my smile.\"","\"And what do you think now?\"","\"I'm not sure.\" Mu Mian's voice was somewhat low. \"The first one to respond to my smile was Chen Hui, but he doesn't seem like a good person.\"","Feeling their gaze, Bai Jing put down the cat food and walked towards them.","\"Officer Fang, congratulations on cracking this serial murder case!\" Bai Jing smiled at them, her tone suddenly turn somber. \"I can't quite believe it... The kind-hearted Chen Hui would do something like this!\"","\"Miss Bai studies psychology. Didn't you notice anything abnormal about his mental state?\"","\"A lot of psychological diseases are latent. Without in-depth interaction, they are hard to detect. Everyone in the residential area had dealings with Chen Hui, but no one noticed that there was anything wrong with him. This shows that his symptoms were not obvious.\"","Bai Jing mocked herself, \"What's more, if my professional knowledge was good, how could I not find a job and ended up working as a community service worker here?\"","\"Your father is a university professor, can't he find a job for you?\"","As soon as her father was mentioned, Bai Jing's facial expression became stiff for a moment.","\"My mother has already divorced that man. Please do not associate me with him.\"","\"Do you hate your father?\"","Bai Jing's eyes were filled with defensiveness: \"Officer Fang, what are you trying to ask, exactly?\"","\"Is it really a coincidence that the third victim was your father's mistress?\"","\"Of course it's not a coincidence. It was he who first posted a video online to provoke Chen Hui. Someone who studies psychology, yet doesn't understand how to respect people, it's laughable!\"","On Bai Jing's face, there was little expression. \"This is his retribution, and the retribution of that woman for being a mistress, isn't it?\"","\"Miss Bai, were these books you showed to Chen Hui?\"","\"Do you mean the coloring book? That's a gift I gave to Chen Hui,\" Bai Jing responded, \"Chen Hui sometimes has trouble controlling his emotions. I gave it to him to help him regulate.\"","\"I'm talking about the books on mysticism.\"","\"No. Chen Hui and I are not interested in mysticism.\"","\"You used those books on mysticism, and that novel to lure Chen Hui into committing these crimes, didn't you?\"","\"Do you suspect me?\" Bai Jing sounded somewhat incredulous, \"Do you suspect that I caused Chen Hui to become like this?\"","Bai Jing became agitated instantly, her voice choked up, tears flowing uncontrollably down her cheeks.","\"Believe it or not, Chen Hui was a good friend of mine. Recently, I've been feeling a lot of regret... If I had been better at my major, if I had been more intelligent, could I have seen the pain he was hiding behind his bright smile? Could I have pulled him out from the muck of his dysfunctional family...\"","Mu Mian quietly pulled out a tissue and handed it to Bai Jing, \"Even if you had noticed, you couldn't have helped him because psychological counseling is not effective for mental illness. You should have taken him to the hospital...\"","Fang Rui signaled Mu Mian with his eyes to keep quiet.","Mu Mian protested with a sense of grievance, \"I was comforting her.\"","\"...\"","Rather than respond to them, Bai Jing focused on her lamenting. \"Chen Hui was a beam of sunlight in my life. After I graduated from a prestigious school and couldn't find a job, and had to settle for a job paying just a few thousand, it was him who comforted me, it was him who took me to feed the stray cats.\"","\"In fact, if it weren't for Chen Hui, I would have jumped off that building,” pointing towards a building at a distance, Bai Jing stated, \"I stood there several times. It was Chen Hui who saved me.\"","\"He told me that life is precious. Just like these stray cats; they have nothing, but they continue to live freely.\"","Fang Rui promptly advised her, \"Miss Bai, in your current state, you should consider seeing a psychiatrist.\"","\"Don't worry, I won't commit suicide. Only those who are mentally fragile choose to escape reality through suicide. Besides, these stray cats still need me.\"","Seeing her in such a state, Fang Rui realized that he wasn't going to get anything useful out of Bai Jing.","Although one could deduce from the results that Bai Jing benefitted, there was currently no evidence pointing towards Bai Jing having any dealings with the case.","Even if it was discovered that Bai Jing had a close relationship with Chen Hui, it wouldn't prove anything, much less charge Bai Jing with any crime.","\"Officer Fang, you don't need me for anything else, do you?\" Bai Jing wiped her tears, slowly regaining her composure, \"I need to go to work. I work hard to earn a living and feed these little ones.”","Watching Bai Jing walk away, Fang Rui turned to look at Mu Mian, \"Mu Mian, do you think she manipulated Chen Hui to commit the crimes?\"","\"It doesn't seem like she has the ability to do so.\"","\"That's true. She is just an ordinary psychology graduate. She shouldn't have the ability to manipulate Chen Hui into committing crimes,\" someone commented.","\"But my older sister said that people's self-awareness is fragile. Sometimes a simple psychological suggestion can interfere with others' choices,\" another person interjected.","\"Even if Chen Hui committed crimes under her influence, we can't catch her. We can't say that Bai Jing used psychological suggestion to control Chen Hui into committing all these murders,\" came a counter-argument.","Fang Rui felt helpless. If Bai Jing really used psychological suggestions to mould Chen Hui into a serial killer, then Bai Jing is truly terrifying.","\"Although I can't quite figure out whether her expressions are real or feigned, I think Chen Hui must have been the sunshine in her life. She wouldn't intentionally extinguish it,\" someone hypothesized.","\"Only Bai Jing would know if she did lead Chen Hui astray,\" someone else pointed out.","Mu Mian turned to Fang Rui, asking, \"Why did you keep my secret?\"","\"What?\"","\"You know that I have autism, don't you? But I was never fired. Is it you who kept the secret for me?\"","Fang Rui paused, \"Was this really a secret? Can't everyone see it?\"","Changing the subject, Fang Rui suggested, \"Let's go eat. I'm treating.\"","\"I should be treating you. I appreciate you keeping my secret,\" Mu Mian insisted.","After walking a few steps, Fang Rui turned to give Mu Mian a warm smile.","\"Mu Mian, you don't have to pretend to be normal,\" he told her.","A smile...this was the third person to smile at her since she arrived.","In that moment, Mu Mian's heart felt as if it was touched by sunshine, warmly illuminating her.","It was a satisfaction felt from being accepted.","\"Because, your secret might not be a secret anymore,\" he added.","Stunned, like she was struck by lightning, Mu Mian stared at him. \"Who did you tell?\"","She had perfectly masked herself, how could anyone see through her?","\"Consultant Lin discovered it. Zhang was there too at that time. You probably don't know, but there's nothing that he can keep to himself. Once he knows, the whole department will know,\" Fang Rui explained.","Mu Mian felt a wave of sadness wash over her. She had meticulously hidden her true self for nearly a month. Was all her effort in vain? She had thought she hid it so well.","\"Mu Mian, just be yourself from now on. You don't need to pretend to be seen as normal,\" he reassured her.","Can she really be herself?","\"Captain Fang,\" Mu Mian looked at Fang Rui earnestly, \"would you donate your body to me?\"","\"No! I've told you not to bring up that again!\"","It seems that being herself is still out of reach..."]},{"number":17,"title":"Chapter 17: The Cat Child Case: The Unloved Child","paragraphs":["After Chen Hui's case was closed, the police station became much more relaxed.","Mu Mian made significant contributions in the process of solving the case, leading to his formal promotion and official entry into the Special Crime Unit, and Chen Xue became Mu Mian's assistant.","The Special Crime Unit held a welcoming ceremony for Mu Mian.","Mu Mian met many familiar faces. They were all friendly towards him, after all, as soon as he arrived at the city bureau, he helped them solve a major murder case.","Mu Mian's impression changed from an eccentric forensic doctor to a competent case solver.","\"Mu Mian, write a self-criticism, and reflect well on why a forensic doctor like you could be taken hostage by the killer.\" Fang Rui's words broke the previous friendly atmosphere, \"Submit it to me before work ends.\"","\"Alright.\"","Fang Rui received Mu Mian's self-criticism, which was very earnestly written, with deeply profound self-analysis. Just as he was about to fold it up, he caught sight of the conclusion:","All the above reasons are not the root cause of why I was taken hostage by the killer. The real reason is: I've been unlucky lately, or in Chen Xue's words, my luck has been bad! People of the Leo zodiac sign will be very unlucky recently!","Seeing Mu Mian space out in front of the computer, Chen Xue patted her, \"Mian Mian, why are you wasting time and effort on DNA tests for these babies? It's meaningless.\"","\"Chen Xue, I want to help these fetuses find their mothers.\"","\"Their mothers had them aborted, they didn't want them anymore, what good would finding their parents do? They won't take this jar back, they might even resent it for bringing bad luck.\"","\"Were they... also abandoned by their mothers?\" Mu Mian looked at the clumps of flesh floating in glass jars, seeming somewhat perplexed.","\"Of course!\" Chen Xue felt that today's Mu Mian was a bit different. She was usually spaced-out, expressionless, but today she seems particularly down.","Mu Mian hung her head, \"Why don't they want them? These embryos look healthy, they could have been normal children.\"","Mu Mian had always thought that it was only the disabled children who were abandoned by their mothers, like those in the orphanage who were sick, or physically handicapped, or autistic...","\"There are many reasons, it could be an unplanned pregnancy or lack of resources to raise them... In any case, their mothers won't want to see them again.\"","Chen Xue took a sip of her coffee, \"So let's send these embryos to the funeral parlor asap. Otherwise, it's bad luck to keep them here.\"","Mu Mian remained silent.","\"I know you feel sympathetic towards these embryos. How about we give these embryos names, so they would have left some traces of existence in this world.\"","\"I already named them.\"","Only then did Chen Xue notice that there were labels stuck on the jars:","BB1, BB2...","\"Do these names carry any special meaning?\"","\"This one is called Baby No.1, this one is called Baby No.2, and so on.\"","Chen Xue facepalmed. Mu Mian did show kindness, but not too thoughtfully.","Mu Mian continued searching for the parents of these children in the police department's gene bank.","But she found nothing.","Mu Mian became somewhat frustrated.","She tried to match the genes of the victims with those of these children. But the result showed no match.","Mu Mian frowned, weren't the jars marked with the death date of the deceased supposed to contain their children?","Chen Hui's house had been thoroughly searched, all the jars had been brought to the office, and Mu Mian had collected all the DNA data. However, the DNA of the infants in those jars did not match that of the three victims.","So, where had Chen Hui hidden the fully formed fetuses inside the stomachs of these three victims?","Why did he hide them?","Mu Mian pulled out the files of the three victims again and discovered that they had all had pregnancy check-ups at the Anqi Obstetrics and Gynecology Hospital, where Chen Hui worked.","\"Mu Mian, Zhang Qiang says there is a dinner tonight. Will you go?\"","Chen Xue's voice disrupted Mu Mian’s pondering, and suddenly she felt that the truth of the matter wasn't that important.","Those children were all unwanted, who would care about where their bodies were?","\"Can I... not go?\"","\"Of course not! As a newcomer to the workplace, it is essential to go to the dinner!\"","\"Okay.\"","The dinner ended well past ten in the evening.","When Mu Mian returned home and was about to open the door, she noticed that the keyhole was shifted by 5 degrees - someone had broken into her house, and they had used a key.","As Mu Mian contemplated whether to call the police, the door suddenly opened from the inside.","\"Mu Mian, it's been a long time.\" A beautiful woman emerged from inside, holding out her arms to hug Mu Mian.","\"Shen Xiyin.\"","Mu Mian was slightly taken aback upon seeing Shen Xiyin, with her voice slightly choked.","Shen Xiyin was the daughter of her foster parents and also Mu Mian's therapist. Mu Mian had grown up abroad as her parents had gotten divorced and her father had died, her father's colleague had adopted her.","Shen Xiyin released Mu Mian and gave a gentle smile, \"You didn't push me away this time, it seems like living independently has brought about some changes in you.\"","\"We haven't seen each other in a long time, so we can hug.\" Mu Mian hated physical contact with others; it was already hard enough for her to not push her away.","\"How did you get injured on your neck?\" Shen Xiyin noticed the scar on Mu Mian's neck.","\"Zhang says, it's a badge of honor.\" Mu Mian's voice carried a hint of pride.","\"A badge?\"","\"It is the badge left by my confrontation with a ruthless criminal.\"","Mu Mian briefly described the course of events, of course, she hid the part about her acrophobia causing her to faint, and then embellished the part about how she escaped from Chen Hui.","Mu Mian found that she could already skillfully tell small white lies.","\"Your work seems quite dangerous.\"","Shen Xiyin had already found Mu Mian a very good job, working as a researcher at a university, which was stable and required no social interaction. But Mu Mian had secretly quit.","\"Not dangerous. Chen Xue says I am the only forensic pathologist in the office who was taken hostage by a murderer. This shows how safe this job really is.\"","\"But you got hurt.\"","\"That's because I’m unlucky, otherwise known as going through a retrograde period. But don’t worry, Chen Xue says that Leo's retrograde period is already over, my luck for the next few months will be very good.\"","Shen Xiyin realized, Mu Mian had changed a lot.","Mu Mian took several notebooks from the desk, \"I have recorded all the peculiar things that have been happening recently in my self-observation diary.\"","Shen Xiyin flipped through Mu Mian's observation diary. As with previous entries, they were descriptions of events viewed objectively, with little subjective emotional experience.","When she read about Mu Mian's interest in the body of her deceased coworker and realized she had even planned how to study the corpse, Shen Xiyin seemed a bit exasperated, \"How have you been getting along with your colleagues?\"","\"I don't know. Most of my colleagues don't talk to me much. Maybe not so good, they don't smile at me,\" Mu Mian slumped into the sofa, sounding extremely dejected, \"I've been interacting with them according to the social guidelines, but it seems like I still messed up.\"","\"But they were okay with you hitching a ride. And you became a regular in just a month,\" Shen Xiyin encouraged, \"This shows that your social skills have improved a lot.\"","\"Really?\" Mu Mian's mood immediately lifted, \"Sister Xiyin, am I a normal person now?\"","She had asked this question countless times since childhood.","Mu Mian was diagnosed with autism when she was just three years old. At that time, many top autism experts predicted: Mu Mian would have a low IQ, might not even develop language skills, and would lack emotion.","When Mu Mian still couldn't speak at the age of six, all the therapists gave up on teaching her language skills.","However, only Shen Xiyin didn't give up. She was just a high school student at the time, not understanding complicated techniques. She could only repeat simple words and phrases in front of Mu Mian over and over again, even if Mu Mian didn't respond.","Amazingly, Mu Mian eventually spoke her first word. Now, she could basically communicate with others without any problems.","The journey was lengthy and challenging.","Shen Xiyin knew very well that it was a miracle for Mu Mian to have recovered to this extent.","Mu Mian could never become a \"normal\" person.","No matter how much training she went through, she would never have the emotions of a 'normal' person.","\"Little Mian, you're a genius. Geniuses are always a bit different from others.\"","\"I still want to be a normal person like you.\"","Mu Mian had always admired Shen Xiyin. Her sister had loving parents, many friends, didn't have to hide in the corner all by herself, and was never a burden to anyone.","Shen Xiyin understood why Mu Mian wanted to be normal—Mu Mian stubbornly believed that if her autism was cured, her mother would come back for her.","\"I'm sorry, Little Mian, it's my fault. I shouldn't have hidden your mother's photos. You have the right to find your mother.\"","Half a year ago, Mu Mian found her mother's marriage license and a stack of photos in Shen Xiyin's room. In one of them, her mother was holding a baby, her eyes full of affection.","This photo overturned Mu Mian's opinion of her mother—an unfeeling woman who abandoned her autistic child. It led to a fierce argument between Mu Mian and Shen Xiyin, and Mu Mian ran away from home.","Mu Mian suddenly interrupted her, \"I don’t want to look for her anymore.\"","\"Why?\" Shen Xiyin was somewhat surprised, \"Didn't you return to China to find your mother?\"","Mu Mian thought of Chen Hui, who committed so many evil deeds, just to gain illusory love and acceptance.","\"Here is your photo,\" Mu Mian took out the picture with her mother from the pocket of her clothes, took a reluctant glance at it, then handed it to Shen Xiyin, \"I think you are right. I shouldn't disturb her current life, nor should I let her disturb mine.\"","Shen Xiyin was surprised by Mu Mian's shift. In fact, she was not eager for Mu Mian to see that woman, as it might be a heavy blow to Mu Mian.","\"Mu Mian, let's move. The sound insulation here is not good, and it's too far from where you work,\" Shen Xiyin closed Mu Mian's diary. \"I have already bought a house near your city bureau, let's move there in the next few days.\"","\"Are you also staying here?\" Mu Mian was somewhat surprised, \"What about your job?\"","\"I have a senior sister who opened a psychological clinic, she wants me to return to China to help her, I have agreed.\"","Seeing that Mu Mian's mood was low, Shen Xiyin added, \"Mu Mian, you are not a burden to me, you are my family. No matter what happens, I will not abandon you.\"","Shen Xiyin knew that Mu Mian had a great sense of insecurity, so she always repeatedly told Mu Mian that there were people who would steadfastly love her.","\"And neither will I!\"","Shen Xiyin somewhat hoped Mu Mian could abandon her, as then Mu Mian would be able to become an independent person."]},{"number":18,"title":"Chapter 18: Cloud of Suspicion: Was He Murdered","paragraphs":["Fang Rui took advantage of his time off and had a good rest at home for several days. But when he opened the door, he saw Mu Mian squatting in front of his house, her eyes vacant, seemingly lost in thought.","\"Mu Mian, why are you squatting in front of my house? Looking for a loan?\" Fang Rui frowned at her.","\"Fang Rui?\" Upon seeing Fang Rui, Mu Mian looked surprised, \"What a coincidence, so you also live here!\"","\"What are you doing?\"","\"Eliminating potential threats. The good news is, the danger alert has now been cleared!\"","Mu Mian's new home almost perfectly met her requirements: quiet surroundings, no blind spots for surveillance, and close to her workplace.","The only thing that worried her was her unseen neighbor.","Fang Rui looked at the peeling door. Except for being a bit run-down, it seemed nothing special.","He asked in confusion, \"What risks? Someone is planning to break into my room?\"","\"I thought my neighbor was a violent adult male. But now I see it's just you, I feel more at ease.\"","\"Why would you think I'm violent?\"","\"During my inspection around the new house, I noticed that the neighbor's doorknob was loose and the bottom of the door frame had lots of shoe prints—evidence of frequent violent treatment.\"","\"...\"","\"So, I deduced that the occupant could be a quick-tempered, violence-prone danger.\"","Mu Mian explained gravely, not noticing Fang Rui's rapidly darkening face.","\"You're pretty unlucky then, to have a dangerous neighbor like me.\"","\"Not unlucky at all!\"","With Fang Rui there, she felt her safety was secured. She wouldn't have to worry about being captured by a murderer and taken to the rooftop for chills anymore.","\"Congratulations, you've got a very dependable neighbor.\" Mu Mian pointed at herself, beginning to enumerate her own virtues, \"I won't make any noise, won't litter; if you fall ill, I'll be the first one to take you to the hospital.\"","\"You sure you won't be squatting by my bed, waiting for me to pass away and then steal my body?\"","Fang Rui imagined the scenario in his head and felt it quite humorous. Mu Mian being so tiny, she probably wouldn’t be able to move his corpse.","\"Stealing bodies is illegal!\" Mu Mian corrected him.","\"...You sure respectful of the law.\"","\"I will take you to the hospital first, then stay by your sickbed, get the body donation document from you before you die. Don't worry, I'll take good care of your body...\"","\"...\" Why did he even bring up this subject?","At this point, Fang Rui's phone rang. Mu Mian tried to avoid it, but saw Fang Rui put his hand on her shoulder, his expression becoming serious.","\"Call the firefighters for a fire! The fire department reported it? Give me the address.\"","\"The villa area on the outskirts of the city. Boss, I've already sent you the coordinates on your phone, hurry up!\"","\"Mu Mian, your vacation is over.\" After finishing the call, Fang Rui turned to Mu Mian, \"There's a new case, we'll go straight to the scene.\"","\"Let's go immediately!\" Mu Mian's eyes instantly lit up.","Fang Rui was speechless, why was Mu Mian so interested in dead bodies?","By the time Fang Rui and Mu Mian arrived at the scene, the fire had already been extinguished. Zhang and his team also made it to the scene of the homicide.","The once lush green lawn was burnt bare, strewn with a variety of objects and shards of glass.","Mu Mian paused in her steps as she felt like she stepped on something. Something soft was prickling her feet. She looked down and was startled to find a charred severed finger.","Mu Mian put on her gloves and picked it up for closer inspection.","The finger had a silver ring on it. The ring was uniquely shaped and irregular, much like a Möbius strip.","The ring's silver sheen glimmered under the sunlight.","\"What on earth are you holding, Doctor Mu?\" Zhang suddenly exclaimed, \"Is that a broken finger?\"","Everyone turned their attention towards Mu Mian.","\"I picked it up from the ground.\" she said, putting the finger with the ring into an evidence bag.","\"The impact of the blast shredded the victim’s body, you all might come across many body parts.\"","Mu Mian further explained: \"So be careful not to step on the body parts. Also, please mark the spots where you find the remains.”","\"My God, I used to think it was just drama in those war stories, but it seems even minor explosions can shatter bodies!\" exclaimed Zhang.","Fang Rui gave Zhang a look, \"Do you want to check out the state of this building? Can you call this a minor explosion?\"","The mansion’s owner, Ye Zeming, was a renowned sculpture artist in the city. He enjoyed a surge in his net worth as his works sold at high prices over the recent years.","The targeted villa was his workshop, stocked with inflammable materials such as paints, varnishes, and plaster, which aggravated the fire. The villa had been reduced to its frame, even the lawn outside was left scorched and explosions occurred in several parts inside the house.","The floor-to-ceiling windows on the second floor were completely shattered with a part of the roof collapsed too. The place was in complete disarray.","The body of the deceased was buried under shards of glass and bricks. The body had scattered into several pieces, and due to the prolonged exposure to the fire, the remains had turned charred black, emitting a revolting smell.","\"Oh God, this smell is unbearable! I guess I won't be having barbecued meat for at least half a month!\" lamented Zhang.","Someone immediately responded, \"Oh, please. The first time you saw a corpse, you declared to quit meat forever, and look at you now, eating more than any of us.”","Old Zhang, the captain of the fire brigade, knew Fang Rui. On his arrival, Old Zhang quickly briefed him about the situation on site.","\"Captain Fang, we believe the victim's fragmented body is due to the blast. This building was filled with explosive materials, which on meeting a spark ignited an explosion. But the victim’s sister insists he was murdered and demands an investigation.\"","Fang Rui asked: \"Have we identified the point of the fire's origin and where the explosion occurred?\"","\"The building was filled with combustible materials, pinpointing the exact location where the fire started is proving difficult, we are still investigating.\"","Mu Mian, wearing gloves, started collecting the remains of the deceased.","With the help of Zhang and others, Mu Mian quickly gathered the deceased's torso and limbs.","The upper half of the body was relatively complete, but the portion below the thighs had mostly been blasted into fragments. Many of the soft tissues, including the reproductive parts, were still missing.","Preliminarily, all these fragments were believed to belong to a single deceased individual.","The face of the deceased was carbonized and covered in ashes. Therefore, the appearance was not identifiable.","But from the pelvic part of the corpse, it could be concluded that the deceased was an adult male.","\"Fang Rui, he was already deceased before the fire broke out. This could be a murder case!\" Mu Mian turned to Fang Rui and said.","Old Zhang doubted Mu Mian's expertise, seeing as she seemed young and freshly out of college.","He retorted, \"It's not possible! Ye Zeming's sister saw him at the scene of the fire. How could he have died before the fire?\"","\"There are no signs of life response on the burns and the severed body parts, which indicates that the deceased was already dead when the fire and explosion occurred. In fact, the time of death was at least two to three hours before the fire broke out.\"","As Mu Mian explained, she continued to scrutinize the breakage on the body parts.","She frowned in puzzlement – the rupture sites of these fragments were too smooth, neither explosion-induced nor caused by a cutting tool, the wounds were strange.","Moreover, body fragments in previous explosion cases would often have soft tissues separated from the skeleton, torn apart. However, these fragments were relatively intact, as if a sculpture had fallen and shattered.","Old Zhang stubbornly claimed, \"Multiple witnesses saw the victim at the window on a phone call before the fire. The victim's sister also affirmed that she saw her brother at the scene of the fire. She was the last person to see him alive.\"","\"What they saw might not be the deceased.\"","\"What?\"","\"What those eyewitnesses saw was a living Ye Zeming.\"","Fang Rui asked, \"Mu Mian, are you suspecting that the deceased is not Ye Zeming?\"","\"Let's start with a DNA test on the body. Does Ye Zeming have any close relatives?\""]},{"number":19,"title":"Chapter 19: Mystery of Shattered Corpse: Love Triangle","paragraphs":["Ye Zeming has a sister named Ye Zeling, twenty-seven years old, a dance drama actress. She was the first to discover the fire and called the fire brigade.","When Fang Rui and Zhang located her, she was outside the police cordon, engaged in a fight with another woman, and several policewomen were intervening to separate them.","The beaten woman was the former girlfriend of the deceased, named Lin Lan.","\"You damn woman, why are you here? Did you start this fire? Did you kill my brother? I knew it, you could not let go of my brother.\"","Ye Zeling yanked Lin Lan's hair forcefully, cursing like a shrew. Her crude behavior heavily contrasts with her beautiful appearance.","\"Zeling, your brother called me here.\"","Lin Lan's hair was disheveled, and there were several scratches on her body, but her tone was still gentle, looking at Ye Zeling as if looking at a naughty child.","\"Nonsense! Impossible! My brother assured me that he would never see you again, why would he call you? You're lying!\" Ye Zeling became increasingly hysterical, her fierce eyes seeming to want to tear Lin Lan apart.","\"Your brother said he wanted to see me one last time.\"","\"Shut up! You're fantasizing again that my brother likes you. My brother hates you, you wicked woman, he would never see you!\"","Lin Lan started to argue back, \"Your brother called me anyway. You are not your brother. How would you know he doesn't want to see me?\"","\"Shut up! I just know. My brother says you're a whore!\"","Seeing Fang Rui and Zhang come over, Ye Zeling immediately felt bolstered.","\"Officer, the fire was definitely set by this woman. She's the murderer! My brother dumped her, and she held a grudge, she killed my brother!\"","\"We will thoroughly investigate this case. Miss Ye, please return to the station for questioning with me,\" said the officer.","\"Good, officer, I will fully cooperate. You must catch my brother's murderer!\" Ye Zeling spoke as she unleashed a venomous glare on Lin Lan.","Zhang corrected her, \"I'm younger than you, you can just call me Officer Zhang,\" emphasizing on 'Officer'.","Zhang then looked at Lin Lan, saying, \"You should come to the station for questioning as well.\"","\"Okay, I will cooperate with your investigation,\" Lin Lan replied defiantly, mocking Ye Zeling with a smirk.","Just then, two policemen emerged, carrying a body bag.","\"Is that my brother's body?\" Ye Zeling threw herself onto the body bag, sobbing uncontrollably, \"Bro, how could you just die like this? How am I supposed to live without you?\"","Everyone present was a bit stunned - the siblings' bond was incredibly strong.","Fang Rui turned to look at Lin Lan. Lin Lan was staring at Ye Zeling, disgust written on her face, but she quickly managed to squeeze out a few tears, feigning grief.","\"Can I ride in the same car as my brother?\" Ye Zeling did not let go of the body bag, \"I want to be with my brother.\"","Mu Mian was taken aback, it was her first time seeing someone so enamored with a corpse. Despite the body being shattered beyond recognition and the stench of flesh charred by fire, Ye Zeling couldn't let go.","She really loved it!","Mu Mian wanted to befriend her.","She switched her gaze to Fang Rui, lost in thought.","Sensing the intense gaze from Mu Mian, Fang Rui couldn't help but ask, \"What's the matter, Doctor Mu?\"","\"If your corpse were to be shattered like that, I definitely wouldn't embrace it. However, I would try to piece you back together!\"","\"...Should I say thank you?\" He added one more unnecessary question.","\"You're welcome.\"","Despite Ye Zeling's persistence, Fang Rui relented and let her ride in the car with the deceased.","\"If you're not afraid, go ahead and ride in this car.\"","\"This is my brother's body, why would I be afraid! I would like to ride in this car!\"","Mu Mian warned her: \"Just don't open the bag. I haven't finished piecing the body together yet. I suggest you wait for me to finish before viewing his remains!\"","Ye Zeling stared at Mu Mian with her shiny, large eyes, \"What do you mean?\"","\"The body of the deceased has been blown to pieces.\" Mu Mian kindly informed, \"Don't worry, I will do my best to put him back together. I am rather good at jigsaws.\"","What then followed was the sound of sirens accompanying Ye Zeling's loud wails the entire way, causing headaches for everyone in hearing range.","As Ye Zeling had had a mental breakdown, Fang Rui and Zhang had no choice but to first take a statement from Lin Lan.","Lin Lan was a pastry chef in her thirties. She was not as pretty as Ye Zeling, but had a unique charm of tranquillity and timelessness, and her voice was gentle.","\"Miss Lin, what is your relationship with Ye Zeming?\"","\"Zeming is my ex-boyfriend.\" Lin Lan lowered her eyelids, her tone somewhat desolate, \"Now, I guess we have no relationship. We broke up six months ago.\"","\"Why did you break up?\"","\"Isn't the answer obvious?\" Lin Lan laughed at herself, \"Once he gained prosperity, he went about damaging relationships. After Zeming became an art master with a net worth of millions, he thought me beneath him, a mere humble pastry chef, and dumped me.\"","Zhang asked, \"Do you hold grudges against him?\"","\"How could I not! When he was in difficulty, penniless, I was the one who took care of him. However, once I was useless to him, he kicked me out, spreading rumors that I was a gold digger and had left him for money before he made a name.","Ahh, but what good is resentment? When we broke up, he gave me a huge sum of money, we settled the score. Life has to go on, you can't be immersed in painful memories all the time.\"","Lin Lan's voice was calm, she seemed void of any emotions towards Ye Zeming. There was no emotional fluctuation when she mentioned him.","Fang Rui asked, \"Considering your bitter fallout, why did he call you this morning?\"","\"He told me he was leaving the country and wanted to see me one last time before he left, to apologise. Initially, I refused but he said he had something important to return to me. I had no choice but to agree.\"","\"What is it?\"","\"He didn't tell me. But I guessed it was the cross that my grandmother gave me, I lost it at his place, couldn't find it, I thought he had found it and wanted to return it to me.\"","Suddenly, something came into Lin Lan's mind, she pulled out her phone, \"This is a recording of our phone call. You might want to listen.\"","Fang Rui played the recording aloud. Indeed, the contents of the call matched what Lin Lan had described.","\"Miss Lin, do you habitually record your calls?\" Fang casually asked.","\"In our line of work, we constantly need to communicate with customers. Some clients are indecisive, if we don't record, it will lead to endless disputes at billing. So, I have set my phone to automatically record all incoming calls.\"","\"Was the relationship between Ye Zeling and the deceased good?\"","\"Pretty good. Their mother left home when Zeling was two, and their father passed away early. It was Zeming who brought up Zeling. Hence, their sibling bond is exceptionally strong.\"","Lin Lan gave a self-mocking smile, \"So good that they might be a bit exclusive. Therefore, she despises me, has prejudices against me. She always says I am after her brother's money, but when I was with Zeming, I was the one supporting her and her brother.\"","\"You mentioned earlier that the deceased told you he was going abroad, do you know why?\"","\"Perhaps...for love.\"","\"Love?\"","“I’m not sure. But he once told me that he seemed to have found his true love. The reason he broke up with me was because he wanted to be with his true love.”","Fang Rui asked, \"Miss Lin, do Ye Zeming siblings have any other relatives?\"","\"Other relatives? They have an uncle, but they don't get in touch frequently. But Zeming told me that their father had an affair and illegitimate child outside, this was the reason for their parents' divorce.\"","\"Alright, thank you for your cooperation. If you have any clues, please contact me.\"","Leaving the interrogation room, Zhang immediately complained, \"Boss, don't you think there is something twisted about the relationship between the sister and the deceased? They don't behave like the typical siblings.\"","Fang Rui corrected him, \"At this point, it is not confirmed whether the deceased is Ye Zeming.\"","\"Who else can it be! Just now, Lin Lan mentioned that Ye Zeming had a true love. Given Ye Zeling's obsessive property towards her brother, wouldn’t she have gone crazy and ended up killing her brother if she found out about this true love? Can the murderer be Ye Zeling?\"","\"Following your logic, shouldn't she have killed the true love of her brother first?\"","\"Yeah, boss, you thought about it more comprehensively! Shall I go and dig more at the fire scene, see if I can find the body of the deceased's true love?\"","\"You go!\"","Zhang ran off in a puff of smoke.","The world quieted down in an instant for Fang Rui."]},{"number":20,"title":"Chapter 20: Cloud of Suspicion: Sibling Affair","paragraphs":["At the entrance of the autopsy room.","\"I won't let you touch my brother's body. No one can touch it!\" Ye Zeling clung tightly to the body bag, her eyes darting around warily. She threatened to scratch anyone who dared come close. \"Get away! All of you, get away! Don't you dare disturb me and my brother.\"","Mu Mian looked at the scratch marks on the back of her hand, feeling like she had just earned a new badge in her professional career. She might well be the first forensic pathologist in the Jiangzhou City Police Department to be scratched by a victim's family member.","\"Miss Ye, if you keep holding onto the body like this, how can we help you catch your brother's killer?\" a female police officer approached cautiously, trying to soothe her. \"Why don't you let go of your brother's body first and come with me to the rest area? Okay?\"","\"No! Don't think I don't know. An autopsy means you'll cut my brother open. I won't let you get away with it.\"","\"But your brother's body has already been blown apart and burned by the fire,\" Mu Mian carefully reminded her. \"Cutting it open won't make much difference now, since the body is already damaged.\"","\"Ah! I don't want to hear you talk! Go away! Go away!\"","The female police officer was Li Lanlan, the department's psychological counselor. She glared at Mu Mian, signaling with her eyes for Mu Mian to step back and stop agitating the deceased's family member.","Mu Mian quietly retreated to the back, but her eyes remained fixed on the body bag Ye Zeling was holding. She desperately wanted to autopsy this body. She was curious to know what exactly the body had endured to result in such shattered wounds.","\"Miss Ye, please try to calm down. Your brother would want to rest now. If you keep crying and making a fuss, I'm sure it would make him sad,\" Li Lanlan gently patted Ye Zeling's shoulder. \"Can you let us move your brother's body inside first?\"","Ye Zeling seemed to be listening. Her grip on the body bag slowly loosened. But when she looked up and saw Mu Mian staring intently at her brother's body, she immediately tightened her hold again.","\"No! You're lying! You just want to autopsy my brother's body!\"","Mu Mian sighed inwardly. If this dragged on any longer, it would be dark soon. Once night fell, the timid Chen Xue wouldn't want to work overtime with her, and she'd have to autopsy the body alone.","\"Mian, what's going on here?\"","Mu Mian turned around to find her sister, Shen Xiyin, speaking.","\"Sister Xiyin, why are you here?\"","\"Professor Jiang invited us to dinner today. I'm here to pick you up. Professor Jiang is a top expert in autism in the country, and she's also a good friend of Dad's. She's been wanting to meet you.\"","Mu Mian didn't really want to go. Those useless experts always repeated the same boring, tedious procedures. But she didn't want to make things difficult for her sister.","Shen Xiyin changed the subject, \"What's happening here? What's wrong with that girl?\"","\"She's in shock. She needs immediate psychological crisis intervention,\" Mu Mian quietly explained the situation, adding at the end, \"I really want to autopsy that body right now!\"","Shen Xiyin walked over to Ye Zeling, crouching down to meet her eyes:","\"Miss Ye, I know the news of your brother's death is very upsetting for you. I also know that you don't really want to stop the police from autopsying the body. You just don't want to believe that your brother is really gone, isn't that right?\"","Tears rolled down Ye Zeling's cheeks in big drops.","\"Your brother loved you so much. He would want to see you being brave and strong. You want to put your brother's mind at ease too, don't you?\"","\"If my brother loved me, why did he leave me?\" Ye Zeling burst into tears. \"Without my brother, how am I supposed to live on my own?\"","\"You love your brother very much too. For your brother's sake, you can become braver and stronger.\"","\"I...\"","Ye Zeling hugged Shen Xiyin. \"My brother said he would take care of me for life. How could he lie to me!\"","Shen Xiyin patted her shoulder gently. \"Your brother didn't lie to you. He loved you very much. Nothing can change the fact that he loved you. He will always live on in your memories.\"","Ye Zeling cried for a long time. When she was finally exhausted from crying, her emotions stabilized.","Li Lanlan looked at Shen Xiyin with admiration. Li Lanlan felt that what she had said wasn't much different from Shen Xiyin's words, so why was the effect so different?","Shen Xiyin explained: \"People go through four stages when accepting death: denial and shock, anger and resistance, pain and grief, acceptance and adjustment. Miss Ye's situation is a bit special. She witnessed her brother's death with her own eyes, so she can't deny the fact. That's why her resistance is stronger.\"","Li Lanlan asked, \"Are you a professional psychological counselor?\"","\"Not exactly. I'm a psychiatrist. Most of the cases I handle are neurotic patients with psychological abnormalities.\"","\"No wonder you're so good at this. Neurotic patients are much harder to deal with.\"","Shen Xiyin advised, \"Miss Ye's condition requires immediate psychological crisis intervention. Someone needs to watch her 24 hours a day. Her emotional state is very fragile right now.\"","Li Lanlan nodded, \"Mm, I understand.\"","Mu Mian quickly had someone help move the body into the autopsy room. Just as she was about to go change her clothes, Shen Xiyin called out to her, \"Mian, it's already after work hours. We need to go meet Professor Jiang first.\"","Mu Mian's gaze reluctantly left the body bag as she replied in a disappointed tone, \"Alright. Let's go quickly then. I need to work overtime tonight!\"","As they were about to reach the exit, Mu Mian saw Fang Rui and Lin Sen returning from outside. She greeted them, \"Good evening, Captain Fang, Consultant Lin!\"","Shen Xiyin looked at Fang Rui. This name left a deep impression on her, as it appeared most frequently in Mu Mian's self-observation diary. She knew that Fang Rui held a special place in Mu Mian's heart.","When she saw Lin Sen, her brows furrowed slightly before quickly returning to a polite smile.","\"Captain Fang, hello. I'm Mian's sister. Thank you so much for taking care of her.\"","\"Hello.\" For some reason, Fang Rui felt that Mu Mian was acting very strangely today, constantly making eye contact with him as if pleading for help.","But Shen Xiyin was her sister, so why would Mu Mian need to ask for help?","Shen Xiyin then turned to Lin Sen, a smile on her face: \"Lin Sen, long time no see. How have you been?\"","The air suddenly froze.","Lin Sen stared at Shen Xiyin for a full five seconds before coldly averting his gaze and walking away without a word.","Fang Rui was surprised. Although Lin Sen was known for being arrogant and sharp-tongued, he usually maintained basic politeness. Why would he completely ignore Shen Xiyin today? And it seemed they knew each other. Had something happened between them?","Mu Mian's eyes were blinking frantically, trying to get Fang Rui to notice her distress signal and rescue her from her sister using the overtime work excuse. But to no avail.","\"Sister, let's go! We need to hurry to dinner! Quick!\"","\"Alright.\" Shen Xiyin said to Fang Rui, \"Captain Fang, I'll take my sister to dinner now. Let's chat more another day when we have time.\"","After Mu Mian and her sister left, Fang Rui went upstairs and found Lin Sen standing on the second floor, watching Shen Xiyin leave.","\"What happened between you and Mu Mian's sister? She greeted you, but you completely ignored her. Don't tell me she's your ex-girlfriend?\"","Lin Sen turned his head, looking coldly at Fang Rui.","\"Even if she is an ex, you shouldn't treat her so coldly,\" Fang Rui advised. \"You're not getting any younger. If you keep being so cold to everyone, you'll never find someone.\"","Fang Rui and Lin Sen were childhood friends who grew up together. Lin Sen had always been cold and aloof, not very fond of socializing, but he still had many friends and many girls pursuing him. However, Lin Sen never seemed to take an interest in anyone.","Fang Rui always thought it was because Lin Sen was too picky and couldn't find anyone good enough.","\"You don't have a partner either!\" Lin Sen retorted.","\"That's because I've dedicated myself to the noble cause of fighting crime. I'm so busy every day, where would I find time for romance!\"","Lin Sen remained silent. Just as Fang Rui was starting to wonder if Lin Sen had caught autism from Mu Mian, he finally spoke:","\"She was the one who broke up with me first. She said she never wanted to see me again. But just now she appeared in front of me, called my name, and asked how I've been, as if nothing ever happened.\"","Fang Rui couldn't help but pry, \"Why did you two break up?\"","Fang Rui guessed that Lin Sen must have met Shen Xiyin while studying abroad.","\"I don't know. She said she doesn't love me. But I can't accept that reason.\"","\"...\"","Fang Rui hadn't expected Lin Sen to be such a hopeless romantic!","\"Fang Rui, do you think she broke up with me because of Mu Mian? Maybe she gave up our love to take care of her autistic sister.\"","Fang Rui couldn't help but remind him, \"First, you need to be sure if there was any love between you two.\"","\"Let's assume there was.\"","How pathetic... Too pathetic! He even needed to assume whether the other person had loved him or not. Fang Rui started to feel a bit sorry for Lin Sen.","\"I don't think it's because of Mu Mian.\"","\"Why not?\"","\"If she had asked you to help her take care of her autistic sister, you would have agreed without a second thought, right?\"","\"Of course!\"","\"Then she probably really doesn't love you,\" Fang Rui patted his shoulder. \"Hey, you can't force love, you know!\""]},{"number":21,"title":"Chapter 21: Mystery of Shattered Bodies: Emotions Unremembered","paragraphs":["Due to traffic delays, Mu Mian and Shen Xiyin arrived at the restaurant to find that Professor Jiang had already been waiting for them for quite some time.","Professor Jiang was a kindly old lady with graying hair and glasses. Upon seeing Mu Mian, she greeted her first:","\"Hello, Mu Mian. It's wonderful to finally meet you. You're just as lovely as your photo.\"","\"Hello, Professor Jiang. It's nice to meet you too. You look just as professional as your photo,\" Mu Mian forced herself to make eye contact with Professor Jiang, stretching her lips into a smile, trying to act like a normal person.","\"Mu Mian, there's no need to be nervous. We're just here to have a meal. I won't be conducting any behavioral assessments.\"","\"I'm not nervous.\"","Professor Jiang exchanged pleasantries with Shen Xiyin for a moment, then turned to Mu Mian and cautiously probed, \"Mu Mian, would you like to see your mother...\"","Mu Mian, focused intently on the menu, hadn't clearly heard what Professor Jiang was saying.","\"Professor Jiang,\" Shen Xiyin handed the menu to her, forcibly interrupting, \"What would you like to eat?\"","Professor Jiang gave Shen Xiyin a disapproving look but swallowed the question she was about to ask.","They were at a Western restaurant. Shen Xiyin ordered a seafood risotto for Mu Mian and a steak for herself.","\"I'd like another seafood risotto to go!\" Mu Mian told the waiter.","Shen Xiyin looked at Mu Mian, puzzled. \"Are you that hungry today?\"","\"I have a friend who often forgets to eat dinner on time. I thought I'd bring him something to eat.\"","After the food arrived, Shen Xiyin and Professor Jiang began discussing work-related matters.","Mu Mian first picked out all the shrimp and carrots from her plate and put them into the takeaway box.","\"Mu Mian, wasn't that meant for your friend? How can you put the food you don't like in there?\" Although Mu Mian had been picky with food before, she never had the habit of putting food into other people's bowls.","\"He won't mind. He likes these things. Last time, he ate all the carrots from the plate.\"","Shen Xiyin was a bit surprised. Mu Mian was a person with strong boundaries, but this friend she spoke of seemed to have already been placed within the circle Mu Mian had drawn for herself.","Over the past six months, Mu Mian's social skills had improved greatly.","Having finished picking through her food, Mu Mian began to eat quickly. \"Sister, don't talk to me. You'll affect my eating speed.\"","Professor Jiang asked, confused, \"Mu Mian, are you in a hurry? You're eating so fast.\"","\"There's a corpse waiting for me. It's urgent, I need to get back quickly.\"","Professor Jiang's expression froze for a moment before she regained her smile. \"You're a forensic pathologist now?\"","\"Yes! And a very excellent one at that.\"","\"I can see that, because you're so dedicated to your work.\"","\"Your logic is flawed. Not all dedicated forensic pathologists are excellent ones. Chen Xue is also very dedicated, but she's not an excellent forensic pathologist.\"","\"...\"","Mu Mian finished her meal quickly. She refused Shen Xiyin's offer to drive her home and took a taxi instead.","After Mu Mian left, Professor Jiang watched her retreating figure and couldn't help but remark:","\"It's been nineteen years, hasn't it? The last time I saw Mu Mian, she was only six years old. Back then, we all thought she might live in her own world forever. I never expected her to change so much. If I didn't observe carefully, I wouldn't even be able to tell she's an autistic patient.\"","Professor Jiang still remembered her first encounter with Mu Mian. Mu Mian was very quiet, like a soulless puppet. No matter how people talked to her, she wouldn't react at all, focusing intently on the patterns on the floor.","She conducted a series of tests on Mu Mian, and the results were terrible. Mu Mian's intelligence level was extremely low, her language development was stagnant, and she had severe sensory integration disorder. It was a case where post-natal intervention seemed impossible.","At that time, they all gave up on intervention therapy for Mu Mian. Only Shen Xiyin didn't give up.","Shen Xiyin smiled and said, \"Professor Jiang, you're exaggerating. Mu Mian's symptoms are still very obvious. Her behavioral logic is very different from normal people.\"","\"But her current state is what many families with autistic members dream of. She can basically live independently now, right?\"","\"Yes, she's been living independently for the past six months.\"","Professor Jiang was a bit shocked. It was rare for autistic patients to live independently without a caregiver. Although Mu Mian had no problems with daily living skills, it was clear from their conversation that she had severe social difficulties.","\"Mu Mian's emotional disorder is still very serious. Her memory is excellent, but she can hardly remember emotions. Her emotions are just perceptions of the present moment, and it's very difficult for her to extract them from memories again. Professor Jiang, is there any way to improve this situation?\"","Shen Xiyin knew that the root of Mu Mian's social difficulties was that she couldn't judge other people's emotions or empathize with them.","\"Many autistic patients have this problem. It might be related to the developmental state of their brains. It's very difficult to improve through post-natal training.\"","\"I see.\" Shen Xiyin wasn't surprised by her answer. She had brought Mu Mian to meet Professor Jiang today just to catch up.","\"So, are you planning to settle down in China?\"","\"It's uncertain. But for now, we might stay in China. My father left an inheritance that I need to deal with. Once I've handled that, I'll take Mu Mian back.\"","\"I met Mu Mian's mother a few days ago. She's doing quite well now. Don't you want to take Mu Mian to see her? I think she would be willing to take care of Mu Mian, and you could relax a bit.\"","\"There's no need! I begged her before to see Mu Mian, I even promised her a large sum of money, but she still refused to come see Mu Mian.\" Shen Xiyin calmly cut the steak on her plate. \"So I won't let Mu Mian see her.\"","Professor Jiang noticed that Shen Xiyin had changed a lot. During her university days, Shen Xiyin was like a little sun, lively and expressive. Since her parents died in a car accident, she had become much more composed, but she had lost that sense of lightness.","She seemed to be carrying a lot of pressure.","\"Xiyin, what responsibility and obligation do you have to take care of Mu Mian? What about your own life? Your career? Your supervisor is very angry. He's cultivated you carefully for so many years, and now you've come back to China to work in an unknown clinic. You're throwing away your career! You should return Mu Mian to her mother, let her mother take care of her. It would be good for you and for Mu Mian!\"","Professor Jiang became increasingly agitated as she spoke.","She was good friends with Shen Xiyin's parents and knew Shen Xiyin's supervisor. She felt that Shen Xiyin was being too emotional, giving up such a good job opportunity for Mu Mian, a sister with no blood relation.","\"Xiyin, if you go back now and apologize to your supervisor, withdraw that resignation letter, there's still a chance to salvage everything.\"","\"He should learn to respect my choices. My career aspiration is simple: I just want to fulfill my sister's wish and help her become a normal person.\"","Shen Xiyin didn't understand why everyone thought Mu Mian was holding her back. In fact, it wasn't the case. She resigned not just to take care of Mu Mian, but more for herself.","Mu Mian was her family, and also an achievement in her professional career!","\"You're too naive! That's impossible!\" Professor Jiang sighed.","Shen Xiyin remembered many years ago when they had told her the same thing: you're too naive, Mu Mian will be a speechless idiot all her life.","\"Professor Jiang, as therapists, we shouldn't easily say something is impossible.\"","\"Ah, we advised you back then that you should hand Mu Mian over to other therapists. She's both your patient and your sister. This dual relationship means you can no longer make rational judgments.\""]},{"number":22,"title":"Chapter 22: Murder Mystery: Crime of Passion","paragraphs":["As Mu Mian passed by Fang Rui's office, she noticed his light was still on.","He was indeed working overtime, as expected.","Mu Mian knocked on the door and then walked in.","\"This is for you!\" Mu Mian handed him the lunchbox.","Fang Rui was somewhat surprised. He hadn't expected Mu Mian to bring him food.","\"Thank you.\"","Fang Rui opened the lunchbox to find a seafood rice dish, generously filled with shrimp and carrots.","\"Dr. Mu, what about me? I'm sitting right here, and you don't even say hello?\" Zhang looked at Mu Mian with a hurt expression.","He noticed that Mu Mian had completely different attitudes towards him and Fang Rui.","\"Officer Zhang, good evening!\"","\"Mu Mian, you've wounded me. We're such close friends, yet when you bring food, you only bring it for the boss and not for me. Tsk tsk, you're not being a good friend at all!\"","Mu Mian was already accustomed to Zhang's exaggerated way of speaking. She explained, \"Because you've already eaten!\"","Unable to refute! Zhang had just returned from fieldwork and had already eaten a hearty meal outside.","\"But I could eat another portion!\"","\"You're allergic to seafood. Even if I had brought you seafood rice, you couldn't eat it.\"","Zhang felt a bit touched that Mu Mian remembered his seafood allergy.","But still—","\"So that restaurant doesn't have any other dishes? They only serve seafood rice?\"","\"Of course not. But if you don't eat seafood, I wouldn't be able to pick out the shrimp and carrots I don't like and put them in the lunchbox.\"","\"Haha, that's so like you!\" Zhang immediately felt better.","Fang Rui was speechless. So Mu Mian had put all the food she didn't like into his bowl? No wonder it was so full!","He had felt touched for nothing!","While listening to Zhang's gossip, Mu Mian kept sneaking glances at Fang Rui eating.","Her actions were so obvious that Zhang first gaped in surprise for a moment, then quietly asked Mu Mian, \"Dr. Mu, have you finally realized how handsome our boss is?\"","\"...\"","Fang Rui closed the lunchbox and said to Mu Mian, \"Let's go!\"","\"Where to?\"","\"Didn't you want me to help you?\"","Mu Mian was a bit surprised but nodded, \"Yes, I need a brave assistant right now!\"","\"Assistant? I can do that too! Dr. Mu, why didn't you ask me for help? I'm free right now!\"","Fang Rui and Mu Mian both looked at Zhang. Fang Rui said helplessly, \"Aren't you afraid of having nightmares tonight?\"","Zhang watched their retreating figures, feeling that something was off. Something flashed through his mind, but regrettably, it passed too quickly for him to grasp.","Mu Mian and Fang Rui placed the body parts one by one on the autopsy table. The upper half was mostly reassembled, but the lower half was more severely fragmented, with many parts missing.","Fang Rui noticed that Mu Mian was indeed skilled at puzzles. She could tell where many small body fragments should be placed with just a glance.","Mu Mian frowned as she looked at the body, \"It's strange, this body is too easy to reassemble!\"","\"Is it easy? I've been looking for a while and still don't know where this piece should go,\" Fang Rui said, holding a small piece of flesh. He suppressed his nausea and handed it to Mu Mian.","\"I once reconstructed a body that had been run over by a train. That time, I spent a very long time on it, a full five hours.\"","\"You've been working on this for quite a while too. Look, it's already past 2 AM. That's about five hours as well.\"","Mu Mian glanced at Fang Rui's watch, realizing it had indeed been a long time. She was a bit surprised, \"Has my perception of time gone wrong? I thought it hadn't been that long. Well, let's go home and sleep for now, and continue tomorrow!\"","\"First, tell me what's different about this body?\"","\"This body seems like a ceramic sculpture that fell to the ground and shattered into this state.\"","\"Isn't it normal for a body to be blown apart by an explosion?\"","\"Explosion injuries are mainly caused by shock waves, high temperatures, or explosive projectiles. From what we can see of this body, the most obvious injury pattern is blast injury.","The explosion's shock wave would create multiple blast and stretching forces that would tear the body apart.","Because the force is uneven, the severed ends should be very irregular, and there should be a large amount of soft tissue separation. But the severed ends of this body are very neat. Even the victim's clothing is strange; it doesn't look like it was torn by impact force, but more like it shattered.","Fearing Fang Rui might not understand, Mu Mian gave another example: \"This body should have been torn apart like a piece of cloth, but instead, it shattered like a piece of glass.\"","\"You suspect the body's fragmentation wasn't caused by the explosion?\"","\"No, it should have been caused by the explosion. It's just that this body gives me the feeling that at the time of the explosion, it was in a very brittle state.\"","\"How can a body be brittle?\"","\"I've never encountered this situation before. I need to research it further.\"","At this moment, Mu Mian noticed that the victim's left hand was tightly clenched, seemingly hiding something inside.","\"There's a piece of paper in the victim's hand.\"","Mu Mian had to use considerable force to extract a small piece of paper from the hand. The paper was very small, about the size of a thumb, with its edges burned away.","On the paper was written:","Unrecorded 18:9","The text was handwritten in black ink, with very neat handwriting.","\"Is this a message the victim left for us? It looks like some kind of code.\"","Fang Rui looked at it for a while, unable to understand the information on the note. He put the paper into an evidence bag: \"What was the victim trying to tell us?\"","Mu Mian corrected him: \"It could also be something the killer left for us. This seems to be a page number and chapter from a book. However, it doesn't seem that such a book exists.\"","Fang Rui took off his gloves and searched for this string of text on his phone, but found no results. There was also no book called \"Unrecorded.\"","\"There's another strange thing. We haven't found the victim's genitals at the crime scene yet. According to the direction of the shock wave's force, it should have appeared on the lawn, but we haven't found it.\"","Fang Rui remembered Ye Zeming's complicated romantic relationships and couldn't help but form a hypothesis: \"Could this be a crime of passion?\"","\"A crime of passion?\"","Mu Mian suddenly remembered something. She found the severed finger and handed it to Fang Rui to look at.","\"The victim was wearing a ring with a special shape. This shape looks very much like a Möbius strip, which could symbolize eternal time. Could this be a couple's ring?\"","Fang Rui took off the ring and found two letters engraved on the inside:","M&L","M stands for Ye Zeming, but who does L represent?"]},{"number":23,"title":"Chapter 23: Murder Mystery: Displaced Time","paragraphs":["The next day, after receiving counseling from a professional psychologist, Ye Zeling's condition had improved significantly.","Fang Rui and Zhang took her statement.","Ye Zeling was already twenty-seven years old, but her mental maturity seemed lacking. Not only did she speak in a childish, coquettish voice, but her language was also disorganized and illogical.","Before Zhang could even begin questioning, Ye Zeling, with puffy eyes, started accusing: \"It was Lin Lan who killed my brother! Lin Lan is an extremely vicious woman. My brother...\"","\"Miss Ye, please calm down first,\" Zhang interrupted her endless lament. \"Answer only what I ask, and don't over-elaborate. Do you understand?\"","\"Okay.\"","\"Did you report the fire?\"","\"That morning, I received a call from my brother, so I came over to see him. As soon as I entered the villa's gate, I saw my brother standing by the window. I was about to greet him when I saw the entire villa catch fire. In no time, my brother was engulfed in flames.\"","\"Are you sure it was your brother you saw?\"","\"It should... be. Although I didn't see clearly, it was my brother. I wouldn't mistake him,\" Ye Zeling tried hard to recall the scene. \"It was my brother. I couldn't have been wrong. He even waved at me.\"","Fang Rui asked, \"Why do you think your brother was murdered?\"","\"My brother's villa was equipped with the most advanced fire prevention system. Even if a fire broke out, the intelligent system would automatically extinguish it. How could such a severe fire occur? Someone must have deliberately set the fire! It must have been Lin Lan. She knew the layout of my brother's house very well. She must have disabled the system in advance!\"","Zhang reminded her, \"But Lin Lan has an alibi. When the fire occurred, she was involved in a traffic accident. The traffic police can verify this. Don't make baseless accusations in the future. It's slander and damages Lin Lan's reputation!\"","\"The murderer isn't Lin Lan...?\"","\"How was your brother's relationship with Lin Lan? How did they break up?\"","\"My brother didn't like Lin Lan, but that bitch was like a leech, always clinging to my brother. She was just after my brother's money. That woman is extremely vicious. She even killed my favorite pet dog. Wah, that was my favorite Teddy...\"","\"Why did they break up?\"","\"My brother didn't love her, so he dumped her. A woman like her doesn't deserve my brother!\"","Zhang continued to ask, \"Did your brother have any new girlfriends after breaking up with Lin Lan?\"","Ye Zeling's expression changed momentarily, and she immediately denied it: \"No, my brother said he would never have another girlfriend. The harm that evil woman Lin Lan caused him was too great. He would never fall in love with another woman!\"","Fang Rui asked, \"Miss Ye, besides Ye Zeming, do you have any other siblings?\"","\"Why do you ask that? I only have this one brother. Where would other siblings come from?\"","\"Your father seems to have had an illegitimate child. Did you know about this?\"","\"An illegitimate child? Impossible! My father passed away when I was very young. How could he possibly have other children?\" Ye Zeling seemed to realize something. \"Did Lin Lan say this? She's a compulsive liar. There's not a word of truth from her mouth. Don't believe her!\"","After Ye Zeling left, Fang Rui fell into deep thought. Both Ye Zeling and Lin Lan had received calls from the deceased, and both were asked to come to his house. Was this a coincidence?","\"Has the deceased's phone been found?\"","\"Yes, it's in the evidence bag. However, the entire phone was badly burned in the fire. The data inside might not be recoverable.\"","\"Ask the Technical Department to check it and see if there are any clues.\"","\"Understood!\"","Case analysis meeting.","The DNA test results of the deceased had come out, indicating that the deceased was related to Ye Zeling.","Zhang briefly introduced the case:","\"The deceased is named Ye Zeming, 33 years old, and worked as a sculptor. The fire occurred around 9:30 this morning. The first person to discover the fire was the deceased's sister, Ye Zeling.","According to Ye Zeling's description, she first received a call from her brother, then went to her brother's villa to see him, only to find the entire villa on fire. An explosion occurred shortly after.\"","Zhang continued, \"Around 9 AM this morning, the deceased's neighbor saw him making a phone call by the window. The deceased's ex-girlfriend also received a call from him around 9 AM, proving that the deceased was still alive at that time. Therefore, the time of death should be between 9 AM and 10 AM.\"","Mu Mian interrupted, \"If the deceased is Ye Zeming, he should have already been dead at that time. It's impossible for him to make phone calls to the outside world.\"","\"But there's a phone recording as evidence. We've let Ye Zeming's sister listen to it, and she's certain that it's her brother's voice.\"","Mu Mian interrupted again, \"Does Ye Zeling have any other male relatives? Around thirty to thirty-five years old?\"","\"Dr. Mu, why do you ask that?\"","\"If the deceased is Ye Zeming, he couldn't have been alive at 9 AM on the day of the incident!\"","Mu Mian explained, \"The burns and limb fractures on the deceased's body show no vital reaction, proving that the deceased was already dead when the fire and explosion occurred.","When a person has just died, the cells still have vitality, so the wounds would still show bleeding, blood clotting, and other vital reactions. But his wounds show none of these, proving that the deceased had been dead for at least three hours before the fire occurred.\"","Everyone was shocked. The forensic autopsy results contradicted the information they had gathered from their investigation.","Chen Xue analyzed, \"Could it be that the immense force of the explosion caused the deceased to die rapidly, and the high-temperature burning resulted in no vital reactions in the wounds?\"","\"But the deceased didn't die from traumatic shock caused by limb separation.","Preliminary judgment suggests that the cause of death was mechanical asphyxiation. We can't determine exactly how the asphyxiation occurred at this point, but we can at least prove that it's unrelated to the fire and explosion. This is because no soot was found in the deceased's nasal cavity, throat, or lungs.","Furthermore, we found a wound on the back of the deceased's head in the occipital area. There were bleeding points at the wound site, indicating that the wound was inflicted while the deceased was still alive.\"","The people present fell silent for a moment. They had initially thought this was just an ordinary accident, but if someone had deliberately staged the fire scene, then this was a murder case.","Zhang asked, \"But how do we explain that several people saw Ye Zeming before the fire?\"","Mu Mian said, \"Either there's a problem with the deceased's identity, or there's a problem with their eyes.\"","\"Now that the deceased's identity has been confirmed, and he's related to Ye Zeling, he must be Ye Zeming. Could it be that all those witnesses had a collective hallucination? Did they see a fake Ye Zeming?\"","Fang Rui interrupted, \"Having a blood relation doesn't necessarily mean he's Ye Zeming. Lin Lan mentioned that Ye Zeling has a half-brother. We can't be certain that the deceased is Ye Zeming.\"","Mu Mian agreed, \"That's right. The DNA test can only prove that they're related. Ye Zeming's house has been completely burned down, so we can't find any uncontaminated DNA samples from his home.\"","Zhang had a sudden idea, \"We could look at Lin Lan's house. She's the deceased's ex-girlfriend. She must have some of his personal belongings at her place. There might be his hair or skin cells on them.\"","\"But we can't confirm whether the samples we obtain are Ye Zeming's.\"","Fang Rui looked at Mu Mian, \"Dr. Mu, do you have a way to confirm the deceased's identity?\"","\"Of course!\" Mu Mian opened a photo showing the deceased's oral cavity. \"I discovered that his lower left wisdom tooth had been extracted. The root of that tooth is close to the nerve, so a CT scan of the oral cavity is necessary to extract a tooth in that position.\"","Mu Mian continued, \"If the deceased is Ye Zeming, he must have a record of tooth extraction, and we should be able to obtain his dental X-rays to compare with the deceased's teeth. The shape of human teeth is unique and can be used to prove the deceased's identity.\""]},{"number":24,"title":"Chapter 24: Mutilated Corpse Mystery: Coincidence","paragraphs":["Through Ye Zeling, Fang Rui and the others quickly learned about the dental clinic where Ye Zeming had his tooth extracted.","\"My brother had his wisdom tooth removed about six months ago, I believe it was at a private clinic called Huikang Dental Clinic in the city center. I actually accompanied him there at the time.\"","Mu Mian went with Fang Rui to visit the dental clinic.","\"Mr. Ye Zeming was indeed our client. Our visitor records show that he came to our clinic six months ago to have his wisdom tooth extracted,\" confirmed the receptionist.","Mu Mian inquired, \"Do you have his medical records on file?\"","\"We should. Mr. Ye is one of our VIP clients, so we keep all of his reports and generate a personal file for him.\"","The nurse at the front desk opened the system, intending to retrieve Ye Zeming's file, but after searching for quite some time, she couldn't find it.","She apologized with a regretful expression, \"I'm sorry, but Mr. Ye's file has been deleted. This usually happens at the client's request. Some clients are particularly concerned about their privacy and ask us to remove their records.\"","Mu Mian persisted, \"Don't you have any backups?\"","The receptionist shook her head, \"No, if a client requests deletion, we remove the backups as well.\"","\"What about the dental CT scans? Are there no backups of those in the system either?\"","\"No, we delete those periodically to free up system memory.\"","\"I see,\" Mu Mian said, feeling a bit dejected. \"It's going to be much harder to prove his identity now.\"","Fang Rui also felt that this case had too many coincidences. Both Ye Zeling and Lin Lan happened to receive calls from the deceased, and several neighbors just happened to see Ye Zeming standing by the window—all of these seemed to emphasize that the person who died in the fire was indeed Ye Zeming.","But now the dental records that could prove the deceased's identity had conveniently been deleted.","This lead had hit a dead end. Mu Mian could only fall back on the next best option: going to Ye Zeling and Lin Lan's homes to find Ye Zeming's personal belongings. Fortunately, both of their homes still retained traces of Ye Zeming's life.","Mu Mian quickly collected numerous DNA samples, and after comparison, all the DNA belonged to the same person. So the deceased was very likely Ye Zeming.","This method of comparison still had significant flaws, but Mu Mian had no other evidence to verify with.","Early the next morning, instead of going to the City Police Bureau, Mu Mian took a taxi directly to Ye Zeming's villa.","Mu Mian lifted the police tape and had just stepped onto the lawn when she saw what appeared to be a person standing on the second floor. The clothing looked like Fang Rui's, but the build didn't quite match.","At that moment, Mu Mian received a phone call from Zhang: \"Dr. Mu, look at the second floor. Do you see the boss?\"","\"You mean that person on the second floor? That's not Fang Rui!\" Mu Mian's tone was certain.","\"Ah, I knew you'd be able to tell,\" Zhang said, then turned to mutter to the others, \"This doesn't count! I told you this test wouldn't work on Dr. Mu!\"","Mu Mian went straight to the second floor. She saw a familiar-looking police officer wearing Fang Rui's clothes, apparently impersonating him. Fang Rui himself was standing right next to him.","\"Aside from Dr. Mu, who's a special case, no one else realized that the boss was being impersonated by Jian Guo. So if someone were to wear Ye Zeming's clothes and stand on the second floor, passersby might also think it was Ye Zeming,\" Zhang excitedly concluded. \"This could prove that on the morning of the explosion, what the neighbors and Ye Zeling saw might not have been the deceased, but rather the killer in disguise.\"","Mu Mian couldn't help but pour cold water on his enthusiasm: \"Ye Zeling loves her brother so much. Are you sure she would make such a mistake?\"","\"...\"","The villa complex where the deceased lived was an upscale neighborhood that placed a high value on privacy. This resulted in very few public surveillance cameras within the complex, with most cameras being installed by the homeowners themselves. The only surveillance cameras were at the entrance to the neighborhood.","The villa area was nestled against a mountain and bordered by a forest, in a secluded environment. This meant that if the killer didn't use the main entrance but instead came through the forest to enter the villa, they could avoid the surveillance cameras.","There were cameras installed around the deceased's villa, but the surveillance footage wasn't backed up to the cloud and was instead saved on the deceased's computer. The massive fire had destroyed all the electronic devices in the deceased's home, and the technicians had no way to recover the data.","This added significant difficulty to the investigation.","There were still a few technicians at the scene, working to determine the cause of the explosion.","The entire second floor of the villa was open-plan, serving as the deceased's studio. It was filled with his artworks, as well as large quantities of paint, varnish, and plaster powder. After the intense fire and explosion, the place was in complete disarray. The floor was covered with debris.","Fang Rui asked, \"Has the center of the explosion been determined?\"","\"We've pretty much pinpointed it. The explosive force radiated outward, with the epicenter as its focal point. The distance objects were thrown correlates with their proximity to the epicenter. In other words, the closer to the center, the shorter the distance objects were thrown. Based on the distribution of body parts, we can determine that the epicenter was the workbench behind where the deceased was standing.\"","The deceased's workbench faced the floor-to-ceiling windows, measuring three meters long and two meters wide, occupying a considerable area. The workbench was made of high-quality pear wood, now reduced to a pile of charcoal by the fire.","Technician Feng said, \"However, we didn't detect any explosive residue here. Our initial guess is that the explosion was caused by the large number of aerosol paint cans stored in the house, which exploded under high temperatures. We also found a large amount of paint thinner in the air, which might have rapidly evaporated and accumulated, leading to a deflagration when it encountered a source of ignition.\"","Fang Rui asked, \"Are you suggesting the explosion might have been accidental?\"","\"At this point, we can't prove it was deliberate. There were too many flammable and explosive items stored here. Once they encountered an open flame, an explosion was highly likely.\"","Feng pointed to the left side of the workbench: \"The carbonization is most severe here, so this should be where the fire started. We also detected accelerants in this area. From the combustion products, it's likely to be paint. We've sent samples for physicochemical analysis, and we should be able to determine the specific accelerant soon.\"","Captain Fang, wearing gloves, rummaged through the pile of debris. The ground was covered with various charred objects, broken plaster fragments, utility knives, an old-fashioned alarm clock, batteries... Fang Rui noticed the burnt-out battery, picked it up to examine it for a moment, then placed it in an evidence bag.","\"What's this?\"","Mu Mian had originally come to look for body fragments, but she discovered something strange.","Fang Rui and the others all turned to look at Mu Mian.","Mu Mian was holding a small piece of charcoal, black and unremarkable. From its shape, it appeared to be a wooden clothespin that had been burned by the fire.","\"Dr. Mu, isn't that just a wooden clothespin used for hanging socks?\" Zhang glanced at it, his tone disappointed. He had thought Mu Mian had found something important.","Fang Rui took the clothespin and examined it carefully. The front end of the clothespin had two thumbtacks nailed to the upper and lower sides respectively, with the two thumbtacks touching each other and wire wrapped around them.","Mu Mian explained, \"The burnt material on the clothespin appears to be glue. It likely had something attached to it.\"","Fang Rui remembered the battery from earlier. He took it out and placed it on the clothespin.","\"If there were two wires, this could make a simple ignition device,\" Mu Mian said quietly. \"A closed circuit would cause a short circuit, generating heat that could ignite flammable materials. This kind of device is quite simple, something an ordinary person could probably make.\"","Everyone present was startled by this revelation. It meant that the killer might have been able to start the fire remotely. This invalidated all the previously established alibis.","The technicians conducted another sweep of the villa and quickly made a new discovery.","\"This villa was equipped with an intelligent fire suppression system. In the event of a fire, this system would immediately sound an alarm and spray water to extinguish the flames. However, we found that the electrical system of this setup had been tampered with.\"","This discovery proved that the villa fire was not an accident, but a deliberate act of arson.","Mu Mian searched the crime scene for a long time and found some more fragments of the body. However, she still couldn't find the deceased's genitals.","Based on the angle between the epicenter and the body parts on the ground, it was possible to deduce where the severed limbs should have been. The positions of the other body parts generally matched Mu Mian's predictions, but she just couldn't find this particular part.","Therefore, Mu Mian speculated that it was highly likely that the evidence had either been taken away by the murderer or destroyed by them."]},{"number":25,"title":"Chapter 25: Murder Mystery: Suspect","paragraphs":["Fang Rui and his team quickly reconstructed the ignition device found at the fire scene:","They glued a 5V battery to the upper end of a wooden clothespin. On the inside of the gripping part of the clothespin, they nailed two thumbtacks, one on top and one on the bottom, separated by a piece of stiff paper. The positive and negative terminals of the battery were connected to two wires, with the ends of the wires wrapped around the two thumbtacks.","\"Can this little device really start a fire?\" Zhang looked at the ordinary-looking clothespin on the ground. The device was so simple that even an elementary school student could make it.","Fang Rui removed the paper, causing the entire circuit to short circuit. The high temperature quickly ignited the accelerant placed nearby.","\"It can actually start a fire?\" Zhang exclaimed in surprise. \"But the killer would have to pull out the paper strip to ignite it. How is that any different from lighting a match?\"","\"This ignition device should have another part that controls when the circuit is connected,\" Fang Rui said.","Fang Rui recalled the old-fashioned alarm clock he had seen at the explosion site. He found a similar one in the adjacent office. He drilled a hole in the paper strip, tied a string to it, and attached the other end to the alarm clock.","When the alarm clock vibrated, the paper strip was quickly pulled out of the clothespin. Without the paper as an insulator, the circuit connected and short-circuited, igniting the accelerant once again.","\"This way, the killer doesn't even need to be present at the fire scene. They just need to set the alarm clock time to achieve ignition!\" Zhang exclaimed.","Fang Rui took out the alarm clock found at the crime scene from the evidence box. The clock had been damaged by the explosion, with the time frozen at 9:30.","Mu Mian realized she had encountered a major problem. She seemed unable to determine the victim's exact time of death.","Mu Mian and Chen Xue separated the food from the victim's stomach and placed it in a container.","\"Mian, the food in the victim's stomach is barely digested,\" Chen Xue analyzed. \"We found undigested green cake and coffee in his stomach. Based on the degree of digestion of the stomach contents, the victim died within an hour after finishing breakfast.\"","The high-temperature burns had damaged the victim's body, making it impossible for them to determine the time of death based on body temperature and rigor mortis. Fortunately, the victim had just eaten before dying, so they could estimate the time of death by examining the degree of digestion of the food in the victim's stomach.","\"Based on the reaction of the wounds on the body, I estimate that the victim died at least three hours before the fire started, which would be before 6:30 in the morning, possibly even earlier. However, analyzing the degree of digestion of the stomach contents suggests that the time of death should be between 8:30 and 9:00. The death times we've deduced using these two methods don't match up.\"","Chen Xue cautiously said, \"Could it be that the high-temperature burns and the impact of the explosion altered the body's condition, leading you to make an incorrect judgment? This is a special case, so it's understandable if the assessment is off.\"","Mu Mian frowned. Had she made a mistake in her judgment?","Chen Xue continued, \"If the victim's time of death was between 8:30 and 9:00 on the day of the incident, that would also align with the witnesses' statements. They could indeed have seen the victim alive at that time. So it's possible that the killer first murdered the victim at the crime scene and then set the fire to destroy the body and evidence.\"","But then why would the killer design a remote ignition device? Usually, such a device is designed to create an alibi.","Mu Mian felt Chen Xue's reasoning wasn't rigorous.","Mu Mian looked at the pile of sticky green food, furrowing her brow. After death, the food in the stomach would continue to digest. Although estimating the time of death based on the degree of stomach content digestion couldn't be very precise, the margin of error shouldn't be this large.","Was there something preventing the victim's stomach from digesting?","In fact, Mu Mian had a theory, but unfortunately, there was no evidence to verify her idea at the moment.","Fang Rui and his team reviewed the surveillance footage from the fire scene. After careful examination, they quickly identified a suspicious person—the victim's apprentice, Liu Jiale.","Liu Jiale was thirty-one years old and had repeatedly clashed with the victim. They had even ended up at the police station due to a physical altercation.","The surveillance video from the villa area showed that over the past two weeks, Liu Jiale had followed Ye Zeming in his car several times, behaving suspiciously. However, in the past week, the surveillance at the entrance of the community hadn't captured Liu Jiale entering the villa.","The victim's neighbor had once seen Liu Jiale sneaking into Ye Zeming's house through a window. He reported it to the police, who were about to file a case, but Ye Zeming vouched for Liu Jiale, saying he had allowed Liu Jiale to enter and that he climbed through the window only because he didn't have a key. In the end, the police dropped the administrative penalty against Liu Jiale.","Staff at Ye Zeming's studio reported that the relationship between Ye Zeming and Liu Jiale was strange. Liu Jiale would often argue with Ye Zeming one-sidedly, but Ye Zeming always patiently coaxed him and even spent a lot of money on Liu Jiale.","Fang Rui suddenly thought of the engraving on the couple's ring: M&L.","Liu Jiale's name could also be abbreviated as L.","However, Liu Jiale had disappeared.","Liu Jiale lived in a cheap rental apartment in an urban village. The building was dilapidated, and he lived on the top floor with an artist friend.","His roommate was an art student who made a living by setting up a street stall to draw portraits. Liu Jiale sold sculptures next to his stall, and that's how they got to know each other. Later, when Liu Jiale had a complete falling out with Ye Zeming, his roommate took him in.","Liu Jiale's roommate had rainbow-colored hair and looked disheveled with sunken eyes. He appeared nervous when he saw the police.","\"Officers, has Jiale done something wrong? Jiale is a good person; he wouldn't commit a crime.\"","There were still some of Liu Jiale's belongings in the room, mostly paints and some finished sculptures. Although Fang Rui and Zhang weren't art experts, they could tell that Liu Jiale's works were artistic. The shapes and color combinations were abstract yet had a harmonious beauty.","There was a self-portrait of Liu Jiale on his bed. He had an ordinary appearance, but there was a decadent air unique to artists that gave him a melancholic quality.","\"When was the last time you saw Liu Jiale?\"","\"Last Thursday. Jiale suddenly came back in a panic at noon that day. He told me he was going to stay with his cousin in another city. He hurriedly grabbed a few clothes, packed his backpack, and left. He hasn't been back since then. His phone is also unreachable.\"","The fire occurred on June 12th, and last Thursday was June 8th. This meant that Liu Jiale had disappeared before the fire happened.","\"Do you know the address of Liu Jiale's cousin?\"","\"No, I don't! I even doubt he has a cousin at all. Jiale grew up in a single-parent family and had very few relatives. I only heard him mention his mother.\"","\"Do you have his mother's contact information?\"","\"No. His mother passed away seven years ago. He was in college at the time. After that, he lost his motivation, let himself go, and dropped out of school to pursue art.\"","Fang Rui asked, \"Do you know Liu Jiale's master?\"","\"You mean that famous sculptor, Ye Zeming? I've met him a few times. He's a nice person. Every time he saw Liu Jiale, he would give him money and repeatedly urged him to return to the studio. But Jiale always refused. Jiale said he didn't like the oppressive atmosphere of the studio and preferred a free creative environment!\"","Liu Jiale didn't have many friends in Jiangzhou City, nor did he have any relatives, so the police couldn't immediately find his whereabouts.","Surveillance cameras near the rental apartment showed Liu Jiale carrying a black backpack, looking very nervous, his eyes darting around. Later, he disappeared into a blind spot in the surveillance coverage.","Based on his ID number, there were no records of him purchasing bus, train, or plane tickets, but it couldn't be ruled out that he left Jiangzhou City by private car."]},{"number":26,"title":"Chapter 26: Mystery of the Dismembered Body: Doppelgänger","paragraphs":["Fang Rui and Zhang went to the police station again to inquire about the dispute between Liu Jiale and Ye Zeming.","\"Liu Jiale assaulted Ye Zeming, and during the scuffle, Ye Zeming's left leg was fractured. We were originally going to place Liu Jiale under criminal detention, but Ye Zeming claimed he fell on his own and didn't want to press charges against Liu Jiale. The two eventually reached a settlement.\"","Fang Rui asked, \"Why did Liu Jiale assault Ye Zeming?\"","\"It seems to have been about money. Liu Jiale said Ye Zeming had promised him five million yuan, but Ye Zeming hadn't given it to him. He was desperate for the money, so he used force to try to get it from Ye Zeming!\"","Fang Rui then asked the police officer for the original statement from that time.","After leaving the police station, Zhang asked, puzzled, \"I heard Ye Zeming has assets worth over 100 million yuan, and he even owns a large villa. Is it possible he couldn't come up with five million?\"","Fang Rui was equally confused: \"And why would he need to give Liu Jiale money? He seems to be very afraid of Liu Jiale. Zhang, go investigate Ye Zeming's transfer records.\"","To their surprise, Ye Zeming wasn't as wealthy as rumors suggested. In fact, he was deeply in debt.","He originally owned two apartments and a villa, but half a year ago, all these properties had been mortgaged. Even so, Ye Zeming still owed the bank over ten million yuan in loans.","Zhang had a sudden realization: \"No wonder Lin Lan said he was planning to go abroad recently. Could he be planning to flee from his debts? Boss, do you think it's possible that the deceased isn't Ye Zeming, but someone else?\"","Fang Rui was also shocked. Ye Zeming was an artist, and even if he spent money like water, how could he have accumulated so much external debt?","The bank staff helped them check Ye Zeming's bank transactions. There were several large transfers, all to overseas accounts, which had since been closed.","\"All that money transferred overseas... Could Ye Zeming have fallen victim to a telecom fraud? Or was he gambling? Otherwise, how could there be such large transfers?\"","Fang Rui then had Zhang investigate Ye Zeming's insurance purchases.","\"Chief Fang, your guess was right. Ye Zeming did indeed purchase insurance. Half a year ago, he bought three personal accident insurance policies, all with high payouts. One policy's beneficiary is named Lin Lan, and the other two are for someone named Ye Zeling. He also insured his villa, with Ye Zeling as the beneficiary for that as well.\"","Zhang couldn't help but exclaim, \"Boss, if it weren't for the DNA test results showing that the deceased is indeed Ye Zeming, I would suspect he might be faking his own death for insurance fraud.\"","Fang Rui had originally suspected this was a crime of passion, but now he too began to doubt whether the deceased was really Ye Zeming.","Mu Mian had been working overtime for many days in a row. When Fang Rui arrived at the autopsy room, he found Mu Mian had scattered the body parts, as if playing a jigsaw puzzle, trying to reassemble them.","Mu Mian was somewhat agitated, disliking this state of being unable to solve the problem.","\"Dr. Mu, do you have any other ways to confirm the identity of the deceased?\" Fang Rui's words pulled Mu Mian back to reality from her reverie.","\"The testimony from the deceased's neighbor, the deceased's sister's statement, and the phone recordings all confirm that the deceased was alive around 9 PM on the day of the incident. But I also trust your autopsy conclusions. The two are contradictory, so I can only question whether the deceased is really Ye Zeming.\"","Mu Mian was somewhat surprised: \"You believe me?\"","\"Of course.\"","Mu Mian felt less agitated now.","\"But proving whether the deceased is Ye Zeming or not is difficult. The fire has burned away his external features, and the only dental records that could prove his identity have been deleted.\"","\"The deceased had an apprentice named Liu Jiale, who has now disappeared. I'm even starting to wonder if the body at the fire scene might be Liu Jiale?\"","Fang Rui handed Mu Mian a photo – a picture of Liu Jiale and Ye Zeming together. From the photo, although Liu Jiale and Ye Zeming looked different, their height and build were very similar.","Moreover, Liu Jiale grew up in a single-parent family, and his hometown was also in Yuan'an County, the same place as Ye Zeming and his sister's hometown. He could very well be the illegitimate son of Ye Zeming's father that Lin Lan had mentioned earlier.","The face of the body at the fire scene had been burned beyond recognition by the flames. If it weren't for the DNA test proving that the deceased was related to Ye Zeling, he would have suspected that the body was the missing Liu Jiale.","\"Mu Mian, is there any other way to determine if the deceased is Ye Zeming? Ye Zeming owed a lot of debt, and he also bought several insurance policies. We can't rule out the possibility of him faking his death for insurance fraud.\"","Although the DNA samples taken from Ye Zeling and Lin Lan's homes matched the deceased's DNA, if the killer really had a plan to fake death, they could have easily replaced the DNA samples in advance.","\"I'll do my best.\"","Mu Mian had almost finished reassembling the body. As she was about to place the shattered soft tissue into the left lower leg, she noticed a surgical scar on the deceased's knee. She cut open the deceased's knee and found a titanium alloy bone pin in the joint.","\"Fang Rui, I have a way to prove whether this person is Ye Zeming or not.\" Mu Mian stared at the bone pin, a look of excitement on her face.","Fang Rui followed Mu Mian's gaze and saw only a metal-like pin in the deceased's joint, which must have been used to fix a broken joint.","\"What's this?\"","Mu Mian carefully removed the bone pin and placed it in an evidence bag.","\"Fang Rui, let's go to the hospital now.\"","\"Which hospital?\"","\"I don't know. We'll check them one by one.\"","Mu Mian quickly tidied up the autopsy room and pushed the body back into the freezer.","Outside the City Police Bureau, the night was dark, with barely any stars visible. The once bustling city now had only a few lights still on.","When Fang Rui parked the car at their residential complex, Mu Mian was surprised: \"Aren't we going to the hospital?\"","\"Mu Mian, doctors need to sleep too.\"","\"But...\"","\"Good night!\"","The answer was right in front of them, yet they had to wait until tomorrow to uncover it. Mu Mian didn't know how Fang Rui could sleep, but she certainly couldn't. She didn't close her eyes all night and was waiting outside Fang Rui's door early the next morning.","When Fang Rui opened the door, he saw Mu Mian with dark circles under her eyes. Her short hair was messy, and she looked disheveled, but her eyes were bright and alert.","\"Fang Rui, let's go!\"","Mu Mian's original strategy was to inquire at hospitals one by one. But Fang Rui remembered that the earlier dispute between Liu Jiale and Ye Zeming at the police station was because Ye Zeming's leg had been injured. So he went directly to the First Affiliated Hospital of the City.","\"This is a titanium alloy bone pin. From the serial number on it, it should be from our hospital. You should ask at the orthopedics department.\"","Mu Mian then found the head of the orthopedics department.","\"This type of titanium alloy bone pin is used to fix bones after a fracture. This one is from our hospital; it has our hospital's specific coding on it.\"","\"Is it possible to find the user of this titanium alloy bone pin based on this code?\"","\"Of course!\"","The nurse on duty quickly helped retrieve the medical records of the user."]},{"number":27,"title":"Chapter 27: Murder Mystery: Green Cake","paragraphs":["The sun blazed overhead as Mu Mian sat listlessly in the passenger seat.","She had reviewed the medical file countless times, but those three glaring characters remained unchanged: Ye Zeming.","To their surprise, the deceased was indeed Ye Zeming.","\"It's alright, at least we've eliminated one incorrect answer. Since the victim is Ye Zeming, the missing Liu Jiale becomes very suspicious. If we find Liu Jiale, we might uncover more clues.\"","Just then, Fang Rui received a phone call.","\"Boss, we've found a trace of Liu Jiale. His mobile payment app shows he made a purchase at a convenience store in the East City district. The store's security camera captured footage of a man who looks like him!\"","\"Have you located him then?\"","\"Not yet. Nearby cameras caught him too, but there aren't many in the area. He disappeared in a blind spot. We're currently searching for his whereabouts.\"","The search for Liu Jiale wasn't going smoothly. The East City district was an old area, surrounded by urban villages with many illegally renovated rental units, making it difficult to pinpoint Liu Jiale's location.","After work, Fang Rui took the initiative to wait for Mu Mian to go home. He realized that ever since Mu Mian moved in next door, he had been forced to take on the responsibility of driving her around.","And Mu Mian seemed quite content to enjoy this arrangement.","\"Fang Rui, I want to buy a cake!\"","\"I thought you didn't eat sweets?\"","\"It's my sister's birthday in a few days. I want to order a beautiful cake for her.\"","\"Alright, I'll take you!\"","Fang Rui remembered Lin Sen's lovesick state and decided to gather some information about Shen Xiyin for him.","\"Mu Mian, does your sister have a boyfriend right now?\"","Mu Mian was taken aback by the question. She looked at Fang Rui for a few seconds, then averted her gaze. \"Probably not. I'm not entirely sure.\"","In truth, Mu Mian didn't know much about Shen Xiyin's private life, or rather, she didn't care.","Ever since their adoptive parents died in a car accident, Shen Xiyin had become very busy. Not only did she have to manage her own work and handle their adoptive parents' estate, but she also had to take care of Mu Mian's daily needs. As a result, Mu Mian spent much less time with her.","But Mu Mian believed her sister probably didn't have a boyfriend, otherwise she would have told her.","\"Doesn't she introduce you to her friends?\"","\"She does. She has many friends, both men and women. They even give me gifts. But I'm not interested in them. I just focus on eating whenever I go out with them.\"","Shen Xiyin's friends were all very friendly to Mu Mian, but Mu Mian didn't like how they always looked at her with pity in their eyes, as if confirming that she wasn't a normal person.","She didn't need anyone's sympathy or pity.","\"Has your sister ever told you who she likes?\"","\"Yes! Her favorite psychologist is Piaget, and her favorite writer is Camus.\"","\"...\"","Mu Mian found it strange that Fang Rui was suddenly interested in her sister. Could it be that he liked Shen Xiyin?","\"Fang Rui, do you like my sister?\" Mu Mian's tone was somewhat excited. If Fang Rui married her sister, then when Fang Rui died, she could ask her sister to give her his body.","Her sister surely wouldn't refuse.","Fang Rui immediately clarified: \"I don't like your sister.\"","Mu Mian looked a bit disappointed, \"Are you sure you don't want to like her? My sister is very accomplished. She's kind, and she's also wealthy.\"","\"I'm sorry, but I won't like her.\" Fang Rui felt a lump in his throat, making him a bit uncomfortable. \"I was asking for Lin Sen. He likes your sister!\"","\"But I don't want Consultant Lin's body. He can't even read minds, his brain has no research value.\"","\"...\"","Fang Rui suddenly laughed, almost forgetting that Mu Mian was autistic. She seemed to have no idea what \"liking\" someone meant.","Fang Rui drove Mu Mian to the nearest cake shop. Upon entering, he realized that this shop was owned by Lin Lan.","Lin Lan was momentarily surprised to see Fang Rui and Mu Mian, but quickly composed herself. She smiled and said, \"Officer Fang, do you have any more questions for me?\"","Mu Mian replied, \"I want to order a very beautiful cake!\"","Lin Lan gave Fang Rui a teasing look: \"Officer Fang, is this your girlfriend? She's very cute.\"","Fang Rui wanted to clarify, but Mu Mian spoke first: \"Please don't call me cute. That's for describing small animals and children.\"","After clarifying this point, Mu Mian wanted to further clarify that she wasn't Fang Rui's girlfriend, but Lin Lan interrupted: \"Officer Fang, your girlfriend is very humorous.\"","Humorous... No one had ever used that word to describe her before. Mu Mian liked this word. Because humorous people tend to be more popular.","\"Thank you for the compliment.\"","\"...\"","Lin Lan sighed. How could such a handsome man like Officer Fang end up with such a silly girlfriend?","The shop specialized in custom wedding fondant cakes, focusing on beautiful designs but with average taste.","The display cases were filled with many beautifully crafted desserts.","On the left, there was a special display with a sign that read \"Thursday Special.\" Inside was a stunning velvet cake. The cake was green, dotted with chocolate chips and powdered sugar.","Mu Mian stared at it for a long time, then asked, \"Is this cake matcha flavored?\" Mu Mian detected a fresh plant scent from the cake.","\"No, it's not.\"","\"The green color is very unique.\"","\"It's not made with food coloring. I used pandan leaf juice to dye it, which gives the cake a special plant fragrance.\"","\"Did you design this yourself? It's very special!\" Mu Mian seemed to really like the color.","\"Yes, I designed many of the cakes here myself. They're not only beautiful but also delicious.\" Pleased with the customer's approval, Lin Lan cut a small piece and handed it to Mu Mian. \"Here, try it for free.\"","\"Can you pack it for me?\" Mu Mian wasn't interested in the taste of the cake; she was just attracted by the green color.","\"...\"","Lin Lan gave Mu Mian a strange look, then packed the piece of cake for her. \"It's best to eat it on the same day. This type of cake doesn't taste good if left overnight.\"","\"Is this cake only sold on Thursdays?\"","\"Yes. Our shop offers a special cake each day of the week. This velvet cake is only available on Thursdays.\"","Mu Mian's attention seemed to be completely captured by the green cake, showing little interest in the other cakes.","\"Mu Mian, you can't give your sister a green cake!\" Fang Rui couldn't help but remind her.","\"I know.\" Mu Mian's eyes showed some regret; she thought the green color was quite beautiful.","Mu Mian continued to carefully select a cake design while Fang Rui inquired about Ye Zeming from Lin Lan.","\"Miss Lin, do you know about Ye Zeming's financial situation?\"","\"Not really. The Ye siblings guarded against me like I was a thief. He never told me how much money he made. But he hasn't earned much in recent years. His famous works are all from before, and he hasn't completed any works in the past year, so he probably doesn't have much income.\"","\"Did he have a history of online gambling?\"","\"Online gambling? I don't think so! When we were together, he didn't have any bad habits. After we broke up, I don't know. But strangely, a while ago, Zeming asked me if I could lend him some money. I was planning to open a branch store at the time, so I didn't lend him any.\"","Fang Rui continued, \"Do you know Liu Jiale?\"","\"Yes, I do. Jiale was Zeming's apprentice, and they had a good relationship. Jiale was even Zeling's boyfriend at one point, but they broke up later. After that, Jiale and Zeming's relationship also became strained, seemingly due to differences in creative ideas. Zeming has a bit of a temper and sometimes acts without consideration for others' feelings, easily offending people.\"","Mentioning Liu Jiale, Lin Lan's expression softened a bit, \"Jiale is a very talented artist. His future achievements might even surpass Zeming's. But Zeming was too harsh on him, always suppressing him, causing him to lose some confidence. This might be the main reason for their falling out.\"","After a long selection process, Mu Mian finally chose a cake with a rose and Little Prince theme.","Lin Lan asked, \"Miss Mu, when would you like to pick up the cake?\"","\"Sunday morning.\"","\"I'm sorry, our shop isn't open on Sunday mornings. I have to attend church service on Sundays. Could you come on Saturday evening instead? I'll wait for you no matter how late!\"","\"Saturday it is, then.\"","\"Thank you so much for understanding. Here's your receipt. Remember to bring it with you when you come to pick up the cake.\" Lin Lan wrote out the receipt and handed it to Mu Mian.","As Mu Mian took the receipt, she noticed several books on Lin Lan's desk. Judging by the titles on their spines, most were detective novels. On top of the pile was a Bible, its embossed golden title somewhat faded, evidence of frequent use.","Suddenly, Mu Mian remembered the code on the small piece of paper:","Deuteronomy 18:9","Lin Lan seemed to sense Mu Mian's gaze. She casually placed the receipt book on top of the Bible, covering its title.","Mu Mian asked, \"May I take a look at that book? I'd like to write a blessing from the Bible on the cake, but I've forgotten the exact words. I'd like to check it.\""]},{"number":28,"title":"Chapter 28: Murder Mystery: Secrets on the Note","paragraphs":["Lin Lan hesitated for a moment before handing the book to Mu Mian. \"Do you believe in God too?\"","Mu Mian didn't answer her question. Instead, she quickly flipped through the book, stopping at a page and glancing at it briefly. The page was intact.","\"Never mind, here's your book back. I don't want to add any text to the cake anymore,\" Mu Mian said, returning the book to Lin Lan. She then left the cake shop, leaving Lin Lan puzzled.","Once in the car, Mu Mian turned to Fang Rui and said, \"Fang Rui, I know what the words on that small piece of paper mean now.\"","\"You mean the note found in the victim's hand?\"","\"Yes. That string of characters was incomplete. The complete version should be: Leviticus 18:9. Leviticus is one of the books in the Bible, and 18:9 corresponds to this passage.\" Mu Mian recited, \"You shall not uncover the nakedness of your sister, your father's daughter or your mother's daughter, whether brought up in the family or in another home.\"","Fang Rui summarized, \"So the killer left this note to tell us that the victim had a special relationship with his own sister?\"","Fang Rui was shocked, but then he recalled Ye Zeling's unusual reactions and realized that the relationship between the Ye siblings did indeed seem abnormal.","Fang Rui and Mu Mian immediately drove to find Ye Zeling.","Due to Ye Zeling's fragile mental state, the police had assigned a female officer to protect her closely to prevent any potential incidents.","Ye Zeling's home was in an upscale neighborhood in the city center. The apartment, registered under Ye Zeming's name, was beautifully decorated.","\"Captain Fang, you're here to see Ye Zeling?\" The female police officer seemed surprised to see Fang Rui.","\"Yes.\"","Upon seeing Fang Rui, Ye Zeling ran over, her emotions high. \"Officer Fang, have you found my brother's killer?\"","As she turned her head, she spotted Mu Mian and her expression instantly changed to one of hostility. \"Get away from me! I don't want to see you!\"","Mu Mian, however, smiled at her, seeing Ye Zeling as a kindred spirit who shared her fascination with corpses.","\"Miss Ye, what was your relationship with Liu Jiale?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"Jiale was my brother's apprentice. They had known each other for many years and used to be very close. Since none of us had parents, my brother and I considered him family.\"","\"But Liu Jiale had several recent conflicts with your brother. Why was that?\"","Ye Zeling's expression changed slightly, but she quickly tried to cover it up.","\"Because Jiale changed. He met some new friends outside, and his creative vision no longer aligned with my brother's. So he wanted to leave my brother's studio. But my brother felt that Jiale was family, and he didn't want to let him mix with those people, afraid he'd eventually go astray.\"","\"Is that the only reason?\"","\"It's the main reason.\"","\"Was Liu Jiale your ex-boyfriend?\"","\"Of course not. Jiale and I were just friends. He was the most talented student in my brother's studio. I often visited the studio, and that's how we got to know each other. He did confess his feelings for me, but I didn't like him that way. I had someone else I liked at the time.\"","Fang Rui looked at her and asked, \"Was the person you liked your brother?\"","\"My brother is my family. Isn't it normal for me to like him?\" Ye Zeling awkwardly tucked a strand of hair behind her ear, her expression becoming unnatural.","Mu Mian, observing Ye Zeling's fingers as she touched her hair, asked bluntly, \"Did you have a sexual relationship with him?\"","Ye Zeling's face instantly turned red. Trembling with anger, she pointed at Mu Mian and shouted, \"What nonsense are you spouting? How could I have a sexual relationship with my brother? You're spreading lies!\"","Mu Mian grasped Ye Zeling's hand, pointing at her finger. \"What's this mark?\"","There was an irregular indentation on Ye Zeling's middle finger, left by a ring.","\"It's none of your business! This is my private matter!\" Ye Zeling quickly pulled her hand away.","\"Did you wear a ring here? From this mark, we can deduce that the ring had an irregular shape. With such a unique indentation, it would be easy for us to recreate the shape of the ring.\"","Ye Zeling's expression changed again.","Fang Rui said, \"Your brother was also wearing a ring, with M&L engraved inside. Those are the initials of your names, aren't they?\"","Ye Zeling's face flushed with anger. \"Shut up! Don't talk nonsense! My relationship with my brother was pure and innocent.\"","\"I can produce that ring. We can compare them and find out.\"","\"You...\"","Suddenly, Ye Zeling covered her face and burst into tears. \"I just love my brother so much, is that wrong? Why can't I love my brother...\"","Mu Mian and Fang Rui exchanged glances. If there was an inappropriate relationship between Ye Zeming and his sister, then Lin Lan would become a strong suspect for the murder.","\"It's not just wrong, it's illegal,\" Mu Mian cautiously reminded her. \"In our country, marriage between close relatives is forbidden.\"","\"Shut up! I love my brother. My brother is so exceptional, he's mine alone. I won't allow him to be good to anyone else! My brother had already promised me that he wouldn't be with anyone else in the future, only with me...\"","Through Ye Zeling's incoherent narrative, they learned the story of the Ye siblings.","Originally, they had a normal sibling relationship, but Ye Zeling became increasingly dependent on Ye Zeming and gradually developed inappropriate feelings. Later, when Ye Zeming broke up with Lin Lan, Ye Zeling seized the opportunity and became intimate with her brother.","Afterwards, under Ye Zeling's constant pursuit, they maintained this distorted relationship until her brother's death.","After leaving Ye Zeling's home, Mu Mian analyzed:","\"Lin Lan is a religious person. In the Bible, a relationship between siblings is considered a grave sin, and a raging fire can cleanse the world of sin. This could be Lin Lan's motive for murder.\"","\"But Lin Lan doesn't have an alibi for the time of the crime. She was in a car accident that morning and was cooperating with the traffic police investigation until she received a call from Ye Zeming. Only then did she leave the vehicle management office. Moreover, the cameras at the entrance of the villa complex didn't capture her on film.\"","Fang Rui had initially suspected Lin Lan as well, but she had an alibi. She had been going only between her shop and home for the past few days, and the neighborhood surveillance cameras hadn't captured her either.","Mu Mian fell silent. This again raised the question of how to determine the exact time of the victim's death.","\"Liu Jiale once had feelings for Ye Zeling. If he knew about the inappropriate relationship between Ye Zeling and her brother, he would also have a motive. According to our previous investigation, Liu Jiale and Ye Zeming had several arguments, which could very well have been about this. It's possible that Liu Jiale was using this information to blackmail Ye Zeming for money.\"","\"Their relationships are so complicated!\" Mu Mian couldn't understand such complex emotions, though, to be fair, she couldn't understand simple emotions either."]},{"number":29,"title":"Chapter 29: Murder Mystery: Victims, Perpetrators","paragraphs":["The next day, Mu Mian brought the small green cake to work.","Chen Xue noticed the cake in Mu Mian's hand and said with surprise, \"Mian Mian, what a beautiful cake! Is it for me?\"","Mu Mian hesitated for a moment, quickly hiding the cake behind her back. She smiled apologetically, \"I'm sorry, Chen Xue, it's not for you. If you like it, I can buy you one next time.\"","\"Oh, I see. Did Fang get this cake for you? No wonder you're so protective of it. Tsk tsk, Mu Mian, I never thought you'd prioritize romance over friendship,\" Chen Xue teased, leaning in closer.","Chen Xue didn't understand! Mu Mian found Chen Xue's words strange, not quite grasping the meaning of each sentence.","Mu Mian clarified, \"Fang Rui didn't buy it. The bakery owner gave it to me. But Fang Rui did take me to the bakery.\"","\"Mian Mian, there's been a lot of gossip lately. People are saying you and Fang are together. I've noticed you two have been inseparable recently. Are you really dating?\" Chen Xue's eyes sparkled with curiosity.","Chen Xue had observed that Mu Mian's gaze rarely lingered on living people, as she seemed uninterested in most things. However, whenever Fang Rui appeared, Mu Mian's eyes would lock onto him with radar-like precision.","After much observation, Chen Xue realized she had become invested in their potential relationship.","The interactions between Mu Mian and Fang Rui were intriguing. Often, only Fang Rui could understand Mu Mian's train of thought. They shared a strange kind of chemistry. Moreover, Fang Rui displayed exceptional patience with Mu Mian.","In the past, other female officers had pursued Fang Rui, but he had remained aloof. With Mu Mian, however, he was always accommodating.","Mu Mian nodded, \"Together? Yes, we've been together recently.\"","\"Ah! I knew it! You really are involved with Fang!\"","\"Chen Xue, your guess is incorrect. Fang Rui and I don't have a leg.\"","\"...Wait, what do you think 'being together' means?\"","\"Frequently appearing in the same place, commuting to and from work at the same time. I'm often together with you too, aren't I?\" Mu Mian opened the cake box, took out a small piece, and placed it in a glass container.","Chen Xue suddenly realized that Mu Mian might not have understood her meaning.","\"Mu Mian, don't you like Fang?\"","Mu Mian turned to look at Chen Xue: \"Your question is too vague. You should add more specific details. I suppose I do like Fang Rui. I really want to obtain his remains.\"","\"Remains? What do you want his remains for?\" Chen Xue's eyes widened in shock.","So, every time Mu Mian's eyes sparkled while looking at Fang Rui, was she seeing a corpse? Chen Xue suddenly felt a pang of sympathy for Fang Rui.","\"For research, of course. I had initially planned to slice Fang Rui's brain and preserve it, discarding the rest of the tissues and keeping only the skeleton. But I've changed my mind now. I want to immerse him in formaldehyde solution, so his remains won't decay, and I can see him every day...\"","\"You haven't told Fang Rui about your plan, have you?\"","\"Of course not. I'm afraid if I did, Fang Rui might think I'm a pervert.\"","\"...\" At least she's self-aware!","\"Chen Xue, you have higher emotional intelligence. Do you know any way to make Fang Rui willingly donate his remains to me? It has to be through legal means. I've asked him many times before, but he always refuses. I've tried hinting at it, but that didn't work either.\"","\"He just refused? He didn't hit you?\" Chen Xue couldn't believe that Mu Mian had actually expressed her desire for Fang Rui's remains, and multiple times at that.","Mu Mian's expression turned dejected: \"He told me never to mention it again!\"","\"Have you considered marrying Fang Rui? That way, when he dies, wouldn't his remains be yours?\" As soon as she said it, Chen Xue regretted it. She must have been infected by Mu Mian's thinking; otherwise, how could she suggest such a morbid idea?","Even more disturbing was Mu Mian's response:","\"Chen Xue, I've actually thought of that method.\"","\"...\"","\"But I can't get married.\"","\"Why not?\"","Mu Mian didn't answer that question.","\"Well, you could try to gain more favor with Fang. Maybe then he'd be willing to donate his remains to you.\" Chen Xue skipped over that topic and offered a new suggestion.","How could she let the relationship she had just started shipping end badly?","\"Do you know how to gain favor?\"","Chen Xue grinned at her and then forwarded several files: \"I think these novels would be perfect for you. You should study them carefully.\"","Mu Mian felt that Chen Xue might not be entirely reliable, but she agreed to read the files when she had time.","Fang Rui and his team had spent a long time finally pinpointing Liu Jiale's approximate location. He had rented a house in the urban village of the East City district.","Just as Fang Rui was about to go bring Liu Jiale in for questioning, he received a phone call:","\"Fang, it's terrible! Someone tried to kill Ye Zeling! The attacker has been subdued, but he seems to be mentally unstable.\"","When Fang Rui arrived at the scene, he saw that the female officer protecting Ye Zeling had been slashed with a knife, her entire right arm covered in blood. Ye Zeling was unharmed, but she appeared to be in shock.","The assailant was pinned to the ground by several concerned citizens.","\"Ye Zeling, pay up! Your brother swindled my money, you have to pay it back for him! If you don't pay, I'll stab you to death!\" The criminal was still struggling, glaring at Ye Zeling with murderous intent, as if he might lunge at her at any moment.","Zhang exclaimed, \"Boss, isn't that Liu Jiale?\"","Liu Jiale looked like a vagrant, with long beard and hair, disheveled and wearing tattered clothes. His eyes were sunken, and his overall mental state appeared to be in terrible condition.","Fang Rui brought them all back to the station.","Ye Zeling was emotionally distraught, continuously crying and pleading, \"I don't know why Liu Jiale wanted to kill me! We don't have any conflicts, we used to be good friends. My brother was so kind to him, how could he have swindled his money? He's lying!\"","\"According to our investigation, it seems your brother owed a lot of money. Do you know why he was in debt?\" Fang Rui asked.","Ye Zeling vehemently denied it: \"Impossible! My brother couldn't possibly be in debt!\" But her tone didn't sound very confident.","Fang Rui then took Liu Jiale's statement.","Liu Jiale had calmed down by then: \"Officer, I wasn't trying to kill Ye Zeling. I just wanted to scare her into paying me back. Her brother is dead, so all his money is hers now. She should repay me!\"","\"We haven't released the investigation results yet. How are you so certain that the deceased at the fire scene was him?\"","Liu Jiale hesitated for a moment, then replied, \"It was in the news. They said Ye Zeming had died and reminded everyone about fire safety.\"","\"How much money did Ye Zeming borrow from you, and why did he need to borrow from you?\"","\"Six months ago, he got addicted to online gambling and lost a lot of money. At first, he could manage by selling his artworks, but later when he couldn't sell them anymore, he turned to me. He said if I gave him all my money, he'd let Zeling marry me. But he lied to me. Not only did he not repay me, but he also made Zeling ignore me!\"","\"Then why did you go into hiding?\"","Liu Jiale looked bewildered: \"Hiding? I didn't hide!\"","\"Why did you lie to your roommate about going to stay with your cousin?\"","\"I did intend to go to the Northeast to find my cousin, but I didn't have enough money for the plane ticket. I could only rent a place in the urban village and continue with my artwork. I've been working on a piece these past few days that I can enter into a competition!\"","\"If that's the case, why did you suddenly attack Ye Zeling instead of focusing on your work?\"","\"I saw in the news that Ye Zeming had also bought accident insurance, so Ye Zeling would get a large compensation. I went to ask her for the money, but she refused to acknowledge the debt and accused me of slandering her brother! I got angry and tried to stab her, but I ended up stabbing someone else by mistake.\"","Fang Rui asked, \"If you were just going to ask her for compensation, why did you bring a knife?\"","Liu Jiale fell silent.","\"Is Ye Zeling your girlfriend?\"","\"No, I've been pursuing her, but she never accepted my confession. She said she would only be with me after I became famous. Later, I realized she had been lying to me all along. She would never like me. Because...\"","\"Because she likes her brother?\"","Liu Jiale's eyes widened suddenly: \"How did you know that?\"","\"Did you attack Ye Zeling in the street because you couldn't accept this fact?\"","\"No! I just wanted money!\" Liu Jiale's fingers kept fidgeting with the cross he wore on his chest. He seemed a bit nervous, his hand trembling slightly.","\"Where were you on the day of the fire, which was June 12th?\""]},{"number":30,"title":"Chapter 30: Mystery of Dismembered Body: Surveillance Evidence","paragraphs":["\"Officers, do you suspect that I killed Ye Zeming?\" Liu Jiale suddenly became agitated. \"If I wanted to kill him, wouldn't I have done it long ago? Why would I set fire to the house? Why do you suspect me? I'm an innocent, upstanding citizen...\"","Fang Rui interrupted him: \"Upstanding citizen? Just a moment ago, you tried to harm Ye Zeling.\"","\"I...\" Liu Jiale lost his confidence for a moment, but he quickly recovered, saying, \"That day, I was at the city library reading books for inspiration. I was there from 7 AM until 5 PM, staying inside the whole time. I even ate a sandwich there for lunch. You can check the security footage. There's no way I could be the murderer!\"","Fang Rui had someone retrieve the library's security footage. Whether by coincidence or not, Liu Jiale's reading spot was directly in view of the camera, which captured his actions clearly.","Liu Jiale entered the library at 7:05 AM. He found a few art books and then sat down to read. He was very focused on his reading, only leaving his seat once to use the restroom.","When Liu Jiale saw Fang Rui and Zhang return, he displayed a smug smile. \"Officers, have you proven my innocence now? Can I go home? I'm just a bit short of finishing my sculpture, and I need to get back to complete it as soon as possible.\"","Zhang was irritated by his smug expression, but they indeed had no evidence linking Liu Jiale to Ye Zeming's case.","Fang Rui gave him a cold look. \"I'm sorry, but you can't leave yet.\"","\"You're not trying to frame me, are you? This is a society governed by the rule of law. You can't detain me without cause.\"","\"Yes, this is indeed a society governed by law, which is why assaulting a police officer is a crime! We need to detain you first. Once the hospital provides a report on the injuries, we'll decide whether to press charges against you!\"","Liu Jiale's smug smile instantly crumbled.","As soon as they left the interrogation room, Zhang analyzed, \"Chief Fang, I think this Liu Jiale is the killer. Look at that smug smile of his, he's so arrogant he might as well confess to being the murderer. Plus, the library camera was pointed right at him. He must have done that on purpose to create an alibi.\"","However, Fang Rui found Liu Jiale's sudden attack on Ye Zeling strange. Even if Liu Jiale was desperate for money, there was no need to resort to such extreme measures to get it.","Fang Rui returned to his office to find Mu Mian sitting in his chair, waiting for him.","\"Fang Rui, I declare that from now on, green is my lucky color,\" Mu Mian said excitedly, her face clearly saying: Ask me why.","Fang Rui obliged, \"Why?\"","\"I've reached a conclusion. It's not entirely rigorous, but I think it could help with your investigation,\" Mu Mian handed Fang Rui a report. \"The victim likely died on a Thursday.\"","Fang Rui recalled the green cake that had piqued Mu Mian's interest. The sign next to that cake seemed to say it was a Thursday special.","\"Because of that green cake?\"","\"Yes. We found partially digested green cake in the victim's stomach. At the time, I thought the color was unusual, not like matcha or food coloring. But I couldn't pinpoint what was special about it. Then I saw that green velvet cake at Lin Lan's Shop. I've compared them, and the ingredients are the same.\"","The fire occurred on June 12th, which was a Monday.","\"This cake is only sold on Thursdays, but the fire happened on a Monday. Logically, the victim shouldn't have been able to eat that cake on a Monday.\"","Mu Mian continued to explain: \"So I reasonably suspect that the victim's actual time of death was likely the previous Thursday, which would be June 8th.\"","Fang Rui suddenly remembered that Liu Jiale had disappeared on June 8th.","\"Of course, this reasoning isn't entirely rigorous. That's why I'm only telling you.\"","If the victim's time of death was moved earlier, many people's alibis would be invalidated.","\"Dr. Mu, you're so biased. You discover a clue and only tell the boss, not us,\" Zhang suddenly chimed in.","Mu Mian was startled. When had Zhang appeared?","\"I was here when you said the first word.\"","\"...\"","Zhang analyzed, \"Dr. Mu, according to your reasoning, if the victim had been dead for several days, the body should have decomposed, right? Shouldn't you have noticed that immediately during the autopsy?\"","\"Yes, and this leads to another of my not-so-rigorous conclusions,\" Mu Mian sighed. \"I suspect that after killing the victim, the murderer immediately froze the body. By using extremely low temperatures, they prevented changes in the body's condition. Then they used the fire to destroy the body's surface features, interfering with the forensic examination.\"","\"The body was likely still frozen when the explosion occurred. That's why I felt the body was as fragile as a sculpture at the time.\"","Mu Mian felt her analysis was correct, but there was no concrete evidence to prove her deductions. Unfortunately, by the time she performed the autopsy, the body parts had already been frozen once in the morgue refrigerator.","Mu Mian then thought of Ye Zeling, blaming her for delaying the examination by clinging to the body.","Zhang listened in astonishment. \"This killer is incredibly clever!\"","But Zhang quickly noticed another issue: \"Then how do we explain that several people received phone calls from Ye Zeming? The tech department analyzed the call recordings and confirmed they were real human voices, not synthesized.\"","Fang Rui instructed Zhang, \"Zhang, go check Ye Zeming's electricity bills. See if there have been any fluctuations in power usage recently.\"","\"On it!\"","The investigation results came back quickly. Ye Zeming's power usage had spiked abnormally on June 8th and remained at that elevated level for the following days.","Fang Rui recalled that when they examined the scene, they found a freezer in the blast area, which was used to accelerate the setting of plaster molds.","All of this indirectly supported Mu Mian's deductions. Ye Zeming was likely murdered on June 8th, and the killer staged the fire and explosion on June 12th in an attempt to destroy evidence.","Fang Rui went to the security office of the villa complex to retrieve surveillance footage from around June 8th.","The video showed that on June 8th, Ye Zeling first drove to Ye Zeming's house, then Liu Jiale arrived by taxi. Later, Ye Zeling left in her car, followed shortly by Liu Jiale, who nervously left the villa complex and took a taxi at the entrance.","Fang Rui first questioned Ye Zeling.","\"Miss Ye, do you remember what you did on June 8th?\"","\"June 8th? I can't quite recall. I'm busy every day, how can I remember what happened on a specific day?\"","\"Your theater company said you took a day off. Don't you remember why you took that day off?\"","\"Oh, that day. I took time off to visit my brother. He said he was sick, so I specifically took a day off to check on him.\"","\"Did you see Liu Jiale that day?\"","\"Yes, I did. He came to my brother's house, quite angry. My brother didn't want me involved in their business, so he asked me to leave first.\"","\"After June 8th, did you see your brother?\"","\"Yes, I talked to my brother on the phone every day. On the morning of the day he died, I even received a call from him...\"","\"I mean, did you see your brother in person, not just talk on the phone?\"","\"No, I didn't. Our theater company was about to have a performance, so I was rehearsing every day and didn't have time to meet with my brother. He was supposed to have dinner with me, but I was kept for rehearsal, so we didn't get to meet. If I had known my brother would die, I would have gone to see him even if it meant missing the performance...\"","Ye Zeling seemed to be on the verge of an emotional breakdown.","\"I'm sorry, I'm having trouble controlling my emotions. Could you give me a moment to calm down?\"","Fang Rui then interrogated Liu Jiale again.","Fang Rui played the surveillance video showing Liu Jiale hurriedly leaving Ye Zeming's villa.","\"Mr. Liu, do you remember when this happened?\"","\"I don't remember. The video is a bit blurry. Is that even me in there?\"","Fang Rui paused the video, freezing the frame on Liu Jiale's panic-stricken face.","\"Does this jog your memory now?\" he asked.","\"Yes, I did go to see Ye Zeming that day. I was pressuring him to pay me back, but he threatened me, saying he knew a lot of people in the underworld. He warned that if I kept bothering him, he'd kill me and dump my body in the sea to feed the fish.","I was so terrified that I ran away immediately. After that, I didn't dare to ask him for the money again. Officer, do you think it's possible that those gangsters Ye Zeming knew might have killed him? He owed so much money, surely many people wanted him dead!\"","\"Did you see Ye Zeming again after that incident?\"","\"No, I was too scared to approach him. However, I did try calling him once. He answered, but only to hurl more abuse at me. After that, I didn't dare to call him again.\""]},{"number":31,"title":"Chapter 31: Murder Mystery: Breakthrough","paragraphs":["Although Liu Jiale was highly suspicious, there was no direct evidence yet proving that he had killed Ye Zeming.","However, Fang Rui discovered that after June 8th, none of them had seen Ye Zeming, but several people close to him had all received phone calls from him, seemingly at random.","It appeared that the killer was trying to create the illusion that Ye Zeming was still alive through these call records.","In the conference room, Fang Rui played the phone recording again.","[Ye Zeming: Lin Lan, are you busy today?","Lin Lan: I'm watching the shop now. What do you need?","Ye Zeming: Lin Lan, I'm going to emigrate abroad in a few days. Can you come see me one last time?","Lin Lan: That's not necessary! I don't think we need a farewell given our relationship.","Ye Zeming: Didn't you leave something important at my place last time? I found it for you, come pick it up!","Lin Lan: Why don't you just mail it to me?","Ye Zeming: If you don't come, I'll throw it in the trash.","Lin Lan: I'll come right away, you...]","The call was disconnected.","Zhang said, \"The tone sounds natural, Ye Zeming speaks fluently. This recording doesn't sound like it was spliced together.\"","Wang from the technical department said, \"Audio analysis shows that Ye Zeming's voice is not synthesized or pre-recorded. It's a real human voice.\"","\"But Ye Zeming was already dead at this time, so how could he make a phone call?\"","\"May I request to listen to it again?\" Mu Mian asked.","Fang Rui played it once more for Mu Mian.","\"At 19 seconds, I heard a car horn. At 31 seconds, I heard the voice announcement of a bus - it's the B31 bus route, and the stop is Yunzhai Station...\"","Wang said, \"We've already isolated the background noise, there's nothing special.\" He then played the isolated background sounds, which were not very clear but matched what Mu Mian had described.","Mu Mian continued her analysis: \"Lin Lan said she was watching the shop. But the B31 bus route doesn't pass by her cake shop.\"","Zhang and the others immediately checked the map on their phones. Lin Lan's shop was in the North City District, while the B31 bus connected the East-West City District, indeed not passing by Lin Lan's cake shop.","Zhang looked at Mu Mian in surprise: \"Dr. Mu, do you memorize bus routes in your spare time?\"","\"Is that something you need to memorize? Can't you just remember it after seeing it once?\" Mu Mian had an exceptional memory since childhood, almost able to remember everything she saw.","Fang Rui asked, \"You suspect Lin Lan is lying?\"","\"That bus announcement should have come from Ye Zeming's end. The person faking the recording was probably driving, and their route overlapped with this bus route.\"","Fang Rui quickly retrieved surveillance footage near the Yunzhai Station bus stop.","After careful screening, one of the cameras caught Ye Zeling's car. The footage clearly showed Ye Zeling's face as she was holding a phone, seemingly talking to someone.","The surveillance video showed it was 9:04 AM on June 12th. This was exactly the time when Ye Zeming had called Lin Lan.","Fang Rui quickly investigated further and found that Ye Zeling had been part of the anime club in university. She was skilled at voice acting and could imitate many voice actors' tones.","This almost proved that Ye Zeling was the one who faked the phone call recording.","Fang Rui called Ye Zeling back in for questioning once again.","Ye Zeling, confused, asked, \"Detective Fang, have you caught the person who killed my brother?\"","Fang Rui handed her a photograph. In the photo, Ye Zeling was making a phone call.","\"Miss Ye, does this scene look familiar to you?\"","Ye Zeling glanced at it, her expression changing slightly, but she tried to remain composed, \"This photo shows me making a phone call. What's so special about that? Don't you all make phone calls?\"","\"Miss Ye, what were you doing at 9:04 AM on June 12th, the day of the fire?\"","Ye Zeling adjusted her posture, \"How could I remember that precisely? I only remember that I was driving to my brother's house around 9 AM that morning.\"","\"Did you make a phone call on the way?\"","\"Yes, I did.\"","\"But when we checked your phone records, you didn't make any calls that day. You used your brother's SIM card to call Lin Lan, didn't you?\"","Ye Zeling vehemently denied it: \"No, why would I call that bitch Lin Lan?\"","\"Miss Ye, you'd better tell the truth. We already have evidence of your crime.\"","\"I...\" Ye Zeling covered her face and began to sob uncontrollably. \"It was Liu Jiale who forced me! He accidentally killed my brother, and I saw it. Then he threatened me, making me help him cover it up. He knew I was good at imitating voices, so he made me call my brother's friends and colleagues to create the illusion that my brother was still alive!\"","Fang Rui exchanged a glance with Zhang. According to the surveillance video, Liu Jiale had left after Ye Zeling, so it was very likely that Liu Jiale was also involved in this case.","\"Jiale said my brother was already dead, and if I didn't help him, he would go to jail. Liu Jiale was like another brother to me, I couldn't not help him! Plus, Jiale said if I went to the police, he would spread rumors to the media about my relationship with my brother, ruining both our reputations. I had no choice, I could only help him cover up the truth...\"","Ye Zeling broke down crying hysterically.","Fang Rui waited for her emotions to calm a bit before asking her to recount the details of the incident.","\"That day, my brother said he was sick and asked me to come see him. Shortly after I arrived, Liu Jiale also came. He and my brother were discussing something in the second-floor studio while I was washing fruit downstairs. Just as I was about to go upstairs, I heard a scream.","My brother had been pushed by Liu Jiale and hit his head on a sculpture on the table. There was blood all over his head. Then I realized my brother wasn't breathing! Liu Jiale had accidentally killed my brother. I was going to call the police, but Liu Jiale wouldn't let me.","He was very panicked at first, but then he said we should freeze my brother's body first and find a way to dispose of it later. Initially, he planned to cut the body into small pieces and hide them inside sculptures, but that was too risky. Later, he found out that my brother had bought accident insurance for the villa. So he thought of setting a fire to burn down the villa. This way, he could destroy the evidence and I could get a large insurance payout.","I don't know about the other details. He just made me imitate my brother's voice to make phone calls and act in front of the police. He didn't tell me anything else.\"","Fang Rui then interrogated Liu Jiale.","At first, Liu Jiale was confident, seemingly certain that the police couldn't find any evidence. But when Fang Rui told him that Ye Zeling had already confessed, his expression changed dramatically.","Liu Jiale's body tensed, but he feigned nonchalance, saying contemptuously, \"I'm innocent! Do you have any evidence that I killed him? If not, even if a judge convicts me, I'll appeal to the media!\"","Fang Rui showed Liu Jiale the chain of evidence regarding Ye Zeling faking Ye Zeming's voice to create call records.","Liu Jiale's eyes turned red as he shouted, \"What did you do to Zeling? Why is she falsely accusing me?\"","\"Based on the surveillance footage and Ye Zeling's confession, we can basically convict you now. Are you sure you still want to deny it?\"","Liu Jiale gritted his teeth and said, \"Ye Zeming was scum who deserved to die! Even if God knew what I did, He wouldn't consider me guilty!\"","Fang Rui interrupted him: \"I don't know how God would judge, but why don't you tell us what happened first.\"","\"Do you know how disgusting Ye Zeming was? He was so perverted that he raped his own sister! You think he's some kind of artist? He's just scum! None of his works were his own. At first, he relied on Lin Lan - those famous pieces were all completed by her. Later, he started stealing my work.","Six months ago, he got addicted to gambling and lost all his money.","That day I went to his house, he said he had no money to pay me back, but he offered to let me sleep with Zeling to settle the debt! I was furious, so I pushed him. He fell to the ground, hit his head on the edge of the workbench, bled a lot, and then stopped breathing.\"","Liu Jiale became increasingly agitated as he spoke, his saliva droplets almost spraying across the interrogation room table onto their faces.","Fang Rui asked, \"You're saying you pushed the deceased once, his head hit the workbench, and then he died?\""]},{"number":32,"title":"Chapter 32: Murder Mystery: You Are Not the Killer","paragraphs":["Liu Jiale licked his dry lips and grinned, \"Ye Zeming got what he deserved for all his evil deeds. How else could he have died from such a light bump?\"","\"Are you sure he hit the workbench?\" Fang Rui repeated.","\"Is that important? I killed him, I admit it. Judge me however you want, just stop interrogating me!\"","Fang Rui paused the questioning and left the room to find Mu Mian.","\"Mu Mian, you mentioned earlier that the victim had a wound on his head that was inflicted before death. How was that wound caused?\"","Mu Mian retrieved the autopsy report and turned to the photo of the wound.","\"It's an impact injury. Based on the shape of the wound, the object should have been oval-shaped. I suspect it was a sculpture. Unfortunately, I couldn't find the murder weapon at the crime scene.\"","\"Is there any possibility it was caused by hitting the edge of the workbench?\"","\"Unlikely. If it had hit the edge of the workbench, the wound shape wouldn't be oval.\"","\"Thank you. Liu Jiale is lying. It's very likely that Ye Zeling killed him, and Liu Jiale is taking the blame for her!\" Fang Rui patted Mu Mian's head and left with the report.","Mu Mian was stunned for a moment, then reminded Fang Rui unhappily, \"Patting heads stunts growth. Also, the victim...\"","But Fang Rui had already left.","He really is an impatient person! But Mu Mian knew Fang Rui would come back to see her later.","When Fang Rui returned to the interrogation room, Liu Jiale had already entered a state of refusing to answer any questions.","Fang Rui's eyes fixed on Liu Jiale, \"The one who killed the victim wasn't you, but Ye Zeling, right?\"","\"What does this have to do with Zeling? I killed him, I confess! What more do you want?\"","\"Then please answer again, how did Ye Zeming die?\"","\"I told you, I was very angry at the time, so I pushed him. He hit the workbench and died shortly after!\"","\"But our forensic results don't show that,\" Fang Rui took out the autopsy report and showed Liu Jiale the photo. \"This wound was clearly caused by hitting the floor. You don't even know how the victim died, are you sure you killed him?\"","Liu Jiale immediately defended himself, \"I was too panicked at the time, I remembered wrong. Now I recall, his head hit the floor, making a very crisp sound.\"","\"I just lied to you. Actually, it was caused by hitting a sculpture,\" Fang Rui said to Liu Jiale. \"You don't know the details of the case at all. The killer isn't you, you're just trying to take the blame for Ye Zeling, aren't you?\"","\"I'm the killer, I killed him! Am I an idiot? How could I possibly take the blame for that bitch Ye Zeling! I hate her so much I could kill her too!\"","Zhang couldn't help but feel some sympathy for Liu Jiale. Being this devoted to someone who doesn't care about you is too pathetic.","\"Ye Zeling doesn't like you, she likes her brother,\" Zhang couldn't help but remind him. \"Even if you take the blame for Ye Zeling, she won't like you!\"","Liu Jiale clenched his fists in anger but remained silent, seemingly confident that the police couldn't prove whether it was Ye Zeling or him who pushed Ye Zeming down.","Fang Rui said, \"Liu Jiale, your plan was perfect, but do you know why we still guessed the truth? It's because of Ye Zeling. She insisted that the victim was murdered, she insisted that we investigate.\"","Liu Jiale's eyes widened instantly, as if struck by lightning, and he froze.","\"Why do you think she did that?\"","Liu Jiale still didn't speak.","\"If your plan had succeeded, you both would have been innocent, and Ye Zeling would have been blackmailed by you with this incident. She would have been under your control for the rest of her life. On the contrary, if the case was solved, you would definitely take the blame for her voluntarily. This way, Ye Zeling could successfully escape punishment and have a free life.\"","\"No, you're talking nonsense, Zeling wouldn't do this to me!\"","Fang Rui continued to attack his psyche: \"It seems Ye Zeling is much smarter than you. Her plan is what you'd call a perfect crime.\"","Liu Jiale was on the verge of a mental breakdown, but he still defended Ye Zeling: \"Zeling didn't mean to, she accidentally pushed her brother, who knew it would turn out like this. She only committed manslaughter.\"","\"Then why did you create the fire and explosion?\"","\"It was all my idea. We were too panicked at the time. Later when we calmed down, we were blinded by the huge benefits.","Ye Zeming had bought insurance for himself, with Zeling as the beneficiary. But if the insurance company found out that Zeling killed Ye Zeming, she wouldn't get a penny of compensation. And there would be no way to repay the debts Ye Zeming owed!","We created the fire to ensure Ye Zeming's body would be discovered quickly, so the insurance company would pay us the compensation.\"","Liu Jiale detailed the process of the crime:","When Ye Zeling discovered that her brother was addicted to gambling and owed huge debts, she completely broke down. She lost her temper with her brother, and when Ye Zeming tried to comfort her, she pushed him away forcefully. Unexpectedly, he lost his balance and crashed into a huge sculpture on the table.","Ye Zeling left the villa in a panic but encountered Liu Jiale, who had come to collect debts, outside the villa. Seeing Ye Zeling in a state of panic, Liu Jiale asked her what happened. After learning that Ye Zeling had accidentally killed Ye Zeming, Liu Jiale immediately said he would help Ye Zeling handle the situation.","Liu Jiale loved reading detective novels, so his mind quickly came up with many ways to dispose of the body.","He originally planned to cut the body into small pieces and hide them inside a batch of plaster sculptures. He first cut off Ye Zeming's genitals with a knife, and out of anger, he smashed them with a hammer. But when he saw the bloody wound, he became scared and didn't dare to dismember Ye Zeming further.","But then he thought of an even more clever method.","First, he and Ye Zeling put Ye Zeming's body in a freezer and set it to the lowest temperature. This way, the body wouldn't decompose, and the forensic experts wouldn't be able to determine exactly which day Ye Zeming died.","He had Ye Zeling imitate Ye Zeming's voice and call Ye Zeming's colleagues and friends every day, creating the illusion that Ye Zeming was still alive.","In the early hours of the day of the incident, he placed the frozen Ye Zeming near a window. From that position, one could vaguely make out that it was Ye Zeming, but couldn't see the details clearly. This further reinforced the illusion that Ye Zeming died on June 12th.","Then he left the villa and deliberately found a spot directly facing a camera in the library, giving himself a solid alibi.","The reason he deliberately left his previous residence and went into hiding was to add another layer of protection. If the police discovered the truth, he could more easily take the blame for Ye Zeling. He loved Ye Zeling so much that he didn't want her to be harmed in any way.","On June 12th, he set up the fire-starting device and deliberately piled up many paint cans and turpentine near the workbench. He closed all the windows so that when the fire started, it might cause an explosion, further damaging the body.","According to his plan, the firefighters would treat it as an ordinary fire. Even if someone became suspicious, the body would have been burned, making it difficult for the police to determine if the body had been frozen, let alone pinpoint the exact time of death.","But an unexpected situation arose. The police investigating the case were very capable, and they unraveled the truth bit by bit.","Ye Zeling learned from the female officer protecting her that the police had confirmed Ye Zeming was murdered and had made significant progress in the investigation.","Ye Zeling told him this. He immediately planned a staged attack on Ye Zeling in the street, so the police investigation would shift focus to him. If the truth came out, he could reasonably take the blame for Ye Zeling.","His plan was perfect, ensuring that Ye Zeling would definitely escape punishment. He never expected that the one who would make his plan fail would be Ye Zeling, the very person he had been trying to protect.","Liu Jiale's face turned ashen. He knew Ye Zeling didn't love him, but he never imagined she could be so vicious. Indeed, both siblings were demons."]},{"number":33,"title":"Chapter 33: Murderous Suspicion: The Third Person","paragraphs":["Ye Zeling also quickly confessed to her crime. Having killed her most beloved brother with her own hands had been tormenting her heart. So before Fang Rui and his team could even begin to interrogate her, Ye Zeling had already provided a detailed account of how the crime took place.","Her statement was largely consistent with Liu Jiale's account.","Fang Rui remembered something and asked, \"Miss Ye, did you two put that small piece of paper in the victim's hand?\"","\"What paper?\"","Fang Rui felt that there were still some unresolved questions in this case.","However, everyone else was already basking in the joy of solving the case.","Zhang exclaimed, \"Ah! This case is finally solved. I can't believe Ye Zeling's acting was so good, she almost had me fooled!\"","\"I know, right? She was crying so heartbrokenly while hugging her brother's body. Who could have imagined that she was the killer herself! Though she's quite unfortunate. If she had honestly turned herself in, she might have only been charged with manslaughter. Now that she's made everything so complicated, she'll definitely get a longer sentence.\"","\"Aren't you forgetting that she's a dance drama performer? I felt something was off about her at the time. Normal people don't cry like that.\"","\"Then why didn't you say something at the time? If you had, we would have solved the case immediately!\"","\"Well... we didn't have any evidence then!\"","\"I have to say, the boss and Dr. Mu are really impressive. If we were investigating this case, we might have just thought it was an ordinary fire.\"","Everyone was eager to celebrate solving the big case, but Fang Rui wasn't as happy as they were.","Because he remembered Mu Mian saying that the cause of death was mechanical asphyxia. Although brain damage could also cause asphyxia, Mu Mian hadn't emphasized it at the time, which suggested that the wound wasn't the fatal injury.","And then there was that small piece of paper. Both Ye Zeling and Liu Jiale said they didn't put it there, which meant there was likely a third person at the crime scene!","When Fang Rui found Mu Mian, she was drawing in her office.","Mu Mian had weekly drawing assignments as part of her autism intervention therapy. She had been busy with the case all week and hadn't had time to complete it, but now she finally had time to catch up on her homework.","Seeing Fang Rui, Mu Mian put down her brush, \"Fang Rui, I wanted to tell you earlier that I think Lin Lan is the real killer, but you left immediately.\"","Fang Rui smiled at Mu Mian. What a coincidence, he also suspected Lin Lan was the killer.","Mu Mian took out the now shriveled but still beautifully colored green cake from her drawer, \"This is the evidence. Although it's not very rigorous as evidence.\"","\"We found out that Lin Lan also went to that villa on the morning of June 8th. This further proves that she was likely present at the time of the crime.\"","Lin Lan had entered the villa by taxi, sitting in the back seat and avoiding the surveillance cameras the entire time, so she wasn't discovered in the first round of investigation.","After finding this discrepancy, Fang Rui questioned the taxi drivers one by one again, and one taxi driver confirmed that Lin Lan had taken his car to enter the villa area that morning.","Fang Rui took his team to arrest Lin Lan.","Lin Lan was cleaning the shelves, which had already been emptied of cakes, leaving only some molds. But Lin Lan was still cleaning very meticulously.","Fang Rui asked directly, \"Miss Lin, you were also in the room when Ye Zeling and Ye Zeming had their argument, weren't you?\"","Lin Lan's expression was very calm. Fang Rui thought she would deny it, but she confessed, \"Yes, I was there that day. I was hiding behind the shelf.\"","\"When Ye Zeming hit the sculpture, he wasn't dead yet. At that time, Ye Zeling ran out in a panic, and you took advantage of this opportunity to kill Ye Zeming. When Ye Zeling and Liu Jiale came back in, Ye Zeming was already dead, so they mistakenly thought Ye Zeling had killed him, right?\"","\"Yes.\" Lin Lan looked at her cake shop reluctantly, then extended her hands to Fang Rui, saying softly, \"I confess. My faith does not allow me to lie, let alone commit crimes.\"","Fang Rui handcuffed her and took her back to the police station.","Lin Lan was probably the most cooperative criminal Fang Rui had ever seen. Before he could even ask, she volunteered the details of what happened:","\"That day I heard Zeming was sick, so I brought him some medicine and cake. When I got there, I found out he wasn't sick at all, he just used this excuse to lure me there and ask me to lend him money. I was very angry, but I loved him so much that I still decided to lend him the money.","Then Zeling arrived.","Zeming didn't want us to meet because Zeling was very hostile towards me, so he asked me to hide and wait until Zeling left before coming out.","The siblings had a fierce argument, and during their quarrel, I learned about the sordid relationship between them. At that moment, my world collapsed.","Can you understand that kind of despair? I was raised with the purest faith, only to fall in love with such a scumbag. How ironic!","Later, Ye Zeling accidentally pushed Zeming, and his head hit a statue, causing a lot of bleeding. Ye Zeling was frightened, thinking she had accidentally killed her brother, so she ran out of the villa in a panic.","At this point, I walked over to Zeming and found that he was still breathing, he wasn't dead. He opened his eyes wide, seemingly wanting to ask me for help. But I didn't save him. I took a pillow and smothered him to death.","I think God will forgive me. I was punishing a demon, not committing a crime.\"","\"You know what happened after that. When Ye Zeling went out, she met Liu Jiale. Liu Jiale loved her so much that when he found out about this, his first instinct was to cover up the truth. He engineered a fire, intending to destroy all traces of evidence.","Haha, but they never thought that the person who actually killed Ye Zeming was me.\"","Lin Lan sighed, \"If only I hadn't left that note, you probably wouldn't have discovered that there was another person at the crime scene. But I don't regret it. Ye Zeling isn't a good person either, and I wanted to expose her dirty secret with her brother.","I hoped that the big fire would cleanse his filthy, sinful soul.\"","Fang Rui said, \"We suspected you not just because of the note, but also because of that green velvet cake.\"","\"The cake?\" Lin Lan gave a bitter smile, \"No wonder your girlfriend was so interested in that piece of cake. So she suspected me even then. I was careless. I saw her looking so naive, I thought she really just liked the cake. I didn't expect she was trying to get information out of me!\"","\"She's very smart.\"","Coming out of the interrogation room, Zhang gossiped, \"Girl...friend? Boss, aren't you single? Where did you get a girlfriend?\"","Fang Rui glared at him, \"Don't go spreading rumors, this is just a misunderstanding.\"","\"She was talking about Dr. Mu, right? Boss, be honest, are you dating Mu Mian?\"","\"Why would you have such a misconception? Mu Mian and I are diligently solving cases, what are you doing, imagining some romance novel? Are you tired of your job and want to quit?\"","Fang Rui was a bit exasperated. He and Mu Mian had been working day and night to solve the case, where would they find time for dating?","\"Tsk tsk, Boss, you used to call her Dr. Mu, but look now, you're calling her by her first name!\"","\"Is there a difference?\" Fang Rui hadn't paid attention to these details. Names were just labels to him.","\"You should use someone's title when working, it's common sense.\" Zhang imitated Mu Mian's tone.","\"...\"","\"Boss, don't you feel that you treat Dr. Mu very specially?\"","\"I treat everyone who can help me solve cases specially. Mu Mian is a genius at solving cases, of course I have to treat her well, don't I?\"","Zhang felt a bit disappointed. So the boss only valued Dr. Mu for her case-solving abilities. Dr. Mu really misplaced her affections. But then again, it seemed Mu Mian wasn't interested in Fang Rui as a person either, but rather in his future corpse.","Strangely compatible!","\"Zhang Qiang!\" Chen Xue patted Zhang's shoulder, \"What are you muttering about again?\"","\"Ah, don't call my full name! And why are you shouting so loud!\" Zhang saw that no one was around and whispered to Chen Xue, \"Chen Xue, the CP you're shipping is purely your imagination! The boss doesn't like Dr. Mu at all!\"","\"That's not important, it doesn't matter,\" Chen Xue's eyes gleamed, \"The boss is a Libra, and Dr. Mu is a Leo. These two zodiac signs are perfect for each other. They'll definitely end up together!\"","Zhang looked at Chen Xue helplessly. He had thought he was the most unreliable one here, but to his surprise, Chen Xue, who usually appeared clever and quick-witted, turned out to be just as unreliable."]},{"number":34,"title":"Chapter 34: Wishing You Time","paragraphs":["The three testimonies matched up completely, and the case was finally closed.","When Ye Zeling learned that the killer of Ye Zeming was Lin Lan, she was first shocked, then fell into a state of frenzy: \"I knew it, I didn't kill my brother. Thank goodness, I didn't kill my brother...\"","Liu Jiale, on the other hand, was utterly shocked when he found out. He could hardly believe that Lin Lan would kill someone.","In his heart, Lin Lan was like an angel, always accommodating Ye Zeming and the others, and always comforting him when he was oppressed. How could such a kind person kill someone?","He was desperate to see Lin Lan while in detention, almost suicidal in his attempts.","Although Lin Lan was wearing a yellow prison uniform, her expression was calm, and she still exuded an aura of tranquility.","Liu Jiale grabbed Lin Lan's hand and said urgently, \"Sister Lin Lan, the police made a mistake, right? They got it wrong. The one who killed that scumbag Ye Zeming was clearly Ye Zeling. Why are you taking the blame for her?\"","\"Jiale, they didn't make a mistake. I killed Ye Zeming.\"","\"...Why?\"","\"Jiale, although your actions obstructed the police investigation, you probably won't be sentenced to more than a few years. After you get out of prison, stay away from Ye Zeling, don't love her anymore. You should plan for your own life now. Don't be like me, who lost everything for love and betrayed my own beliefs in the end.\"","Liu Jiale's eyes were somewhat bewildered. \"I... I don't know if I can do that.\"","\"You must do it. Don't love someone who doesn't love themselves!\" Lin Lan's gaze was determined. \"It's too late for me, but you still have a chance.\"","Liu Jiale was in tears.","\"Jiale, don't come to see me anymore. I'll be fine in here.\"","Lin Lan was a person with her own beliefs. Even in prison, she could still live out the rest of her days calmly.","After work, Fang Rui didn't plan to go home with Mu Mian. They had been together a lot lately, even commuting together, which could easily lead to misunderstandings. He didn't want rumors to affect their purely professional relationship.","But when he saw Mu Mian standing at the entrance, quietly waiting for a ride, Fang Rui hesitated.","As he was hesitating, a car stopped beside Mu Mian.","\"Dr. Mu, need a ride?\"","It was Lin Sen speaking. He had driven by the City Police Bureau, originally intending to ask Fang Rui out for dinner, but changed his mind when he saw Mu Mian.","Mu Mian quickly analyzed the situation in her head: Lin Sen's car was well-maintained and looked very safe, and Lin Sen was an emotionally stable person who probably wouldn't get road rage—it should be quite safe to ride with him.","More importantly, Mu Mian wanted to get home quickly to prepare a birthday surprise for her sister.","\"Thank you,\" Mu Mian said as she got into the back seat.","Fang Rui watched Lin Sen's car leave, feeling perplexed. Since when had that selfish and cold guy become so kind-hearted? Could it be that Lin Sen was trying an indirect approach, using Mu Mian to get closer to her sister?","Love really does make people blind! Fang Rui couldn't help but sigh.","Zhang, seeing Fang Rui staring wistfully as Lin Sen's car drove away, also sighed, \"Consultant Lin is quite a catch too. I wonder if Dr. Mu might develop feelings for him instead?\"","Fang Rui gave him a withering look. \"Don't you have work to do?\"","If it weren't for Zhang constantly whispering in his ear, would he have been affected by those rumors? And now the culprit had the audacity to appear before him.","\"Consultant Lin also has a smart brain. I wonder if Dr. Mu might be interested in his body too?\" Chen Xue chimed in out of nowhere, playing off Zhang's comment.","Fang Rui retorted, \"You're overthinking it. Consultant Lin can't read minds, so Dr. Mu wouldn't find his brain worth researching. Mu Mian wouldn't be interested in Lin Sen's love-addled brain!\"","\"...No wonder you're not worried!\" Chen Xue muttered under her breath.","\"Yeah, we were so worried for you just now.\"","\"You two...\" Fang Rui suddenly scrutinized them both.","Chen Xue and Zhang felt uneasy under his gaze.","Zhang's voice trembled, \"Boss, what's wrong?\"","\"You two have been acting strange lately, always sticking together. You're not dating, are you?\"","\"Boss, don't spread rumors! Chen Xue and I are just friends, nothing more.\"","\"Oh.\"","Chen Xue also hurried to clarify: \"Captain Fang, Zhang and I are just bros!\" They just liked to ship couples together, that's all.","At this moment, Wang passed by and, seeing Zhang and Chen Xue both blushing furiously, asked in confusion, \"Captain Fang, what's wrong with these two? How come Zhang, with his thick skin, is blushing?\"","\"Don't know, maybe they're dating!\" Fang Rui dropped this bomb and walked away without looking back, leaving the three of them shocked.","Zhang said, \"We're not dating.\"","Chen Xue added, \"We're just friends.\"","Wang, who was passing by, chuckled, \"Oh... I see, I understand!\"","Within minutes, the gossip about Chen Xue and Zhang's romance spread throughout the entire City Police Bureau.","Zhang and Chen Xue were on the verge of tears. This was definitely Fang Rui's revenge on them!","Shen Xiyin was returning home after work when she happened to see Mu Mian getting out of Lin Sen's car.","She was a bit surprised. In Mu Mian's observation diary, Lin Sen's name had only appeared once. Mu Mian and Lin Sen weren't close.","\"Sister.\"","\"Lin Sen, thank you for bringing my sister home.\"","Lin Sen didn't respond to Shen Xiyin, but he didn't leave either. He just looked at her.","Mu Mian, completely oblivious to the undercurrents between them, looked at Shen Xiyin, then at Lin Sen, and curiously asked, \"Consultant Lin, Sister, are you communicating through mind reading?\"","\"...\"","\"But I can't read minds, so I don't know what you're talking about. I'll be very bored standing here. Can you communicate verbally? I promise I'll keep it a secret. I won't tell Fang Rui what you talked about.\"","Shen Xiyin said to Mu Mian, \"Mian, can you go home first?\"","\"Okay. But Sister, come home soon, okay?\" Mu Mian wasn't interested in their secret.","After Mu Mian left, Shen Xiyin said to Lin Sen, \"Lin Sen, we can be friends, can't we?\"","Lin Sen ignored her. He took out a pack of cigarettes from his pocket and lit one.","\"I don't need friends.\"","Shen Xiyin sighed. She knew Lin Sen was a stubborn person, but wasn't she also obsessive in her own way? Once she had decided to break up back then, she wouldn't start over with Lin Sen.","Lin Sen took a drag on his cigarette, his tone softening a bit, \"You came back to the country to investigate the truth about your parents' car accident, didn't you?\"","Shen Xiyin's mother was a renowned neurosurgeon, and her father was a senior researcher at a pharmaceutical company. They died in a car accident. The police found that the car involved in the accident had been tampered with, but they never caught the culprit.","Lin Sen had participated in the investigation of this case at the time. They had identified a suspect, but that person had immigrated back to their home country.","Shen Xiyin's smile gradually faded, and she struggled to control her emotions, \"Please don't tell Mu Mian about this. I can handle my parents' matter on my own.\"","\"Shen Xiyin, I can help you! I'll take care of Mu Mian with you, I'll help you investigate the truth about your parents' accident. Can we get back together?\"","\"Lin Sen, we can't.\"","When Shen Xiyin returned home, she found the house pitch dark. Just as she was puzzled, Mu Mian came out of the room holding a cake.","\"Sister, happy birthday!\"","Shen Xiyin was surprised and touched. This was the first time Mu Mian had taken the initiative to celebrate her birthday.","\"I originally ordered a very pretty cake with lots of beautiful flowers on it, but the bakery owner was arrested. Guess who discovered she was the murderer?\"","\"You.\"","\"Yes, but Fang Rui also guessed she was the killer.\" Mu Mian remembered Lin Sen and asked, \"Fang Rui said Consultant Lin likes you very much. Do you like him?\"","\"Once upon a time, very much.\"","\"Will you marry him then?\"","\"No,\" Shen Xiyin said, \"I won't marry anyone.\"","\"Then Consultant Lin is so pitiful. He likes you, but you won't marry him. He'll be all alone and very lonely.\"","\"He'll fall in love with another girl in the future,\" Shen Xiyin sighed. \"I'm not getting married, why don't you think I'm pitiful?\"","\"Sister, you have me. I'll always be with you.\"","Shen Xiyin smiled.","Mu Mian turned on the small speaker, which played the birthday song. \"Sister, hurry and blow out the candles to make a wish,\" she said.","Shen Xiyin made her wish and blew out the candles.","\"This is my gift for you,\" Mu Mian handed Shen Xiyin an exquisite gift box, urging, \"Open it quickly and take a look.\"","\"It's beautiful. I love it,\" Shen Xiyin said as she opened it. Inside the box was an hourglass, simple in design, with soft white sand inside transparent glass.","\"After Mom and Dad passed away, you've been so busy all the time. I feel like you're very tired. So I'm giving you an hourglass. Chen Xue said it can represent time. Sister, I wish you to have time!\"","Shen Xiyin hadn't cried when their parents died, but at this moment, she suddenly found it hard to control her emotions.","It turned out that Mu Mian could sense her feelings. It's just that before, Mu Mian hadn't learned how to express it.","Mu Mian stretched out her arms and said to Shen Xiyin, \"Sister, I can allow you to hug me now.\"","\"Mu Mian, thank you!\"","\"You're welcome.\"","Mu Mian was very happy. She felt that she had finally done something that made her sister happy.","She decided that when Fang Rui's birthday came, she would also give him a cake and an hourglass. That way, Fang Rui would surely be so moved that he'd immediately agree to donate his body to her."]},{"number":35,"title":"Chapter 35: Reverse Judgment: Voluntary or Coerced","paragraphs":["Mu Mian had just arrived at the office when she overheard Zhang and Chen Xue gossiping about their rumored romance.","She was somewhat surprised, but also found it reasonable - they both loved to talk, so they must get along well.","When Chen Xue saw even Mu Mian's expression of having stumbled upon juicy gossip, she knew that rumors truly don't stop with the wise!","\"Mian Mian, you have to believe me, I'm not dating Zhang,\" Chen Xue said.","Mu Mian's gaze was a bit bewildered as she asked in confusion, \"But you seem so happy when you're with Officer Zhang!\"","\"...Do I?\" Chen Xue questioned.","\"When you talk to me, you smile like this.\" Mu Mian stiffly imitated a \"caught between laughter and tears\" expression.","\"I smile sweetly at you, and your imitation looks nothing like it!\" Chen Xue protested.","\"When you smile at Officer Zhang, your mouth stretches really wide. That's how the female lead smiles at the male lead in movies,\" Mu Mian said, imitating a big, hearty laugh.","One part of the autism intervention program involved having autistic patients watch therapist-selected movies and write their impressions afterwards.","Mu Mian's movie list included several romance films. Though she watched them many times without understanding, she did remember the female lead's smile.","Smiling, being one of the more outward and positive emotions, was also the emotion Mu Mian could identify most easily.","Chen Xue fell into self-doubt: Could her pure collegial relationship with Zhang really have changed without her noticing?","After solving the arson case involving Ye Zeming, the Special Crime Unit had been relatively idle for a while.","\"Fang Rui, there's a case I find rather tricky. Could your Special Crime Unit take it over?\" Captain Li from the neighboring Criminal Investigation Unit approached Fang Rui. \"I think only your team can handle it!\"","Fang Rui asked, \"What kind of case?\"","\"A rape case. The victim is an internet celebrity, so it's causing quite a stir. We need to solve it quickly. But it's complicated and not easy to investigate.\"","Without hesitation, Fang Rui asked for all the case files.","Fang Rui saw the suspect's name: Lin Qianjie, son of Jiangzhou City's wealthiest man. No wonder Captain Li was in such a hurry to pass the case to him - he clearly didn't want to invite trouble.","Zhang tried desperately to signal Fang Rui with his eyes, but failed to stop him from taking the case.","\"Boss, are you crazy? Captain Li is obviously trying to dump this on us! Even if we solve it, we won't get much credit. But if we can't uncover the truth, or if the truth doesn't match public speculation, we'll be crucified!\" Zhang exclaimed.","Fang Rui paused in his steps. \"Zhang, we became police officers to uphold justice, not for promotions or money.\"","Zhang fell silent. Fang Rui had the right to say such things. Both of Fang Rui's parents were in politics, and his family members all held high positions. If Fang Rui hadn't insisted on becoming a police officer, he could have had an even brighter future.","\"But we can't take every case that comes our way,\" Zhang said, stifling a bored yawn. \"A case like this isn't complex. There's no challenge to it.\"","The victim was named Lu Tian, a beauty blogger on a certain platform. On the day of the incident, Lin Qianjie had entered Lu Tian's home under the pretext of discussing a business collaboration and then raped her.","The forensic doctor had already examined Lu Tian. Semen was extracted from her vagina and confirmed to be Lin Qianjie's.","Lu Tian had many defensive wounds on her body, indirectly proving that she had been forced into sexual intercourse with Lin Qianjie against her will.","Lin Qianjie had already been brought to the interrogation room.","Lin Qianjie was somewhat good-looking, but had a sleazy air about him. There was a bruise at the corner of his mouth where Lu Tian had hit him with a vase while resisting.","He wore a gaudy shirt, slouched sideways in his chair with his legs crossed, looking arrogant. No matter what he was asked, he kept saying that he had the right to remain silent until his lawyer arrived.","When he saw Fang Rui enter, he was taken aback for a moment and instinctively sat up straighter. But the contemptuous smile remained on his face.","\"Well, if it isn't my old classmate Fang Rui? Look at you now, what's the point of being a lowly cop? Why don't you come work for me as a bodyguard? I'll pay you tens of thousands a month, that's way more than you make as a cop, right?\"","Fang Rui raised his eyes and gave him a cool look. \"Are you sure about that?\"","\"Oh come on, I was just joking,\" Lin Qianjie immediately backed down. He knew very well that if Fang Rui wasn't wearing that police uniform, he would have already beaten him up.","Lin Qianjie and Fang Rui were classmates from elementary school through high school. Fang Rui, who despised evil, had always disliked Lin Qianjie and had beaten him up quite often.","\"Fang Rui, you don't need to investigate this case. Lu Tian and I are a couple. I didn't rape her at all. She's just upset with me and that's why she called the police on me. If you don't believe me, go check - I have plenty of witnesses and evidence!\"","Fang Rui cut him off, \"Answer only what I ask. Please don't over-explain!\"","\"Don't be so serious. It's not like I'm a real rapist!\" Lin Qianjie protested.","Fang Rui looked at him coldly.","\"Alright, alright, go ahead and ask. I'll answer everything truthfully,\" Lin Qianjie conceded.","\"Describe the situation on the day of the incident.\"","Lin Qianjie explained, \"That day I had secured a brand promotion deal for Lu Tian, so I went to her place to give her the good news.","We were already a couple, you know, and I have pretty high sexual needs, so naturally, things led to us having sex.","Who would have thought Lu Tian would pull this trick, actually accusing me of rape? I'm being framed here!\"","\"If she was willing, why does she have defensive wounds on her body?\" Fang Rui questioned.","\"Come on, women are like that. They say no with their mouths, but they actually mean yes. It's just foreplay!\" Lin Qianjie glanced at Zhang, then looked back at Fang Rui. \"You two are both single, how would you understand these things?\"","\"You say you were dating her. Do you have any evidence?\"","Lin Qianjie leaned back, a very confident smile on his face.","\"There's plenty of evidence. My lawyer is already collecting it, and he'll bring it over to you soon. Fang Rui, you don't need to investigate this case. My lawyer will submit all the evidence to you, and you can just write up the case closure report.\"","Just as Lin Qianjie finished speaking, his lawyer arrived to bail him out.","Lin Qianjie's lawyer was named Wang Li, the most famous criminal lawyer in the city.","Rumor had it that he had never lost a case. He even dared to defend murder cases with a not guilty plea, and still won. However, he generally only took cases for wealthy clients because his fees were exceptionally high.","\"Officer Fang, I believe these materials can prove that my client and Ms. Lu were in a relationship,\" Lawyer Wang, dressed in a black suit with gold-rimmed glasses perched on his nose, looked very professional as he handed Fang Rui a file folder.","Fang Rui took the folder, which was quite heavy, filled with photographs.","All the photos were of Lin Qianjie and Lu Tian together - some of them on a yacht during a sea trip, some of them entering and leaving an apartment complex together, and some of them wearing matching outfits.","The photos covered many different scenarios, but the main subjects were always Lin Qianjie and Lu Tian. In the photos, Lu Tian's expressions looked natural, not as if she had been coerced into taking them.","\"Officer Fang, take your time to look through these. I'll take my client home now,\" Wang Li said, having quickly completed the bail procedures. He was in a hurry to get Lin Qianjie out.","Lin Qianjie raised his chin at Fang Rui provocatively. \"Officer Fang, I'm leaving now!\"","A middle-aged woman with a refined air was waiting for him in the hallway.","When Lin Qianjie saw her, his whole demeanor became nervous. He shuffled over slowly and called out, \"Mom, why are you here?\"","The woman was Lin Qianjie's stepmother, Jiang Yun. Without a word, she slapped him across the face. \"You're a disgrace!\"","Lin Qianjie's fists clenched tightly, but he didn't dare to talk back. Instead, he put on a placating smile and said, \"I was set up by that woman this time. It won't happen again.\"","Mu Mian came out of the office just in time to see Jiang Yun. She froze in place.","This woman looked almost identical to the mother in the photograph.","Could she... be her mother?"]},{"number":36,"title":"Chapter 36: Reversal of Judgment: Adverse Testimony","paragraphs":["Jiang Yun left with Lin Qianjie and Lawyer Wang, brushing past Mu Mian as they went.","Mu Mian froze, unsure whether to call out to her or if this woman could possibly be her mother. She had always imagined her mother as a poor, struggling woman who couldn't afford to visit her abroad despite working hard. In her mind, her mother wore tattered clothes and had a face lined with wrinkles... but this woman looked nothing like that.","If she was her mother, why hadn't she come to see her when she seemed so wealthy?","\"Mu Mian, daydreaming again?\" Fang Rui tapped her shoulder. \"Save that for the office, or you'll affect our City Police Bureau's image.\"","Mu Mian forced a smile worse than crying. \"Got it.\"","\"Did something happen?\" Fang Rui rarely saw Mu Mian looking so upset.","Mu Mian shook her head. She was fine, she just needed to revise the mental image of her mother in her mind.","\"Fang Rui, I'm okay now,\" Mu Mian smiled again, this time genuinely.","Fang Rui had the tech team verify the authenticity of the photos. They reported that none showed signs of digital manipulation and appeared to be genuine.","Fang Rui and the police psychologist Li Lanlan took Lu Tian's statement together.","Lu Tian, 27 years old, was strikingly beautiful with classical features. But sitting in the interview room, she looked haggard, her pretty phoenix eyes swollen from crying.","Li Lanlan asked gently, \"Miss Lu, what is your relationship with Lin Qianjie?\"","\"He's a friend of my best friend. I guess we're friends too.\"","\"But he says you two are in a romantic relationship,\" Li Lanlan said carefully, not wanting to upset the fragile-looking Lu Tian.","\"He's lying! I don't like him at all, and he's never confessed to me. We're just normal friends. He's making this up to avoid punishment. He must be lying to save himself.\"","\"Miss Lu, please calm down. Why did you let him into your home on the night of the incident?\"","Lu Tian kept wiping away tears. \"I've said this many times. He told me he had arranged an advertising deal for me and came over to discuss the details. My best friend was there at first, but she left after getting a phone call. We were in the middle of discussing contract details, so I couldn't just kick him out. I had no idea he would drag me into the bedroom and force himself on me.\"","Each recollection was deeply traumatic for Lu Tian. She was already emotionally fragile, and this retelling pushed her further towards a breakdown. She began crying uncontrollably.","Fang Rui produced a photo of her with Lin Qianjie. \"Miss Lu, how do you explain this picture?\"","The photo showed Lu Tian and Lin Qianjie posing together, Lu Tian smiling sweetly with a blue ocean in the background. They looked very intimate.","\"This photo was taken with my best friend and Lin Qianjie. Why is it just the two of us now? My friend should be there too!\" Lu Tian looked at the photo in shock. \"This must be fake. I've never taken a photo like this with him alone.\"","Fang Rui pointed out, \"But there are many such photos in different settings.\"","\"Impossible! I've never taken photos alone with Lin Qianjie. In this one, we're wearing matching clothes because we were at a charity event. Many people wore the same shirt. This photo has been altered - we took it with a large group...\"","Lu Tian had a somewhat plausible explanation for each photo. But faced with so many pictures, her excuses seemed weak.","Fang Rui latched onto a key figure in her story - her best friend.","His instincts told him Lu Tian wasn't lying.","Fang Rui knew Lin Qianjie fairly well. Lin had been constantly dating girls since middle school and led a chaotic personal life. He was unscrupulous and had a history of deceiving girls. This was why Fang Rui used to beat him up so often!","\"Boss, you don't think Lu Tian is actually lying, do you?\" Zhang held up his phone. \"A cleaner from Lu Tian's apartment complex posted online saying she'd seen Lin Qianjie leaving Lu Tian's place multiple times. Some female employees from Lin Qianjie's company also claimed they saw Lu Tian passionately kissing him in his office...\"","After reporting to the police, Lu Tian had posted about the incident online, fearing the police might favor Lin Qianjie.","As a popular social media influencer, her story spread quickly. Public opinion initially sided with Lu Tian. But when her \"intimate photos\" with Lin Qianjie appeared online, along with the efforts of Lin Qianjie's paid internet trolls, public sentiment rapidly turned against her.","\"Have Li Lanlan stay with her 24/7. Her mental state is already fragile. If she sees these comments, she might even attempt suicide.\"","\"Boss, do you really think Lu Tian was raped?\" Zhang was starting to waver in the face of so much evidence. While Lin Qianjie didn't seem like a good person, did that necessarily mean the seemingly weak and pitiful Lu Tian was innocent?","\"Let's find her best friend first. Maybe we can get some leads from her.\"","Lu Tian's best friend was named Wang Xiaoya, a sales assistant at a luxury goods store.","When Fang Rui and Zhang arrived at the store, they saw Lawyer Wang just leaving.","Lawyer Wang noticed Fang Rui and greeted him before driving away.","\"Boss, we're too late. That lawyer Wang probably already bought off Wang Xiaoya.\"","When they entered, Wang Xiaoya was touching up her makeup.","After learning why they were there, she continued applying foundation: \"Ask what you need to quickly. Don't make me late for work.\"","Zhang was indignant: \"Miss Wang, your best friend went through such a traumatic experience, and you're worried about makeup?\"","\"What's that supposed to mean? I didn't stop doing my makeup even at my father's funeral,\" Wang Xiaoya rolled her eyes at Zhang. \"What's wrong with putting on makeup? Is it a crime?\"","Fang Rui asked, \"Were you at Lu Tian's place on the night of July 20th?\"","Wang Xiaoya's eyes lit up when she saw Fang Rui. She flipped her hair, \"Officer, do you have a girlfriend?\"","\"Please answer my question.\"","\"Fine, no need to be so harsh! Yes, I was at Lu Tian's that night, but they seemed to be having a great conversation, so I felt like a third wheel and made an excuse to leave.\"","\"You say they were chatting happily?\"","\"Of course.\"","\"Are Lu Tian and Lin Qianjie in a relationship?\"","\"I can't say for sure. Lin Qianjie changes girlfriends all the time, who knows what their relationship is? But Lin Qianjie seemed to really like Lu Tian. And Lu Tian took advantage of that to get a lot of benefits from him.\"","Fang Rui showed her the stack of photos: \"Were you present when these were taken?\"","\"I was there for this one on the yacht. I don't remember when this one was taken. I don't think I was there for this one with the matching outfits.\" Wang Xiaoya cooperatively explained each photo.","\"I don't know why Lu Tian is making such a fuss. This should be a good thing, I can't understand why she reported it to the police! I suspect she might be mentally ill. She's not quite right in the head, always going to see psychologists.\"","\"A good thing?\" Zhang was stunned. \"How is this good?\"","\"Lin Qianjie runs an influencer management company. Lu Tian hooking up with him means she'll have no shortage of resources in the future. If Lin Qianjie marries her, she'll become a rich man's wife! So many people would kill for that kind of luck, but she goes and offends her meal ticket!\"","Fang Rui realized they wouldn't get any useful information from Wang Xiaoya.","\"Officer, is that all you're going to ask?\" Wang Xiaoya looked at Fang Rui, seeming reluctant to let him go. \"Why don't you leave me your number? If I remember anything, I'll contact you right away.\"","Fang Rui gave Zhang a look, and Zhang quickly wrote down a phone number for Wang Xiaoya.","Wang Xiaoya took the paper with obvious disappointment.","As soon as Zhang exited the luxury boutique, he quickly took a deep breath of fresh air. \"My goodness,\" he exclaimed, \"that woman's perfume was so overpowering it nearly suffocated me.\""]},{"number":37,"title":"Chapter 37: Reversal of Judgment: Settlement","paragraphs":["Chen Xue and a few others, including Wang, were outraged when they heard about this case. They were completely on Lu Tian's side. Lu Tian had a delicate, pitiful appearance that evoked sympathy, while Lin Qianjie, judging by his looks, seemed every bit the spoiled rich kid.","\"Is there really nothing we can do to help Lu Tian?\" Chen Xue was furious. \"Even if Lu Tian was dating Lin Qianjie, does that give him the right to force her into a sexual relationship?\"","\"Chen Xue, that's not quite right. If they were actually in a relationship, it's a different situation. Isn't it normal for couples to be intimate?\" someone countered.","Chen Xue grew even more indignant: \"As long as the woman doesn't consent, it's rape! Otherwise, why would marital rape be a crime?\"","Mu Mian, irritated by their heated debate, turned and said, \"This Lin Qianjie is not a good person!\"","\"Mu Mian, isn't that obvious and beyond dispute?\"","Mu Mian continued, \"He's been involved in this kind of lawsuit more than once. One of the victims not only lost her case but was also sued by Lin Qianjie for defamation. In the end, that girl committed suicide by jumping off a building.\"","\"How do you know all this?\"","\"I found it on the computer.\"","Chen Xue immediately rushed to Mu Mian's computer. On the screen was a court verdict: The Jiangzhou City East City District Court dismissed Shen Yuanyuan's rape lawsuit against Lin Qianjie due to insufficient evidence...","Mu Mian switched to another webpage, which was a news report.","Shen Yuanyuan had suffered from cyberbullying because of this incident, and she also had to pay Lin Qianjie a huge amount in compensation, or she might have faced jail time. Under this double pressure of mental and financial strain, Shen Yuanyuan jumped to her death.","The media had extensively covered Shen Yuanyuan's loss in court, but very few outlets reported on her suicide. Only some independent bloggers had spread the news voluntarily, so it didn't reach a wide audience.","Chen Xue was terrified after reading this. If they couldn't help Lu Tian, she might very well become the next Shen Yuanyuan.","When Fang Rui and Zhang returned, Chen Xue showed them the news about Shen Yuanyuan:","Shen Yuanyuan was a graduate student who had met Lin Qianjie through a friend, and they had attended gatherings together. Later, at one of these gatherings, Lin Qianjie raped Shen Yuanyuan.","The subsequent developments were similar to Lu Tian's case. Shen Yuanyuan also sued Lin Qianjie for rape, but Lin Qianjie used a wealth of evidence to prove that Shen Yuanyuan was his girlfriend.","His lawyer also provided chat records suggesting that Shen Yuanyuan had attempted blackmail. In the end, not only did Shen Yuanyuan lose the case, but she also had to pay a huge amount in compensation.","Zhang felt a chill run down his spine. \"This Lin Qianjie is a habitual offender!\"","Fang Rui felt a headache coming on. In the current situation, unless they could obtain direct evidence of Lin Qianjie raping Lu Tian, there was no way Lu Tian could win this lawsuit.","The next morning, Lin Qianjie and his defense lawyer proposed a private mediation with Lu Tian.","The mediation was to take place in a private room at a restaurant.","Lu Tian hadn't hired a lawyer. She was accompanied by Nie Yan, the prosecutor in charge of the case.","It wasn't that Lu Tian couldn't afford a lawyer, but other lawyers in Jiangzhou City were unwilling to defend her. They coldly told her that she had no chance of winning this lawsuit.","That's when Nie Yan actively sought her out. Rape cases are criminal cases, usually prosecuted by the procuratorate to the people's court. Most prosecutors didn't want to take on this case, but Nie Yan voluntarily applied to be responsible for it.","When Nie Yan learned that Lin Qianjie and his team had arranged a private settlement meeting with Lu Tian, she feared Lu Tian might be taken advantage of and decided to accompany her.","Lin Qianjie recognized Nie Yan. When he saw her, he flashed a smug smile: \"If it isn't Prosecutor Nie. Didn't you have enough of losing last time?\"","Nie Yan ignored him and went straight into the private room.","Lin Qianjie turned to Wang Li and said, \"Let's not settle with that bitch anymore. Let's sue her for defamation, just like last time!\"","Wang Li's expression was serious. He pushed up his glasses and said, \"Miss Jiang said it would be better if we reached a settlement.\"","Lin Qianjie immediately fell silent.","Lawyer Wang poured Lu Tian a cup of tea and got straight to the point: \"Miss Lu, if you're willing to withdraw the lawsuit and publicly apologize to my client online, my client is willing to pay you one million yuan as a breakup fee!\"","Lu Tian didn't hesitate and immediately refused: \"I don't want money. I want Lin Qianjie, that scumbag, to face legal punishment!\"","Lin Qianjie sat leisurely with his legs crossed, completely unfazed by Lu Tian's curse.","\"We're willing to settle with you not because we're afraid of losing the lawsuit, but because we don't want to make a big fuss and affect my client's reputation,\" Lawyer Wang said. He took a sip of tea, his smile fading and a hint of malice flashing in his eyes. \"Miss Lu, I advise you to think carefully. You only get one chance.\"","\"I've thought it through very clearly. I won't compromise,\" Lu Tian said. Though she looked fragile, her will was strong. On the day she was hurt, she had sworn to make Lin Qianjie pay for his crimes.","Suddenly, the door to the private room was pushed open. Two elderly people walked in – Lu Tian's parents. They were farmers with little worldly experience, and they timidly greeted Lin Qianjie and Lawyer Wang.","\"Lawyer Wang, our Tian Tian will sign the settlement agreement. We'll persuade her,\" Lu Tian's mother said.","Lu Tian's mother held her daughter's hand and said earnestly, \"Tian Tian, just settle with him, okay? Let's drop the lawsuit. How can ordinary people like us win a case like this?\"","\"Dad, Mom, didn't you say you would support me? I won't settle with him!\" Lu Tian protested.","\"We can't win this case. Tian Tian, listen to your mother. Just settle with them,\" Lu Tian's mother hugged her daughter, her tone urgent. \"They've agreed to give us one million yuan. With that money, your brother can buy a house in the city...\"","Lu Tian's father even knelt down before her. \"Tian Tian, please settle.\"","\"Mom... Dad... why are you forcing me?\"","Lu Tian choked up, feeling as if she had fallen into an endless darkness. Her best friend had betrayed her, and now even her beloved parents were betraying her. She felt like a complete failure in life.","Lawyer Wang was satisfied with this scene. He took out a contract that had been prepared in advance and handed it to Lu Tian.","\"Miss Lu, please sign. Once you sign, we'll immediately transfer the one million yuan to your account.\"","Lin Qianjie also watched the scene with a mocking look. In his mind, there was nothing money couldn't solve. If it didn't work, it just meant not enough money had been offered.","\"Tian Tian, sign it, quick, sign it!\" Lu Tian's father hurriedly brought the contract and pen to Lu Tian, urging her to sign. \"That kind of thing isn't a big deal. You can come back to the countryside with us afterward, and we'll definitely find you a good match. He won't mind these things.\"","Lu Tian's mother chimed in, \"Yes, Tian Tian, don't be stubborn. Out of this million, we'll give you 200,000 yuan. You can use it to start a business!\"","Lu Tian was on the verge of a mental breakdown, crying uncontrollably. She felt as if she were drowning, unable to grasp onto anything.","\"Lawyer Wang, a rape case isn't something that can be withdrawn just like that. If Lu Tian signs this contract, aren't you going to turn around and sue her for blackmail next?\" Nie Yan snatched away the contract, saying angrily.","\"Prosecutor Nie, you're interfering too much. You should respect Miss Lu's own choice,\" Lawyer Wang retorted.","Nie Yan turned to Lu Tian and promised, \"Lu Tian, if you don't want to settle, I will definitely help you win this case!\"","Nie Yan's words gave Lu Tian a chance to breathe. Lu Tian looked at Nie Yan eagerly: \"I don't want to settle. I don't want to!\"","\"Then we won't settle,\" Nie Yan affirmed.","\"Madam Prosecutor, haven't you learned your lesson yet? Wasn't your last defeat embarrassing enough?\" Lawyer Wang taunted Nie Yan. \"Do you think you're helping her? You're actually harming her! If you had let that Miss Shen agree to withdraw the case, she wouldn't have jumped to her death. Do you want to see Miss Lu commit suicide in front of you too?\"","Nie Yan was so angry her hands were shaking. She glared fiercely at Lin Qianjie and Lawyer Wang. \"Those who do evil will eventually face retribution!\"","Lu Tian grasped Nie Yan's hand. \"Nie Yan, I trust you. Let's go!\"","Nie Yan led Lu Tian out of the private room, with Lu Tian's parents' pleading voices still echoing behind them: \"Tiantian, why are you being so stubborn? This is a million yuan we're talking about! How can you just refuse it like that?\"","\"Tiantian, please listen to your father just this once. I'm on my knees begging you!\"","Lu Tian ignored her parents. From the moment they had tried to force her to sign, she had decided to sever ties with them.","\"Nie Yan, aren't you afraid of offending them by helping me like this? Lin Qianjie's family is very powerful. Won't they retaliate against you?\"","Nie Yan looked at Lu Tian, and through her, saw another fragile yet determined girl.","Nie Yan said, \"I don't want to see another girl like you. I want to bring Lin Qianjie to justice.\"","Nie Yan had previously handled Shen Yuanyuan's case. She had lost that lawsuit, which had also cost Shen Yuanyuan her life. She didn't want to see the tragedy repeat itself.","Lin Qianjie watched Lu Tian leave, then turned to Lawyer Wang and said, \"Since they refuse to drink to our toast, let's make them drink a forfeit. This time, I'm not only going to sue that Lu Tian, I'm also going to ruin Nie Yan's reputation!\"","Lawyer Wang gave Lin Qianjie a sidelong glance: \"Miss Jiang only asked me to help you win this lawsuit. She didn't ask me to do anything else.\"","\"Don't worry, your work won't go unrewarded. I'll give you another sum of money.\"","Lawyer Wang smiled with satisfaction, \"That Nie Yan has crossed me several times. I've been wanting to teach her a lesson for a long time. Rest assured, this time I'll put an end to her career for good.\""]},{"number":38,"title":"Chapter 38: Reversal of Judgment: Seizing the Initiative","paragraphs":["Fang Rui planned to go to Lu Tian's house with Zhang to see if they could find any clues. But as soon as he left the office, he saw Mu Mian blocking his way.","\"Fang Rui, can I come with you to investigate the case?\" she asked.","\"Why?\" Fang Rui was a bit surprised. In his impression, Mu Mian wasn't very interested in investigating cases; she was only interested in corpses.","Mu Mian glanced back at Chen Xue, then looked at Fang Rui again. \"For justice!\"","\"...\"","As it happened, Zhang had gone out on duty, so Fang Rui directly took Mu Mian to Lu Tian's house.","Lu Tian lived in the Wenyuan Residential Complex in the East City district. The security in the complex was quite good. Lu Tian lived in Building 6, Room 603.","Nie Yan opened the door. Lu Tian had been in a very bad emotional state recently, so Nie Yan was with her almost 24 hours a day, fearing she might do something rash.","Nie Yan was pleasantly surprised to see Fang Rui. \"Officer Fang? It's been a while since we last met. Are you investigating this case?\"","\"Yes. Nie Yan, are you in charge of Lu Tian's case?\"","\"That's right. Are you here to see Lu Tian? She just took her medication and is asleep now. She'll probably wake up in a while.\"","Nie Yan used to specialize in handling criminal cases and was an excellent prosecutor, so she often had work handovers with Fang Rui and his team. Through these interactions, the two of them got to know each other.","Later, Nie Yan was marginalized in the prosecutor's office and was mainly responsible for small cases, so she had fewer interactions with Fang Rui.","\"Fang Rui, seeing that you're investigating this case, I suddenly feel confident. I'm sure we can find evidence to prove Lin Qianjie's guilt,\" Nie Yan said happily.","Fang Rui and Nie Yan continued to exchange pleasantries, blocking Mu Mian's path and making her a bit irritated. So she chimed in, \"And me too!\"","Only then did Nie Yan notice that there was a young girl behind Fang Rui.","\"This is Prosecutor Nie Yan,\" Fang Rui turned to smile at Mu Mian, then introduced her to Nie Yan, \"Nie Yan, this is Mu Mian, our new forensic expert at the City Police Bureau.\"","\"Hello, Forensic Expert Mu!\" Nie Yan extended her hand towards Mu Mian.","\"Hello.\"","Mu Mian looked at Nie Yan's fair hand, which she didn't know how many bacteria it harbored, and felt conflicted. She didn't want to shake hands with this Prosecutor Nie. So she looked at the ceiling.","\"Sorry, I don't like shaking hands.\"","Nie Yan withdrew her hand, feeling that this Forensic Expert Mu didn't seem to like her very much.","The location of the rape case was Lu Tian's room. Her room faced south, with a large window that let in plenty of light when the curtains weren't drawn.","After the rape occurred, Lu Tian hadn't entered the room, preserving the crime scene.","The entire room was in disarray. The pillow had fallen to the floor, there were pieces of a broken vase on the ground, and the blanket was messy, indicating that Lu Tian had put up a fierce struggle at the time.","Looking out from the window, Mu Mian could see the balconies of the building opposite. The distance between the two buildings wasn't very far. With good eyesight, one could see the TV screen in the living room across the way.","The apartment directly across from them on the eighth floor was watching SpongeBob SquarePants.","Mu Mian wanted to see more clearly, so she leaned out of the window to look. She was very curious about the flowers on the balcony of the ninth floor opposite, so she leaned out a bit further.","The feeling of suspension suddenly reminded her that she was afraid of heights!","Fang Rui had been discussing the case with Nie Yan. He caught sight of Mu Mian's dangerous action from the corner of his eye and immediately ran over to pull her back.","\"Mu Mian, don't you know how dangerous that is! Don't you have a fear of heights? Why are you leaning out of the window? This is the sixth floor. If you fall, you'll die!\" Fang Rui was furious with Mu Mian.","Mu Mian was startled and couldn't help but point out, \"I wouldn't have fallen. I only had a quarter of my body out. According to the principle of leverage, I wouldn't have fallen...\"","Seeing Fang Rui's face getting darker, she quickly changed her tune, \"Fang Rui, thank you for saving me!\"","\"If you do this again, I won't bring you out to investigate cases next time.\"","Mu Mian felt a bit wronged. It was Fang Rui who was making a big deal out of nothing; she hadn't done anything very dangerous.","She still valued her life very much. She wanted to live for a very long time, so she could dissect Fang Rui's body after he died.","\"What did you want to see?\"","\"The balcony over there.\"","Fang Rui followed Mu Mian's gaze to the living room on the eighth floor of the opposite building. From this angle, they could see that the TV in the living room was playing a cartoon, which appeared to be SpongeBob SquarePants.","Fang Rui almost laughed in exasperation, \"Mu Mian, you made such a dangerous move just to watch SpongeBob SquarePants? Can't you watch it on your phone?\"","Mu Mian wanted to argue, but seeing that Nie Yan was still standing nearby, she could only acquiesce.","Nie Yan felt that the current Fang Rui was very different. She had dealt with Fang Rui before, and although he was very good at social niceties, he was skilled at controlling his emotions and often gave people a sense of detachment.","But he was very different with Mu Mian.","Fang Rui suddenly realized that the buildings in this residential complex were quite close together, which didn't provide much privacy. The residents in the opposite building might also be able to see what was happening on Lu Tian's side.","\"Were the curtains not drawn at the time of the incident?\" Fang Rui turned to ask Lu Tian.","Lu Tian said, \"I'm not sure. That day he suddenly pulled me into the room. I don't remember clearly. But I didn't touch the curtains afterwards, so they probably weren't drawn.\"","Nie Yan immediately understood Fang Rui's meaning - the residents in the opposite building might have seen what happened. Nie Yan immediately ran out to investigate.","Mu Mian watched Nie Yan's hastily departing figure and sighed, \"Fang Rui, next time don't reveal the clues. Look, she's beaten us to it.\"","\"She's Lu Tian's prosecutor. She's on our side.\"","\"Shouldn't we be neutral?\"","Fang Rui was taken aback. Perhaps because Lin Qianjie had so much negative history, he had subconsciously sided with Lu Tian. But Lu Tian could also be the one lying.","\"It's okay, those residents haven't returned from work yet, so her trip will be in vain,\" Fang Rui said. \"We'll go interview those residents after dark.\"","Fang Rui then questioned the security guard downstairs.","The security guard was a man from the Northwest, with a large build. He spoke with an accent: \"Miss Lu and Mr. Lin were definitely a couple. We often saw them entering and leaving the complex together.\"","\"Are you saying that Lin Qianjie also lives in this complex?\"","\"Yes, Mr. Lin lives on the eighth floor. But Sister Wang said that when she was cleaning early in the morning, she saw Mr. Lin coming out of her apartment several times. They were probably living together.\"","Fang Rui then found the cleaning lady, Sister Wang. She was in her fifties and looked quite kind.","\"Mr. Lin moved in last month. I remember him clearly because as soon as he moved in, he gave me a big red envelope with several hundred yuan. He was very generous. He and Miss Lu had a very good relationship. Once when I was cleaning the corridor, I saw him coming out of Miss Lu's apartment. It was at 6:30 in the morning, they couldn't have been discussing work at that time, right?","Oh, Miss Lu is too bad. She was clearly in a relationship with Mr. Lin, but she accused him of rape. She probably didn't get the money she wanted, so she turned on him. Young girls these days are so wicked.\"","\"Have you seen them come out of the apartment together?\"","\"No, I haven't!\"","\"Thank you for your cooperation.\"","Fang Rui felt that this cleaning lady probably wasn't lying, but why would Lin Qianjie come out of Lu Tian's apartment?","Could Lu Tian be lying?","As night fell, lights began to come on in the residential complex.","\"Based on the distance between the two buildings and the height of Lu Tian's window, the residents who can see into Lu Tian's room are those on the fourth to twelfth floors,\" Mu Mian said, drawing a proportional sketch of the two buildings on paper. \"The residents on the left side can't see into Lu Tian's room due to the angle. So we only need to question sixteen households.\"","\"Mm-hmm.\"","Most of the residents were cooperative. Upon learning of Fang Rui's purpose, they all said they hadn't seen anything.","\"Why are you here again? Didn't you ask us last night?\" one resident complained.","\"Someone came to ask you last night?\" Fang Rui inquired.","\"Yes, he said he was the prosecutor in charge of Miss Lu's case.\"","Fang Rui frowned. Nie Yan had only gone to question these residents this afternoon. How could someone have come last night?","\"It was a man in a suit, wearing glasses.\"","It was Lawyer Wang! Fang Rui knew that someone had beaten him to it again. Even if there were eyewitnesses, it was very likely that Lawyer Wang had already bought them off.","Sure enough, as Fang Rui went door to door asking questions, most people cooperatively claimed they hadn't seen anything.","By the time he had finished questioning all the residents, it was already ten o'clock at night.","They had walked so much that day that Mu Mian felt her legs cramping. She was exhausted and wanted to go to sleep.","Fang Rui said, \"Let's go back!\"","As they reached the ground floor, Mu Mian suddenly said, \"Fang Rui, I wasn't really watching SpongeBob this afternoon.\"","\"Mm, I know.\"","\"No, you don't. I was looking at the balcony on the ninth floor. I saw a red dot from a camera on that balcony. There's a good chance a camera has been installed there.\"","Fang Rui looked up at the balcony on the ninth floor. The owner of that apartment seemed to be away, as the entire place was dark. The balcony was filled with various plants, some with beautiful flowers blooming, and some with vines.","Among the greenery, there was a faint red dot, but it wasn't clear what it was.","Fang Rui went to find the residential complex's security guard again. The guard knew that resident because he had given the guard several pots of orchids and always greeted him when coming and going.","\"Uncle, my girlfriend wants to buy some orchids from the resident on the ninth floor of that building. Do you have their contact information?\" Fang Rui made up an excuse, fearing that this security guard might have also been bought off by Lawyer Wang.","\"The flowers at his place are indeed beautiful, but he might not want to sell them. His phone number... Oh, I can't just give you residents' contact information. You'll have to find him yourself.\"","\"Do you know when he'll be back?\"","\"He left on a business trip a few days ago and should be back tomorrow. How about this: give me your phone number, and when he returns, I'll ask him to contact you. But whether he'll sell the flowers or not, I can't say.\"","After getting the information from the security guard, Fang Rui returned to the car to find Mu Mian already asleep.","Looking at the dark circles under Mu Mian's eyes, Fang Rui smiled helplessly. He didn't know why Mu Mian had suddenly become so invested in this case, but he was certain that Mu Mian had been acting a bit strange these past few days.","Mu Mian wasn't usually the type of person who was passionate about upholding justice."]},{"number":39,"title":"Chapter 39: Reversal of Judgment: Videos in the Recycle Bin","paragraphs":["The next day at noon, Fang Rui suddenly received a call from the community security guard.","\"That young man has returned, but he says he's not selling his flowers, and he refuses to contact you.\"","\"Alright, thank you.\"","Fang Rui and Zhang immediately drove to the residential complex.","\"Boss, what did you do with Mu Forensic Doctor yesterday? Look how tired she is, she has no energy at work today.\"","\"Investigating the case!\"","\"Boss, haven't you noticed that I'm still the more useful assistant? At least I have good stamina and never complain about being tired!\"","Fang Rui gave Zhang a side-eye, \"She's quieter than you!\"","\"When Mu Forensic Doctor isn't quiet, her destructive power is much stronger than mine,\" Zhang grumbled.","\"Her evidence-gathering ability is better than yours.\"","\"...\"","The resident who grew flowers was named Yu Haibo. After learning of Fang Rui's intentions, he hesitated, \"I'm sorry, I can't give you the surveillance footage.\"","\"Why not?\"","\"It's not that I don't want to cooperate with you, but the camera on my balcony is only used to film my flowers. It probably didn't capture any other residents, so even if I gave it to you, it wouldn't be of any use.\"","Zhang pleaded, \"We only need the surveillance footage from July 20th. Even if it's useless, please give it to us. What if there's some clue? We really need this video!\"","\"I'm sorry, I can't provide it!\" Yu Haibo made a gesture of seeing them out, \"Officers, I need to rest, so I won't be entertaining you any longer.\"","\"We won't disclose your personal information,\" Fang Rui said. \"You won't need to cooperate with any subsequent court appearances either. You just need to give us the footage.\"","After hesitating for a long time, Yu Haibo finally told the truth: \"I really only installed the camera to film my plants, but if I give you the surveillance footage, and it happens to have captured something it shouldn't have, my reputation would be ruined. What would others think of me? I'm a university professor, if people found out, I could very well be seen as a peeping tom.\"","\"Mr. Yu, we will keep it confidential for you...\"","Yu Haibo interrupted Zhang, \"Officer, it's not that I don't want to help you. Firstly, my surveillance probably didn't capture any relevant content, and secondly, even if it did capture something, the court would definitely require me to testify, and if I don't testify, this evidence would likely be invalid, so it wouldn't be of any use to you even if you had it. So, you'd better look for other evidence!\"","\"Mr. Yu, please consider the case of Shen Yuanyuan... If you don't help, Miss Lu could very well be the next Shen Yuanyuan...\"","\"I'm sorry, I can't help you. I will delete this footage immediately, so don't come looking for me again!\" Yu Haibo's tone was very firm. He wanted to be a kind person, but everything he had now had not come easily, and he didn't want to face any risks.","Fang Rui knew it would be very difficult to change his mind, and he didn't want to morally coerce Yu Haibo. He said to Zhang, \"Zhang, let's go!\"","The surveillance installed on the balcony was private property, and if the owner refused to provide it, the police couldn't force him to, unless Fang Rui and his team could prove that the camera had captured Lu Tian's situation.","After leaving the complex, Zhang kept looking back, \"Boss, are we really not going to try to persuade him again? This is the most promising evidence.\"","\"We can only look for other evidence now.\"","Back at the office, Chen Xue immediately ran over to ask about the result: \"Zhang, did you get the footage?\"","Zhang dejectedly replied, \"No! The owner refused to hand over the footage.\"","Mu Mian, who had been napping on her desk, sighed upon hearing Zhang's words, \"Then Prosecutor Nie will most likely lose this case.\" Mu Mian then looked at Fang Rui, \"Fang Rui, do you want to go comfort her?\"","Zhang and Chen Xue both looked at Fang Rui: \"Captain Fang, why do you need to comfort Prosecutor Nie? And who is Prosecutor Nie?\"","Mu Mian explained, \"Prosecutor Nie is the public prosecutor for Lu Tian's rape case. She's also Fang Rui's friend.\"","\"You just continue your nap!\" Fang Rui pushed Mu Mian's head back onto the desk. He clarified to Zhang and Chen Xue, \"The person Mu Mian is talking about is Nie Yan. Zhang, you know her too.\"","\"Ah, I remember now. That prosecutor is amazing at investigating cases. And she has a strong sense of justice. I've always thought she should be a police officer; she's wasting her talents in the prosecutor's office.\"","Zhang then turned to whisper to Chen Xue: \"She seems to have a crush on the boss, but unfortunately, the boss never picked up on her hints, so they never got together. The CP you're shipping is in danger.\"","Chen Xue's internal alarm bells started ringing. She looked at Mu Mian, who was carefreely napping, and felt exasperated.","Mu Mian, your man is about to be snatched away, and you can still sleep!","She wanted to shake Mu Mian awake, but she felt a cold gaze on her.","\"Chen Xue, don't disturb Mu Mian's sleep! She needs to rest well,\" Fang Rui warned quietly.","\"...\" She had worried for nothing.","When Nie Yan learned from Fang Rui that Yu Haibo's surveillance might have captured the incident, she also tried to contact Yu Haibo many times, but he refused to provide the footage and stated that he had already deleted it, asking Nie Yan not to harass him anymore.","Nie Yan handed Yu Haibo a newspaper with a report on Shen Yuanyuan's case: \"Mr. Yu, this is a news report about the victim in another case. If you don't help, Lin Qianjie might target other girls. Please reconsider!\"","Yu Haibo took the newspaper, but he still refused to hand over the surveillance video to Nie Yan.","With Lu Tian's case about to go to trial, the police still hadn't found new evidence, and the current evidence all seemed to indicate that Lin Qianjie and Lu Tian were in a relationship, which didn't constitute rape.","Although Chen Xue wasn't directly involved, she was more anxious than anyone. She buzzed around Mu Mian like a fly.","\"Mian Mian, clever and cute Mian Mian, use that smart brain of yours and think of a way to help Lu Tian!\"","She didn't dare to bother Fang Rui, so she could only pester Mu Mian.","Mu Mian heaved a heavy sigh.","Half an hour later, Mu Mian sent Fang Rui and Chen Xue a surveillance video file named \"Evidence.\"","\"Mu Mian, where did you get this video?\" Fang Rui asked, holding his phone.","Chen Xue opened the video. It was about five minutes long. In the video, Lin Qianjie was constantly using violence to control Lu Tian, while Lu Tian was continuously resisting, but unsuccessfully.","\"Mian Mian, where did this video come from? This is solid evidence! Lin Qianjie clearly committed rape!\"","Mu Mian looked up at Fang Rui, \"Downloaded from Mr. Yu's computer.\"","Chen Xue exclaimed in surprise, \"You hacked into Yu Haibo's computer? You even have hacking skills?\"","Mu Mian shook her head, \"I don't have those skills, that would be illegal.\"","Chen Xue breathed a sigh of relief. Good, Mu Mian understands the law!","\"So I paid my hacker friend to help me hack into Mr. Yu's computer. We found this video in his computer's recycle bin. My hacker friend helped me download it and sent it to me.\"","Mu Mian's tone was proud, \"Now we have evidence to prove that Lin Qianjie is a rapist!\"","\"Mu Mian, this footage was obtained through illegal means. We can't use it in court,\" Fang Rui reminded her. \"You can't do things like this in the future, understand?\"","\"But I bought this video, it's not illegal!\" Seeing Fang Rui's expression wasn't very pleased, Mu Mian nodded, \"I understand. Fang Rui, I promise, I won't casually hire hackers to hack other people's computers in the future.\"","Fang Rui patiently explained to her, \"The judge will definitely ask about the source of the video. If we can't provide that, this evidence will likely not be accepted, and we might get into trouble.\"","\"Alright.\"","Fang Rui asked, \"Was the video already edited when you hacked into the computer?\"","\"Yes,\" Mu Mian said. \"But it was in the recycle bin. It had been deleted.\"","This video was probably edited by Yu Haibo himself, and the fact that he edited it shows that he had considered testifying. But he then deleted the video, which means he ultimately chose not to testify.","Fang Rui thought for a moment and said, \"Can your friend put this video back on his computer desktop? Preferably in an easily noticeable place, in a conspicuous format. It would be even better if it could automatically play at random intervals.\""]},{"number":40,"title":"Chapter 40: Reversal of Judgment: Obtaining Evidence","paragraphs":["Mu Mian opened her eyes wide and looked at Fang Rui, \"Fang Rui, you didn't let me hire a hacker earlier. Are you teaching me to do bad things now?\"","Chen Xue was also surprised. How could the usually upright Captain Fang be instigating Mu Mian to break the law?","Fang Rui patted Mu Mian's head and corrected her: \"Mu Mian, computer viruses are very common. This is common knowledge. It's Mr. Yu's computer that got a virus, what does that have to do with us?\"","Mu Mian nodded, \"I see. Getting a virus isn't illegal!\"","You don't understand at all! Chen Xue just realized that Fang Rui could be a bit slyly mischievous.","\"Mian Mian, ask your friend to add some creepy music,\" Chen Xue said. \"It will help set the mood.\"","\"No problem.\" Mu Mian looked at them again, \"Do you have any other requests? Tell me all at once, otherwise if you add requirements later, it'll cost more money.\"","Mu Mian immediately contacted her hacker friend using her encrypted email and told him her requirements.","The hacker said he could do it, but it would cost double.","Mu Mian sent him the money right away.","The hacker replied that he would strike when Yu Haibo was working late at night on his PowerPoint, as that would have the best effect.","Chen Xue exclaimed in surprise: \"Mu Mian, you're so impressive, you even know a hacker friend?\"","\"We met in an online mental health support group. He became my friend because I was the only one willing to play air chess with him.\"","\"What's air chess?\"","\"There's no chessboard or pieces, you have to remember the positions of your moves and your opponent's moves in your head. It's really fun. Want me to play with you? But with you, we might only be able to play tic-tac-toe.\"","\"No thanks!\"","Chen Xue was speechless. Mu Mian's friends were just as strange as her. She asked again: \"How much did you pay to hire him?\"","Mu Mian held up five fingers.","\"Fifty thousand?\"","Mu Mian shook her head.","\"Five hundred thousand?\"","Mu Mian continued shaking her head, \"Fifty US dollars. He said Mr. Yu's computer didn't even have a firewall, so he got in easily. It wasn't technically challenging at all. But he still charged me because he was afraid if he didn't, I'd ask him for favors all the time!\"","\"Do you often ask him to hack computers for you?\"","\"Of course not. Including this time, it's only been twice.\"","\"Whose computer did you hack last time?\" Chen Xue glanced at Fang Rui, who had returned to his seat, and whispered, \"It wasn't Captain Fang's, was it?\"","Mu Mian nodded guiltily, \"Yes. I wanted to know what Fang Rui likes.\" She added: \"But he doesn't have any hobbies. His computer only has work files. His inner world is quite barren.\"","\"...\" Who still uses computers for entertainment these days? Doesn't everyone play on their phones now? But Chen Xue didn't dare remind Mu Mian, afraid she might hack Fang Rui's phone next.","Late that night, Yu Haibo opened his computer, intending to play a game to relax. Suddenly his computer froze, and eerie music began to play.","Just as he was about to shut it down, his screen suddenly split into many small frames, each playing the video of Lu Tian being raped. Accompanied by fancy special effects, these frames started rotating in a mesmerizing way.","He tried to turn off the computer, but couldn't. He was sweating profusely from anxiety.","Ten minutes later, his computer finally returned to normal. The video file he had deleted now reappeared prominently on the desktop. The file kept flashing, impossible to ignore.","He successfully lost sleep that night.","The next morning, when he turned on his computer, the same thing happened again.","He didn't hesitate any longer. He sent the video to Nie Yan, indicating that he would testify in court if needed.","On the day of the trial, the sky was clear and the sun shone brightly.","Fang Rui, Mu Mian, Zhang, Chen Xue, and others also went to the courthouse. Rape cases are usually not open to the public, but they were the investigating officers who handled the case, so they could attend.","They had learned from Mu Mian's hacker friend that Yu Haibo had sent the surveillance video to Nie Yan. So they all came to see Lin Qianjie go to jail.","\"Fang Rui, thank you all for coming to support us,\" Nie Yan greeted them when she saw Fang Rui and the others.","Lu Tian had put on makeup today and was wearing a white chiffon maxi dress. She looked spirited and didn't seem nervous at all. She appeared relaxed, as if certain of her victory.","\"Mr. Yu sent me the surveillance video and agreed to testify,\" Nie Yan said, holding up a USB drive, her face full of confidence. \"We're sure to win this case!\"","The video had been sent just two hours before the trial. Nie Yan hurried to submit it as new evidence. This normally wouldn't follow proper procedure, but luckily the court clerk knew her and bent the rules a bit to allow her to submit it successfully. Otherwise, she would have had to wait until the next hearing to submit it.","After everyone had arrived in court, the presiding judge declared the trial open, and Lin Qianjie was brought to the defendant's seat. His expression was casual and nonchalant, as if he were at a bar rather than in court.","After the judge went through the routine questioning of Lin Qianjie, prosecutor Nie Yan read out the indictment.","Lin Qianjie's defense lawyer, Wang Li, immediately began his defense: \"The charges in the indictment are unfounded. My client and the plaintiff were in a romantic relationship. Prior to this, they had already been intimate multiple times.","On the night in question, my client and the plaintiff were alone together, and overcome by passion, they engaged in consensual relations.","Because my client did not promise to marry the plaintiff, she is falsely accusing my client of forcing her. This is a malicious accusation by the plaintiff.","I have already submitted the relevant evidence to the court.\"","The judge had already reviewed the evidence provided by Wang Li. He turned to Nie Yan: \"Prosecutor, do you have any objections to these photographs?\"","\"Yes!\" Nie Yan held up one of the photos, showing Lu Tian and Lin Qianjie wearing matching outfits. \"Don't the two people in this photo appear to be wearing couple outfits?\"","Nie Yan then produced a group photo, \"But this clothing was actually a T-shirt for a certain event. Everyone in this photo is wearing the same shirt.\"","\"The angles of these photos are all very strange. For example, in this one, neither the plaintiff nor the defendant is facing the camera directly, which doesn't match our usual photo-taking habits. It's reasonable to assume that this was originally a group photo, but to capture just these two people alone, they had to shoot from this awkward angle.\" Nie Yan went on to explain the other photos.","She concluded by saying: \"The defense lawyer is attempting to mislead everyone with these photos, creating a false impression that the victim and the defendant were dating.\"","Wang Li then called other witnesses to the stand.","The first to testify was Lin Qianjie's female secretary.","\"Our boss was definitely dating Miss Lu. That day, Miss Lu went into our boss's office. Our boss came out midway to give me some tasks, and I saw lipstick marks on the corner of his mouth. They must have been kissing, otherwise how would our boss have lipstick on his face?\"","\"When did this happen?\"","\"July 15th.\"","Nie Yan smiled, \"The victim had lip inflammation in early July, so she hadn't been using lipstick for most of that month. So how could the lipstick marks on your boss's face have anything to do with the victim?\"","\"I...\"","\"Objection! This is leading the witness,\" Wang Li interrupted Nie Yan's questioning.","\"Objection sustained. Prosecutor, please present relevant evidence,\" the judge said.","\"The victim mentioned having lip inflammation in her livestream video. She livestreams every day, and she hasn't been wearing lipstick in her recent videos.\"","The next to testify was the janitor from Lu Tian's apartment complex: \"I saw Mr. Lin leaving Miss Lu's apartment.\"","Nie Yan asked, \"How many times did you see this?\"","\"Two or three times?\"","\"You usually clean the hallways between 5 and 7 in the morning. So you saw Mr. Lin in the morning each time?\" Nie Yan inquired.","\"Yes.\"","\"If the defendant and the victim were in a relationship, why would he leave my client's home so early in the morning?\" Nie Yan looked at the judge, \"The victim once lost a key. I suspect this key was picked up by the defendant. He used the key to sneak into the victim's home and create the false impression that he was living with the victim.\"","Nie Yan systematically refuted each piece of evidence presented by the defense lawyer.","However, these rebuttals weren't strong enough, causing the case to fall into a \"Rashomon\" situation where neither side could definitively prove the truth or falsehood of the events.","\"Your Honor, I have submitted a new piece of evidence, a surveillance video,\" Nie Yan said."]},{"number":41,"title":"Chapter 41: Reversal of Judgment: Changes","paragraphs":["\"Objection! This video was not included in the list of evidence provided by the prosecutor before the trial,\" Wang Li said.","The presiding judge hesitated. According to procedure, this was irregular - such evidence should be submitted at the next hearing. However, exceptions could be made on a case-by-case basis. If the evidence had a crucial impact on the trial, he as the judge could use his discretion to make a ruling.","Nie Yan said, \"Your Honor, this evidence will have a critical impact on the case. I only obtained it just before the trial, so I couldn't submit it in advance. Please consider allowing it.\"","The judge played the video in court.","In the video, Lin Qianjie forcibly restrained Lu Tian, who was struggling and repeatedly trying to resist without success, until Lin Qianjie finally had his way with her.","Though not high definition, the faces were clearly visible. This recording was enough to convict Lin Qianjie.","Seeing the video, Lawyer Wang frowned slightly. \"Objection! Your Honor, I question the authenticity of this video and request a recess.\"","\"The court will fully consider the defense counsel's opinion,\" said the judge. \"We will now take a 30-minute recess before reconvening.\"","As soon as the recess began, Lin Qianjie berated his lawyer: \"Is this how you handle things? Why do they have video footage? Why didn't you buy it off them? You're so incompetent - I'll never hire you again!\"","\"Shut up!\" Lawyer Wang snapped impatiently. \"Can't you keep your cool? I told you, we won't lose this case, period! If you don't want to go to jail, keep your mouth shut and don't say anything you shouldn't!\"","Wang Li was furious at his client's idiocy. Committing a crime was bad enough, but how could he let someone record it on video?","Lin Qianjie laughed bitterly. \"You're telling me to shut up? Get this straight - I'm the one paying you. How dare you yell at me?\"","\"Mr. Lin, you're not the one who hired me. Miss Jiang is,\" Lawyer Wang reminded him.","Lin Qianjie immediately backed down.","Lawyer Wang glanced at the smiling Nie Yan and Lu Tian, a hint of viciousness flashing in his eyes. \"Let them enjoy their moment. They won't be smiling for long.\"","He hadn't planned to be too harsh on Lu Tian before, but now they were asking for it.","Across the crowd, Fang Rui observed Lawyer Wang, noting the cold, snake-like gleam in his eyes.","This lawyer likely had more dirty tricks up his sleeve.","\"Fang Rui, it's all thanks to you for telling me that security camera might have caught the incident. Otherwise, we'd have a hard time winning this case. I'll have to treat you to a nice dinner when it's over.\"","\"I'm the one who found the camera,\" Mu Mian emphasized.","Nie Yan turned to Mu Mian. \"Then I owe you a big meal, Dr. Mu.\"","\"Great, I'll send you my list of dietary restrictions beforehand. I'm not a picky eater.\"","\"...\"","The 30 minutes passed quickly. Mu Mian went to the restroom, and when she returned, she noticed the woman who resembled her mother sitting in a corner.","After some consideration, Mu Mian walked over and sat down in the empty seat beside her.","Once all relevant parties had arrived, the court reconvened.","The technical experts had confirmed the video's authenticity. Its contents clearly showed that Lin Qianjie was indeed forcing himself on Lu Tian when the incident occurred.","At this point, Wang Li adjusted his glasses and said, \"Your Honor, I request that a new witness be allowed to testify.\"","The judge felt a headache coming on. Why did everyone insist on presenting new evidence during the trial? Was it so difficult to give advance notice?","\"Your Honor, this witness's testimony will also have a critical impact on the case,\" Wang Li said confidently.","After conferring with the other judges, the presiding judge granted Wang Li's request.","Lu Tian's mother walked gravely to the witness stand. She glanced at her daughter in the plaintiff's seat, a flicker of guilt passing through her aged eyes before she quickly looked away.","When Lu Tian saw her mother appear, it was as if she'd been struck. Why was her mother testifying as a witness for Lin Qianjie?","Nie Yan frowned. Why would Wang Li call Lu Tian's mother to testify? How could this help refute the rape charges against Lin Qianjie?","\"Witness, please state your identity,\" the judge instructed.","\"Wang Guixiang. I am Lu Tian's mother,\" she replied.","\"Witness, do you understand your obligation to testify truthfully to this court? If you give false testimony or deliberately conceal facts, you will face legal consequences,\" the judge reminded her, following procedure.","\"I understand. Lawyer Wang explained everything to me.\"","Wang Li turned to Wang Guixiang and began questioning: \"Mrs. Wang, what is the relationship between your daughter Lu Tian and my client Lin Qianjie?\"","\"They were dating.\"","\"Do you have any evidence to support this?\"","\"My daughter told me several times on the phone that she had a boyfriend. She said his name was Lin Qianjie, that his family was very wealthy, and that we'd soon be living a better life. Her father can confirm this as well.\"","Lu Tian glared furiously at her mother, shouting hysterically, \"I never said any of that! Why are you lying?! Mom, I'm your daughter - how can you slander me like this...\"","\"Plaintiff, please remain calm!\" the judge interrupted Lu Tian's tearful outburst.","\"Tian-tian, it's precisely because you're my daughter that I can't stand by and watch you make mistakes and falsely accuse others! We must live with a clear conscience and not do bad things!\"","Lawyer Wang asked, \"Mrs. Wang, based on your understanding of your daughter, why do you think she would falsely accuse my client?\"","\"Objection! Speculation!\" Nie Yan interjected.","\"Overruled. The witness may continue,\" said the judge.","\"Tian-tian has mental health issues. Her moods are extremely unstable - she can be happy in the morning and throwing tantrums by afternoon. She's been seeing psychologists for years without improvement.\"","\"Did the doctors diagnose her condition?\"","\"I believe it was schizophrenia or multiple personality disorder. Tian-tian has frequently claimed men were raping her before.","Oh, it's our fault really. When Tian-tian was young, a relative of ours molested her. Since it was family, we didn't report it to the police. Tian-tian was severely traumatized - she almost committed suicide by eating rat poison. Luckily we discovered it in time.","We didn't know any better back then and didn't take her to see a psychologist. This is how she turned out as she grew up.\"","\"Has she falsely accused others before?\"","\"In college, she had a boyfriend. The boy kissed her once, and she insisted on reporting him to the police for rape. Fortunately, we stopped her, or that poor boy's reputation would have been ruined.\"","Lu Tian shrieked in denial: \"These are all lies! None of this ever happened. Mom, why are you making up these stories?\"","Nie Yan challenged: \"If you say Lu Tian reported it, where's the police report?\"","\"There isn't one - we stopped Tian-tian from filing the report. But you can contact that boy; I can give you his information.\"","Lu Tian's face changed slightly. In college, she had been sexually harassed by a male student, but he was never her boyfriend. How did her mother know about this?","Nie Yan realized the male student was likely someone who had pursued Lu Tian. After being rejected, he might have spread rumors about her being his girlfriend. And many people tend to believe such rumors.","Wang Li stared at Lu Tian, enunciating each word: \"Miss Lu, are you also denying that you've seen psychologists?\"","\"I...\" Lu Tian couldn't refute this point. She did have bipolar disorder and was indeed taking medication regularly.","\"Your Honor, I request a psychiatric evaluation of the plaintiff. I suspect the plaintiff may have had an episode during intimate relations with my client, which could explain the resistance we saw in the security footage.\"","After conferring with the other judges, the presiding judge granted Wang Li's request.","\"The court will fully consider the defense counsel's opinion,\" said the judge. \"We will now adjourn and reconvene at a later date, which will be notified in writing.\"","As the trial concluded, Lu Tian collapsed in the plaintiff's seat, as if she had endured mental torture.","She had always known her parents favored boys over girls and that her mother didn't love her that much, but she had deluded herself into believing her mother cared for her at least a little.","Even on that day when her parents forced her to sign the settlement agreement, Lu Tian still held a glimmer of hope for them, defending them in her heart as simply being afraid of poverty, desperately in need of money.","But every word her mother just uttered in the courtroom felt like sharp swords, piercing Lu Tian to her core.","At this moment, she had only one thought: to die. Just die and leave this godforsaken world.","\"Lu Tian, don't be afraid. You still have me,\" Nie Yan tightly embraced Lu Tian, her voice trembling. \"It's okay. Even if your mother has betrayed you, you still have me. We can win this!\"","Nie Yan was stunned by Wang Li's brutal attack. She hadn't expected Wang Li to approach the defense from this angle.","Now that Lu Tian had just endured so much, and given her existing emotional issues, if they were to conduct a psychiatric evaluation on her at this point, they would have no chance of winning.","More importantly, Lu Tian's mother's words were a fatal blow to Lu Tian!","Lu Tian was like a soulless puppet, allowing Nie Yan to hold her without any reaction. She felt utterly exhausted, lacking even the strength to blink.","Lin Qianjie strutted around like a victorious rooster, his face beaming with glee. He came over to observe Lu Tian's expression, leering at her with a lecherous grin.","\"Tsk, tsk. I told you to settle with me quietly, but you wouldn't listen. Now it's too late. Let me tell you, you're going to lose this case for sure.","This is just the beginning. I'm going to have you locked up in a mental hospital. Haha! That way, no one will be able to rape you anymore. Though, looking as crazy as you do now, even if someone offered you for free, no one would touch you. They'd be afraid you'd go berserk and attack them!\""]},{"number":42,"title":"Chapter 42: Reversal of Judgment: Can You Hug Me","paragraphs":["Lu Tian watched his smug expression, her nails digging deep into her palms. Blood seeped from her clenched fists, bringing her a moment of clarity.","Suddenly, she felt a surge of strength. A voice in her head told her not to give up, she must not give up! How could she surrender her life when this scumbag hadn't been punished yet?","Fang Rui rolled his eyes at Lin Qianjie, \"You haven't won the case yet. What are you so pleased about?\"","Lin Qianjie put his arm around Lawyer Wang, his tone boastful, \"With Lawyer Wang here, how could I possibly lose? Fang Rui, remember to come to my victory party. I'll treat you to something nice.\"","\"Mr. Lin, Miss Jiang wants us to return,\" Lawyer Wang shrugged off his hand, his tone cold.","\"Alright, I know.\"","\"Nie Yan, we can't lose!\" Lu Tian stared intently at Nie Yan. \"I'll take my medication properly, I'll control my emotions well. I won't let those experts diagnose me as insane. We cannot lose!\"","Lu Tian wasn't doing this for herself. Her life was already ruined. She just didn't want scum like Lin Qianjie to harm another innocent girl.","Let the tragedy end with her.","Nie Yan, however, wasn't so confident anymore. Mental assessments weren't as easy to distinguish between true and false as other physical evidence. In other words, if Lawyer Wang had bribed those experts, even if they provided false assessment reports, they would have no way to refute them.","Mu Mian seemed to have shut out all external sounds, focusing entirely on the painting in her hands.","Jiang Yun felt that the girl sitting next to her was strange. She seemed to want to talk to her, but always hesitated.","Mu Mian finally thought of an opening line, \"Hello. Do you recognize the person in this painting?\"","Mu Mian handed her freshly completed painting to Jiang Yun, her tone probing.","The paper showed a loving mother holding a small infant. Mu Mian had perfectly recreated the photograph with delicate brushstrokes.","Jiang Yun took the painting and looked at it. Her expression froze. The memories she had suppressed came flooding back into her mind like a tidal wave.","She coldly looked at Mu Mian: \"Who are you? What's your relationship with Mu Mian?\"","Mu Mian didn't speak. She didn't know whether to reveal herself to her mother. Her mother's expression didn't seem joyful, it even looked... disgusted.","Why would a mother be disgusted by her own child?","Jiang Yun continued, \"You're from the Shen family, aren't you? Didn't I already tell you not to bother me? Whether that child Mu Mian is dead or alive has nothing to do with me. I won't go see her. If you want money, I can give you a large sum, but on the condition that you stop harassing me...\"","\"Why... don't you want to see her?\" Mu Mian felt her mind was in chaos.","Although her adoptive parents treated her well, cherishing her like a precious and fragile piece of porcelain, that wasn't loving a child. They were just caring for and looking after an autistic patient.","Her entire understanding of mothers came from beautiful fairy tales, so she couldn't comprehend the current situation. Of course, she also couldn't fully understand fairy tales.","\"She's the nightmare of my life. I can't accept having a child who's like an idiot.\" Jiang Yun pinched the bridge of her nose, trying hard to stop herself from remembering the past. \"You've all raised her for so many years, just keep raising her. Why come find me now?\"","So that's how it is...","Mu Mian looked at Jiang Yun, trying hard to maintain eye contact. In those cold eyes, Mu Mian saw a pitiful reflection of herself.","Her sister was right. Not all mothers love their children. Only mothers in storybooks do that.","Jiang Yun also carefully examined the strange girl before her. The girl's features seemed familiar, and she wanted to ask if she was Mu Mian, but she thought it impossible.","Mu Mian should be a mentally deficient girl. She shouldn't be able to speak, shouldn't be able to paint, and certainly shouldn't be appearing before her.","Mu Mian might even be dead already. A child like that wouldn't live long, and shouldn't live too long.","\"Alright,\" Mu Mian snatched her painting back from Jiang Yun's hand. She tried to speak in a calm tone, \"I promise you, she won't bother you.\"","Jiang Yun looked at her empty palm and demanded, \"Who are you really?\"","Mu Mian didn't answer.","By now, the court hearing had ended. Jiang Yun glanced at Mu Mian once more, then put on her sunglasses and left with her assistant.","Mu Mian felt an overwhelming sadness engulf her. But she couldn't describe that feeling. She couldn't even cry. Her mind just went blank, as if all her memories had been erased.","\"Mu Mian, you're spacing out again!\" Fang Rui had been searching for a while before he found Mu Mian sitting dazed in a corner. She looked very different from usual.","At that moment, Mu Mian looked very lonely, as if encased in a glass dome with only herself inside.","Suddenly, the memories rushed back into Mu Mian's mind. Even though she had once again modified the part about her mother in her mental schema, she still couldn't suppress the overwhelming sadness.","\"Fang Rui, I'm very sad. I need comfort,\" Mu Mian opened her arms towards Fang Rui, \"Can you... give me a hug?\"","Fang Rui glanced around. Most people were heading out. He didn't really want to embrace someone in public, even if it was Mu Mian.","But Mu Mian looked so fragile right now.","Fang Rui sighed and hugged Mu Mian. \"Did you meet your mother?\" He saw the painting in Mu Mian's hand and could guess what had happened.","\"Yes, she's completely different from what I imagined. She doesn't like me. It's okay though. Some mothers just don't love their children. That's common sense.\"","Mu Mian realized she didn't love her mother that much either. She had just been deluded by the imaginary mother figure she had created, which embodied Mu Mian's desire to be loved as a normal person.","When she actually met her mother, the illusion shattered, which is why she felt so sad.","Because it meant she could never experience the emotions a normal person should have.","Feeling the warm touch, Mu Mian suddenly felt the wave of sadness recede. But another strange and fresh emotion surged forth. Mu Mian wasn't sure what it was, but it occupied her mind, making her feel happier than ever before.","At this moment, Mu Mian wanted Fang Rui's body more than ever.","Mu Mian reluctantly let go of Fang Rui.","Fang Rui reached out and stroked Mu Mian's head, messing up her short hair, comforting her, \"Mu Mian, it's okay if she doesn't like you. There are still many people who will love you.\"","Fang Rui decided to be even nicer to Mu Mian in the future. She seemed to be in great need of love.","\"I know many people love me. But Fang Rui, you can't ruffle my hair like that. It's too much like petting a cat or dog. I really don't like it!\" Mu Mian reached up to fix her hair.","Even though her adoptive parents and sister didn't treat her as a normal person, their love was genuine. Even the psychologists she disliked had given her a lot of love. So Mu Mian's upbringing wasn't lacking in love.","\"If you really like touching my head that much, I can allow it, but you have to donate your body to me.\"","\"...I can see you're not so upset anymore. Let's head back then!\"","Mu Mian followed Fang Rui out. When they saw Nie Yan and Lu Tian waiting at the courthouse entrance, Mu Mian finally remembered to ask about the trial results: \"Prosecutor Nie, did you win the case?\"","\"No. The court is temporarily adjourned. Both sides need to provide more evidence. The other party has requested a psychiatric evaluation for Lu Tian.\"","\"Do you want to give Prosecutor Nie a hug then?\"","Fang Rui replied irritably, \"Why would I hug her?\" Fang Rui really wanted to open up Mu Mian's brain and see what on earth she was thinking all day.","\"She's your friend. She didn't win the case. Shouldn't you comfort her?\"","\"I've already comforted her verbally. Adults don't use hugs to comfort each other.\"","Mu Mian tilted her head, \"But you hugged me just now.\"","\"...\" Where had that fragile Mu Mian from earlier gone? Was Mu Mian's emotional recovery ability this strong?","Chen Xue had excellent hearing. She immediately came over and asked, \"Mian Mian, what were you just saying? I thought I heard the word 'hug'.\"","\"It's not that difficult to mislead mental health specialists and psychologists into making an incorrect diagnosis,\" Mu Mian said, changing the subject. \"Faking an illness or pretending to be healthy are both relatively simple. Which one does Lu Tian need to do? I can teach her.\""]},{"number":43,"title":"Chapter 43: Reversal of Judgment: Gender Dysphoria","paragraphs":["\"Mu Mian, not everyone can easily manipulate psychological test results like you,\" Fang Rui interrupted Mu Mian, \"and your act wasn't convincing either. Lin Consultant saw through it with just one look.\"","Mu Mian lowered her head guiltily.","Although she always managed to pass the psychologists' scale assessments, she would inevitably slip up during the behavioral evaluation stage.","That's why, for a time, she strongly believed in the existence of mind-reading. Those psychological experts could see through her disguise with just one glance.","It turned out the truth was that her disguise simply wasn't good enough!","Lu Tian confessed, \"Nie Yan, I am indeed seeing a psychologist. I have bipolar disorder. Will this affect the trial outcome?\"","Nie Yan asked, \"Who is your psychologist? We can consult with her.\"","\"Her name is Shen Xiyin. She's an excellent psychologist, and since I started treatment with her, my emotional issues have been under control. She should be able to testify for me in court.\"","\"She's my sister,\" Mu Mian said proudly. \"She's an outstanding psychotherapist. She can definitely help you.\"","Fang Rui reminded them, \"The problem now is that Wang Li may have bribed those experts to provide false assessment results.\"","Mu Mian objected, \"But falsifying evidence is illegal! Would those experts really break the law?\"","They all fell silent, with no one providing an answer to Mu Mian.","The second court hearing arrived quickly. Zhang was out on field duty, and Chen Xue was too afraid of a negative outcome to attend, so this time it was just Fang Rui and Mu Mian who went to court.","Four psychiatric experts and two psychologists from the Judicial Appraisal Center separately evaluated Lu Tian's mental state. The six of them reached a unified assessment result and provided a detailed analysis:","Lu Tian suffers from dissociative conversion disorder (also known as hysteria, or colloquially, multiple personality disorder).","The patient cannot recall important past events—she has forgotten about being molested as a child and falsely accusing her ex-boyfriend of rape.","Delusions—she has repeatedly told her parents that someone raped and molested her.","Recent memory loss—she frequently forgets intermittently that she and Lin Qianjie are in a relationship, leading to her suddenly attacking Lin Qianjie during their intimate moments, which is the content seen in the video.","Sudden purposeless wandering and physical rigidity—observed during the diagnostic process.","Nie Yan looked at this report and found it laughable. The basis for these experts' diagnosis was actually the words of Lu Tian's parents. Even she, as a layperson, could see how unprofessional this diagnostic report was.","Nie Yan also called in their own expert witness.","\"Witness, your identity?\" the presiding judge asked.","\"I am Lu Tian's psychologist, Shen Xiyin,\" Shen Xiyin replied.","Nie Yan asked, \"Dr. Shen, do you agree with this psychiatric assessment report?\"","\"I do not. Lu Tian does not have dissociative conversion disorder. Her personality is very stable, and she hasn't shown any memory problems,\" Shen Xiyin said. \"Her real issue is bipolar affective disorder, commonly known as manic depression. This is an emotional problem that doesn't significantly affect our memory capacity.\"","Wang Li asked, \"Dr. Shen, are you questioning the diagnostic results of these experts?\"","\"Mental and psychological issues are not like other physical illnesses with clear pathological bases. They are usually implicit and require long-term follow-up observation to reach accurate conclusions.","The assessment results emphasize that Miss Lu has memory problems, so additional memory tests should have been conducted to prove that emotions can affect Miss Lu's memory. However, no such tests were performed during the assessment. Therefore, I question the rigor of this assessment result.","Furthermore, I have doubts about the qualifications of these experts. Is it possible to provide more credential information?\"","Shen Xiyin's voice was gentle, but her rebuttal was well-reasoned and substantiated.","Wang Li frowned, seeing that this psychologist was very professional, so he changed the subject, \"If we follow your diagnosis, and Miss Lu has bipolar affective disorder, would this affect her behavior?\"","\"...Yes, it would.\"","Wang Li said, \"Please explain bipolar affective disorder to us.\"","\"Bipolar affective disorder is a serious mental health condition. Clinically, patients may experience periods of extremely low mood, showing symptoms of depression, followed by periods of extremely elevated mood.","These manic and depressive episodes cycle, with some people experiencing highs or lows every six months, others every month, and in severe cases, multiple times within a week or even days.\"","\"Does this sound similar to the symptoms of dissociative conversion disorder?\"","\"Not at all. They are unrelated.\"","\"So, the patient's behavioral patterns are very different in these two emotional states, correct?\"","Shen Xiyin looked at Wang Li for a long time before answering, \"Yes.\"","\"Is it possible for her to suddenly display aggressive behavior?\"","\"If she's in a manic phase, aggressive behavior is possible.\"","\"Your Honor, the expert witness's diagnosis also proves that the plaintiff's emotions are very unstable. When in a manic state, she may exhibit inexplicable aggressive behavior. I reasonably suspect that on the day of the incident, the defendant suddenly had an episode, which is why she assaulted my client.\"","Wang Li also called to testify a male classmate who had harassed Lu Tian in college, \"Lu Tian was originally dating me, all my buddies can attest to this, but when I tried to kiss her, she hit me and accused me of harassment. Your Honor, Lu Tian must have some mental illness that prevents her from accepting intimate relationships.\"","Wang Li said, \"Your Honor, my client is an ordinary person who lacks understanding of mental illnesses. He thought it was normal for couples to engage in intimate relations and didn't realize that the plaintiff's resistance at the time was due to a disease flare-up. He thought she was just being shy.\"","After a long wait, the verdict was finally announced. The presiding judge declared in court, \"...Due to insufficient evidence, the plaintiff Lu Tian's rape lawsuit against Lin Qianjie is dismissed. Lin Qianjie is found not guilty and released in court...\"","Lu Tian calmly listened to the judge's verdict, then turned to Nie Yan with a smile, \"Prosecutor Nie, we really couldn't win after all. But thank you, thank you for staying with me throughout.\"","Perhaps because she had anticipated the outcome, or maybe because the antidepressants she had taken in advance had taken effect, Lu Tian didn't feel as upset. At least she had bravely fought against the darkness, and even though she lost, it was an honorable defeat!","Nie Yan struggled to hold back her tears. She had lost again, this time to power and influence.","The law she had studied had failed to uphold justice. On the contrary, her sense of justice had been crushed by Wang Li using legal weapons.","She had lost not just a case, but also her faith in the law and the once unshakeable dream she had held.","She tightly gripped Lu Tian's hand and said chokingly, \"Lu Tian, promise me you'll keep living well, okay?\"","Lu Tian nodded and said firmly, \"Yes, I will.\" If not for herself, then for Nie Yan's sake, she had to live on. She couldn't let Nie Yan have another psychological trauma.","Lin Qianjie watched them crying miserably, his lips curling into a smile. He turned to Wang Li and said, \"Lawyer Wang, well done! I'll hire you again next time.\"","\"You're planning on a next time?\" Wang Li glared at him coldly, \"If it weren't for Miss Jiang's sake, do you think I would have handled this kind of case for you? Keep a low profile. Next time, you won't be so lucky.\"","With that, Wang Li left.","Lin Qianjie rolled his eyes at Wang Li's back, but his attention was quickly drawn to Shen Xiyin. He had been attracted to this beautiful and gentle psychologist earlier in the courtroom."]},{"number":44,"title":"Chapter 44: Reversal of Judgment: Defeated yet Glorious","paragraphs":["Lin Qianjie caught up with Shen Xiyin in the parking lot. \"Dr. Shen, please wait a moment.\"","Shen Xiyin saw him and a look of disgust flashed across her face, but she quickly put on a professional smile. \"Is there something I can help you with?\"","\"Dr. Shen, I think I have some psychological issues. I often feel empty inside. Do you have time to talk with me?\" Lin Qianjie placed his hand on his heart, feigning a sad and vulnerable expression.","\"I have time right now,\" Shen Xiyin raised an eyebrow, her gaze suddenly turning cold. \"You like to choose women with weak personalities because you think they're easier to control. This is because you've been oppressed for a long time, and can only gain a sense of control by oppressing those weaker than you.\"","Lin Qianjie was taken aback. Shen Xiyin looked so gentle, and her voice was pleasant, but her words were like knives, cruelly stabbing into his heart.","\"I'm not like what you're saying, Dr. Shen. You don't know me well enough. Why don't you give me your contact information so we can get to know each other better sometime?\" Lin Qianjie said shamelessly.","\"I wasn't entirely accurate before. Even when you choose the most vulnerable girls, you still lack the confidence to control them, so you prefer forceful methods. I even suspect that your sexual performance is lacking, and you attempt to use rape as a way to prevent those girls from noticing your inadequacies. Have you ever received positive feedback from a girl regarding your sexual performance?\"","\"Shut up! You're not a real psychologist, you're just a fraud!\" Lin Qianjie exploded, his veins popping out in anger.","Shen Xiyin raised an eyebrow and said, \"Your sexual dysfunction is likely caused by psychological factors. You do indeed need to see a psychologist. However, I don't specialize in that kind of treatment. Would you like me to recommend a doctor?\"","Lin Qianjie instinctively wanted to argue, but he controlled his expression and instead said sleazily, \"Why don't you find out for yourself how good I am?\"","\"Are you sure?\" Shen Xiyin looked at Lin Qianjie as if he were trash, her beautiful eyes intensely intimidating. \"I'm not like those weak girls. I enjoy turning people into my playthings. Are you sure you want to play with me?\"","\"You... aren't you a psychologist? Why are you so perverted?\"","\"Are you scared already? I'm a psychologist, which is why I'm so good at controlling others. Once you become my toy, you'll understand what true perversion is. Want to try?\" Shen Xiyin stared at him. \"I'm very interested in you right now.\"","Lin Qianjie backed away a few steps in fear. Shen Xiyin's expression reminded him of his stepmother, that hateful and terrifying woman.","His original evil intentions towards Shen Xiyin had completely vanished. This kind of woman was definitely not someone he could handle!","\"Sister.\" Mu Mian saw that Shen Xiyin was being bothered by Lin Qianjie and quickly called out to her.","Hearing Mu Mian's voice from behind, Shen Xiyin swiftly switched back to her gentle expression. Lin Qianjie was startled by how quickly she changed her demeanor.","\"Mr. Lin, consider this psychological consultation free of charge. Next time you come to me for a consultation, I'll have to charge you.\" Shen Xiyin suddenly lowered her voice to a whisper, \"Of course, you can be my toy for free!\"","\"What rotten luck to run into someone like you today!\" Lin Qianjie glared at Shen Xiyin before quickly getting into his car.","Shen Xiyin saw Mu Mian standing with Fang Rui. She was a bit surprised - wasn't Mu Mian a forensic pathologist? Why was she at the courthouse?","If that was the case, had Mu Mian already met that woman? She had been careless; she should have taken Mu Mian to see her mother directly. At least then she could have controlled the situation and minimized the hurt Mu Mian might experience.","\"Sister, Lin Qianjie is a bad person. You'd better stay away from him,\" Mu Mian warned in a low voice.","Shen Xiyin smiled at her, \"Don't worry, he probably won't show up in front of me again. I'm a psychologist, after all. I've seen all kinds of disturbed patients. Someone like him is easy for me to handle.\"","Mu Mian turned to Fang Rui and said, \"Yes, my sister is a very capable psychologist.\"","Fang Rui addressed Shen Xiyin, \"Dr. Shen, Lu Tian's mental state isn't good. Please pay extra attention to her condition.\"","\"I've already increased Lu Tian's medication dosage. If she takes her medicine on time, she should be able to control her emotions,\" Shen Xiyin sighed and continued, \"More than Lu Tian, I'm worried about Prosecutor Nie. She hasn't fully recovered from her previous psychological trauma, and now she's suffered a new one. Moreover, she's very resistant to psychological treatment. Her situation could be quite serious.\"","Shen Xiyin had previously suggested that Nie Yan undergo psychological treatment. Her emotional state wasn't much better than Lu Tian's. But Nie Yan had refused.","Fang Rui asked, \"What should we do then?\"","\"For the next few days, have her family pay close attention to her, to prevent her from hurting others or herself. People always need an outlet for their emotions.\"","Nie Yan's parents wouldn't arrive until tomorrow. Fang Rui had originally planned to have Li Lanlan closely protect Nie Yan and Lu Tian, but Chen Xue volunteered to go to Nie Yan's house to both monitor and protect Nie Yan and Lu Tian.","She also invited Mu Mian along, with a very sound reason: Mu Mian had good medical skills, so if they attempted suicide, she could provide immediate first aid.","Chen Xue was a naturally friendly person, and it didn't take long for her to become quite familiar with Lu Tian and Nie Yan. She was great at livening up the atmosphere. She had bought a lot of groceries and prepared a hot pot.","Nie Yan and Lu Tian were infected by her mood, and the group gathered around the table for hot pot.","Mu Mian just stared at the hot pot on the table, sinking into a depressed state.","There wasn't a single dish on the table that she liked. And why were they eating hot pot in the middle of summer?","\"Dr. Mu, why aren't you eating?\" Nie Yan used the serving chopsticks to place a piece of meat in Mu Mian's bowl. \"It's delicious, try it.\"","Mu Mian looked at the unidentifiable piece of meat with a disgusted expression. She didn't want to eat this questionable product.","Chen Xue didn't coddle Mu Mian. She dipped the meat in sesame sauce and stuffed it into Mu Mian's mouth. \"Mian Mian, chew it.\"","Mu Mian chewed, and it was quite tasty. She picked up some more meat and started eating quietly.","\"Mian Mian, you need to be brave and try new things!\"","So Mu Mian bravely ate a chili pepper from the hot pot base.","Mu Mian nearly cried from the spiciness!","Indeed, she shouldn't try things so recklessly.","Mu Mian didn't touch her chopsticks again.","Chen Xue had also brought several cases of beer and said to Lu Tian and Nie Yan, \"Let's drink until we can't anymore!\"","She then whispered to Mu Mian, \"Watch me get them drunk. Once they're drunk, they won't be able to overthink things.\"","\"What if you get drunk first?\" Mu Mian was a bit worried. If Chen Xue drank herself into a stupor, she wouldn't be able to stop both of them from committing suicide at the same time.","\"Impossible! I can drink a thousand cups without getting drunk.\"","The three of them drank can after can, and Nie Yan started to open up: \"I feel so useless. I studied law for so many years, but I can't do anything. I'm just a waste!\"","Lu Tian encouraged her, \"No, you're just too stupid, always choosing cases that no one else wants to take. You're very brave, you're the best prosecutor, a champion of justice!\"","\"Yes, I will be the best prosecutor!\" Nie Yan felt like crying, but she couldn't shed any tears.","She had watched helplessly as Shen Yuanyuan jumped to her death right in front of her, unable to do anything. Even if she could do it all over again, she still wouldn't win.","If incompetence were a crime, she would be guilty of the worst offense!","Chen Xue joined in the shouting: \"I'll be an excellent forensic pathologist in the future too!\"","Lu Tian clinked glasses with them: \"We may be defeated, but we're still glorious!\"","Mu Mian watched this lively atmosphere with confusion. She couldn't quite understand their behavior, but she didn't feel excluded either.","\"Dr. Mu, what's your dream?\" Nie Yan asked.","Mu Mian opened her mouth to speak, but Chen Xue answered for her: \"She wants Fang's corpse. Haha, Mian Mian's brain works differently from ours, her thoughts are always unique.\"","Mu Mian nodded, \"Yes.\" But she had many dreams.","Nie Yan's expression was a bit startled, but she quickly smiled and said to Mu Mian, \"Keep it up, if you work hard enough, you'll soon have the right to dispose of Fang Rui's body.\"","\"Really?\"","Nie Yan and Chen Xue exchanged a glance, and both burst out laughing.","\"Why are you all laughing?\" Mu Mian asked, confused.","\"Mu Mian, I wish you happiness!\" Nie Yan raised her glass towards Mu Mian.","Mu Mian found her behavior strange. \"I've always been happy,\" she said.","Nie Yan then raised her glass to Chen Xue and Lu Tian: \"I wish you both happiness!\"","Chen Xue and Lu Tian were already drunk, and they responded with silly grins: \"Everyone will be happy!\"","Nie Yan had a high alcohol tolerance and had drunk many cans without getting drunk. She opened another can, but Mu Mian tried to stop her, saying, \"You shouldn't drink any more. You could get alcohol poisoning.\"","\"This is just beer. There's hardly any alcohol. I could drink a dozen more without any problem.\"","Mu Mian held onto the beer bottles, refusing to let go.","At that moment, Nie Yan's phone lit up. She glanced at the message, and her expression froze for an instant. Then, smiling, she said, \"Alright, I'll stop drinking.\""]},{"number":45,"title":"Chapter 45: Reversal of Judgment: Murder Case Emerges","paragraphs":["Mu Mian felt that Nie Yan's expression was a bit complex. She couldn't read it, which made her feel irritated.","\"Justice is something that needs to be pursued and sought after. Because we can't achieve a perfect reality of justice, we must strive for it. Justice isn't a result, but a process,\" Mu Mian comforted her.","\"That quote is from Alan Dershowitz. He defended Simpson, who killed his wife, and also defended the pedophile billionaire Epstein. Are you trying to comfort me with the words of such an infamous shyster?\" Nie Yan couldn't help but laugh. She found Mu Mian to be a very interesting person.","\"See, even someone like that believes in justice. It shows that upholding justice isn't a foolish thing,\" Mu Mian said.","\"Haha, your logic for comforting people is so strange. But thank you, my good friend. I do feel comforted. Now I'm going to sleep. Good night.\"","\"Nie Yan, are we... friends now?\"","Nie Yan didn't answer Mu Mian. She was already asleep, leaning on the sofa.","Mu Mian felt a bit happy. She quickly wrote in her self-observation diary: Today I was very lucky, I made a friend. She thought for a moment, then crossed out the \"a\" and changed it to \"two\".","Lu Tian should probably count as her friend too.","Mu Mian covered them both with blankets. She didn't sleep, instead looking at the night sky and boredly counting stars.","She didn't actually believe much in the existence of justice. Justice was just a concept created to maintain order and stability, just like laws were only tools. But Nie Yan viewed it as incredibly noble.","After counting to the 130th star, Mu Mian finally couldn't stay awake and fell asleep.","She only slept for a few minutes before suddenly waking up startled. She looked towards the sofa, and sure enough, Nie Yan was gone.","Mu Mian searched everywhere. When she pushed open the bathroom door, she saw a bathtub full of bloody water. Nie Yan's left wrist artery had been cut, and blood had stained the entire bathtub red.","Mu Mian woke up Chen Xue, telling her to quickly call an ambulance, while she pressed on Nie Yan's wrist to stop the bleeding.","At the same time, she pondered a question - Nie Yan seemed to have been comforted earlier, so why did she attempt suicide?","She should have given Nie Yan a hug... Indeed, she still wasn't good at comforting others.","Because it was discovered in time, Nie Yan's life wasn't in danger. She just needed to have her wound bandaged.","\"The patient didn't lose too much blood. Just make sure she gets plenty of supplements in the near future,\" the doctor instructed, then couldn't help but comment, \"This wound isn't even that deep. And look at how well it's bandaged, even better than we would have done it. There wasn't really any need to bring her here!\"","When Nie Yan woke up, she apologized to everyone: \"I'm sorry, I didn't mean to commit suicide. I don't know what came over me. When the emotions hit, I just couldn't control myself. I won't do this again.\"","Originally, Nie Yan hadn't intended to commit suicide. But then she received a message from her superior saying she had been fired for accepting bribes. Unable to process it in the moment, she cut her wrist.","Mu Mian reminded her: \"Prosecutor Nie, you likely have depression. It's very difficult to recover on your own. You need to see a psychiatrist. Medication can be very effective.\"","Mu Mian handed her Shen Xiyin's business card.","\"Alright, I'll go see one after I'm discharged,\" Nie Yan said, taking the card and casually tucking it under her pillow.","Seeing her dismissive attitude, Mu Mian felt a bit angry. \"I'm giving you very serious advice. We're friends, and I hope I'll be able to see you again in the future.\"","\"I promise I'll go see a psychiatrist! I'm not lying to you! But,\" Nie Yan pointed at her bandaged wrist, \"you can't expect me to go right now, can you? I need to let my hand heal first!\"","\"You must go after you're discharged!\" Mu Mian emphasized again.","\"I know, I know.\"","When Nie Yan's parents heard the news, they quickly came to the hospital. Both were high school teachers. Though they looked stern, they were very good to Nie Yan.","They didn't question her about the reason for her suicide attempt. Her mother gave her a hug and encouraged her: \"Nie Yan, we saw the news. We're very proud to have a daughter like you.\"","Nie Yan hugged her parents and burst into tears.","\"Mom, I don't want to work in law anymore. I want to go home with you,\" Nie Yan tightly hugged her parents, \"I'll become a teacher like you!\"","\"That's fine. Even if you don't work at all, that's okay too. Whatever you want to do, we'll support you. But we hope you've really thought this through, and that you're not just giving up on your dreams because of a setback, trying to avoid difficulties.\"","Seeing that Nie Yan's parents had come to take care of her, Mu Mian and Chen Xue left the hospital.","The sky was just beginning to brighten, with a fiery red sun slowly rising on the horizon.","\"Another beautiful day!\" Chen Xue yawned, admiring the sun rising from the horizon. She took photos while exclaiming, \"It's so beautiful. Just for this gorgeous sunrise, it's worth living well!\"","\"Chen Xue, the sunrise isn't beautiful at all! It's too glaring,\" Mu Mian grumbled, with dark circles under her eyes.","She had only slept for five minutes last night, and she had also pondered a lot of meaningless questions, leaving her exhausted and sleepy. She had gone through an extremely awful night.","\"Mian Mian, you look so tired. Are you going to take the day off?\"","\"Yes! I'm going to sleep for a whole day.\"","Chen Xue drove Mu Mian home. When they were almost at the entrance to the residential complex, Mu Mian's phone rang. She declined the call and continued napping. Then Chen Xue's phone rang.","\"Chen Xue, there's been a homicide case, two victims!\" It was Zhang speaking. \"Is Dr. Mu with you? Come directly to the dock. I've sent you the location.\"","Before Chen Xue could reply, he had already hung up.","\"Mu Mian, you...\" Chen Xue turned her head towards Mu Mian, about to ask if she still wanted to take the day off, when she saw Mu Mian staring at her with bright eyes.","\"Chen Xue, drive to the dock quickly. Hurry, don't let them mess up my corpses.\"","\"Weren't you just feeling very sleepy?\" Chen Xue was shocked at how quickly Mu Mian's energy had recovered.","\"I can manage. I've gone five days without sleep before, and even then, my thinking speed wasn't affected.\"","\"Why would you go five days without sleep?\"","Mu Mian didn't answer. She looked out the window and exclaimed: \"Chen Xue, the scenery here is so beautiful!\"","\"If you don't want to talk about it, that's fine. But there's nothing outside the window except traffic. Where's the beautiful scenery? Mu Mian, your way of changing the subject is really clumsy.\"","Jiangzhou City was a coastal city with a long shoreline and beautiful seaside views.","The location of the homicide was a small yacht. When the incident occurred, the yacht had already set sail, with four passengers on board having a party.","During the party, two of them suddenly started convulsing and foaming at the mouth, becoming unresponsive shortly after. The remaining two immediately steered the yacht back to the dock and called the police.","When Mu Mian and Chen Xue arrived at the yacht, Fang Rui and his team were already examining the scene.","There were two bodies on the floor, one male and one female.","\"The victim is actually Lin Qianjie?\" Chen Xue recognized the victim and exclaimed while nudging the body with her foot, \"Wasn't he alive and kicking just yesterday?\"","Mu Mian said disapprovingly: \"Chen Xue, stop stepping on the corpse.\"","\"Sorry, my foot slipped.\""]},{"number":46,"title":"Chapter 46: Reversal of Judgment: Poisonous Murder","paragraphs":["\"We were also surprised,\" Zhang said quietly. \"The female victim's name is Wang Xiaoya. She was Lu Tian's best friend. What a coincidence that these two ended up dead!\"","\"The killer definitely can't be Lu Tian or Prosecutor Nie. Yesterday, Mu Mian and I were watching them closely the entire time. In the middle of the night, Nie Yan even attempted suicide. Thankfully, Mu Forensic Doctor discovered it in time, otherwise Nie Yan would have lost her life,\" Chen Xue immediately cleared Lu Tian and Nie Yan of suspicion.","\"We weren't suspecting them anyway!\" Zhang said. \"There were only four people on the yacht at the time. Two are dead, so one of the two survivors must be the killer.\"","Mu Mian examined the two corpses. Both victims had white foam around their mouths and their skin had turned bluish.","\"They were poisoned, likely by some kind of neurotoxin,\" Mu Mian carefully inspected the bodies' surfaces. \"No external injuries. No obvious needle marks, so we can tentatively rule out injectable drugs. We'll need to run toxicology tests to determine the specific poison used.\"","Fang Rui turned to one of the people who reported the incident, \"You didn't use any illegal drugs last night, did you?\"","The person he addressed was Chen Dongdong, Lin Qianjie's assistant and lackey, who often participated in Lin Qianjie's misdeeds.","\"No... of course not,\" Chen Dongdong's expression was evasive. \"I definitely didn't use anything. If you don't believe me, you can take me for a urine test.\"","\"You'd better not have!\"","Mu Mian took samples of all the food on the yacht. There were several opened bottles of alcohol and some glasses with alcohol residue on the table. She packaged them as-is, planning to take them back for toxicology testing.","\"What's this?\" Zhang pried open the bedside drawer in the yacht's cabin and discovered a bottle of pills. The bottle was white with a label in English that Zhang couldn't quite understand.","Mu Mian hadn't seen this medication before, but she could read the ingredient list. \"Based on the ingredients, it might be some kind of erectile dysfunction medication. Let's take it back for analysis!\"","Mu Mian opened the bottle and poured some out. It contained small white pills. The bottle was only about a quarter full, suggesting the user had been taking this medication for some time.","After Mu Mian finished collecting samples, Fang Rui and his team had also completed their crime scene investigation. They hadn't found any useful clues on the yacht and were preparing to leave.","\"Is this Qianjie's body?\" A cold female voice came from outside the yacht.","Fang Rui walked out to see the speaker was Jiang Yun, Lin Qianjie's stepmother.","She was wearing a black suit dress, looking polished and businesslike. She looked at Lin Qianjie's body with a slight frown but showed no trace of sorrow, her expression cold and detached.","Jiang Yun knew Fang Rui and addressed him directly: \"Fang Rui, are you in charge of this case?\"","\"Yes, I am.\"","\"There's no need for you to investigate this case. I want to take this body away and find the killer myself!\" Jiang Yun's tone was aggressive.","Due to the police's obvious bias towards Lu Tian in the previous rape case, she didn't trust that Fang Rui and his team would take this case seriously.","Fang Rui refused, \"I'm sorry, but we've already taken over this case. According to procedure, you can't take the body away.\"","\"I'm the deceased's family member. I have the right to handle his body.\"","\"We'll return the victim's remains to you after the case is closed,\" Mu Mian suddenly spoke up. \"But not now. Please trust us. We'll solve this case as quickly as possible.\"","Although Mu Mian was wearing a mask, Jiang Yun still recognized her as the girl she had encountered in the gallery that day.","Jiang Yun looked Mu Mian up and down, her tone arrogant, \"You're a forensic expert? You look extremely unprofessional! Why should I trust that you can find the real culprit?\"","\"Are you afraid we won't find the real killer, or are you worried we'll discover your son was using illegal substances and tarnish your family's reputation?\" Fang Rui stepped in front of Mu Mian, cutting off Jiang Yun's words. \"We're investigating this case, and that's final!\"","At that moment, Chen Xue held up a toothpick and asked Mu Mian, \"Mu Mian, should we take this back for toxicology testing?\"","\"Yes, we should! Chen Xue, you're becoming more attentive to details.\"","Mu Mian... Upon hearing this name, Jiang Yun froze. She scrutinized Mu Mian carefully. She should have recognized her; this was her child after all!","She approached Mu Mian and asked in a trembling voice, \"Are you... Mu Mian?\"","Mu Mian didn't answer her. Instead, she said to Fang Rui, \"Fang Rui, I've finished collecting samples. Let's head back!\"","\"Alright!\"","\"Mu Mian, I'm...\" Jiang Yun grabbed Mu Mian's hand, but halfway through her sentence, she couldn't continue.","She had said such vicious things that day, and she had never visited Mu Mian. What right did she have to acknowledge her daughter now?","\"Ms. Jiang, please don't interfere with our work,\" Mu Mian gently removed her hand. \"We're very busy.\"","Jiang Yun stood there, stunned.","She had finally heard her daughter speak, but she had addressed her as \"Ms. Jiang.\"","After Mu Mian and her team had driven away, the assistant cautiously asked, \"Ms. Jiang, shouldn't we be heading back now?\"","She had worked for Jiang Yun for many years, but she had never seen Jiang Yun display such a guilty and despairing expression. Jiang Yun had always been a cold-blooded woman.","\"Yes, let's go back,\" Jiang Yun composed herself, reminding her assistant, \"If the police discover that Qianjie was using illegal drugs, make sure to suppress the news immediately.\"","\"I understand. I'll have someone keep an eye on the situation.\"","In the autopsy room, Chen Xue kept glancing at Mu Mian. She suspected that Jiang Yun might be the mother Mu Mian had been searching for, but she didn't know how to bring it up.","\"Chen Xue, Ms. Jiang is my biological mother,\" Mu Mian said as she cut open Lin Qianjie's stomach. A strong smell of alcohol wafted out. His stomach was nearly empty, with hardly any food residue.","It seemed likely that the poison had been in the alcohol.","\"Then why didn't you acknowledge her?\" Chen Xue was puzzled. \"Haven't you always wanted to meet your mother?\"","\"Yes. So now that I've seen her, I won't want to anymore.\"","Mu Mian collected a sample of the deceased's heart blood for toxicology testing.","\"But she's very wealthy. If you acknowledged her, you'd suddenly become rich,\" Chen Xue remarked. \"Then you wouldn't have to work anymore and could spend money freely.\"","\"I enjoy working, and I don't like excessive spending,\" Mu Mian paused, looking at Chen Xue. \"Besides, I'm already quite wealthy now.\"","\"...Are you referring to your few hundred dollars of savings that were scammed away? Or our meager salaries?\"","\"Of course not! My sister has a lot of money, and I can use as much as I want.\"","Chen Xue had met Mu Mian's sister. She was beautiful and elegant, and judging from her clothes and car, she was indeed very wealthy.","\"That Ms. Jiang doesn't seem like a good person. You're better off staying away from her. Look at how she raised Lin Qianjie - he turned out to be such a scoundrel! It's fortunate that she didn't raise you, otherwise you might have become a bloodthirsty forensic expert!\"","\"I don't like blood; I prefer bones. I might have become a thief instead, stealing mummies from museums or corpses from ancient tombs.\"","\"...\" Chen Xue was speechless. Even if Mu Mian had turned to the dark side, she wouldn't have been very destructive."]},{"number":47,"title":"Chapter 47: Reversal of Judgment: Poisoning Methods","paragraphs":["The next day, the toxicology results came in.","Mu Mian reported: \"The poison found in the victim's body is tetramethylene disulfone tetramine, commonly known as tetramine. It's a colorless, odorless, highly toxic powder. The lethal dose for humans is only 7 to 10 milligrams.","Symptoms of poisoning include tonic and clonic convulsions, loss of consciousness, foaming at the mouth, cyanosis, resembling status epilepticus, and may be accompanied by psychiatric symptoms. In severe cases, convulsions occur almost continuously, even leading to opisthotonus.","We also detected some undissolved soil in the poisoned wine glass, likely impurities from the tetramine.\"","Zhang asked puzzledly, \"Hasn't tetramine been completely banned from production and sale for many years? How could the killer obtain such a poison?\"","\"Tetramethylene disulfone tetramine is very stable. It won't decompose even after decades,\" Mu Mian explained. \"It could be from earlier production.\"","Fang Rui frowned, \"In that case, it'll be difficult to investigate the source of the poison.\"","Mu Mian continued, \"Although both Lin Qianjie and Wang Xiaoya were poisoned, Lin Qianjie's poisoning was more severe, while Wang Xiaoya's was milder. If medical treatment had been timely, Wang Xiaoya might have had a chance of survival.","There were four wine glasses at the crime scene. We detected tetramine in one glass, but not in the other three. The wine in all four glasses was the same type.","No poison was detected in the wine bottle found at the scene, nor in any other food or containers. This suggests the poison was likely added directly to the glass.\"","Fang Rui said, \"It seems the killer had a specific poisoning target. They probably didn't intend to poison everyone, otherwise they would have put the poison in the wine bottle.\"","Mu Mian then showed the medicine bottle: \"The pills in the bottle are erectile dysfunction medication. Only Lin Qianjie's fingerprints were found on the bottle, so it likely belonged to him. We didn't detect any tetramine in it, and the medication doesn't seem to have been tampered with.\"","Zhang exclaimed, \"No way, Lin Qianjie had performance issues? How could he still rape those girls?\"","Chen Xue gave Zhang a stern look, \"It's erectile dysfunction medication. He just had some difficulties, not complete impotence. Maybe his insecurity about this led to his psychological issues, causing him to rape innocent girls.\"","\"He's such a pervert! He's so rich, why didn't he just get treatment instead of attacking innocent girls?\"","On the night of the incident, there were four people on the yacht: the deceased Lin Qianjie and Wang Xiaoya; and the reporters Chen Dongdong and Xu Qin.","Chen Dongdong was Lin Qianjie's assistant. He was in a relationship with Wang Xiaoya, and it was because of him that Wang Xiaoya was able to board the yacht that night.","Xu Qin was Lin Qianjie's new girlfriend. They had been together for about half a year, constantly breaking up and getting back together, but never managing to separate for good.","At the time, Lin Qianjie had just won a lawsuit. He originally wanted to throw a big celebration, but his stepmother had cut off his credit card and ordered him to keep a low profile. Angered by this, Lin Qianjie took his yacht out to sea. He often did this in the past.","Fang Rui decided to take Chen Dongdong's statement first. Mu Mian said she wanted to join, as she had some questions for them.","Fang Rui first asked Chen Dongdong to recount the incident.","Chen Dongdong recalled, \"We were all drinking at the time. Mr. Lin was in a bad mood, so he drank a bit too much. We were drinking with him. But halfway through, Mr. Lin suddenly collapsed. He was convulsing, foaming at the mouth. It was terrifying.","A while later, Xiaoya also collapsed. She was convulsing just like Mr. Lin. I called out to her, but she didn't respond.","Xu Qin and I were scared to death. We thought we might be next, but after waiting for a long time, nothing happened to us. I quickly steered the yacht back to the dock and called the police.\"","\"Did Lin Qianjie and Wang Xiaoya drink from the same glass?\" Mu Mian asked.","\"Well... they...\" Chen Dongdong looked uncomfortable and stammered, \"We were playing a game. Xiaoya lost, and her punishment was to feed Mr. Lin wine with her mouth. Does that count as drinking from the same glass?\"","\"Whose glass was it?\"","\"Mr. Lin's.\"","Mu Mian and Fang Rui exchanged a glance: it seemed the killer's real target was Lin Qianjie. Wang Xiaoya's death by poisoning was likely due to that silly game.","\"Was everyone drinking the same wine?\" Mu Mian asked.","\"Yes, Jamaican rum,\" Chen Dongdong said. \"It's Mr. Lin's favorite. We were just drinking along with him.\"","\"Did he have a habit of taking medication?\"","\"Not that I know of.\"","\"Are you sure?\" Mu Mian took out the bottle found at the crime scene. \"Then what's this?\"","\"I... I don't know.\"","Fang Rui crossed his arms. \"You know providing false testimony is punishable by law, right?\"","\"It should be erectile dysfunction medication. I bought it for him from abroad. It works very well,\" Chen Dongdong immediately confessed. \"He was a bit insecure about that aspect, so he liked using those pills.\"","\"Did he take any that night?\" Mu Mian asked.","\"I don't think so. Mr. Lin wasn't in a good mood that night, he wasn't in the mood. He probably didn't take any.\"","Fang Rui asked, \"How did Xu Qin and Lin Qianjie meet? Were they close?\"","\"Wang Xiaoya introduced them. Xu Qin is an art teacher at a tutoring center. She has an artistic air about her, and she's quite good at pleasing people, so Mr. Lin liked her a lot. But Mr. Lin had many girlfriends, she was just one of them.\"","Fang Rui and Mu Mian then took Xu Qin's statement.","Xu Qin was very beautiful, but she seemed timid, speaking with a stutter, \"I don't know what happened either. Qianjie and Xiaoya suddenly collapsed, convulsing all over. It looked terrifying, just like an epileptic seizure.\"","Fang Rui asked, \"How did you meet Lin Qianjie?\"","\"Xiaoya introduced us. I used to work part-time at Xiaoya's shop, and we became friends. Later, she introduced me to Lin Qianjie. I quite liked him, so we started dating.\"","Mu Mian asked, \"Who poured Lin Qianjie's wine that night?\"","\"Most of the time, it was Wang Xiaoya. She was very enthusiastic towards Qianjie. She even used the game as an excuse to forcibly kiss Qianjie,\" Xu Qin said. \"Officer, could Wang Xiaoya have been the one who poisoned him?\"","\"Why do you suspect her?\"","\"You might think Wang Xiaoya is carefree, but she actually values relationships quite a lot. She used to be very close with Lu Tian, often dining and shopping together. After what happened to Lu Tian, she must have harbored resentment towards Qianjie. After all, she bears some responsibility for what happened.\"","Fang Rui then asked, \"What was Lin Qianjie's relationship with Chen Dongdong like?\"","\"I'm not sure about that. But I don't think anyone would willingly be someone else's lackey. He must have some resentment towards Qianjie. Plus, Qianjie often lent him money. If Qianjie died, he wouldn't have to repay those loans.\"","\"What about you, Miss Xu? How would you describe your relationship with Lin Qianjie?\"","\"Me? I don't love him, nor do I hate him. I'm with him for his money. I certainly wouldn't want him dead. Where else would I find such a generous sugar daddy?\"","After leaving the interrogation room, Fang Rui asked Mu Mian, \"Who do you think might have poisoned him?\"","\"They all seem suspicious. We need to figure out how the killer administered the poison first,\" Mu Mian said.","Fang Rui remembered the white medicine bottle and analyzed, \"Could the killer have disguised the poison as erectile dysfunction medication and put it in the bottle? Lin Qianjie might have had a habit of putting the medication in his wine. That night, he might have put a poisoned pill in his drink.\"","\"If the medication was in capsule form, that could be possible. But Lin Qianjie's erectile dysfunction medication wasn't encapsulated. If a poison pill was mixed in with the other pills, it would have left traces in the bottle. We would have been able to detect it.\"","Fang Rui speculated further, \"What if the poison pill was coated with normal erectile dysfunction medication on the outside, but contained tetramine on the inside?\""]},{"number":48,"title":"Chapter 48: Reversal of Judgment: The Shen Yuanyuan Case","paragraphs":["\"Fang Rui, I think you have a bit of a criminal talent! But,\" Mu Mian objected, \"we didn't detect any of those aphrodisiac components in Lin Qianjie's body. That possibility has been ruled out.\"","Fang Rui felt that the possibility of Chen Dongdong poisoning Lin was low. He had a close relationship with Lin Qianjie, and if he really wanted to poison him, he could have easily chosen a time when he wasn't present, allowing Lin Qianjie to die from the poison.","Moreover, Wang Xiaoya was his girlfriend. If he only wanted to poison Lin Qianjie, he could have easily prevented Wang Xiaoya from drinking the poisoned wine.","In that case, Xu Qin became highly suspicious.","Fang Rui focused his investigation on Xu Qin.","\"Boss, this Xu Qin and Shen Yuanyuan were actually from the same high school,\" Zhang said, holding up a photo. \"This is their graduation photo. They were in the same class for all three years of high school, and from the photo, it looks like they were quite close.\"","The photo showed three girls, all smiling happily.","The third girl in the photo was called Shen Meilin. She didn't go to college after high school, but she also worked in Jiangzhou City, so she maintained contact with Shen Yuanyuan. When Shen Yuanyuan was involved in the lawsuit earlier, she had been by her side the whole time.","Shen Meilin worked as a waitress in a restaurant.","\"Ah, I should have stayed by Yuanyuan's side,\" Shen Meilin sighed. \"After that lawsuit failed, Yuanyuan developed severe depression. At that time, Prosecutor Nie, who was in charge of Yuanyuan's case, and I stayed with Yuanyuan for many days. Later, Yuanyuan pulled herself together and even found a job. We thought her illness had improved and she was starting to live again. We never expected her to suddenly commit suicide by jumping off a building!\"","Fang Rui took out the group photo and asked, \"What about Xu Qin? How did she react after Shen Yuanyuan's suicide?\"","\"What reaction could that gold-digger have? What happened to Yuanyuan was her fault. If she hadn't introduced Yuanyuan to Lin Qianjie, would Yuanyuan have met such a tragic fate? She's viciously cruel! At that time, she even tried to introduce me to Lin Qianjie. Thankfully, that scumbag wasn't interested in me. Xu Qin, that bitch, I curse her every time I see her!\"","Shen Meilin became increasingly agitated as she spoke. She and Shen Yuanyuan were from the same village and had grown up together, sharing a very close bond.","\"What was the relationship between Xu Qin and Shen Yuanyuan like?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"Very good! Originally, Yuanyuan and I were inseparable best friends, but after Xu Qin came along, I became the third wheel in this friendship. That's why I'm so angry. Yuanyuan trusted her so much, but she knew about Lin Qianjie's crimes and still refused to testify in court, causing Yuanyuan to lose the lawsuit.\"","Shen Meilin sighed, \"Yuanyuan hated her even on her deathbed, which is why she specifically called her to the bottom of the building and jumped to her death right in front of her eyes. If she had any conscience left, she probably wouldn't be able to sleep for the rest of her life.\"","\"Alright, thank you for your cooperation.\"","On the drive back, Zhang analyzed, \"Boss, do you think the killer could be Xu Qin? If she and Shen Yuanyuan were really good friends, she must have harbored hatred towards Lin Qianjie. On the day of the incident, Lin Qianjie had just won another lawsuit. Maybe that triggered Xu Qin, and she couldn't help but poison Lin Qianjie.\"","Fang Rui thought Zhang's analysis made some sense. When they had previously taken Xu Qin's statement, she had spoken about Wang Xiaoya with disdain and mentioned that Wang Xiaoya would feel guilty about what happened to Lu Tian. Could this have been a projection of her own feelings?","\"Let's go talk to Xu Qin again!\" Fang Rui said.","Xu Qin had studied art and was now teaching children to paint at a tutoring center. When Fang Rui found her, she was guiding a child in coloring.","Xu Qin led Fang Rui to her office.","\"Detective Fang, Officer Zhang, please have some tea!\" Xu Qin poured two cups of tea for Fang Rui and Zhang, then sat down on the sofa.","Fang Rui didn't drink the tea. He noticed a sketchbook on the table and casually picked it up to flip through it.","The drawings were in color, but the lines were very blurry. They didn't look like paintings, more like colors randomly smeared on paper. Although Fang Rui didn't understand psychology, he could tell from these drawings that the mental state of the person who drew them was not very good.","He took out his phone and photographed them, planning to ask Mu Mian to take a look later. Mu Mian had long been receiving art therapy and should be familiar with these things.","\"Miss Xu, did you draw these?\" Fang Rui asked casually, pretending to be curious. \"They're quite unique!\"","\"Yes,\" Xu Qin nervously snatched the sketchbook and stuffed it into a drawer. \"I've been obsessed with modernist painting styles lately. These are just some casual drawings, very abstract. That's the style of modernism.\"","Seeing that Fang Rui hadn't drunk the tea, Zhang didn't dare to drink his cup either. He was afraid Xu Qin might have poisoned the tea and kill them both.","Zhang asked, \"Miss Xu, do you remember Shen Yuanyuan?\"","Upon hearing this name, Xu Qin froze. She cautiously asked, \"What does this case have to do with Yuanyuan? Yuanyuan's parents are farmers, they couldn't possibly have poisoned Lin Qianjie. Please don't harass her parents, they're already miserable enough having to bury their child.\"","Fang Rui asked, \"Do you feel guilty about Shen Yuanyuan's death?\"","\"Why should I feel guilty? I wasn't the one who raped Yuanyuan, nor did I push her off the building. Why don't you blame Lin Qianjie? Why blame me? I had no choice, I didn't want things to turn out like this...\" Xu Qin lost control of her emotions, tears continuously flowing from the corners of her eyes. \"Yuanyuan's death wasn't caused by me!\"","Zhang asked, \"Then don't you hate Lin Qianjie? He caused the death of your best friend, yet you still associated with him. Aren't you afraid that Shen Yuanyuan won't rest in peace?\"","Xu Qin's mind flashed back to Shen Yuanyuan's bloody, mangled body and those wide-open eyes. These scenes had become her inescapable nightmares.","Her mental state was on the verge of collapse, and she struggled to defend herself: \"This society is all about survival of the fittest. Even the law couldn't do anything to him, what could I do? If I had helped Yuanyuan, I might have been the one who ended up dead!\"","Xu Qin finally realized Fang Rui's intention. \"Detective, I didn't poison Lin Qianjie. It wasn't me!\"","\"If it wasn't you, then it must be Chen Dongdong,\" Fang Rui said. \"Was there anything suspicious about him on the night of the incident?\"","\"Wang Xiaoya liked Lin Qianjie, she was always trying to seduce him. No man can tolerate being cheated on.\"","Xu Qin continued, \"He also knows many people in the black market and often buys illegal goods. It would be easy for him to buy poison. I think he's the killer!\"","Xu Qin recalled, \"Before we went to the dock that day, I saw Wang Xiaoya arguing with Chen Dongdong, and it was quite heated. Could it be that Chen Dongdong intended to poison Wang Xiaoya? Maybe Lin Qianjie accidentally drank that glass of wine by mistake, and that's why he was poisoned too? Detective Fang, you should investigate Chen Dongdong thoroughly, he might just be the killer!\"","It was already dark when they left the tutoring center where Xu Qin worked.","\"Boss, looking at the motives, both Chen Dongdong and Xu Qin had reasons to commit the crime. They also had the opportunity to do so, but it's difficult to prove which one of them is the killer. If the poison was directly added to the glass, it would be hard to find any evidence.\"","The lead on the source of the poison couldn't be pursued further either. Tetramethylene disulfotetramine didn't have a clear sales channel, making it difficult to trace its origin.","When Fang Rui returned to the police station, he found Mu Mian still working overtime. She was hunched over her desk, which was covered with papers. She seemed to be solving calculation problems.","Fang Rui placed his phone in front of Mu Mian, showing Xu Qin's drawings. \"Mu Mian, these drawings are very strange. Can they reflect the artist's psychological issues? Like antisocial personality disorder or something?\"","Mu Mian glanced at the jumbled colors and thought for a moment before saying, \"According to the principles of drawing tests, the artist is likely suffering from depression. She needs psychological treatment.\"","\"These drawings were done by Xu Qin. I thought they might indicate that she had strong aggressive tendencies. Now it seems she's less likely to be the killer.\"","\"But many poisoners don't exhibit aggressive tendencies. The perpetrators in these types of cases are usually women who can't seek revenge through violent means, so they resort to poisoning instead,\" Mu Mian said as she continued her calculations on the paper.","\"What are you calculating?\"","\"Liquid concentration,\" Mu Mian replied. \"I've just finished.\"","Fang Rui took a look, but the paper was full of formulas he couldn't quite understand.","\"What's the point of calculating this?\"","Mu Mian drew four glasses of wine on the paper, labeling one as poisoned wine while leaving the other three unmarked. Pointing at the poisoned glass, Mu Mian explained, \"I conducted a component analysis of the four glasses of wine. This poisoned glass contains an additional component of rodenticide, but all other components are the same as the other three glasses. However, their alcohol concentrations differ significantly.\"","\"The poisoned glass has added rodenticide, so it would definitely affect the alcohol concentration. Are you suspecting that the murderer put a lot of poison in it?\"","Mu Mian sighed, thinking that Fang Rui was being a bit slow.","\"Mu Mian, just tell me the correct answer directly.\" Fang Rui couldn't help but ruffle Mu Mian's hair. \"And don't you dare think I'm stupid in your mind!\"","Mu Mian explained, \"This indicates that the poisoned wine has been diluted.\""]},{"number":49,"title":"Chapter 49: Reversal of Judgment: Case Replay","paragraphs":["Fang Rui decided to reenact the case. He called Chen Dongdong and Xu Qin to describe the incident again, while he and Zhang played the roles of the deceased Lin Qianjie and Wang Xiaoya.","\"We were sitting around this table, in this order: Lin, me, Wang Xiaoya, and Xu Qin,\" Chen Dongdong recalled.","Fang Rui and the others sat down according to this arrangement.","\"At first, Xu Qin went to get four glasses, then I went to the liquor cabinet and got a few bottles of rum. After the alcohol arrived, I poured the first round for everyone,\" Chen Dongdong said. \"Later, Xiaoya took the bottle and kept enthusiastically pouring drinks for us. We continued drinking until about 11 o'clock.\"","\"Did the seating positions change at all?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"Yes, they did. Later, we played a dice game where the person with the highest roll could make the person with the lowest roll do something. Xiaoya rolled the lowest, and Xu Qin the highest. Xu Qin made Xiaoya feed Lin alcohol mouth-to-mouth,\" Chen Dongdong described. \"During the feeding, Xu Qin and Xiaoya switched places.\"","Fang Rui looked at Xu Qin, \"Wasn't Lin Qianjie your boyfriend? Why did you make Wang Xiaoya feed him alcohol?\"","\"When Wang Xiaoya was pouring drinks, she was practically clinging to Lin Qianjie. Since she was so eager to get something going with Lin Qianjie, I figured I'd just let her,\" Xu Qin shrugged and said.","Fang Rui asked Chen Dongdong again, \"Did Wang Xiaoya use Lin Qianjie's glass to feed him directly?\"","Chen Dongdong shook his head, \"At first, Xiaoya took a sip from her own glass, then fed it to Lin. Lin probably thought this way of drinking was interesting, so he picked up his glass and fed Xiaoya a sip too.\"","\"Did anything unusual happen after that? Like someone leaving?\"","\"Yes, Xu Qin went out for a bit.\"","\"I went to the bathroom,\" Xu Qin quickly explained.","Chen Dongdong continued, \"Afterwards, we kept drinking together. We didn't continue the game because Lin was in a bad mood. Shortly after, Lin collapsed on the ground, convulsing. Less than a minute later, Xiaoya fell too. About ten minutes later, we realized they had both stopped breathing.\"","After simulating the entire process, Fang Rui realized that the most likely person to have poisoned them was actually Wang Xiaoya. She poured the drinks and even kissed Lin Qianjie, making her the most probable suspect.","But paradoxically, Wang Xiaoya herself had died.","\"Boss, could it be that Wang Xiaoya wanted to die together with Lin Qianjie? Maybe the poisoned glass wasn't Lin Qianjie's, but Wang Xiaoya's? This way, she could kill Lin Qianjie and also make his lackeys suspects, causing them to turn on each other?\" Zhang speculated.","Fang Rui thought this was unlikely, given that Wang Xiaoya probably wasn't clever enough to devise such a scheme.","\"Don't you remember Mu Mian saying that Wang Xiaoya's poisoning was less severe? If that poisoned glass was her own, she should have been more heavily poisoned. That poisoned glass must have been Lin Qianjie's.\"","\"Then the murderer must be Xu Qin! She deliberately made Wang Xiaoya feed Lin Qianjie, so she could kill two birds with one stone and poison both of them at once,\" Zhang continued to guess.","\"If the killer wanted to kill Wang Xiaoya too, they could have just poisoned her glass directly. Why go through such a roundabout way? The killer also couldn't be sure that Lin Qianjie would finish his own drink before feeding Wang Xiaoya.\"","After watching their reenactment, Mu Mian realized that it was unlikely the poison was administered by any of the four people present. If the killer had added rat poison powder to the glass, it would have been quickly discovered; if they had added a liquid, it would have been impossible to do so discreetly.","Fang Rui helped Mu Mian with the search and asked, \"Mu Mian, do you think it's possible the killer wasn't among them?\"","\"That's highly likely,\" Mu Mian said confidently. \"In poisoning cases, the killer rarely stays at the crime scene waiting to be arrested by the police.\"","\"Then how could the killer have poisoned them so precisely?\"","\"The killer probably took advantage of some habit of the victims,\" Mu Mian said. \"A very specific habit.\"","\"Are you saying that the method of poisoning is still related to that bottle of aphrodisiac?\" Fang Rui guessed.","\"Why are you all so focused on that aphrodisiac bottle? It's just an ordinary medicine.\"","Fang Rui looked at Mu Mian and asked, \"Mu Mian, do you know how the killer administered the poison?\"","Mu Mian didn't answer. She pointed at the refrigerator on the yacht that held food, \"Fang Rui, can you help me bring all of this back? Everything inside, including the refrigerator.\"","Fang Rui remembered Mu Mian saying yesterday that the poisoned drink had been diluted, and he suddenly understood what Mu Mian wanted to verify.","Mu Mian thought for a moment and added, \"Fang Rui, even if we figure out how the killer administered the poison, we might still have trouble catching them. Because we may not be able to find evidence to arrest her.\"","When Mu Mian returned to the station, Chen Xue was on a video call with someone.","\"Look, Mian Mian is back. She just went out on duty,\" Chen Xue said to the person on the phone, turning to pat Mu Mian.","\"Dr. Mu, long time no see!\" It was Lu Tian on the other end of the video. Her emotional state seemed much improved.","She was currently traveling abroad, with a background of azure sea - the scenery was beautiful.","\"Lu Tian, it's been a while,\" Mu Mian greeted her.","\"The scenery here is really beautiful. Next time I'll bring you all here!\" Lu Tian noticed that Mu Mian looked busy and asked, \"Dr. Mu, what are you busy with? Why aren't you chatting with me?\"","Chen Xue explained, \"We're investigating a poisoning case! I told you about it, remember? That scumbag Lin Qianjie was poisoned to death. We're working on this case now. Who knows which good Samaritan poisoned him. You have no idea, when I saw he was dead, I almost laughed out loud.\"","\"Have you caught the killer yet?\"","\"Not so fast! We have no leads at all right now. Oh, I've got to go now, I need to get back to work.\"","After hanging up, Chen Xue saw Mu Mian looking at her seriously. Chen Xue asked, \"Mian Mian, what's wrong?\"","\"Chen Xue, we need to keep our work confidential.\"","\"Oh come on, Lu Tian couldn't possibly be the killer,\" Chen Xue thought Mu Mian was being overly cautious.","\"It's not impossible! This is a poisoning case.\" Mu Mian opened the freezer compartment of the refrigerator. The ice tray that should have been full of ice cubes was empty.","\"Mian Mian, have you forgotten? That night, we were all drinking together. Lu Tian can't be in two places at once, how could she possibly kill Lin Qianjie?\"","Mu Mian didn't say anything. She took the empty ice tray to run toxicology tests.","\"Mian Mian, you don't really suspect Lu Tian, do you?\"","\"The current situation is that anyone who has been on Lin Qianjie's yacht is a suspect,\" Mu Mian explained. \"I'm not just suspecting her. I only trust evidence.\""]},{"number":50,"title":"Chapter 50: Reversal of Judgment: The Familiar Suspect","paragraphs":["When the toxicology results for the ice box came back, it was already 7 PM.","Mu Mian glanced at the report, then closed it. The results were as she had expected.","Mu Mian returned to her office and saw that Fang Rui was also working late. She handed the report to Fang Rui, saying, \"Fang Rui, I know how the killer administered the poison.\"","\"This killer is quite clever, using such a discreet method to poison the victim.\"","\"Using ice cubes to deliver poison is a common technique in detective novels. It's simple and doesn't leave many traces,\" Mu Mian continued. \"I just ran a toxicology test on that ice box and detected traces of tetramethylenedisulfotetramine. The killer used this box to make poisoned ice cubes.\"","\"So the killer likely prepared the poisoned ice cubes in advance and kept them in the freezer,\" Fang Rui analyzed. \"On the day of the incident, Lin Qianjie happened to use one of those poisoned ice cubes, which led to his death by poisoning. But how did the killer ensure Lin Qianjie would definitely use that particular ice cube?\"","Fang Rui soon got the answer from Chen Dongdong.","\"Mr. Lin liked to add ice cubes to his drinks, but this particular liquor is meant to be enjoyed for its kick, so the rest of us don't like adding ice,\" Chen Dongdong explained. \"Mr. Lin was image-conscious, but he couldn't hold his liquor well, so he could only reduce the alcohol content this way. We all knew about this, but no one dared to call him out on it.\"","\"Did he add ice cubes to his drink on the night of the incident?\"","\"Of course he did! Otherwise, he wouldn't have been able to drink more than a few glasses of that strong liquor.\"","Fang Rui was speechless. Lin Qianjie really was a man who cared too much about his image.","Although they had cracked the killer's poisoning method, this actually made the case more complex.","Firstly, Lin Qianjie's yacht was docked at the marina, so it wouldn't be difficult to sneak aboard, and Lin Qianjie himself had brought many friends on board before. Secondly, there were too many people who harbored hatred towards Lin Qianjie to investigate them all.","Jiang Yun and the Lin family kept pressuring them about the progress of the investigation. They even hired thugs to beat Chen Dongdong half to death, trying to extract information about the poisoner from him.","Fang Rui had no choice but to assign people to protect Chen Dongdong in the hospital to prevent any further incidents.","As Mu Mian passed by Director Wang's office, she overheard Jiang Yun complaining inside about their slow progress and demanding a change in the investigating team.","Director Wang, troubled by her persistence, had to ask Captain Li, who was previously in charge of this case, to assist with the investigation again.","Mu Mian thought Jiang Yun was terrifying, just like the wicked stepmother in fairy tales.","\"Mu Mian.\"","Mu Mian was about to return to her office when Jiang Yun called out to her. \"Mu Mian, I'm your mother. You have my photo, you should still remember me, right?\"","Jiang Yun's face wore an expectant expression.","\"I don't know you!\" Mu Mian said calmly. \"My mother is already dead. But she was very good to me, and she will always live in my memories.\"","Mu Mian was referring to her adoptive mother, a very gentle woman.","\"Is it Shen Xiyin who's not letting you acknowledge me?\" Jiang Yun grabbed Mu Mian's arm, her tone becoming urgent. \"Shen Xiyin isn't as good as you think. Their family's motives for adopting you weren't pure either. They didn't adopt you because they liked you, but to claim your father's inheritance. Mu Mian, come back to your mother.\"","Mu Mian's eyes widened. She didn't understand why Jiang Yun would say such things.","Her adoptive parents had spent a great deal of money and effort to treat her autism. If they were only after her father's inheritance, they could have simply abandoned her at an orphanage and left her to fend for herself.","Fang Rui, who had been summoned to the director's office, happened to witness this scene. He pulled Mu Mian behind him and addressed Jiang Yun, \"Ms. Jiang, if you're dissatisfied with our investigation efficiency, you can file a complaint directly. Please don't manhandle our staff!\"","\"Fang Rui, she's my daughter. I was just catching up with her.\"","\"But Mu Mian doesn't want to catch up with you!\"","Mu Mian nodded, \"Fang Rui, I don't know her. I want to go back to work.\"","\"Alright, you can go!\"","Jiang Yun glared at Fang Rui, displeased. \"Mind your own business! I'm Mu Mian's mother. It's not your place as an outsider to interfere in our affairs!\"","\"Mu Mian was once a victim of a telecom fraud. The scammer claimed to be her mother, and she transferred all her money to them. She used to look forward to meeting her mother, but when she finally met you, you hurt her deeply.\"","Jiang Yun's eyes reddened. She deeply regretted saying those things to Mu Mian back then.","\"Ms. Jiang, if you truly have even a shred of love for this daughter, please stop hurting her.\"","The director informed Fang Rui about increasing manpower for the investigation, with Captain Li assisting him. Fang Rui guessed that Jiang Yun must have been applying pressure again.","\"Fang Rui, what rotten luck. This case has landed in my lap again.\"","Fang Rui shrugged helplessly, \"We could actually use some help in investigating the victim's social connections. It's great that you can assist!\"","Fang Rui obtained a list from Chen Dongdong of everyone who had been on the yacht in the past month, including cleaning staff. There were twenty-five people in total, and to their surprise, Lu Tian was one of them.","Zhang looked at Lu Tian's name and exclaimed, \"My goodness, could the poisoner be Lu Tian? No one hates Lin Qianjie more than her right now, right?\"","Lu Tian had been on the yacht on July 19th, the day before she was raped by Lin Qianjie.","\"No way, it can't be Lu Tian. Lu Tian was raped by Lin Qianjie on July 20th. She hadn't even been raped at that point, so what motive would she have had to kill Lin Qianjie?\" Chen Xue argued, \"She couldn't have killed him for no reason, could she?\"","Fang Rui suddenly realized that there were some questionable points about Lu Tian's rape case. For instance, even if Lin Qianjie had deliberately created an opportunity to meet Lu Tian, how could they have taken so many photos together if Lu Tian wasn't cooperating?","Moreover, Lin Qianjie and Lu Tian were chatting in the living room that night. Why would Lin Qianjie drag Lu Tian into the bedroom to rape her instead of doing it right there in the living room?","Fang Rui also recalled what Lu Tian's mother had said in court. If what she said was true, then...","As they were leaving work, Mu Mian and Chen Xue saw Lu Tian standing at the entrance of the City Police Bureau, seemingly waiting for someone. She greeted them warmly when she saw them: \"Dr. Mu, Dr. Chen.\"","\"Tiantian, are you back from your trip?\" Chen Xue was happy to see Lu Tian. After spending time together, they had become quite close. \"How was your trip abroad? I'd love to go too, but I can't afford it!\"","\"I brought gifts for you.\" Lu Tian handed Chen Xue a gift bag containing postcards and a souvenir made from a conch shell.","Chen Xue loved it.","Lu Tian then gave Mu Mian a gift box, \"Dr. Shen said you especially enjoy unwrapping gifts, so I put your present in a box. I hope you like it.\"","Mu Mian opened the box to find a colorful wind chime made of seashells.","\"It's beautiful. I love it,\" Mu Mian said, carefully closing the box and cradling it.","\"Tiantian, come on, let's go eat. I'll treat you to hot pot,\" Chen Xue said, putting her arm around Lu Tian. She was glad to see Lu Tian moving past her trauma.","\"Sure! I haven't had hot pot in ages.\"","The thought of hot pot made Mu Mian a bit glum. The last time she had bravely tried it, she had developed a fever and suffered from toothache for days. She didn't want to eat hot pot.","\"Chen Xue, Lu Tian, I can't join you for hot pot. I need to go home. Goodbye!\" Mu Mian's refusal was quite direct.","\"Alright then, we'll go on our own.\" Chen Xue waved goodbye to Mu Mian and drove off with Lu Tian.","Mu Mian waited for a while and soon saw Fang Rui's car coming out. She got in, holding her gift box.","\"Who gave you that gift?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"Lu Tian,\" Mu Mian replied. \"She went on a beach vacation. She gave me a very pretty seashell wind chime. I really like it.\"","\"When did you and Chen Xue become so close with her?\"","Mu Mian looked a bit sad as she turned to Fang Rui, \"If Lu Tian turns out to be the one who poisoned Lin Qianjie, can we not arrest her?\""]},{"number":51,"title":"Chapter 51: Reversal of Verdict: The Truth","paragraphs":["\"Mu Mian, everyone should be responsible for their own actions. If she committed a crime, she should face legal judgment,\" Fang Rui said, looking at the crowded traffic. \"However, our immediate priority is to find evidence first.\"","\"Lin Qianjie also committed a crime, but he escaped legal punishment,\" Mu Mian argued. \"Lu Tian is a good person. She was forced into committing a crime!\"","Fang Rui noticed the red light, stopped the car, then looked at Mu Mian: \"This shows the limitations of the law, and we need to work hard to improve it. Any tragic experience is not an excuse for committing a crime. If Lu Tian really committed a crime, then she should be held responsible for her actions.\"","\"But that's so unfair!\"","\"Mu Mian, there's no absolute fairness in this world.\"","Back home, Mu Mian hung the seashell wind chime by the inner window. When the wind blew, the shells made a crisp sound.","So noisy!","After a while, Mu Mian put it away again, storing it in a box.","The next day, Fang Rui and Zhang once again found Shen Yuanyuan's best friend, Shen Meilin.","\"Officer Fang, what can I do for you?\" Shen Meilin asked. \"We've told you everything about Yuanyuan. Please don't keep coming to find me; it's affecting my work.\"","\"Did Shen Yuanyuan have any other close friends?\"","\"She had quite a few friends. Which one are you asking about?\"","Fang Rui took out Lu Tian's photo and handed it to Shen Meilin. \"Did Shen Yuanyuan know this girl?\"","\"Isn't this Lu Tian?\" Shen Meilin recognized the person in the photo immediately. \"She was Yuanyuan's good friend.\"","\"How did they meet?\"","\"They met in a small psychological support group about six months ago. The people in that group all had various psychological issues. They often held gatherings privately to comfort each other, and it was quite effective.","After Yuanyuan was raped by Lin Qianjie, she developed PTSD (Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder), so she joined this group to seek solace. Later, she met Lu Tian in this group. Lu Tian was especially kind, often inviting Yuanyuan out and giving her gifts.\"","Shen Meilin remembered something and took out her phone. \"This is a photo of Yuanyuan and Lu Tian together.\"","Fang Rui and Zhang exchanged a glance. It seemed that Lu Tian was likely seeking revenge for Shen Yuanyuan.","\"Later, when Yuanyuan's lawsuit failed, she couldn't bear the stress and committed suicide. Lu Tian even gave her parents some money to help them buy a good burial plot for Yuanyuan.\"","\"Can you send me this photo?\"","\"Sure.\"","After leaving the restaurant where Shen Meilin worked, Zhang's thoughts were still in disarray.","\"Boss, if Lu Tian knew Shen Yuanyuan six months ago, how could she still fall into Lin Qianjie's trap? Could Lu Tian have deliberately set up Lin Qianjie to rape her?\"","Fang Rui analyzed, \"Lu Tian's plan might have been in two parts: if the rape charge stood, then Lin Qianjie would face legal judgment; if he managed to escape punishment like last time, then he would face Lu Tian's judgment.\"","\"But why would Lu Tian help Shen Yuanyuan? They were just friends. Is it worth committing a crime for a friend you've just met?\" Zhang asked, puzzled.","\"Do you remember what Lu Tian's mother said in court? She said Lu Tian was molested as a child,\" Fang Rui paused. \"Shen Yuanyuan's case might have triggered her, so she wanted to seek justice for Shen Yuanyuan, and also for her younger self.\"","Fang Rui immediately called Lu Tian to the interrogation room.","Lu Tian was still wearing the white dress she had worn during the trial. Her expression was calm, not at all like a criminal awaiting trial.","\"Miss Lu, you know Shen Yuanyuan, don't you?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"Yes, I met her in a psychological support group. I've always had bipolar disorder, so I often participate in such support groups. It helps me manage my emotions and also allows me to help others.\"","Fang Rui continued, \"Miss Lu, since you knew Shen Yuanyuan, you must have known what kind of person Lin Qianjie was and what methods he used. So why did you still go to various events with him?\"","\"For money!\" Lu Tian answered. \"I needed money. You should know about my family background. We're very poor, and I have parents and a younger brother depending on me, so I need to earn money. I thought with Yuanyuan's experience as a lesson, I could avoid such things happening, but I underestimated my judgment.\"","Zhang interrupted, \"Miss Lu, do you think this reason is convincing?\"","\"I could be after his money, but that doesn't mean he can force me to do things I don't want to do.\"","Fang Rui said, \"On July 19th, you followed Wang Xiaoya onto the yacht. When they weren't paying attention, you put rat poison in the ice tray.","On July 20th, you deliberately provoked Lin Qianjie to rape you and tricked him into the room because you knew there was a camera installed on the balcony of the opposite building that could capture what was happening in your room. You also deliberately made a lot of noise while resisting.","After losing the trial, you immediately went abroad for a vacation to create an alibi for yourself.","Miss Lu, am I correct in my analysis?\"","\"Officer Fang, your story is very imaginative,\" Lu Tian's face showed a mocking smile. \"But do you solve cases by making up stories? Though maybe that's how all you judicial personnel work. Lin Qianjie also got away by making up a story, labeling me as mentally ill, and was acquitted.\"","\"We're already collecting evidence,\" Zhang retorted. \"Any crime will leave traces. If you confess now, it will be considered a voluntary surrender, and the judge will give you a reduced sentence.\"","Lu Tian sneered, \"So you have no evidence. I'm sorry, but before my lawyer arrives, I have the right to remain silent.\"","Fang Rui also knew that the chain of evidence was not complete, but judging from Lu Tian's attitude, she was undoubtedly the culprit.","Lu Tian's lawyer arrived at the station quickly.","\"Isn't Nie Yan a prosecutor? How did she become Lu Tian's lawyer?\" Chen Xue was a bit surprised.","After Lu Tian's case ended, Nie Yan was framed for accepting bribes and was dismissed from the prosecutor's office. Before joining the prosecutor's office, Nie Yan had been a criminal defense lawyer. After being dismissed, she joined a small law firm and returned to being a lawyer.","Mu Mian looked at Nie Yan in front of her and felt she was so unfamiliar. The previous Nie Yan, although she didn't smile much, had a light in her eyes. But now, Nie Yan's expression was cold, reminding her of Lin Qianjie's defense lawyer.","\"Officer Fang, you have no evidence to prove that my client is related to Lin Qianjie's poisoning case. Summoning her here privately is a violation of procedure. We have the right to file a complaint against you!\" Nie Yan's tone was a bit aggressive.","Fang Rui explained, \"This is not a summons. We just asked her to come here to understand some situations.\"","\"Then why are you detaining my client?\"","\"We're not detaining her. We'll let her go after we finish talking.\"","\"Can my client leave now?\"","\"...Yes!\"","Nie Yan left the city bureau with Lu Tian.","After get","ting in the car, Nie Yan held Lu Tian's hand, \"Lu Tian, don't be afraid!\"","\"Sister Nie Yan, they've guessed the truth. They'll soon find evidence to incriminate me! But it doesn't matter. Exchanging my life for that scumbag Lin Qianjie's is very worthwhile. And Wang Xiaoya died too, we've gained.\"","\"Lu Tian, do you trust my abilities?\" Nie Yan looked at Lu Tian.","Lu Tian said without hesitation, \"I trust you.\"","\"Then you should believe that you will be found not guilty.\" Nie Yan hugged Lu Tian. \"Lu Tian, no matter what evidence they find, you must not admit that you put the poison. You must deny it, firmly deny it. Leave the rest to me.\"","\"Alright, Nie Yan, thank you!\"","Lu Tian looked at the azure sky, the sunlight felt piercing to her eyes. Perhaps this world is very dark, but there will always be someone to be the light that illuminates this world.","She was willing to commit a crime for Shen Yuanyuan, and Nie Yan was also willing to do anything for her. Only girls would selflessly help other girls!"]},{"number":52,"title":"Chapter 52: Reversal of Judgment: Decisive Evidence","paragraphs":["After Nie Yan and her companions left, Fang Rui and his team held a brief case analysis meeting.","\"There are no fingerprints on the ice box, so we can't prove that Lu Tian ever touched it. There's no surveillance on the yacht either, so video evidence is impossible...\" Zhang muttered, \"We have no way to prove that Lu Tian was the one who poisoned them!\"","\"Lu Tian must have had some container or packaging for the poison when she brought it onto the yacht,\" Mu Mian said. \"But since the yacht was out at sea, she would have thrown it overboard, letting the evidence sink to the bottom of the ocean.\"","Everyone fell silent.","Although they had figured out the poisoning method and deduced who the culprit was, they couldn't find any evidence to incriminate the perpetrator.","Fang Rui said, \"Can we start by investigating the source of the poison? Lu Tian is from a rural area. Would they have any special channels to buy rat poison?\"","Zhang's eyes lit up, \"That makes sense!\"","After the meeting, Fang Rui had originally planned to go to Lu Tian's rural hometown with Zhang, but Mu Mian beat him to it, saying, \"Can I go with you? I know quite a bit about poisons.\"","\"Sure.\"","Lu Tian's hometown was far away. It took nearly four hours of driving to reach the entrance of their village.","The village was mostly populated by elderly people, with few young residents. Fang Rui bought a pack of cigarettes and a bottle of water at a small shop at the village entrance, then started chatting with the shopkeeper.","\"Shopkeeper, I heard there's an internet celebrity from your village. Do you know her?\"","\"Internet celebrity? How could we have one in a place like this?\" The shopkeeper suddenly slapped his forehead and said, \"Come to think of it, we actually do! It's that girl from the Lu family. I heard she makes quite a bit of money. But the way she makes money is a bit vulgar!\"","\"How is it vulgar?\"","\"Well, she dresses up all fancy and makes videos every day. Lots of men like her. But this child has always been pretty since she was little. Otherwise, her uncle wouldn't have...\" The shopkeeper suddenly stopped, as if remembering something.","\"Shopkeeper, being an internet celebrity is a legitimate job now. You shouldn't judge them with prejudice,\" Fang Rui guessed what he was about to say - Lu Tian had likely been molested by her uncle when she was young.","\"Everyone in the village says so. Even her mother scolds her for being improper. It's not just me saying this.\"","Fang Rui decided not to continue this topic. \"Shopkeeper, do you know where I can buy rat poison? I have a lot of rats at home and want to get rid of them.\"","\"Yes, I have some right here!\" The shopkeeper took out several rat glue traps. \"These work really well. Do you want to buy some?\"","\"I'm looking for rat poison, the really strong kind.\"","\"We don't have that. The government doesn't allow the sale of those. It's illegal!\"","\"Do you know where I could buy some?\" Fang Rui offered the shopkeeper a cigarette.","\"You probably can't buy it anywhere now. It's not available anywhere!\" The shopkeeper lit the cigarette and took a puff before continuing, \"About ten or fifteen years ago, there was a chemical factory in the next village that produced rat poison. But then the government banned its production, right? It's probably not available anymore.\"","\"Did anyone from your village work at that chemical factory?\"","\"Many did. That Lu family girl I mentioned earlier actually accidentally ate some rat poison when she was little. Luckily it was discovered early, and they made her drink a bowl of manure water to make her vomit it out. Otherwise, she would have died.\"","Fang Rui and Mu Mian exchanged a glance. The poison Lu Tian accidentally ingested back then was very likely to have been the same rat poison they were investigating.","\"Shopkeeper, thank you. You can keep this pack of cigarettes!\"","\"Aren't you going to smoke them yourself?\"","\"I don't smoke!\"","The shopkeeper laughed, thinking this person was quite strange to buy cigarettes without smoking.","Lu Tian's family home was a two-story old-style building. The house was dilapidated, with the surface lime corroded away, exposing the bricks underneath.","The courtyard wasn't paved with cement and looked uneven and potholed.","Fang Rui found it strange. Given Lu Tian's income, her parents shouldn't be living in such a rundown house. However, Lu Tian probably hated her parents and likely wouldn't spend money on them even if she earned a lot.","Lu's Mother looked confused when she saw Fang Rui at the door, not recognizing him. \"Who are you? What are you doing at my house?\"","\"We're from the police station. We suspect you have a highly toxic rat poison called tetramine in your home,\" Mu Mian looked at Lu's Mother with a serious expression. \"Please hand it over immediately, or you'll face legal consequences.\"","Lu's Mother looked utterly bewildered. \"What tetramine? Where would we have such a thing? Who told you this?\" She suddenly walked to the gate, put her hands on her hips, and shouted towards the entrance, \"Which one of you gossips has been making false reports? Where would we get such a toxic substance?\"","Mu Mian took out her phone and played a video recording. The background was a courtroom, where Lu's Mother was testifying that Lu Tian had been molested by a relative when she was young and had once attempted suicide by eating rat poison.","\"I... I did say that. What's the problem?\" Lu's Mother stammered.","\"Do you still have any rat poison at home?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"Rat poison? Are you here to collect it?\" Lu's Mother suddenly realized. \"We do have a small packet, it's been here for over ten years.\"","\"Can you find it and give it to us?\"","Lu's Mother went into a storage room filled with various items. As soon as the door opened, dust particles floated in the air.","\"Auntie, just tell me where it is, and I'll get it myself,\" Fang Rui put on gloves, then said to Mu Mian, \"Mu Mian, you take photos of the evidence from the side.\"","\"Alright.\"","Lu's Mother pointed to a dust-covered box on top of a cabinet.","Fang Rui was about to take it down when Mu Mian stopped him, \"Fang Rui, there are handprints on the box. Don't disturb them.\"","\"I see them.\"","Fang Rui first photographed the two faint handprints on the box, then carefully lifted the box down, avoiding the prints.","The box was about half a meter long, not very big, but it was full of various items, including expired pesticides and different plant seeds.","Lu's Mother pointed to a yellow paper package and said, \"That's the rat poison. It's been over ten years, I don't know if it's expired. I never dared to throw it away carelessly, afraid it might poison someone else's chickens or ducks.\"","While all the other items were covered in dust, the yellow paper package was clean, clearly indicating that someone had recently opened it and taken something out.","\"Has Lu Tian been home recently?\"","\"She hasn't been back for a while,\" Lu's Mother sighed. \"This child hates me to death. But I had no choice. If I didn't testify, that lawyer would have sent my son to jail. He's my only son. I had to testify.\"","\"When was the last time she came home?\"","\"I think it was in July, July 12th. She suddenly came back that day, didn't even stay overnight. She just packed some things and left. I don't even know why she came back.\"","\"Auntie, we need to take this box with us.\"","\"Go ahead and take it!\"","It was already 10 PM when Fang Rui drove back to the city. Mu Mian had been sleeping soundly but was woken up by the voice prompt at the highway toll station.","Mu Mian perked up a bit, \"Fang Rui, let's go back to the station when we get back. I want to run a toxicology test on the substances inside.\"","\"Mu Mian, it's already 10 PM.\" Fang Rui couldn't understand why Mu Mian was so eager to work. She had been exhausted earlier, but now she was suddenly full of energy.","\"But I'm not tired. I feel very awake now.\"","\"I'm very tired!\"","Mu Mian looked at Fang Rui for a moment before deciding to compromise, \"Alright, but you have to get up early tomorrow!\"","\"...\""]},{"number":53,"title":"Chapter 53: Reversal of Verdict: Innocence Defense","paragraphs":["The next day, Mu Mian had her sister drop her off at work early. She bought a beautiful cake and a cup of hot cocoa for Chen Xue.","Mu Mian thought Chen Xue might need some sweets to lift her mood after the events that were likely to upset her today.","When Chen Xue arrived at the office, Mu Mian had already sent all the items for toxicology testing, and now they were just waiting for the results.","\"Mu Mian, were you out burgling last night? Look at those dark circles under your eyes. You didn't sleep at all, did you?\" Chen Xue stared at Mu Mian for a moment, then commented, \"If you were a bit rounder, you could cosplay as a panda.\"","\"This is for you!\" Mu Mian handed Chen Xue the breakfast she had bought.","\"How did you know I hadn't eaten breakfast? You're so thoughtful!\"","\"Chen Xue,\" Mu Mian's expression turned serious, \"We may have found evidence proving Lu Tian's crime.\"","To Mu Mian's surprise, Chen Xue didn't seem upset or angry. She just kept taking bites of her bread, stuffing it into her mouth.","\"I knew you and Captain Fang would find evidence,\" Chen Xue said. \"That's good. At least this case can finally be solved.\"","\"Shouldn't you be condemning us?\" Mu Mian felt a bit frustrated, unable to read Chen Xue's expression.","\"We're law enforcement officers. Our job is to solve cases and catch criminals. If Lu Tian committed a crime, we should arrest her. Although I sympathize with Lu Tian, I won't cover for her.\"","\"Chen Xue, even if Lu Tian committed a crime, she's still our friend,\" Mu Mian consoled her.","\"Mian Mian, she won't consider us friends anymore. Ah, it's really the irony of fate. We couldn't bring a criminal like Lin Qianjie to justice, but now we have to arrest Lu Tian, the victim, with our own hands.\"","The toxicology results came back quickly. The yellow paper package indeed contained tetramethylenedisulfotetramine, a potent rodenticide.","The poison was mixed with some soil, and there was also soil in the poisoned wine at the crime scene. The impurities in the poison solution were the same, strongly suggesting it was the same batch of poison.","The palm print on the wooden box was also extracted. Based on the size of the palm print and the length of the fingers, it could be preliminarily determined that the print belonged to an adult female.","Fang Rui brought Lu Tian in for questioning again. This time, Nie Yan accompanied her.","Nie Yan's gaze towards Fang Rui and Mu Mian was ice-cold, as if accusing them of aiding evil.","Fang Rui had Wang from the technical department take Lu Tian's palm print and compare it with the one on the wooden box. The results showed that the two prints belonged to the same person.","Now they could almost convict Lu Tian.","But Fang Rui still decided to give Lu Tian a chance to confess.","In the interrogation room, Fang Rui and Captain Li questioned Lu Tian together.","\"Lu Tian, do you still want to deny it?\" Fang Rui placed a photo of the wooden box in front of Lu Tian. \"The poison was taken from this box, wasn't it?\"","\"I don't know what you're talking about.\"","\"You're very aware of anti-detection techniques. You wore gloves to handle the poison, but you forgot that the box was covered in dust, and your palm print was left on it.\" Fang Rui placed another photo of the palm print in front of Lu Tian. \"This can prove that you opened that box.\"","\"So what? Am I not allowed to touch things in my own home?\" Lu Tian retorted.","\"We also have your mother's testimony. All this evidence together forms a complete chain of evidence, enough to convict you!\"","Lu Tian looked at Fang Rui. \"I didn't do any of this. I don't know anything.\"","No matter what Fang Rui and Captain Li said after that, Lu Tian kept saying she didn't know, adamantly refusing to admit anything. Towards the end, Lu Tian started to ramble incoherently.","\"You're all bad people, you're framing me! You're all bad people, go away! Nie Yan, save me, I'm so scared...\"","The current evidence had already formed a complete chain. There were even photos proving that Lu Tian had been on that yacht. Her denial was useless. But to close the case, they needed to get Lu Tian's confession and signed admission of guilt.","Fang Rui suggested that Lu Tian see a psychologist first, but Captain Li insisted that with the complete chain of evidence, they would definitely get a confession. After he and his assistant interrogated Lu Tian for eight hours, they finally got her confession, and Lu Tian signed an admission of guilt. The case was officially closed.","After the case was closed, the prosecutor's office quickly filed public charges against Lu Tian, accusing her of intentional homicide.","On the day of the trial, Mu Mian thought for a long time and decided to go to court to observe. Chen Xue refused to go with her, not wanting to witness Lu Tian being judged. Mu Mian could only ask Fang Rui to accompany her.","The public gallery was full of people. Mu Mian saw Jiang Yun sitting in a corner of the gallery, still wearing sunglasses, her expression cold, showing no sign of having just experienced the loss of a child.","Lu Tian stood in the dock as the defendant, looking haggard and vacant. Nie Yan stood beside her, her gaze determined.","Not long ago, the two of them had also stood together, fighting a losing battle in court. Only now, they had changed from plaintiffs to defendants, from victims to perpetrators.","After the prosecutor finished reading the indictment, he thought the rest would be a mere formality, since Lu Tian's guilt was a foregone conclusion. His voice was monotonous, and the lengthy indictment was making people drowsy.","The prosecutor said, \"Defendant, do you have any objections to the charges in the indictment?\"","\"I didn't kill anyone!\"","The prosecutor's face changed slightly. He said, \"But the evidence provided by the police proves that you are the murderer, and you also gave a confession and signed an admission of guilt.\"","\"They subjected me to mental torture and forced me to confess. They even forced my hand to sign that admission of guilt.\" Lu Tian stood straight, \"I didn't kill anyone. I don't know what happened. I was framed!\"","The presiding judge warned, \"Defendant, the court reminds you that retracting your confession in court may increase your sentence.\"","\"Your Honor, I really didn't kill anyone. Someone controlled me to do it. It wasn't me. It was someone else.\"","The audience in the gallery started to murmur, everyone wondering if the defendant had gone insane. She looked like a madwoman.","Nie Yan said, \"Your Honor, my client suffers from dissociative conversion disorder, also known as multiple personality disorder. She has just experienced severe psychological trauma, her memory is confused, and in this situation, she may be experiencing intermittent amnesia.\"","The judge was a bit angry. He reminded, \"Counsel, the court is a very serious place. Please don't make up stories.\"","\"Your Honor, I have provided a psychiatric evaluation report. This report was jointly issued by four psychiatric experts and two psychological experts from the judicial center. This report is highly authoritative,\" Nie Yan emphasized the word 'authoritative' and continued, \"The report confirms that my client indeed suffers from dissociative conversion disorder.\"","\"My client is a completely mentally ill person. At the time of the incident, she was in a state where she could not recognize or control her own actions. Therefore, I request a not guilty plea for my client on grounds of insanity!\"","The prosecutor argued, \"Even if the defendant suffers from dissociative conversion disorder, she is only intermittently mentally ill. How can you prove that she was in an unconscious state when she administered the poison?\"","\"Prosecutor, it's you who believes she is intermittently mentally ill. The burden of proof lies with the one who makes the claim. So, you need to provide evidence to prove that my client was in a clear state of mind when she administered the poison.\" Nie Yan held up the evaluation report in her hand. \"This report can prove that my client is mentally ill, her mental state is extremely unstable, and she cannot control her own actions.\"","The judge announced a recess to reassess Lu Tian's mental state before reconvening for a retrial.","Fang Rui stopped Nie Yan, \"Nie Yan, you know very well that Lu Tian doesn't have dissociative conversion disorder at all. Having Lu Tian fake illness is illegal, and...\"","\"Fang Rui, I'm not the one saying she's ill. It's those psychiatric experts who say she's ill,\" Nie Yan interrupted Fang Rui. \"I'm just presenting that authoritative report.\"","\"You could use this to help reduce Lu Tian's sentence.\"","\"The law is not fit to judge Lu Tian,\" Nie Yan's lips curled into a mocking smile. \"Lu Tian asked me to ask you all, now that you know the whole truth, do you really think she's guilty?\"","Lu Tian felt that this world was deeply unfair. As a child, she had been molested by her own uncle, but no one sought justice for her. Not a single person condemned that beast. Instead, the neighbors constantly slut-shamed her, saying it was her fault for being too pretty, which led to her being molested.","Shen Yuanyuan was raped by Lin Qianjie, and no one stood up for her justice either. Countless strangers hurled the most vicious insults at Shen Yuanyuan, ultimately driving her to commit suicide by jumping off a building.","Was she committing a crime? She was merely avenging her childhood self, as well as seeking vengeance for the helpless Shen Yuanyuan who had jumped to her death.","She had tried to let the law judge scum like Lin Qianjie, but reality proved that it wouldn't work. So the only option left was to let that scumbag face her judgment.","Fang Rui didn't know how to answer this question.","Nie Yan gave them a cold look, then left the courthouse."]},{"number":54,"title":"Chapter 54: Reversal of Judgment: The Bright Ending","paragraphs":["\"Fang Rui, we can't stop Lin Qianjie's lawyer from getting him acquitted, and we can't stop Nie Yan from getting Lu Tian off the hook,\" Mu Mian consoled him. \"It's fair. All we can do is reveal the truth.\"","\"Mu Mian, you don't understand. Sometimes prison is actually the safest place,\" Fang Rui sighed. \"Do you think the Lin Family will let Lu Tian go? Only those with power and influence can exploit legal loopholes. Nie Yan is still too naive.\"","Mu Mian indeed didn't understand. She thought the world was so complicated. Why were there laws if so many people didn't obey them? Was it really that hard to follow the rules?","But she quickly figured it out. If there were no criminals, she and Fang Rui would be out of a job. Being unemployed meant no salary, no money to spend, and nothing to do every day. How boring and painful that would be.","\"Alright, don't think about such complex issues,\" Fang Rui patted Mu Mian's head. \"Otherwise your brain might short-circuit again.\"","\"Fang Rui, my brain is perfectly normal. It won't short-circuit.\"","The Judicial Appraisal Center organized a team of experts to conduct a comprehensive diagnosis of Lu Tian. They eventually issued a written report confirming that Lu Tian indeed suffered from dissociative conversion disorder.","One expert even scanned Lu Tian's brain and found organic changes, further corroborating that Lu Tian had a mental illness.","Shen Xiyin was also part of the expert team. She had raised objections, but they weren't accepted.","Previously, their Judicial Appraisal Center had already issued a report stating that Lu Tian suffered from dissociative conversion disorder. If they were to issue another report now saying Lu Tian didn't have this condition, their center's reputation would be ruined.","So Lu Tian had to be sick!","The Lin Family had also intervened, but they later gave up.","If Lu Tian went to prison, there was little they could do. But if Lu Tian entered a mental hospital, they would have plenty of ways to make her life a living hell!","Lin Qianjie had been killed by Lu Tian, and they didn't want Lu Tian to simply serve time in prison. That would be too easy for her.","Under the influence of various factors, the court finally made its ruling: \"...As the defendant is a person with complete mental illness and lacks civil capacity, this court rules that the defendant Lu Tian's charge of intentional homicide does not stand... Lu Tian needs to be confined for life in Jiangzhou City's Qingshan Mental Hospital...\"","Upon hearing the verdict, Nie Yan breathed a sigh of relief. She felt incredibly elated; she had finally won a case!","As Nie Yan was leaving the courthouse, she saw Fang Rui and Mu Mian waiting for her at the entrance.","\"Fang Rui, Mu Mian, if you're here to condemn me, please leave! If you're here to congratulate me on winning this case, then you're welcome to join my celebration party.\"","Fang Rui sighed, \"Nie Yan, you used to despise such despicable tactics.\"","\"Fang Rui, justice belongs to the victors. I won this case, so I represent justice,\" Nie Yan's tone carried a hint of arrogance and self-satisfaction. \"In the pursuit of justice, it's okay to use some tactics. I'll use despicable means to reach a bright outcome.\"","Nie Yan looked up at the azure sky, feeling only that the sunlight was too harsh. She seemed to have finally become the kind of person she used to hate the most.","But so what? Those in power could manipulate the law to exonerate themselves, so why couldn't she manipulate the law to save a poor girl who shouldn't be guilty?","The law was no longer sacred in her heart; justice would only belong to the victors.","\"Is the outcome really bright? Lu Tian will have to live in a mental hospital from now on. That's a terrifying place. In prison, people aren't free, but at least their minds are free. But in a mental hospital, people are not free, and neither are their minds. Moreover, the Lin Family won't let Lu Tian off. Nie Yan, you know very well what Lu Tian is about to face,\" Fang Rui reminded her. \"The only winner is you!\"","Nie Yan's body stiffened.","Shen Xiyin had also warned Nie Yan not to pursue a not guilty plea, because the consequence would be Lu Tian being confined to a mental hospital for life, a fate worse than prison.","She had suggested that Nie Yan could use Lu Tian's mental illness to apply for a reduced sentence. But Nie Yan had refused. She even prevented others from seeing Lu Tian.","Was it really just about getting Lu Tian acquitted? Nie Yan found herself unable to answer this question.","Nie Yan quickly regained her smile, \"It wasn't me who put her in a mental hospital, it was you. If you hadn't insisted on uncovering the truth, Lu Tian wouldn't have been prosecuted. You should be the ones feeling guilty! Doesn't a scumbag like Lin Qianjie deserve to die? Why did you have to catch the killer? Couldn't you have been incompetent just one more time?\"","\"A tragic experience is not an excuse for crime,\" Fang Rui retorted. \"If you commit a crime, you should face the consequences.\"","\"What about Lin Qianjie then? What consequences did he face?\"","Fang Rui didn't know how to answer this question. The world was inherently unfair; for the same act, different people had to pay different prices.","Nie Yan was too extreme. Previously, she had been too righteous, too believing in justice. When her sense of justice crumbled, she swung to the other extreme.","\"He was poisoned to death,\" Mu Mian answered softly. \"That's the price he paid for his misdeeds. If he hadn't exploited legal loopholes, he would have only served a few years in prison and could have quickly come out to continue his wrongdoings.\"","This time it was Nie Yan who was left speechless. Mu Mian didn't understand anything; her thinking was too simple. She couldn't comprehend this complex world at all.","Fang Rui tried to console Nie Yan, \"Your current mindset is problematic. You need to adjust it.\"","\"Mu Forensic Doctor, Police Officer Fang, I hope we won't meet again,\" Nie Yan's tone carried a hint of sadness. \"I'm now a criminal defense lawyer. I think if we meet again, we'll be opponents. I don't want to face opponents like you. But if we do meet, I'll still win!\"","Fang Rui watched Nie Yan's retreating figure, feeling a bit regretful. Nie Yan had once been an excellent prosecutor.","At this moment, he suddenly found himself being hugged tightly by Mu Mian.","Fang Rui looked down at Mu Mian, \"What's wrong?\"","\"I feel like you're very sad. But I don't know how to comfort you,\" Mu Mian sighed. \"I'm not good at comforting people.\"","Mu Mian remembered the night they drank together. It was Nie Yan's darkest moment, but she still said she would become the best prosecutor.","Nie Yan ultimately couldn't realize her dream.","When did Nie Yan change? Maybe it was when she lost case after case to Lin Qianjie's lawyer, or maybe it was the night she attempted suicide. She didn't kill herself, but she killed her naive self and adopted a new persona to face this complex world.","\"I'm just a bit regretful, but this is Nie Yan's own choice. I think that passionate Prosecutor Nie will forever remain in our memories.\"","Those who gaze into the abyss must also be wary of being swallowed by it.","\"Fang Rui, did you get over your sadness so quickly?\" Mu Mian's tone was a bit disappointed. She felt that hugging Fang Rui was quite nice, and she didn't expect him to be comforted so quickly.","\"Do you want me to keep being sad about Nie Yan?\"","\"Of course not. I don't want to see you sad,\" Mu Mian reluctantly let go of his embrace.","She suddenly thought of a serious question: if Fang Rui died, she would only be able to hug a cold corpse. She didn't like hugging corpses. She seemed to not want his remains as much now.","Mu Mian immediately pushed this strange thought out of her mind. How could she not want Fang Rui's remains? Had her brain really short-circuited from overthinking?","\"Fang Rui, I've lost another friend,\" Mu Mian mumbled dejectedly. \"I finally made two friends, and now they're both gone. Sigh, making friends is so hard. Fang Rui, I'm so sad.\"","\"Do you want me to hug you to comfort you?\"","\"If you sign this, I won't be sad anymore.\" Mu Mian quickly pulled out a donation agreement from her bag and handed the pen to Fang Rui. \"Just sign it, write 'Fang Rui' right here.\"","\"Mu Mian, it seems you're not sad anymore,\" Fang Rui stuffed the agreement back into Mu Mian's bag. \"Let's go, we're heading back.\"","Mu Mian was dumbfounded. She compromised, saying, \"Fang Rui, then just give me a hug. That way I won't feel so bad.\"","\"Sorry, but that offer of a hug has been rescinded. You don't need comforting now!\"","Mu Mian's face fell, looking like a bitter gourd. Indeed, one shouldn't be too greedy in life.","After winning this court case, Nie Yan's fame skyrocketed overnight. Suddenly, many parties involved in criminal cases sought her out as their defense attorney. She began a brilliant new chapter in her career in this fresh field.","However, she never went to see Lu Tian again."]},{"number":55,"title":"Chapter 55: Meeting an Old Friend","paragraphs":["After experiencing various twists and turns, the poisoning case of Lin Qianjie and Wang Xiaoya finally came to an end.","During the weekend holiday, Mu Mian accompanied Shen Xiyin to a very high-end sanatorium. This sanatorium integrated medical care and nursing, housing many wealthy people with health issues.","\"Mian, we'll be meeting Aunt shortly,\" Shen Xiyin handed the lily bouquet to Mu Mian, \"Remember to give her these flowers when you see her.\"","Mu Mian had heard about this Aunt Shen Min. Reportedly, she had gotten pregnant before marriage, then ran away with the child and eloped with that man, never returning to see the Shen family again. Shen's father despised this sister; he would get angry at anyone who mentioned Shen Min.","\"Alright, but why should I give them to her?\" Mu Mian asked curiously.","Shen Xiyin's tone was somewhat dejected, \"She might not like me very much.\"","Mu Mian was a bit surprised. Why would Aunt dislike her sister? No one could dislike her sister!","The nurse seemed to recognize Shen Xiyin and smiled warmly, \"Miss Shen, are you here to see Mrs. Shen again? Her condition has improved recently. She's sunbathing on the lawn outside now. Let me take you to her.\"","\"Alright, thank you, Nurse Li.\"","Mu Mian walked into the sanatorium's garden and saw an elegant woman sitting in a wheelchair reading a book. The sunlight fell on her face, giving her a soft appearance.","The woman looked very much like Shen Xiyin, so Mu Mian recognized her at once. She must be Aunt Shen Min.","\"Sister, is her leg injured?\"","Shen Xiyin shook her head and sighed, \"Her legs are healthy. Aunt has Alzheimer's disease. Sometimes she forgets she can walk. Her memory is very confused now; she often forgets many things.\"","\"She doesn't look very old. Why does she have Alzheimer's?\"","Shen Xiyin looked at Shen Min's not-so-aged face, as if seeing her own future through her.","\"She just turned sixty this year. It might be hereditary; our Eldest Uncle also developed this disease.\" Shen Xiyin's voice was so soft that Mu Mian could barely hear her.","\"Does she still remember Dad?\" Mu Mian asked.","\"Probably not. She's forgotten many things. She even forgot her own name. She only remembers her daughter.\"","Mu Mian walked up to Shen Min and handed her the flowers, \"Aunt, it's nice to meet you.\"","Feeling the sunlight blocked, Shen Min looked up displeased. She looked at Mu Mian as if seeing someone else through her: \"Miao Miao? Is that you, Miao Miao?\"","\"My name is Mu Mian, not Miao Miao,\" Mu Mian corrected, stuffing the flowers into Shen Min's arms. \"These flowers are for you. I hope they brighten your day.\"","Shen Min's eyes were a bit bewildered. She hugged the flowers, murmuring, \"Where has my Miao Miao gone? Why doesn't she come to see me?\"","Mu Mian felt sympathy for her. \"Is Miao Miao your daughter? What does she look like?\"","Shen Min pointed to the book in her hand for Mu Mian to see. Mu Mian then realized it wasn't a book, but a thick photo album. The open page showed a photo of a girl in a police uniform.","The girl was very young and pretty, making a peace sign with her fingers and smiling brightly.","\"Is she a police officer? I think I can help you find her and ask her to come see you.\" Mu Mian made a mental note of the police badge number, deciding to help Aunt find her daughter when she got back.","Shen Min's eyes suddenly lit up, \"Really? Mu Mian, can you help me find my daughter?\"","However, Shen Xiyin held Mu Mian back, signaling her not to promise this.","Shen Min didn't wait for Mu Mian's response and wrote beside the photo: Mu Mian promised to help me find Miao Miao.","After writing, she turned to the next page and continued looking at her daughter's photos. The entire album was filled with her daughter's pictures, from childhood to adulthood, capturing different moments. Each photo was accompanied by lengthy notes. This was how she prevented herself from forgetting her daughter.","Mu Mian thought this Miao Miao girl was so lucky to have a mother who loved her so much. But why was she so heartless, refusing to visit her own mother?","Through those notes, Shen Min seemed to gradually recover some memories: \"My Miao Miao was so obedient, why won't she come to see me? Has someone kidnapped her?\"","Her gaze began to search around, and when she saw Shen Xiyin, she became agitated: \"Get out! You're Shen Min, you hurt my daughter, get out!\"","\"Aunt, I'm Shen Xiyin.\" Shen Xiyin knew she was having another episode.","\"Shen Min, you killed my Miao Miao!\" Shen Min seemed to remember something and burst into tears, \"My Miao Miao is dead, you killed her, it was you!\"","She tried to attack Shen Xiyin like a madwoman. Nearby medical staff quickly came over to give Shen Min a sedative and then took her back to her room.","\"Sister, did Aunt's daughter die?\" Mu Mian picked up the photo album that had fallen to the ground and flipped through it casually. \"Was she killed by bad people? Was the bad person Aunt herself?\"","Mu Mian suddenly felt the situation was quite complex.","\"Yes, Miao Miao died,\" Shen Xiyin nodded, \"But she died of illness a few years ago. Aunt was deeply shocked and felt very guilty, thinking she hadn't taken good care of her daughter. This has also accelerated her condition.\"","\"That's so sad! She must have loved her daughter very much.\" Mu Mian envied this Miao Miao. If she died, Jiang Yun probably wouldn't even buy her an urn, let alone remember her.","But her sister would buy her the most beautiful and expensive urn, and choose the most scenic cemetery for her. Thinking of this, Mu Mian didn't envy Miao Miao as much anymore, because Miao Miao had died so young.","Shen Xiyin sighed, \"I thought if we came to keep her company and talk to her, it might improve her condition. I didn't expect it would upset her instead. Her condition is getting worse. Last time I visited her, her emotions weren't this unstable.\"","\"Then maybe I should come see her alone next time. She seems to like me,\" Mu Mian suggested.","\"Yes, she liked you a lot when you were very little.\"","\"She's met me before?\" Mu Mian searched her memory. \"But I don't remember meeting her.\"","\"You were just a baby then. Later, Aunt had a falling out with Dad, and she never came back. Dad also forbade us from mentioning her.\"","As they were about to leave, the nurse called out to them, \"Miss Shen, remember I told you last time about a gentleman who's been taking care of your aunt? He's here today too. He's in the Dean's office discussing medical cooperation. Would you like to meet him?\"","\"I'll sit here and wait for him.\"","Time ticked by slowly. Just as Shen Xiyin was losing patience and about to leave, the person appeared before them.","\"Senior Yi Nian? How come you're here?\" Mu Mian looked surprised to see him. \"Weren't you missing? I thought you might have been killed by kidnappers.\""]},{"number":56,"title":"Chapter 56: Madman","paragraphs":["\"Mu Mian, long time no see. Can't you wish me well for once? Why did you think I was kidnapped?\" Jiang Yinian reached out to pat Mu Mian's head, but she dodged.","\"You know I don't like people touching my head, not even my sister, and especially not you,\" Mu Mian reminded him. \"I don't want to end up bald like Xiao Bai.\"","Xiao Bai was an adorable little squirrel Mu Mian once had. It was so cute that everyone in her father's lab kept petting it, until its head became completely bald.","Jiang Yinian used to be Shen's father's most favored student, almost certainly destined to be the future successor of his lab. That's why he often visited the Shen family, and gradually got to know Mu Mian.","Back then, Mu Mian didn't like talking much and rarely paid attention to others.","Unlike Shen Xiyin who always went along with Mu Mian, Jiang Yinian often did disruptive things, like deliberately knocking down Mu Mian's block towers, adding colors to Mu Mian's finished drawings, and even hiding Mu Mian's beloved animal specimens, making her search everywhere.","At first, Mu Mian hated him, but gradually she got used to his behavior and even started to enjoy this confrontational interaction. It made Mu Mian feel like she was being treated as a normal person.","\"Senior Jiang, you really disappeared for a long time. You used to come play with me every week, but ever since my dad passed away, you suddenly vanished. I couldn't even reach you by phone. Senior Fabien said you were kidnapped by bandits and they'd kill you if they didn't get ransom money. I didn't have money then and couldn't borrow any. I didn't want to sell my specimen collection either, so I could only let you be killed. Seeing you alive now, I think Senior Fabien must have been lying to me.\"","At that time, Mu Mian wasn't very good at detecting lies. But now she could. She decided to call Senior Fabien later and give him a good scolding.","\"Mu Mian, I'm sorry. I left in a hurry and didn't have time to say goodbye,\" Jiang Yinian apologized to Mu Mian, but his eyes were fixed on Shen Xiyin.","Mu Mian shrugged, \"It's fine with me. But my sister is very angry. She doesn't even want to hear your name. You left in such a hurry, how could you not even attend my father's funeral? He liked you the most. It's a good thing ghosts don't exist in this world, otherwise, my father's ghost would have come out to scold you.\"","Jiang Yinian looked at Shen Xiyin, \"Xiyin, you have to believe me, what happened to your parents has nothing to do with...\"","Shen Xiyin interrupted him. She stood in front of Mu Mian, \"I don't know why you're taking care of my aunt, but please don't come anymore! She doesn't need your care!\"","\"Professor Shen always thought about this sister of his when he was alive. He mentioned her to me many times,\" Jiang Yinian explained. \"Coincidentally, her daughter is my cousin's wife. My cousin and his wife have passed away, so I have the responsibility and obligation to take care of Aunt Shen.\"","Shen Xiyin sneered, \"Don't you find this reason ridiculous? You don't even respect my father, and you expect me to believe you're kindheartedly taking care of his sister? Do you think you're the type of person who would suddenly become so benevolent? Although I don't know your purpose, please stay away from my family.\"","\"We used to be such good friends, why won't you believe me? I would never do anything to harm you or Mu Mian.\" Jiang Yinian's eyes looked hurt, and with his handsome features, his vulnerable expression made him look very innocent.","Mu Mian found it strange. Her sister and Jiang Yinian used to have a great relationship and never argued. Why did her sister hate him so much now?","Mu Mian suddenly remembered that when her parents died, her sister always prevented her from seeing the bodies. Could it be that they didn't die in a car accident?","It seemed like her sister was hiding many things from her.","\"Mu Mian, let's go home.\"","On the way back, Mu Mian felt the atmosphere in the car was very tense. This was the first time she had seen her sister so angry. Shen Xiyin had extremely strong control over her emotions and had almost never lost her composure in front of Mu Mian.","\"Sister, didn't Mom and Dad die in a car accident?\" Mu Mian asked.","Shen Xiyin didn't answer this question, \"Mian, if you see that man in the future, stay far away from him, okay?\"","Mu Mian nodded, then asked in confusion, \"Why? Senior Jiang is a good person.\"","\"He's very dangerous, he's a madman,\" Shen Xiyin explained. \"He might hurt you.\"","\"He seems normal. Why would he want to hurt me?\"","\"Maybe because he hates Dad for firing him and publicly humiliating him. He might be holding a grudge and wanting to take revenge on us.\"","\"But we're friends with him. He was always nice to me before,\" Mu Mian felt Shen Xiyin's judgment was wrong. \"Besides, Fang Rui will protect me.\"","\"Mian, some people are nice to you for a reason. Beneath their kind exterior, they harbor great malice. We need to stay away from these people.\"","Mu Mian didn't quite understand, but she agreed anyway. She now had friends like Chen Xue and Fang Rui, so losing one friend didn't matter much.","\"Mian, don't think too much about it. I can handle those things myself.\"","\"Okay. If you can't handle it, I'll help you.\" Mu Mian had great faith in her sister's abilities. As long as her sister wanted to do something, she could do anything well.","Just as they arrived downstairs, Mu Mian saw an uninvited guest waiting for them.","Mu Mian cautiously looked at Shen Xiyin. She felt her sister was a bit unlucky today, encountering people she didn't like.","\"Mu Mian, Mom's here to see you.\" Jiang Yun saw Mu Mian and immediately came forward. She changed her previous cold attitude and started to appeal to emotions, \"Look, what did Mom bring for you? A gift!\"","Mu Mian was unhappy. It turned out she was unlucky too.","Jiang Yun handed the exquisite gift box to Mu Mian.","Mu Mian took a look. The box was pink, and the ribbon on the box was another shade of pink. She hated pink the most.","\"Miss Shen, can I talk to Mu Mian alone?\" Jiang Yun said to Shen Xiyin. She felt Shen Xiyin was controlling Mu Mian, making her distance herself from Jiang Yun.","Mu Mian directly refused, \"Ms. Jiang, I have nothing to talk about with you.\"","\"Mu Mian, don't call me Ms. Jiang. Call me Mom, okay?\" Jiang Yun frowned at Mu Mian. \"It makes Mom very sad when you do that.\"","\"No!\" Mu Mian looked down at her toes. \"The reason I wanted to find you before was because I thought you were living in poverty. If that was the case, I could give you some money to make your life a bit better. I never intended to reconnect with you. Now you're very rich and living well, so I'm relieved. I don't want to see you anymore in the future.\"","\"Mu Mian, I'm your mother. You can't treat me like this,\" Jiang Yun held Mu Mian's hand. \"Can you give Mom a chance? Mom wants to make it up to you.\"","Mu Mian jerked her hand away as if electrocuted. \"Ms. Jiang, I thought I made myself clear. I don't want to see you.\"","\"Mu Mian, Mom had her reasons for doing what she did before. Mom loves you. Won't you come back to Mom?\"","Mu Mian shook her head. She couldn't understand why Jiang Yun, who used to despise her, suddenly became so full of maternal love. Did she have some special purpose?","But that didn't matter. Just like Jiang Yun didn't matter to her at all!","\"Sister, let's go home,\" Mu Mian tugged at Shen Xiyin's hand. \"I'm very hungry. I need to eat.\"","\"Mian, you go back first. There are sandwiches in the fridge you can eat. I want to talk with her for a bit.\"","\"Don't talk to her for too long,\" Mu Mian whispered to Shen Xiyin. \"She's a bad person. But don't be afraid. If she hurts you, I'll have Fang Rui arrest her.\"","\"Don't worry, she can't hurt us.\"","\"But she's powerful and influential. We can't fight against her,\" Mu Mian made a sour face. \"We only have money.\"","Through Lu Tian's lawsuit, Mu Mian deeply realized that there were many people in this world who didn't obey the law and wouldn't be punished.","\"Mian, aren't you very hungry?\"","\"Yes, I'm going back to eat sandwiches now.\"","Jiang Yun heard their conversation clearly. She felt a bit dejected, realizing that in Mu Mian's heart, she had already been defined as a bad woman.","Jiang Yun suppressed her emotions and handed Shen Xiyin a business card. \"Miss Shen, I've established a foundation specifically to help children with autism. I'd like you to manage it. Would you be willing to work for the foundation?\"","\"I'm not in need of a job, and I've only treated one autistic patient, Mu Mian. I won't be treating any other autistic patients,\" Shen Xiyin didn't take her card. \"If you have something to say, just say it. I'm very busy and don't have time to listen to you beat around the bush.\"","\"If you don't want this job, I can give you a large sum of money. You can name any amount, as long as you give Mu Mian back to me...\"","\"Give her back to you?\" Shen Xiyin scoffed. \"You've ignored Mu Mian all these years. Later, when I found you and asked you to see Mu Mian, you refused. Why are you suddenly so concerned about Mu Mian now?\"","Jiang Yun's face showed embarrassment, but she emphasized, \"Miss Shen, whether you believe it or not, I love Mu Mian. I refused to see her before because I hated her father. Seeing Mu Mian would remind me of those painful things from the past.\"","Shen Xiyin interrupted her, \"I'm not interested in the story between you and Uncle Mu. As far as I know, you were the one who had an affair, and you were the one who abandoned Uncle Mu and Mu Mian.\"","\"He's slandering me!\" Jiang Yun's tone suddenly rose. \"Xiyin, you were young then. You couldn't understand adult matters. I truly love Mu Mian, and I want to make it up to her.\"","\"Mrs. Jiang, what you want isn't Mu Mian, is it? You just want those experts to study Mu Mian. You want to know why she was able to recover, don't you?\""]},{"number":57,"title":"Chapter 57: The Abandoned Gift","paragraphs":["Jiang Yun's expression stiffened, but she still defended herself, \"Miss Shen, don't think so badly of me. I want my daughter back. Is that too much to ask?\"","\"You have a son named Lin Qianyan with your current husband. He's also autistic.\"","\"How do you know that?\"","Jiang Yun was shocked. Shen Xiyin had investigated her. They had kept Lin Qianyan's autism a secret, and almost no one outside knew about it. She realized she had underestimated Shen Xiyin.","Shen Xiyin sneered, \"You know very well that they have autism because of your genetic defect, so all the children you give birth to are autistic. You're the one who caused Mu Mian's autism, and you cruelly abandoned her. Yet I don't see any guilt on your face. You're truly a cold-blooded woman.\"","With her true motives exposed, Jiang Yun dropped her pretense. \"Miss Shen, since you know about Qianyan's condition, can you help him?\"","\"What do you think autism treatment is? A surgery? Or just taking a few pills to get better? It's a long and arduous process, involving countless training sessions and interventions, requiring immense patience and love. A cold-hearted person like you wouldn't understand.\"","\"Miss Shen, I'm not here to negotiate. I'm Mu Mian's biological mother. I have the responsibility and obligation to take care of her. If we go to court, I think you'd lose!\"","\"Mu Mian is an adult. She has the right to choose who she lives with. Do you think she'd choose you?\" Shen Xiyin paused, then mockingly added, \"Or do you also want to have Mu Mian diagnosed as mentally ill so you can get custody of her?\"","\"I wouldn't use such dirty tactics. However, I have many ways to make you compromise. Xiyin, have you forgotten? I used to be good friends with your parents. I know a thing or two about their affairs.\"","Shen Xiyin's smile instantly vanished, her eyes turning cold. \"Of course you know. Jiang Yinian is your nephew, and you're currently funding his lab. You sent him to my father back then, didn't you?\"","\"No, that's not true. I didn't orchestrate this. He's my brother's illegitimate son. I only found out about him a few years ago. And your father's car accident wasn't Yinian's doing. He didn't steal your father's research materials either. Yinian suddenly returned to the country after your father's accident because his mother had passed away. He came back for the funeral. Someone is framing him! Xiyin, you have too many misunderstandings about us.\"","Jiang Yun patted Shen Xiyin's shoulder, \"I've watched you grow up. You should trust your aunt's character. You should investigate others. There were so many people in your father's lab, they're all suspects.\"","\"I know your kind too well. People like you would do anything to achieve your goals,\" Shen Xiyin struggled to control her emotions.","\"Xiyin, so you should agree to my request and give Mu Mian back to me,\" Jiang Yun's tone carried a threat.","Shen Xiyin hesitated for a moment, then took out a document from her bag and handed it to Jiang Yun. \"This is Michelle's information. She's the most authoritative expert in the field of autism. She was my teacher. I can help you contact her to provide intervention therapy for your son.\"","\"Is she the therapist who cured Mu Mian? So she can cure Qianyan's autism too?\" Jiang Yun's tone was eager.","Shen Xiyin found it laughable. So Jiang Yun didn't hate autistic children, she just didn't love Mu Mian.","As Jiang Yun reached for the document, Shen Xiyin pulled it back. \"I can help you, but you need to agree to two conditions first.\"","\"What conditions?\"","Shen Xiyin spoke slowly and clearly: \"First, you and Jiang Yinian will never appear in front of Mu Mian again. You can't disturb Mu Mian and my aunt's life. Second, you make the Lin Family leave Lu Tian alone.\"","\"I don't quite understand the second condition. Why are you helping Lu Tian?\"","\"Lu Tian is my patient, and she's also Mu Mian's friend. I hope you can leave her alone. Actually, with Lin Qianjie dead, you're the biggest beneficiary, aren't you? Or rather, Lin Qianjie's current fate was orchestrated by you. You indulged his misconduct, suppressed him, and turned him into a psychologically unstable wreck. This way, he posed no threat to you and was completely under your control.\"","\"I can agree to these two conditions. I can even have the hospital give Lu Tian preferential treatment. You're right, I deliberately ruined Lin Qianjie. Now that he's dead, the Lin Family's property belongs entirely to my Qianyan.\" Jiang Yun no longer tried to hide from Shen Xiyin, feeling she had Shen Xiyin completely in her grasp.","\"Michelle will be coming next week for a conference. I'll bring her to see you then.\"","\"Can she cure Qianyan?\"","\"Mrs. Jiang, autism can't be cured, only the symptoms can be improved. But she'll do her best to help you.\"","\"Good, I hope we can cooperate pleasantly.\"","\"Here's a friendly reminder: you'd better stay away from that lunatic Jiang Yinian. You can't control him.\"","\"How can Yinian be a lunatic? He's a medical genius, the pride of our family, and your father's most satisfactory student.\" Jiang Yun was very fond of this nephew. The new drugs he had developed over the years had earned her a lot of money.","As Jiang Yun was leaving, Shen Xiyin called out to her, \"Give me that gift box. I'll give it to Mu Mian for you.\"","Jiang Yun looked surprised, \"Didn't you tell me not to disturb Mu Mian's life?\"","\"If this gift box remains unopened, Mu Mian will always wonder about it. But once it's opened, Mu Mian will know that inside is just an expensive item without any genuine sentiment,\" Shen Xiyin said, \"Just like her feelings towards you - once she sees you, the illusion is shattered.\"","\"Miss Shen, this is a gift I carefully selected,\" Jiang Yun defended herself. \"Is it because you've been brainwashing Mu Mian, telling her I don't love her, that she has that attitude towards me?\"","\"Isn't it a fact that you don't love her? Or have you acted for so long that you actually believe you're a caring mother?\"","Jiang Yun was left speechless. She did feel guilty about Mu Mian, but that little guilt was nothing compared to her love for power and status.","When Shen Xiyin entered, Mu Mian was reading a book, though not very attentively. As soon as Shen Xiyin came in, Mu Mian fixed her gaze on the gift box in her hand.","\"Sister, I don't want her gift,\" Mu Mian hid her face behind the book, trying not to look at the box.","Shen Xiyin pushed the gift box into Mu Mian's hands, \"Open it. Otherwise, you'll be thinking about it and unable to sleep for days.\"","\"Alright, I just really want to know what's inside. You know I have OCD. When I see a gift box, I just want to open it.\"","\"Mm-hmm, go ahead and open it.\"","Mu Mian carefully untied the ribbon and opened the box. Inside was a pink handbag.","Mu Mian opened the bag, but it was empty.","\"Sister, there's no gift, no card. Did she forget to put the gift inside?\" Mu Mian searched every corner of the bag but still couldn't find what she was hoping for.","\"I think the bag is the gift,\" Shen Xiyin reminded her.","\"I hate pink!\" Mu Mian was very unhappy. \"This bag is so small, it can't hold anything. Why would she give me this? She's terrible at giving gifts.\"","Shen Xiyin was also at a loss. Was this really the gift Jiang Yun had carefully chosen? There was no sincerity at all.","\"You don't like it?\"","\"No, I don't!\"","Shen Xiyin suggested, \"Then throw it away. Don't let useless things take up space.\"","\"That makes sense. It's really ugly!\" Mu Mian threw the bag along with the box into the trash can and went back to her book.","\"Mu Mian, you don't need to worry about Lu Tian anymore. I have a friend working at that hospital. He promised me he'd take good care of her. The Lin Family won't harm her either.\"","\"Sister, how did you manage that?\"","\"Whatever you want, sister will always try her best to get it for you.\"","Mu Mian's eyes lit up, \"Then can you get Fang Rui to donate his body to me?\"","\"Some things you need to work for yourself, you know.\"","\"Alright, I'm going to tell Fang Rui and the others this good news.\"","Fang Rui was at his parents' house when he received Mu Mian's call.","\"Fang Rui, my sister has dealt with those evil forces. She said Lu Tian will be well taken care of in the mental hospital,\" Mu Mian said proudly. \"My sister is amazing, isn't she?\"","\"Mm-hmm.\"","After hanging up the phone, Fang Rui heard his mother say, \"Fang Rui, have you made up your mind? As long as you agree to go on the blind date, I'll help you settle things with the Lin Family and make them leave Lu Tian alone.\"","Fang Rui grabbed his jacket and headed for the door. \"I'm sorry, but that deal is off now. Mom, you don't need to make me dinner. I have something to take care of, so I'm heading back.\"","\"Fang Rui, you little rascal. You come running home calling 'Mom, Mom' when you need something, but you won't even stay for a meal when you don't. Hey, are you really not going to eat? I cooked myself, won't you at least try it?\"","\"Mom, goodbye! Save all those delicious dishes for Dad, he loves them. I won't intrude on your romantic time together.\" Fang Rui quickly made his escape.","Mom's cooking... was quite unpalatable."]},{"number":58,"title":"Chapter 58: Ghost House Mystery: Terror Experience","paragraphs":["That morning, the police received a report of a murder at an escape room in a downtown shopping mall.","Fang Rui and Mu Mian drove to the mall.","The escape room was called \"Poe's Cottage,\" located on the fourth floor of the mall.","Last month, this place was chosen as a filming location for a popular variety show, which made it suddenly famous. Many young people liked to choose it as a team-building venue. The customer flow increased dramatically.","The owner of the store was wealthy and rented an entire floor for the venue. The exterior decoration style was Gothic horror, and as soon as one reached the fourth floor, they could feel a terrifying and chilling atmosphere that sent shivers down one's spine.","\"Officers, you're finally here.\" The store manager hurried over when he saw the police arrive. The manager's name was Wang Huajian, a middle-aged man in his forties wearing black-framed glasses. He looked very anxious at the moment.","\"Where was the body found? Please take us there.\"","\"Inside the escape room, the body was discovered in the hidden level called 'Bride and Groom Collection Room'.\"","The manager led them inside while explaining the situation, \"We rarely go to that room normally. We didn't expect someone to hang themselves in there. Fortunately, it was discovered in time. If it had been found any later, the body would probably have started to decay and smell.\"","After discovering the body, the manager immediately sealed off the scene, both to protect the site and prevent the news from spreading, which could affect their store's reputation.","The room the manager was taking them to was part of a scenario called \"Escape from the Mental Hospital,\" which was their most popular escape room.","Players need to find various clues and props to deduce the correct escape route. Along the way, they encounter many horrifying scenes, such as a blood-splattered operating room, a collection room full of human organs, a gallows room hung with corpses... During the game, people dressed as ghosts or mental patients wielding chainsaws would attack the players.","\"Ah! What's this thing?\" Zhang accidentally touched a bone hanging on the wall, and suddenly a human head dropped from the ceiling, hitting Zhang in the face. Zhang looked up, his eyes meeting a pair of pale eyes with a blue glow.","\"You need to be careful, don't touch things randomly. There are many small traps here. They're not dangerous, just a bit scary,\" the manager warned.","These traps needed to be manually turned off, which was troublesome, so even though a murder had occurred, the manager still hadn't stopped those mechanisms.","He was thinking that once the police removed the body, he would continue business as usual. The store had quite a large customer flow, and even though it was a weekday, there were still quite a few players coming to play.","Mu Mian curiously touched the human head. She found that the face was made of silicone, with very realistic features that looked real at first glance. It felt cold and soft to the touch, quite pleasant to feel.","\"Dr. Mu, don't just touch it, help me get it away!\" Zhang was on the verge of tears. The head was right in his face, and he didn't dare to touch it or move, stuck in an awkward position.","Chen Xue silently helped him remove it.","\"Zhang, don't be afraid. Stay behind me, I'll protect you!\" Chen Xue said to Zhang.","\"Okay!\" Zhang clung to Chen Xue's arm, trembling.","Wang from the tech department was also shaking, \"Chen Xue, I'm scared too. What kind of place is this?\"","\"Wang, you're a man, be brave!\" Chen Xue encouraged Wang.","\"...\" Wang was speechless. Chen Xue was so biased. Why was it okay for Zhang not to be brave? Well, who could blame him for being single?","Mu Mian picked up a corpse from the ground, pinching its scarred hand to show Zhang and Wang, \"These corpses are all fake! Feel them, human skin can't possibly be this elastic. Why are you afraid of something fake?\"","\"Ah, Dr. Mu, take it away, take it away quickly!\" Zhang shrank behind Chen Xue, tightly hugging her arm, \"It's not that I'm a coward, it's just that this place triggers my fear of certain things that shouldn't exist after the founding of the country! I'm not afraid when encountering real corpses.\"","Chen Xue said to Mu Mian, \"Mian Mian, stop scaring Zhang. He's timid.\"","\"Alright.\" Mu Mian put the prop corpse back in its place.","Mu Mian then looked at Fang Rui, \"Fang Rui, are you scared? If you're afraid, you can hide behind me. I'm not afraid of these things. I'll protect you.\"","\"Not really scared.\" Fang Rui was a firm materialist, and besides, he had been forced to watch horror movies with his mother since childhood, so he was already immune to these startling horror scenes.","\"Okay.\" Mu Mian's tone was somewhat disappointed, \"You're quite brave.\"","The hidden level was in the innermost part of the escape room, considered the final scene.","The further they went, the more horrifying the scenes became. The air conditioning on the wall occasionally blew cold air, giving a feeling of chilly gusts. The props inside were made extremely realistically, providing a fully immersive experience.","Chen Xue was also starting to struggle, holding hands with Zhang as they walked carefully, afraid of triggering any traps or having strange human organs or bizarrely shaped creatures suddenly jump out.","This wasn't an escape room at all; it was practically a haunted house! It required courage rather than intelligence!","\"You seem a bit timid,\" the manager said, noticing Zhang and the others trembling in fear. He tried to lighten the mood, \"We've already turned off many of the traps now, and we've turned on more lights. The people pretending to be ghosts aren't coming out either, so it's not as scary anymore. If you have time another day, you should come and experience it!\"","\"No, thanks.\" If it weren't for solving the case, they would never come to this man-made haunted place again!","Mu Mian looked at Chen Xue, who was practically hugging Zhang now, and couldn't help but remind her, \"Chen Xue, you're a forensic expert. You're not afraid of real corpses, why are you scared of fake ones?\"","\"Because real corpses don't sway back and forth, they don't suddenly grab my leg, and they don't make scary noises,\" Chen Xue said, shaking.","\"Chen Xue, don't be afraid, I'll protect you!\" Zhang said in a weak voice.","\"...You'd better protect yourself first,\" Wang commented sourly.","Is it really that scary? Mu Mian tilted her head to look at Fang Rui: \"Fang Rui, if you feel scared, you can hold my hand. I won't make fun of you for being timid.\"","\"I'm not very scared!\"","\"Really not scared?\"","\"...Really.\" Fang Rui couldn't understand why Mu Mian looked so disappointed that he wasn't afraid.","Fang Rui had been observing the structure of the escape room. He found that this theme focused on horror, with the deduction part being quite simple. Players just needed to keep walking forward to easily find the exit — provided they were brave enough.","Although they had only walked for a few short minutes, it felt like the longest few minutes of Zhang and the others' lives. Meanwhile, Mu Mian had spent an incredibly exciting few minutes. She never knew there were such fun places.","She decided that on her next day off, she would spend an entire day here.","The manager stopped at a room. The room was decorated like a bridal chamber, with a skeleton bride standing by the door, wearing a beautiful wedding dress and a crown on her head. Its hollow eyes were staring intently at them.","\"The key to triggering this hidden level, 'Bride and Groom Collection Room,' is to hug this skeleton bride,\" the manager said, pointing at the skeleton bride. \"Many players don't think of this, so very few discover this hidden level. Isn't this design clever?\"","Mu Mian's eyes lit up as she looked at the skeleton bride, \"Can I hug it?\"","Fang Rui held Mu Mian back, stopping her action, \"It's been hugged by many people. It's covered in bacteria.\"","\"Alright then.\"","The manager went over and hugged the bride. With a whoosh, the black wallpaper painted with fluorescent skulls was pushed up, revealing an electronic screen.","A string of numbers appeared on the electronic screen: 1,12.35.914.2741.81; () Please find the pattern in this string of numbers, deduce the next number according to the pattern, and fill it in the brackets.","\"Just a moment, I need to find the password,\" the manager took out a piece of paper from his pocket with many strings of numbers written on it. \"This puzzle appears randomly, there are many questions, and I can't remember all the passwords. Let me find it.\"","The store manager seemed very anxious. As a result, the more frantic he became, the harder it was for him to find the password.","Mu Mian put on her gloves and typed the numbers on the screen: 122.243."]},{"number":59,"title":"Chapter 59: Ghost House Mystery: The Hanging Body","paragraphs":["With a whoosh, a door appeared on the wall directly opposite the bride, and it slowly opened.","The Shop Manager looked at Mu Mian with shock, \"Have you seen our shop's walkthrough? How did you know the password?\"","\"It's a simple numerical reasoning problem. The numbers are divided into two parts, the decimal part is a geometric sequence with a common ratio of three. The integer part is also a sequence, where the differences between adjacent numbers form a new sequence, which is again a geometric sequence with a common ratio of three,\" Mu Mian explained earnestly.","The manager was dumbfounded, feeling dizzy just hearing her explanation. How could this be called simple?","Zhang and the others were no longer surprised, as Mu Mian's mental processing ability was on a different level from theirs.","\"Is this touchscreen cleaned regularly?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"Yes, about once a week. We haven't had the chance to clean it this week, as the discovery of the corpse disrupted our work schedule.\"","Fang Rui turned to Wang, \"Wang, collect fingerprints from the touchscreen.\"","To enter this hidden level, the killer would have had to input the password, so they might have left fingerprints on the screen. Of course, it was also possible that the killer had worn gloves while entering the password.","\"Yes, boss!\"","The Shop Manager led them into the hidden level.","The room was dark. The manager felt for an eyeball on the wall, and suddenly the room lit up with a pale green light, revealing numerous prop corpses dressed as brides or grooms.","The corpses appeared in male-female pairs, all with wound makeup on their faces. Some were hung on the walls, others suspended from the ceiling. Above their heads hung several empty nooses, as if waiting for new victims to be hung.","\"These are all prop corpses,\" the Shop Manager said, pointing to a male corpse dressed as a groom hanging above their heads. \"Except for that one. It's a real corpse, and we don't know how it got up there.\"","The corpse was suspended by a noose made of thick hemp rope. The deceased's face was pale, and his red tongue was slightly protruding. Combined with his bloody and horrific makeup, the sight was extremely eerie.","He wore a blood-stained black suit with a corsage on his chest. At first glance, there was no difference between him and the other prop corpses.","\"Today, when our staff came in here to clean, they found an extra groom prop. At first, they thought some thoughtless player had moved it from another scene, which wasn't uncommon. Players often did such inconsiderate things.","Later, while cleaning the floor, the corpse's shoe touched their face, and that's when they realized the corpse was wearing AJs. They immediately knew something was wrong - who would put brand-name shoes on a prop corpse? When they touched it, they realized it was a real corpse. We called the police right away,\" the Shop Manager described how they discovered the body.","\"Was the corpse in this state when you found it?\" Mu Mian asked.","\"Yes. We know some basics about crime scene preservation, so we didn't touch the body and immediately sealed off the scene.\"","Fang Rui asked, \"Do you recognize this person? Is he a regular at your shop?\"","The manager immediately shook his head, \"I don't recognize him. His face is in this state, how could anyone tell who he is?\"","The corpse was hanging quite high, and it would be troublesome to take down. Just as Fang Rui was about to ask the manager for a ladder, the manager said, \"The rope's height can be controlled by a mechanism. By sliding the mechanism, it can go up or down. Do you want to lower the body?\"","\"Yes.\"","There were many skeleton hands on the wall. The manager found the one directly opposite the corpse and slid the ring on the skeleton hand outward. The corpse slowly began to descend, soon reaching the ground.","\"This is another small mechanism. If players touch the rings on these skeletons, the hanging corpses will rise or fall,\" the manager explained, adding, \"Isn't this design creative? It's unique to our shop!\"","\"...\" Zhang was speechless, seeing that the manager was quite pleased with their terrifying and inconsiderate mechanisms.","The lighting wasn't very good, so Mu Mian could only roughly examine the body.","The deceased's face was pale, with a deep ligature mark on the neck. The mark was located between the hyoid bone and the thyroid cartilage, deepest near the throat and gradually becoming shallower on both sides.","The corneas were highly cloudy, with black spots on the sclera. The oral mucosa and conjunctiva showed signs of autolysis, and the abdomen was swollen due to decomposition. The livor mortis was approaching the fixation stage. From these characteristics, it could be deduced that the victim had been dead for 18-20 hours.","\"The time of death should be between 3 and 5 PM yesterday,\" Mu Mian frowned, saying, \"The cause of death appears to be hanging.\"","\"Hanging? You mean he committed suicide?\" the Shop Manager exclaimed, \"Good heavens, why would he come to my shop to commit suicide? Isn't this bad for my business? He could have died anywhere, why here?\"","\"Hanging doesn't necessarily mean suicide,\" Mu Mian corrected him. \"Hanging is death caused by asphyxiation due to the pressure of gravity on the neck. In layman's terms, he was hanged. There are two possibilities: he hanged himself, or someone vertically suspended him.\"","\"That seems unlikely. It's not easy to hang a living person. Shouldn't a murderer strangle their victim?\" The manager had some knowledge about murder cases.","Mu Mian explained, \"We can distinguish between strangulation and hanging by the pattern of the ligature mark. In hanging, the victim's own weight acts vertically on the neck, so the force is uneven, resulting in a ligature mark that varies in depth and has gaps.","In strangulation, external mechanical force is applied to the neck. Since the neck is roughly circular, the force is more evenly distributed, resulting in a more consistent depth of the ligature mark.","Moreover, in most strangulation cases, the ligature marks intersect.","This corpse's ligature mark is inconsistent in depth, and the face is pale, which can prove that he died from hanging. If he had been strangled, his face would be purplish-red. Like those prop corpses hanging up there. Your prop corpses aren't very professionally made.\"","The shop owner fell silent.","Fang Rui examined the room for a while. He reached out and moved the ring on a skeleton hand. When he slid it outward, the rope would descend, the distance correlating with how far he slid the ring. When he slid the ring inward, the rope slowly ascended, the distance again related to how far he slid the ring.","Looking at the empty noose, he suddenly seemed to understand the killer's method.","He turned to Mu Mian, \"Could the killer have first knocked out the victim, then put the noose around his neck, slid the ring to make the rope slowly rise, and let the victim be hanged to death? Did he use this method to try to make it look like suicide?\"","\"But he was able to crack the password at the entrance. Although that password isn't very complex, the fact that he solved it proves he's not a stupid person. How could he naively think this would disguise it as suicide? That idea is too foolish.\"","\"...\" Fang Rui felt he had been indirectly insulted. Was he also stupid for suggesting this theory?","\"Fang Rui, you're very smart, don't doubt yourself,\" Mu Mian comforted him.","\"...\"","There were no surveillance cameras inside this room, but cameras were installed at the entrance and exit of the escape room, and they were functional. Fang Rui took the surveillance footage from the past month.","Back at the police station, Mu Mian cleaned off the heavy makeup on the deceased's face, revealing his clean, fair complexion. The victim had average looks with heavy dark circles under his eyes, indicating he might have been a night owl.","Apart from the abrasions on his neck, there were no other external injuries on his body, and no signs of struggle. This suggested he hadn't resisted before death.","The victim wore a suit on the outside, with a long-sleeved sweatshirt and blue jeans underneath. The suit jacket was directly put on over his other clothes. His inner clothing was neat, without any twisting that would indicate a struggle.","Mu Mian also took a blood sample from the victim for toxicology screening.","Fang Rui found a mobile phone in the victim's pocket, and they quickly identified the deceased.","The deceased was named Liu Xiaonian, a 24-year-old unemployed individual who lived with his parents and relied on them for financial support. Liu Xiaonian was also an enthusiast of escape room games."]},{"number":60,"title":"Chapter 60: Mystery of the Haunted House: The Room Enthusiast","paragraphs":["Fang Rui and Zhang went to Liu Xiaonian's home to gather information.","Liu Xiaonian's parents were both middle school teachers - his mother taught Chinese language and his father taught physics. They lived in an old residential compound for teaching staff.","Seeing Fang Rui and Zhang at their door, Liu's father's expression was not very welcoming, while his mother anxiously asked, \"Officers, my Xiaonian couldn't possibly have committed a crime. He's just been a bit listless lately, but he's a good boy. He couldn't have done anything wrong.\"","Zhang carefully said, \"Auntie, Uncle, please prepare yourselves. Liu Xiaonian has passed away. We suspect he was murdered, so we're here to learn more about his situation.\"","\"That good-for-nothing is dead?\" Liu's father was stunned at first, then flew into a rage. \"Good riddance! A waste of space like him, a parasite - it's better he's dead. Now we can finally be rid of him!\"","\"Old man, what are you saying? Xiaonian is dead and you're still cursing him. So what if he didn't have a job? Our pension was enough to support him. Why do you always have to scold him like this?\" Liu's mother retorted.","\"Hmph, it's all your fault. You spoiled him rotten. Go ahead and keep defending him.\"","\"It's all my fault, is that what you want to hear? Fine, it's all my fault!\" Liu's mother broke down sobbing. \"My poor Xiaonian, how could you bear to leave your mother all alone?\"","Liu's father looked at her. He wanted to get her some tissues, but in the end, he left the living room and went into the study, slamming the door shut behind him.","\"Auntie, please try to stay calm,\" Zhang said, handing her some tissues and gently patting her back to comfort her.","\"Officers, my husband just has a sharp tongue. He doesn't mean what he says. Please don't take offense,\" Liu's mother said as she gradually composed herself. Then she asked, \"How did Xiaonian die?\"","\"He was found hanged in an escape room.\"","\"Escape room... again with the escape rooms. Oh, my poor Xiaonian, how did you get so trapped that you couldn't escape?\" Liu's mother wailed. \"It's all my fault. I shouldn't have indulged him. I shouldn't have given him money.\"","\"Auntie, what do you mean by that?\" Zhang handed Liu's mother more tissues. \"What's wrong with escape rooms?\"","\"Ah, those escape rooms ruined my Xiaonian. He used to be such a good student, got into a great university. In his senior year, escape rooms suddenly became popular, and he fell in love with them. After that, he was obsessed, even skipping classes. He's 24 now, won't look for a job, won't date, doesn't even talk to people. All he does is play escape rooms all day. He's completely wasted his life.\"","\"Did he have conflicts with anyone?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"I don't think so. Xiaonian was introverted. He usually didn't get into conflicts with others.\" Liu's mother thought for a moment, then suddenly said, \"There was one time Xiaonian came home with an injured lip, like someone had hit him. I asked him what happened, but he wouldn't tell me.\"","\"When was this? Where had he gone out to?\"","\"I think it was September 5th. I remember because it was the day before my husband's birthday. He asked me for a few hundred yuan that day, definitely to play escape rooms again. He wasn't interested in anything else.\"","\"Can we take a look at his room?\"","\"Of course. I'll show you the way.\"","Liu Xiaonian's room was very dark, with thick curtains blocking the windows. Without the lights on, it was almost impossible to see anything.","When the lights came on, Fang Rui saw an extremely tidy room, seemingly only in black and white. The bedsheets were white, while the wardrobe and curtains were black, covered with various strange symbols. It felt oppressive to be in such a room.","On Liu Xiaonian's desk was a row of books, many about code-breaking, including professional cryptography textbooks and some novels. In his drawer was a large stack of blueprints that looked like architectural designs.","Fang Rui picked up one of the blueprints to look at it. It seemed familiar, with a layout similar to the scene he had seen in the escape room. The date written in the corner was January 15th.","He looked at another one, which depicted the scene from the \"Newlyweds' Collection Room,\" complete with annotations for various mechanisms and how to activate them. This one was dated February 21st.","\"Zhang, when did that 'Edgar Allan Poe's Cottage' place open?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"It's a new place, opened around June, I think. It became an overnight sensation because it was chosen as a filming location for a variety show right after opening.\"","Fang Rui frowned. \"Then why was Liu Xiaonian able to draw the layout of one of its scenes on February 21st?\"","\"Could Liu Xiaonian have been the designer of those rooms?\" Zhang speculated. \"Could it be that the people from that shop did it? They plagiarized Liu Xiaonian's designs and didn't want to pay, so they killed him to silence him?\"","Fang Rui found a student ID in Liu Xiaonian's drawer, which showed that he had majored in Civil Engineering. This made it plausible that Liu Xiaonian could indeed draw architectural designs.","\"Auntie, can we take these drawings with us?\" Fang Rui asked Liu's mother. \"We'll return them to you once the case is closed.\"","\"Yes, take them,\" Liu's mother said. Then she asked, \"Officers, what about my son's body? Can I bring him home?\"","\"I'm afraid that's not possible. We can only release the body for cremation after the case is closed,\" Zhang said carefully.","\"Can I at least see him?\"","\"Of course. You can come with us in our car. We can take you there on our way back.\"","\"Thank you, thank you so much!\"","At that moment, the study door suddenly opened, and Liu's father came out. Fang Rui thought he seemed to have aged a bit.","Liu's father's expression was still stern as he said to Fang Rui, \"I'll come too. My wife doesn't handle these things well. If she faints, it'll just cause more trouble for you.\"","Fang Rui took them back to the police station. Mu Mian had already completed the autopsy and sewn up the body, so she graciously allowed them to view it.","\"My son! Mama won't scold you anymore, just open your eyes and look at Mama,\" Liu's mother cried, throwing herself onto Liu Xiaonian's body. \"Whatever you want to do, Mama will support you. Don't leave Mama!\"","Liu's father's expression was more restrained. He stood at the door of the autopsy room, looking at Liu Xiaonian's body from afar.","He regretted being so harsh on his son. He should have been more patient. Even if Xiaonian was useless, he was still his child.","Thinking this, he could no longer control his emotions and also embraced Liu Xiaonian's body, crying.","The autopsy results came out quickly. Mu Mian reported the findings at the next morning's meeting.","\"The cause of death was hanging. Time of death was between 3 PM and 5 PM on September 18th. There were no signs of struggle on the body,\" Mu Mian paused, then continued, \"We also detected sleeping pills in his system.\"","\"Sleeping pills? Could the killer have drugged the victim first, then dressed him up like a prop corpse and hung him in the escape room?\" Zhang speculated.","Everyone agreed that this was currently the most plausible theory.","Li reported his findings from reviewing the surveillance footage: \"On September 18th at 3:11 PM, Liu Xiaonian entered the shop. At 3:14 PM, he entered the 'Escape from the Mental Hospital' room alone. After that, he wasn't seen on any cameras. It seems he never came out after going in.\"","Li had already edited the video to show only the footage with Liu Xiaonian. The surveillance showed Liu Xiaonian entering the shop with a black backpack, looking gloomy. Shortly after, he appeared at the entrance to the escape room, still carrying his bag and looking unhappy.","\"I've extracted the faces of everyone who entered that room before and after this time frame,\" Li opened a folder containing image files. \"There were about 47 people who entered that room.\"","\"The fingerprint analysis results are also in. We found twelve sets of fingerprints, four belonging to the shop's employees, one to Liu Xiaonian. The other seven are unknown.\"","\"Then this case seems straightforward,\" Zhang leaned back, confidently saying, \"We just need to investigate these people, find out who knew Liu Xiaonian, who had conflicts with him, and that person is likely to be the killer!\"","After hearing Zhang's deduction, Mu Mian nudged Fang Rui's arm. When Fang Rui looked at her, Mu Mian drew a square shape with her hand, then added several circles on top of it.","Seeing this, Fang Rui smiled helplessly.","Chen Xue caught a glimpse of Mu Mian's little gesture and said disapprovingly, \"Mian Mian, you can't keep doing this, only sharing clues with Captain Fang. There are many other people sitting here too, you know?\""]},{"number":61,"title":"Chapter 61: Ghost House Mystery: Design Plagiarism","paragraphs":["After being caught by Chen Xue, Mu Mian guiltily looked at the ceiling, avoiding their accusing gazes.","Zhang chimed in, \"That's right, what is it that we can't hear? Or does Forensic Specialist Mu think we won't understand?\"","\"Zhang, are you sure you want to hear?\" Fang Rui looked at Zhang helplessly, \"I think it's better if you don't know.\"","\"Of course I do! Tell me, tell me.\" Zhang found it strange that the boss singled him out. He suddenly had an ominous feeling.","\"Mu Mian told me that your deduction just now was like a net.\"","Zhang's face lit up, \"Is she praising my deduction for being rigorous and tightly knit?\"","Fang Rui continued, \"Full of holes.\"","Zhang looked at Mu Mian with a hurt expression, \"Forensic Specialist Mu, you've wounded me!\"","\"It wouldn't have hurt if you hadn't asked,\" Mu Mian also looked aggrieved, \"You insisted on knowing.\"","\"I feel so bad... Well, help me patch up the holes then.\" Zhang was used to it by now; his deductions always seemed to miss the correct answer.","Why was this happening? He wasn't that stupid, and he had quite an imagination.","Mu Mian reminded him, \"There are many other possibilities. For example, the killer could be a psychopath randomly selecting victims, which would make it impossible to identify the killer through personal connections...\"","After the meeting, Fang Rui decided to revisit the shop. He had some questions for the Shop Manager.","When Mu Mian found out, she excitedly expressed her desire to go there to look for clues as well.","\"Forensic Specialist Mu, hasn't the cause of death been determined? What other clues are you looking for?\" Zhang looked at Mu Mian's excited face, feeling that things weren't so simple.","Mu Mian didn't answer this question, instead turning to Fang Rui, \"Fang Rui, drive faster.\"","Once they arrived at the shop, Mu Mian said to Fang Rui and Zhang, \"Fang Rui, you guys go take statements. I'll go to the escape room first to look for clues. Take your time asking questions. I'll wait for you in the room.\"","The Shop Manager said worriedly, \"But without me guiding you, it might take you half a day to solve the puzzles. You'd better wait for me to take you...\"","Before he could finish, Mu Mian had already cheerfully walked away.","\"It's fine, she'll probably be faster on her own than if you were guiding her,\" Fang Rui said with a smile.","\"...\" The Shop Manager was a bit speechless, but remembering Mu Mian's speed in decoding, he thought Fang Rui might have a point.","This young lady was very clever.","\"Boss, won't Forensic Specialist Mu be scared all alone? That place is terrifying!\" Zhang exclaimed.","\"Are you sure she'd be afraid?\" Fang Rui and the Shop Manager looked at Zhang simultaneously, and Zhang suddenly felt his concern might be unnecessary.","Fang Rui turned to the Shop Manager and asked, \"Do you know Liu Xiaonian?\"","\"Who's Liu Xiaonian? I don't know him. We receive dozens of players every day in our shop. With such a large customer flow, how could I possibly remember every player's name?\"","Fang Rui interrupted him, \"I only asked about the name. If you don't know him, how did you know he was once a player in your shop?\"","The Shop Manager's expression changed. He explained, \"Oh, I instinctively assumed you were asking about a player. My mistake, I spoke too quickly. I really don't know any Liu Xiaonian.\"","Fang Rui handed him Liu Xiaonian's photo, \"Are you sure you don't know him?\"","\"I don't know him.\"","\"Didn't you beat him up? How could you not know him?\" Fang Rui asked. Actually, he wasn't sure if Liu Xiaonian's injuries were from them, so he was just bluffing the Shop Manager.","Unexpectedly, the Shop Manager instantly broke into a cold sweat. He confessed, \"Officer Fang, I lied earlier. I do know him. He caused trouble in our shop before, and our staff beat him up and kicked him out. I was nervous earlier, so I lied.\"","After discovering the body, the Shop Manager immediately had the staff check the surveillance videos. Through the entrance and exit footage, they identified the deceased as Liu Xiaonian. Because of their previous conflict, the Shop Manager was worried the police would suspect them, so he lied.","\"Why did he cause trouble?\"","\"Well... um...\" The Shop Manager hesitated, but seeing Fang Rui staring at him, he finally admitted, \"He thought our escape room design was garbage, that the experience was like shit. He was very dissatisfied, so he caused trouble.\"","\"Is that the only reason?\"","\"It is. I'm not lying this time.\"","Fang Rui felt that this Shop Manager was full of lies. He took out Liu Xiaonian's design sketches and handed them to the Shop Manager, \"Your shop opened in June, so why did Liu Xiaonian draw these design sketches for your escape room in January?\"","After looking at the sketches, the Shop Manager still tried to argue, \"Well... escape rooms all follow similar patterns. It's normal for designs to overlap!\"","Fang Rui pulled out one sketch, \"This one shows a mechanism that's identical to the scene setup in your 'Bride and Groom Collection Room', with the same mechanism design and even the same way to trigger it. You call this a design overlap? Isn't this direct copying?\"","Seeing that he couldn't hide it anymore, the Shop Manager wiped the sweat from his forehead and confessed, \"Some elements of our escape room were copied from competitors. The 'Bride and Groom Collection Room' was plagiarized from another design, but definitely not from Liu Xiaonian's. I'm not lying about this. We beat him up last time because he was cursing loudly in our shop, affecting our reputation.\"","Fearing that Fang Rui wouldn't believe him, the Shop Manager added, \"That shop was called 'Lost Island', and it's already closed down. Last month, their boss sued us, we paid a large sum in compensation, and then got their authorization. If you don't believe me, you can check the court judgment online, it's been made public.\"","\"If he thought your shop's experience was so bad, why did he come to play again this time?\"","The Shop Manager looked exasperated, \"We don't know either! We had already blacklisted him, but that day he was received by a new employee who didn't recognize him, so he was let in. We're just unlucky to encounter such a situation.\"","So how did Liu Xiaonian have those design sketches? And what was his connection to the shop called \"Lost Island\"?","Fang Rui decided to go to the escape room to find Mu Mian first.","Zhang initially refused to go, but he had no choice but to succumb to Fang Rui's pressure. Perhaps because he had been through it once before, Zhang found it less terrifying this time.","Zhang touched the decorations on the wall, feeling they had a nice texture, but noticed Fang Rui observing him.","\"Chen Xue isn't here, and your courage seems to have grown. Weren't you scared to death yesterday?\"","Zhang's face reddened, \"Boss...\"","\"You're quite clever, kid.\" Fang Rui looked at Zhang with newfound respect, surprised at Zhang's little tricks when it came to romance.","\"...\"","Under the Shop Manager's guidance, they quickly arrived at the hidden level.","Zhang saw Mu Mian standing in front of the skeleton Bride, touching it here and there, looking extremely happy.","\"Forensic Specialist Mu, why are you standing here? Can't you get into the escape room?\"","Zhang's sudden voice startled Mu Mian. She quickly concealed her burning gaze and explained, \"You finished taking statements so quickly?\"","Fang Rui looked at the resin skeleton, strongly suspecting that Mu Mian had fallen in love with the skeleton Bride, just like she had inexplicably fallen in love with his corpse.","Mu Mian pressed the Bride's chest and said to the Shop Manager, \"The mechanism is in the chest. You don't actually need to hug it to trigger the mechanism.\"","Hearing this, the Shop Manager's face became somewhat unnatural."]},{"number":62,"title":"Chapter 62: Mystery of the Haunted House: The Skeleton Gift","paragraphs":["The store manager had other matters to attend to, so he left after Fang Rui and Mu Mian entered the crime scene.","\"Dr. Mu, you're not really here to look for clues, are you? You just like this place, don't you? Have you fallen for that skeleton bride?\" Zhang teased, exposing Mu Mian's little scheme.","Mu Mian averted her gaze guiltily but insisted, \"I'm here to find clues. Haven't you noticed? When he entered this escape room, he was carrying a bag, but when we found his body, the bag was missing. Aren't you curious about why the bag disappeared?\"","Fang Rui remembered seeing Liu Xiaonian carrying a bulky black bag in the surveillance footage, but they hadn't found it at the scene.","\"Could the killer have taken it?\" Zhang speculated. \"Maybe the killer murdered him to steal whatever was in the victim's bag?\"","Fang Rui and Zhang spent the entire morning searching the locked room, examining every prop and corpse, but they couldn't find the victim's missing bag.","\"It seems the killer really did take it,\" Zhang sighed.","Meanwhile, Mu Mian was playing with the nooses, even putting her neck through one to experience the feeling of hanging.","Seeing this, Fang Rui quickly pulled Mu Mian away.","\"Mu Mian, that's dangerous. You might accidentally trigger a mechanism and hang yourself,\" Fang Rui warned her exasperatedly.","\"I won't be that unlucky. Chen Xue said us Leos would be very lucky this month.\"","Unable to find the victim's black bag, they had to leave the store. As they left, Mu Mian kept looking back, making Zhang suspect that her soul had been captivated by the skeleton bride.","That place was so eerie, could it really be haunted by something?","It was already noon, and everyone was hungry, so they ate at the restaurant downstairs.","Fang Rui finished eating quickly and told Mu Mian and Zhang, \"Take your time. I'm going to buy something.\"","\"Boss, go ahead. I'll keep a close eye on Dr. Mu and make sure she doesn't get lost,\" Zhang said.","Mu Mian looked at Zhang with a hurt expression. \"I have a very good memory. I've never gotten lost before.\"","\"Oh, the point is that I'll protect you. Understand?\"","\"Then next time, please just say the main point.\"","\"...\"","A little while later, Fang Rui called Zhang, telling them to meet him in the underground parking lot after they finished eating.","As Mu Mian and Zhang walked to the parking lot, Mu Mian spotted Fang Rui carrying the skeleton bride from afar. Her pupils dilated in excitement.","\"Boss, why did you take that thing down?\" Zhang asked.","The skeleton bride was about Zhang's height, made of resin, and not too heavy. Fang Rui brought the skeleton bride to Mu Mian and said, \"Mu Mian, this is for you.\"","\"This is a gift for me?\" Mu Mian felt as if she'd been hit by an enormous surprise.","Mu Mian was stunned. It wasn't her birthday or any special occasion, yet Fang Rui had given her a gift, and it was the very thing she wanted most today – this beautiful skeleton bride.","Chen Xue was right; Leos really were going to be lucky this month!","Zhang was also dumbfounded. He seriously doubted whether the boss had been influenced by Mu Mian. Who gives a skeleton as a gift? But he didn't dare to criticize, because Mu Mian might actually like it!","\"You don't like it?\" Fang Rui frowned. Then why had Mu Mian been staring at it earlier? Had he guessed wrong?","\"I like it, I love it so much!\" Mu Mian hugged the skeleton, her face full of emotion. \"Fang Rui, how did you manage to buy it? I asked the staff if I could buy it, and they said no. They even said I didn't look like I could afford it. I told them I was very rich, but they didn't believe me...\"","\"I'm glad you like it.\"","In truth, it wasn't that difficult to buy. Since a murder had occurred in that escape room, the manager planned to renovate it and was selling off all the props at a discount to replace them with new ones.","So when Fang Rui offered to pay double the price for the skeleton bride, the manager immediately agreed and even offered to throw in the original coffin. Fang Rui declined.","He'd rather not have such an inauspicious package. He didn't want to be seen carrying a coffin around; it was already drawing enough attention just carrying the bride.","\"I like it, I really, really, really like it,\" Mu Mian said excitedly. \"Fang Rui, I really, really, really like you right now too. Thank you, you're so wonderful. I hereby declare that you're now ranked first on my list of best friends.\"","Fang Rui's expression became a bit awkward. He knew that Mu Mian's \"like\" for him was equivalent to her liking the skeleton bride, but he still felt there should be some difference between the two types of \"like.\"","\"Boss wasn't ranked first before?\" Zhang asked in surprise.","\"Chen Xue said she had to be first. But not anymore. Even if she cries in front of me, it won't work. Now Fang Rui must be first.\"","\"What rank am I?\" Zhang asked curiously.","\"Fourth.\"","\"That high up?\" Zhang felt a bit touched. \"How many friends do you have in total?\"","\"I have many friends, exactly four.\"","\"...\"","\"Officer Zhang, you're very important to me too. You're the funniest person I've ever met.\"","\"Oh, stop praising me to my face.\" Zhang's heart suddenly blossomed with joy.","They were driving an SUV today, which could barely fit the bride. Mu Mian hugged it the whole way, extremely excited.","Back at the police station, Mu Mian carried the bride, deliberately taking the longest route back to the office.","Along the way, many people greeted her and asked, \"Dr. Mu, what's that? Is it evidence you've collected?\"","Mu Mian would then answer, \"It's not evidence. It's a gift, a gift from Fang Rui. It's the first gift he's ever given me.\"","Then they would look at Fang Rui with an expression Mu Mian couldn't understand: \"Fang Rui, is this what you give to a girl? You should have asked me for advice on gift-giving, I'm quite good at it.\"","Mu Mian corrected them: \"He's very good at giving gifts. I absolutely love this gift.\"","They all looked shocked. Fang Rui just shrugged helplessly at them.","\"Chen Xue, look, this is the gift Fang Rui gave me. I love it so much,\" Mu Mian said excitedly as she carried the skeleton bride into the office. \"It's the first gift he's ever given me.\"","\"I already know,\" Chen Xue said, holding up her phone. She had already heard about it in the group chat, where someone had even posted pictures. She glanced at the horrifying-looking skeleton bride and commented, \"It's very pretty.\"","\"I was originally going to put it in my room, but since you like it so much too, I'll keep it here in the office, right next to my desk. That way, when you're tired from work, you can look up and see it.\"","\"...Alright.\"","\"I'm going to buy some pretty clothes for it online, and I'll get some maintenance equipment to take good care of it,\" Mu Mian said excitedly.","Fang Rui and Zhang showed the photos to Liu Xiaonian's parents, but they weren't clear about Liu Xiaonian's social circle. They only knew that Liu Xiaonian had almost no friends.","Fang Rui could only open Liu Xiaonian's phone and find the person he contacted most frequently.","That friend was also an escape room enthusiast named Li Bin. He used to team up with Liu Xiaonian to play escape rooms often, and they were good partners.","Upon hearing the news of Liu Xiaonian's death, he found it hard to believe. \"Are you sure you haven't made a mistake? Xiaonian was severely socially anxious and had no enemies. How could he be murdered? Are you really the police? You're not scammers trying to con me out of money, are you?\"","Zhang showed him their credentials and Liu Xiaonian's post-mortem photo.","Only then did he slowly accept the news of Liu Xiaonian's death. He choked up as he said, \"I really can't understand. How could someone like Xiaonian, with severe social anxiety and a people-pleasing personality, be murdered?\""]},{"number":63,"title":"Chapter 63: Ghost House Mystery: High-End Player","paragraphs":["Fang Rui showed the photos to Li Bin, \"Among these people, who is acquainted with Liu Xiaonian?\"","Li Bin examined them carefully, scrutinizing each photo before finally pulling out a few: \"These people know Liu Xiaonian.\"","Fang Rui looked through the selected photos. One was of the manager of the escape room, three were of employees from that store, and one was of a passerby whose identity they hadn't yet determined.","\"Do you know who this person is?\" Fang Rui asked, pointing to the photo of the passerby.","\"His name is Wang Yang. He used to run an escape room too. Xiaonian and I were regulars at his place. But his store went bankrupt a few months ago.\"","\"What was the name of that store?\" Fang Rui inquired.","\"It was called 'Lost Island.' It was quite popular once. Xiaonian and I loved going there. Later, 'Poe's Cottage' became famous through a TV show and started a price war, drastically cutting prices. These underhanded tactics forced many escape rooms out of business.\" Li Bin frowned, \"But it's strange, why would Wang Yang and Xiaonian go to that store?\"","Fang Rui remembered the manager mentioning this store name that morning. Could Liu Xiaonian have sold his designs to this 'Lost Island' store?","\"Why is it strange?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"Xiaonian, Wang Yang, and I are high-end escape room players. We usually wouldn't stoop to visiting that kind of place.\" Li Bin sneered, \"I can understand Xiaonian going there, but why would Wang Yang go too? I don't get it. Their tastes have really gone downhill.\"","\"What's wrong with that store?\" Fang Rui probed.","\"It's very low-brow. The charm of escape rooms should be in solving puzzles, not in horror. If you want a scary thrill, why not just go to a haunted house? That place has a lot of hype, with ads everywhere, but the experience is utter crap. The worst part is, it's driving out the good businesses. Several quality escape rooms have shut down because of it. That's how Wang Yang's store went under. Ugh, we won't be able to enjoy good escape rooms anymore.\"","\"Do you know where Wang Yang lives now?\"","\"Not really sure,\" Li Bin pondered, then added, \"But after he went bankrupt, he was drowning in debt and couldn't afford rent. He's been staying with his sister. She runs a shop nearby. I can take you there.\"","On the way to the shop, Fang Rui asked, \"How did Liu Xiaonian know the manager of 'Poe's Cottage'?\"","\"Two weeks ago, we went to play there. We thought the experience was terrible and demanded a refund. They thought we were causing trouble, so the manager had his staff throw us out. We almost got into a fight.\"","Li Bin sighed, \"They even hurt Xiaonian. We were going to call the police, but they refunded our money, so we didn't.\"","Li Bin suddenly had a thought, \"Officer, do you think it's possible that those employees conspired to murder Xiaonian? Maybe they resented him for giving them a bad review, so they killed him?\"","\"Do you think a store would kill someone over one bad review?\" Fang Rui said.","\"Xiaonian's review was pretty harsh. He even hired internet trolls to badmouth the store online.\" Li Bin looked a bit embarrassed and explained, \"But that place really deserved it.\"","Fang Rui thought Liu Xiaonian's hatred for that store seemed excessive, almost incomprehensible. He remembered the design sketches he'd seen at Liu Xiaonian's home. \"Why did Liu Xiaonian hate that store so much? Was it because they plagiarized his designs?\"","\"Because the experience was terrible!\" Li Bin looked surprised, \"Plagiarize Xiaonian's designs? That's highly unlikely. Although Xiaonian was good at solving puzzles, I've seen his room designs before, and I have to say, they were extremely uncreative! No one would want to steal those designs.\"","Fang Rui found this odd. Where did those design sketches in Liu Xiaonian's house come from then?","Wang Yang's sister lived in an urban village where she ran a fried noodle shop.","When Li Bin brought them there, Wang Yang was lazily helping his sister wash vegetables while she nagged him: \"Can't you wash vegetables more carefully? How can you not even do this small task properly? Don't look at me like that. You're not a boss anymore. I've helped pay off so many of your debts, can't I say a word or two to you?\"","Wang Yang looked unkempt, with a scruffy beard and long, greasy, unkempt hair. He appeared completely dejected.","\"Mr. Wang... I mean, Brother Wang,\" Li Bin quickly corrected himself as he greeted Wang Yang, \"Could we borrow a moment of your time? These two police officers have some questions for you.\"","Wang Yang's sister immediately became flustered. She looked at Wang Yang, \"You haven't done anything illegal, have you? If you've lost money in business, I can help pay it back, but if you've broken the law, don't expect me to bail you out. If you've done something bad, go turn yourself in right away! You hear me?\"","\"Sis, I haven't done anything,\" Wang Yang's expression was somewhat helpless.","Fang Rui explained on his behalf: \"We're just here to gather some information. There's no need to worry.\"","\"Oh, that's good, that's good!\" Wang Yang's sister breathed a sigh of relief and enthusiastically invited them into the shop. \"Officers, please come in and have a seat. Ask whatever you need to ask. Our Wang Yang will cooperate fully.\"","Wang Yang's sister was very hospitable, pouring hot tea for each of them.","Fang Rui asked, \"Do you know Liu Xiaonian?\"","\"Yes, I do. He was a regular at our store and we got along well. We're friends, I suppose. We have a group chat where we often organize various escape room activities.\"","Li Bin looked at Wang Yang with a sad expression, \"Brother Wang, Xiaonian is dead.\"","Wang Yang was shocked: \"How did he die? That's impossible! How could he be dead? I saw him just a few days ago.\"","Fang Rui asked, \"What were you doing on September 18th?\"","\"The 18th? That morning I was washing dishes at my sister's shop. I broke a plate and cut my hand on the broken pieces. In the afternoon, my sister told me to rest.\" Wang Yang lowered his voice, \"I went to play an escape room in the afternoon. Please don't tell my sister. She doesn't allow me to play those anymore, and I promised her I wouldn't. If she finds out, she'll kill me.\"","Li Bin said, \"Brother Wang, you shouldn't go to that kind of place anyway. What's the point of playing there?\"","\"But it's the only place nearby to play! And they had a half-price discount that Monday. The temptation was too great!\" Wang Yang's tone was resigned, \"I feel ashamed too, but I just couldn't resist the urge to play. I have to admit, that place has an intense immersive experience. It's quite thrilling.\"","\"Brother Wang, we play escape rooms for the mental challenge, not for thrills!\"","\"What time did you go?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"I arrived there around 4 PM and played until evening before going home,\" Wang Yang answered.","His statement matched what the surveillance footage had captured.","\"Liu Xiaonian also went to that store that day. Didn't you arrange to go together?\"","\"Xiaonian went too?\" Wang Yang looked shocked, \"That's impossible! Xiaonian said that place was garbage. How could he go there? Anyone else might go, but not him!\"","Fang Rui looked at him, \"You also thought that place was garbage, but you still went.\""]},{"number":64,"title":"Chapter 64: The Haunted House Mystery: Suspect","paragraphs":["\"That's different! Xiaonian told us he would never go to that store, even if it killed him,\" Wang Yang argued. \"As for me, I didn't just go to play, I went to investigate.\"","Li Bin chimed in, \"Yes, I can testify to that. Xiaonian said he hated that store and wouldn't go there even if it meant his death.\"","\"What were you investigating?\" Fang Rui asked.","Wang Yang took a sip of tea, instantly becoming energized, completely lacking the dejected air he had while washing vegetables earlier.","\"Previously, Xiaonian told me that store had plagiarized my store's design, so I sued them in court. A few days ago, we reached a settlement. Their boss was very forthcoming and agreed to compensate me three million yuan. My goodness, three million! With this money, I can not only clear my debts but also open a new store.\"","\"Brother Wang, you're going to open another store? We support you!\" Li Bin said excitedly. \"I can provide you with creative ideas when the time comes.\"","\"Sounds great!\"","Fang Rui seized on the key point of his statement: \"Was it Liu Xiaonian who told you that store had copied your design?\"","\"Yes. I had been to that store before and played that scenario, but I didn't trigger the hidden mechanism, so I didn't know about the design in that secret room. Later, Xiaonian sent me photos, and that's when I realized they had made a one-to-one copy of my store's design. This was all thanks to Xiaonian.\"","\"Who designed that secret room?\"","\"I did! All the mechanisms in there were my ideas, though my friends helped with some creative input,\" Wang Yang said proudly. \"However, that store did make some changes. They altered how the mechanism is triggered. They made it very vulgar - you have to touch the skeleton bride's chest to trigger the mechanism. Tsk tsk, doing such obscene things, it's disgusting and lowbrow!\"","Fang Rui was speechless. No wonder the store manager's face looked unnatural when Mu Mian mentioned the location of the mechanism.","\"Did you trigger that hidden level? Did you enter the 'Bride and Groom Collection Room'?\" Fang Rui continued to ask.","\"I triggered it, but I didn't go in. The password was too difficult; I couldn't crack it,\" Wang Yang's face reddened slightly. \"The password in my store wasn't nearly that hard.\"","Having asked most of what he wanted to know, as they were about to leave, Fang Rui gave Zhang a look and then glanced at Wang Yang's cup.","Zhang understood immediately. He said to Wang Yang's sister, \"Sis, where's the bathroom? I need to use it.\"","\"It's over there.\"","\"Boss, I'll go to the bathroom first. You guys wait for me outside.\"","While Wang Yang went back to washing vegetables and his sister was preparing seasonings for the evening, Zhang put on gloves and, when they weren't looking, slipped Wang Yang's cup into an evidence bag.","This cup had Wang Yang's fingerprints on it, which could be compared with the fingerprints on the display screen.","After leaving Wang Yang's sister's store, Fang Rui turned to Li Bin: \"What do you think of the relationship between Wang Yang and Liu Xiaonian?\"","\"What do you mean? You're not suspecting Brother Wang, are you? That's impossible! Brother Wang is exceptionally good to all of us. Every time he updates a scenario, he invites us to play for free and even treats us to snacks. You've probably noticed that Xiaonian doesn't have friends. Among all of us, besides me, Brother Wang was the kindest to him.\"","\"Did Liu Xiaonian know about Wang Yang winning the lawsuit?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"I don't think so. I only found out about it today. This lawsuit was very difficult. Brother Wang was so poor he couldn't even afford a lawyer. Later, he had to swear to his sister that he would never touch escape rooms again before she gave him some money. None of us thought he could win the case, let alone that the boss would be so generous and pay such a large amount without even haggling.\"","After Li Bin left, Zhang speculated, \"Boss, could it be that Wang Yang didn't want to share the three million with Liu Xiaonian, so he killed him? It can't be such a coincidence that both of them appeared in that store at the same time, right?\"","Fang Rui also found it too coincidental, and he couldn't understand why Wang Yang insisted the room was his own design when the design drawings were clearly made by Liu Xiaonian.","Fang Rui returned to the station. As he passed by Mu Mian's office, he glanced in and saw the skeleton bride standing coldly next to Mu Mian. He found it oddly eye-catching and thought it looked very unaesthetic in that position.","Mu Mian was writing a report. She would look up at the skeleton bride every few lines, then lower her head and continue writing happily.","It was seriously affecting work efficiency!","\"Boss, look at you. Of all the things you could have given her, you had to choose this,\" Zhang commented from the side. \"Mu Mian doesn't even pay attention to us anymore. Chen Xue says Mu Mian doesn't listen to her now, she's too focused on choosing brushes for it.\"","\"Brushes?\"","\"Are those the forensic doctor's maintenance tools?\"","\"...\"","Fang Rui then had Li pull up all the surveillance footage related to Wang Yang.","The footage showed Wang Yang arriving at the store at 4:03 PM that day. He was wearing a baseball cap and a mask, looking around vigilantly. At 4:12 PM, he entered the scenario and didn't come out until after 6 PM, sneaking out like a thief. It definitely looked suspicious.","\"Boss, look at him. He must have a guilty conscience. This guy's acting skills are really good. We were almost fooled by him,\" Zhang exclaimed. When they were talking to Wang Yang at his sister's store, Zhang had thought he was a good person.","\"Boss, the fingerprints on this cup match one of the fingerprints on the screen. That Wang Yang guy must have entered the password on the screen,\" Wang from the fingerprint comparison team quickly reported their results. He detected that one of the fingerprints matched Wang Yang's.","Fang Rui felt it was necessary to summon Wang Yang for a chat.","But he remembered what Mu Mian had said: if the killer could crack that numerical password, they shouldn't be too stupid, so why would they leave such obvious evidence as fingerprints?","The next day, Fang Rui invited Wang Yang to the station to give a statement.","When Wang Yang saw Fang Rui and Zhang, he spoke urgently: \"Officer Fang, why did you call me here? I've told you everything I know. Did you call me here because you have more questions?\"","\"Can you help us crack these passwords?\" Fang Rui handed him a piece of paper with all the numerical reasoning questions that would appear in that hidden level.","Wang Yang glanced at it and frowned, \"So many? Let me see.\"","\"No rush, take your time.\"","Wang Yang found it strange why they asked him to do math problems at the police station. He wasn't a math student. Nevertheless, he worked on them seriously, only to find that he seemed quite poor at math.","He was sweating profusely with anxiety. After half an hour, he had only solved two problems.","Zhang quietly graded his answers against the correct ones and whispered to Fang Rui, \"He worked for an hour and only did two problems, both wrong.\"","Wang Yang's face was bright red. He defended himself, \"I've never been good at math since I was young. If it were other types of reasoning problems, like graphical reasoning or logical reasoning, I'd be much better...\"","Fang Rui frowned. If Wang Yang couldn't solve a single problem, could it be that he really hadn't entered that hidden room?","Fang Rui took out the stack of design drawings made by Liu Xiaonian. \"Mr. Wang, you said all the rooms in your store were designed by you. How do you explain these design drawings?\""]},{"number":65,"title":"Chapter 65: The Haunted House Mystery: Foreign Object in the Chest Cavity","paragraphs":["Wang Yang took the design drawings and slowly examined them, frowning. \"Who drew these designs? Why do they look so similar to the ones in my shop? These scenes are all from escape rooms we've launched before.\"","\"Look at this 'Newlyweds' Collection Room' design. I remember your shop launched it on April 5th, but this drawing is dated February 21st, earlier than your shop. How do you explain that?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"What's there to explain? Are you accusing me of plagiarism? Tell me who drew this, and I'll confront them face-to-face. All the mechanisms and prop placements in this scene were designed by me. I hired a professional designer to draw the plans, and he can testify. I couldn't have plagiarized!\"","Fang Rui said, \"That person can't confront you because he's already dead, hanged in that escape room.\"","\"Are you saying Liu Xiaonian drew this design?\" Wang Yang's face instantly turned pale. \"No, I didn't copy his design. I don't know how he got this drawing. The date must be fake, it has to be!\"","\"This design was drawn with a pen. Our technicians can roughly determine when it was drawn through technical analysis.\"","Fang Rui suddenly found it odd. Usually, design drawings need revisions, so they're drawn in pencil. Why was this one done in pen?","Was Liu Xiaonian a genius who could perfect a design drawing in one go?","\"I... I don't know how to explain it,\" Wang Yang stammered, then quickly added, \"I described all my ideas in the group chat. Could he have recreated my escape room design from that?\"","\"What would be his purpose in doing that?\" Zhang countered, \"Was he just bored?\"","\"How would I know?\" Wang Yang shrank back, looking wronged.","\"Why would Liu Xiaonian tell you about the plagiarism? Was it because he was also a creator, and you killed him to avoid sharing the three million with him?\" Zhang questioned.","\"No! Xiaonian and I were friends, that's why he told me about this. And I've said, this design was my idea, it has nothing to do with Xiaonian! Nothing!\" Wang Yang grew increasingly angry. \"I didn't kill anyone! You can't wrongly accuse me!\"","\"Did you enter that hidden escape room?\"","\"No! I told you, I couldn't crack the password, so I couldn't get in,\" Wang Yang explained. \"But I did try entering a password once.\"","\"Why were you so flustered when you came out of the escape room?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"Oh, I saw the shop owner when I came out. You know I'm in a lawsuit with them, and it's very unpleasant. If he knew I snuck into his shop to play, wouldn't he laugh at me? So I was hiding from him!\"","Without evidence to prove Wang Yang was the killer, Fang Rui let him go.","\"Boss, this Wang Yang is such a good liar. Even with evidence right in front of him, he won't admit to plagiarism,\" Zhang complained. \"People like him are the worst, taking credit for others' work and then killing the original creator. Hey, how can we find evidence to convict him?\"","Fang Rui thought of the suit on the victim's body and said, \"Check his shopping records to see if he bought a similar suit. Also check on the party poppers.\"","\"Ah, boss, you're so smart!\"","The suit had no particular style and was made of poor-quality fabric, the kind you could buy for a hundred yuan. A white label was sewn onto the collar, showing the fabric composition and brand.","Although the brand wasn't famous, it wasn't a knockoff. It had its own online store and fixed offline sales channels - in the commercial street next to Jiangzhou City's farmers' market.","Seeing Fang Rui and his team investigating the suit, Mu Mian shared her observation: \"Fang Rui, that suit fit the victim well. And the clothes underneath weren't very wrinkled. Usually, if you forcibly dress someone, the clothes underneath would be all crumpled.\"","\"You suspect it was someone he knew?\" Fang Rui asked. This increased the suspicion on Wang Yang, who knew Liu Xiaonian so well.","Fang Rui first obtained the past six months' sales records from the online store's salesperson, focusing on orders shipped to Jiangzhou City. However, Wang Yang's name wasn't on the list.","He and Zhang then took the label and went from store to store looking for the same suit. They finally found a shop that sold it, close to both Wang Yang's escape room and his sister's fried noodle shop.","\"Boss, do you sell many of these suits?\"","\"This one? Not many. Usually, there aren't many buyers. We have to wait until graduation season when college students need to find jobs. Those who can't afford expensive suits come here. They're very cheap but look smart.\"","Fang Rui showed her Wang Yang's photo. \"Boss, do you know this man?\"","\"Yes, that's Boss Wang. He's been quite unlucky lately. His shop closed down, and he's in a lot of debt.\"","\"Has he bought a suit from you?\"","\"No. Although he's a boss, he's not particular about his appearance. He wouldn't buy a suit. And don't be fooled by him owning a shop, he's always been broke. He kept his shop running by borrowing money!\"","Fang Rui thought for a moment and asked, \"What about his family? Has anyone bought this suit? Like his brother-in-law?\"","\"Ah! Come to think of it, his brother-in-law might have bought one. He's in sales and bought a suit here before. It was this brand.\"","Fang Rui and Zhang exchanged glances, thinking Wang Yang might have stolen his brother-in-law's suit.","To be thorough, Fang Rui asked another question, \"What size suit did his brother-in-law buy?\"","\"XL, the largest size. His brother-in-law is a big guy, he can only fit that size.\"","\"...\"","Fang Rui and Zhang visited a few more stores, all confirming that Wang Yang hadn't bought that suit.","\"Boss, this lead seems to be a dead end,\" Zhang sighed. \"How can we find evidence to catch Wang Yang?\"","\"Zhang, there's no evidence proving Wang Yang is the killer yet. Don't jump to conclusions,\" Fang Rui reminded him.","Two more days passed without progress on the case.","Meanwhile, \"Edgar Allan Poe's Cottage\" escape room was facing backlash. Online rumors spread about someone being hanged there, with conspiracy theories suggesting the victim died by accidentally triggering a mechanism. The shop received many negative reviews, damaging its reputation and leaving it deserted.","Early in the morning, Mu Mian arrived at the office carrying several parcels. She opened one to reveal a delicate small brush. Another contained a wizard's robe and a wand made from a radius bone.","Mu Mian thought the skeleton bride's outfit wasn't very attractive and wanted to change its clothes.","The skeleton bride's dress was laced up and difficult to remove. Mu Mian tried for a while but got tired, so she asked Fang Rui for help.","\"Fang Rui, quick, help me take off its clothes.\"","\"Okay.\" Fang Rui found a pair of scissors and cut the dress to pieces. Freed from the bulky bridal gown, the skeleton soon revealed its thin, slender frame.","\"Fang Rui, you're so violent!\" Mu Mian complained, but quickly praised him, \"Your method is brilliant, solving the problem instantly. Fang Rui, you're so smart!\"","At that moment, Mu Mian and Fang Rui simultaneously noticed a black fabric object inside the skeleton's ribcage.","\"What's this?\""]},{"number":66,"title":"Chapter 66: Haunted House Mystery: Blank Secret Letter","paragraphs":["The black object was lodged firmly in the skeleton's chest cavity. Fang Rui had to exert some effort to remove it from the ribcage.","\"Fang Rui, be careful! Don't break it,\" Mu Mian watched nervously. \"Fang Rui, you're being too careless! You've broken one of its ribs. Oh no, you've broken another one!\"","\"I'm sorry, Mu Mian. I didn't mean to. Since it's damaged now, why don't we just throw it away?\" Fang Rui felt that the skeleton's presence was seriously affecting Mu Mian's work efficiency, and he needed to set things right.","\"It's okay, I'll glue it back together later. I'm going to dress it up anyway, so the damage won't be visible.\" But Mu Mian still felt heartbroken. After all, this was the first gift Fang Rui had given her!","Fang Rui extracted the black object, and they discovered it was a black backpack. A hexagram pendant hung from the zipper.","The bag was flat, containing only a book and a pen, with nothing else inside.","\"This looks like the bag Liu Xiaonian had when he disappeared,\" Mu Mian said. \"Look, it has the same hexagram pendant. So it was hidden here all along. But in the video, it looked full. Why is it so flat now?\"","\"Someone must have taken the contents out.\"","Earlier, Fang Rui and his team had searched the skeleton bride, but they had only looked at the lower half. They hadn't imagined that the victim's backpack would be hidden in the skeleton's chest cavity.","Fang Rui found it strange. Why would the killer hide the bag inside this skeleton bride? Wouldn't it have been safer to take it out and dispose of it?","Or was he afraid of being caught on camera carrying the bag? But the bag wasn't very thick; it could have been easily concealed under clothing to avoid detection.","Fang Rui suddenly had a very outlandish theory. He wanted to share it with Mu Mian, but she was sadly stroking the broken rib of the skeleton, completely ignoring him.","Mu Mian found some glue in the cabinet and carefully glued the rib back. She even considered buying paint to cover up the crack, but it was work hours, and she couldn't leave.","Mu Mian dressed the skeleton in a black wizard's robe and put a wizard's hat on it.","The skeleton's joints were movable, so Mu Mian adjusted the angle of its hand to hold a magic wand made from a radius bone.","In an instant, it transformed from a beautiful bride into a cold, evil wizard. Mu Mian was very satisfied with its new appearance.","\"Mu Mian, what are you doing... Wow, it looks so cool now!\" Chen Xue couldn't help but exclaim. \"Is it an evil wizard now?\"","\"Yes, it's a necromancer. It can turn corpses and bones into minions to fight for it. When I was little, my dream was to become a necromancer so I could summon many undead to be my friends. Ah, it's a pity there's no magic in this world.\"","As a child, Mu Mian wasn't so scientifically minded and was even obsessed with studying magic. It was only after her magical worldview collapsed that she became passionately in love with science. Because, in a sense, science is modern-day magic.","\"So that's why you became a forensic scientist?\" Chen Xue asked.","Mu Mian didn't answer her because she noticed that her necromancer's wand-holding pose looked unnatural, so she adjusted the position of its fingers again.","Chen Xue was exasperated. Ever since Mu Mian got this thing, she had lost interest in socializing and barely talked to her anymore.","Chen Xue suddenly had a wicked thought. She desperately wanted to steal this skeleton wizard and throw it in the trash!","Fang Rui examined the black backpack. It wasn't damaged and contained only a book and a pen.","The book was a recently popular detective novel, \"The Home Where I Died Before.\" Fang Rui flipped through it casually and found two blank envelopes inside. The envelopes had no writing on them and seemed to have been used as bookmarks.","But the envelopes were thick, as if they contained something. Fang Rui opened one of the envelopes and found only a folded white paper inside. He opened the other envelope and found the same thing - a folded white paper.","It was strange. Why put a blank piece of paper in an empty envelope? Fang Rui put the paper back in the envelope and placed it in an evidence bag.","Fang Rui checked the compartments of the backpack and found nothing. But suddenly, he noticed some red substance stuck to the inner lining of the bag, which looked like paint or lipstick marks.","It seemed his guess was correct.","Fang Rui went to find Wang Yang again and asked him to send him the design sketches drawn by the designer.","After comparing the two sketches, Fang Rui noticed some differences.","The most obvious difference was that in the designer's sketch, the bride and groom appeared as a pair, while in Liu Xiaonian's sketch, there was an additional lone groom, just like at the crime scene.","\"Zhang, take this bag to the Technical Department and have them analyze what this red substance is,\" Fang Rui said to Zhang.","\"Alright.\" Zhang looked at the red marks that resembled bloodstains. \"This looks like makeup, probably lipstick or eyeshadow or something like that.\"","At that moment, Fang Rui saw that Lin Sen had come to work.","\"Consultant Lin, weren't you borrowed by the neighboring city to solve a case?\" Zhang was a bit surprised to see him. \"Did the case end so quickly? That's incredibly efficient!\"","A serial killing case had occurred in the neighboring city, where the killer had abducted young girls and cruelly steamed them. The case had remained unsolved, so the bureau chief had generously lent Lin Sen to help solve it.","\"Mm-hmm.\"","Fang Rui looked at Lin Sen for a moment. \"Has your heartbreak healed as well?\"","\"...\"","\"What heartbreak?\" Zhang immediately became curious. \"Consultant Lin was dumped? My goodness, who would dump Consultant Lin? They must have no taste!\"","\"Zhang, quickly take this bag for analysis. Let me know the results as soon as they're out,\" Fang Rui sent Zhang away.","\"Alright.\"","Fang Rui told Lin Sen the details of the case and then shared his speculations.","\"Do you think my deduction is reasonable?\"","\"Very reasonable.\"","Fang Rui asked, \"But don't you think it's far-fetched? I can't figure out what his motive could be for doing this.\"","\"Could it be that you're overthinking it?\"","Fang Rui took out the two blank envelopes again: \"These two letters couldn't be meant for us, could they? But there's not a single word on them. What was his purpose in leaving these two letters?\"","Although Lin Sen didn't know Liu Xiaonian very well, he had a general idea of his personality. Lin Sen said, \"This is probably a puzzle that we need to solve.\"","\"How do we solve it?\"","\"I'm sorry, but I'm currently suffering from severe heartbreak and don't have the energy to help you solve puzzles.\"","\"... Lin Sen, do you have to be so petty? I was just teasing you earlier, I didn't mean to mock you.\"","Lin Sen gave him a cold glance, \"I'm sorry, but right now I'm just a petty, heartbroken person.\"","\"Fine, I'll go find Mu Mian later. She's much smarter than you!\"","\"Are you sure she has time to pay attention to you right now?\"","\"...\""]},{"number":67,"title":"Chapter 67: Mystery of the Haunted House: A One-Star Review at the Cost of Life","paragraphs":["Fang Rui found the shipping record of that suit from the online store. He discovered that a user named \"Year After Year Abundance\" had bought a size L suit, and this person's delivery address was the same residential compound where Liu Xiaonian lived.","\"Boss, do you think this 'Year After Year Abundance' could be Liu Xiaonian?\" Zhang asked in shock. \"Did he buy the suit himself? Could he be into Cosplay in escape rooms?\"","During the case analysis meeting, Fang Rui presented his deduction: \"I suspect there's no murderer in this case. The victim hanged himself.\"","Wang objected, \"Wait, boss, you're saying he committed suicide by hanging? How is that possible? Dr. Mu detected sleeping pills in his system. No one would drug themselves before hanging, right?\"","\"Exactly. And he was wearing a blood-stained suit. He couldn't have put that on himself, could he?\"","\"Even if he wanted to commit suicide, why would he go to such a creepy place? What was the point?\"","However, Mu Mian eagerly raised her hand, \"I support Fang Rui's theory. If this were truly a murder case, the killer wouldn't have dressed the victim as a horror groom because that would automatically make us suspect murder. It's completely unnecessary. But if we think about it in reverse, if the victim committed suicide, this setup would easily disguise it as a murder.\"","Mu Mian had always felt that whoever killed the victim must have been very intelligent and wouldn't make such a foolish mistake. Unless they deliberately wanted the case to be treated as a murder.","Fang Rui turned to Mu Mian: \"Mu Mian, when did you start suspecting it was suicide?\"","\"When I first saw the body. I felt then that the mechanism was very suitable for suicide. After activating it, the noose rises very slowly. He would have had plenty of time to walk over and put his neck in it. Of course, if he wanted to change his mind, he would have had a few seconds to do so.\"","\"Why didn't you tell me this at the time?\" Fang Rui asked, somewhat exasperated.","\"I didn't have any evidence. I was afraid of misleading you.\"","\"Boss, we still don't have any concrete evidence now! These are just our speculations,\" Wang pointed out.","Fang Rui said, \"Do you remember the bag Liu Xiaonian was carrying in the surveillance video?\"","\"Yes, it was black.\"","\"We found that black bag inside the chest cavity of the skeleton bride, and it only contained a book. It looked quite flat,\" Fang Rui replayed the video on the screen. \"But in the surveillance footage, that bag was bulging, full of things. I suspect that when Liu Xiaonian went in, the bag he was carrying contained that suit.\"","Fang Rui continued, \"We found red substances in the bag. The tech team has already tested it, and it's a type of theatrical makeup pigment, the same as the one on the suit. Moreover, Liu Xiaonian had purchased this suit online. All of this suggests that Liu Xiaonian made the bloody suit himself and brought it in.\"","\"And he put it on himself,\" Mu Mian added. \"His inner clothes weren't wrinkled, which indirectly proves that he most likely put on the clothes himself. Because even if he were unconscious, it would be very difficult for someone else to dress him without wrinkling his inner clothes.\"","\"But how do we explain the sleeping pills?\" Chen Xue asked. \"Why were sleeping pills detected in the victim's system?\"","\"Liu Xiaonian had sleep issues. His parents confirmed that he had seen a doctor at the hospital, and the doctor had prescribed him sleeping pills,\" Fang Rui added.","All the evidence pieced together almost conclusively proved that Liu Xiaonian had hanged himself.","\"But what about the motive?\" Zhang asked. \"What could be his motive for going to that escape room to commit suicide?\"","Everyone fell silent for a moment.","\"Maybe to give the store a bad review,\" Lin Sen said quietly.","\"Lin, consultant, that's too far-fetched. Who would hang themselves in a store just to give it a bad review?\" Chen Xue found this guess too outlandish.","Lin Sen continued, \"Giving the store a bad review is just the surface reason. The deeper reason is that escape rooms were the most important thing in his life, the meaning that kept him going. But that store tarnished the most sacred thing in his heart, so he was willing to use his life to take revenge on that store.\"","The current physical evidence was almost enough to prove that Liu Xiaonian had committed suicide.","Fang Rui then remembered the two blank envelopes. He took them and went to find Mu Mian.","Mu Mian was seriously brushing non-existent dust off the skeleton.","Fang Rui felt that this skeleton was seriously interfering with Mu Mian's work. She had never slacked off at work before!","It seemed necessary to make this skeleton disappear.","\"Fang Rui, were you looking for me?\"","\"Mu Mian, is there any way to make words disappear from paper?\" Fang Rui asked. His instinct told him that there should be words on those two envelopes, words that would tell them the reason for the victim's suicide.","\"There are many ways! We can write with colorless phenolphthalein, and once it dries, the words will disappear. We can also use lemon juice or vinegar...\" Mu Mian listed many methods. \"But to make the words appear again, we'd have to try many different methods.\"","\"Can you see if there are any words on these two envelopes?\" Fang Rui handed the envelopes to Mu Mian.","\"No problem.\"","Mu Mian had been very lucky recently. She only tried one method before making the words on the envelopes appear.","Mu Mian discovered that the words on the envelopes were written with colorless phenolphthalein. They just needed to apply an alkaline solution to make the words visible.","The words on the first envelope read: Congratulations on solving my suicide puzzle. Please read the letter inside for answers.","The other envelope read: To Dad.","Using the same method, Mu Mian revealed the words on the white paper inside the first envelope.","[To the clever police officer (sir or madam):","Congratulations, you have successfully solved my suicide puzzle. Your prize is that you will now know the whole truth about my suicide.","I've wanted to commit suicide since high school. But I didn't. Because suicide is a cowardly way to die, not only does it not garner sympathy, but it also invites criticism. I didn't want to become a topic of gossip.","So, I thought about disguising my death as a murder. This way, people would sympathize with me, mourn for me, rather than mock me for being weak. I considered many ways to kill myself but never went through with any of them. Maybe I was still afraid of death.","I had initially planned to commit suicide at the \"Lost Island\" escape room. I even drew up the blueprints. But Eldest Brother Wang was too kind to me. He never mocked my hobbies or called me useless. So I didn't want to die anymore. I felt that life was still pretty good.","Unexpectedly, just when I wanted to live on, \"Poe's Cabin\" ruined my life!","Now, I suppose no one dares to patronize that store anymore? Is it about to go out of business? Haha, that's the effect I wanted to achieve.","Before entering the escape room that day, I put on a suit similar to the prop corpse outside. Then I stuffed the bag containing my clothes into the chest cavity of the skeleton bride. I figured you wouldn't search there immediately. I couldn't let you find this bag easily, otherwise you would quickly determine the case as a suicide, and then it wouldn't have the devastating impact on that store.","I took sleeping pills before I died. This way, you definitely wouldn't classify this case as a suicide.","I even deliberately left the blueprints in the drawer. Based on the dates on the blueprints, you would think that the store owner or Eldest Brother Wang killed me to cover up their plagiarism. This would provide a motive for the murderer.","But in fact, those blueprints were what I used to design my death. The dates are real, but the content of the blueprints was drawn based on Eldest Brother Wang's descriptions in the group chat. If you observe carefully, you'll notice that there's the same little figure in each design sketch - that's me.","At that time, I wanted to commit suicide in that escape room. I never thought I would eventually fulfill my wish.","I learned from Eldest Brother Wang's Weibo account post that he had deliberately injured his hand that morning, in order to ask for leave from his sister in the afternoon to play an escape room at that store. So I chose to commit suicide that day, adding another suspect and making the case more complex. Of course, if you investigate further, you'll find that Eldest Brother Wang couldn't be the murderer.","In the end, you can only come to one conclusion: I committed suicide. By then, you'll surely find various pieces of evidence proving that I took my own life. But that store will have its reputation ruined because of this murder case, and no one will dare to play there anymore.","You might not understand what escape rooms mean to me. They are the most important thing in my life, my spiritual pillar, my only joy in living. But that store destroyed it; it shattered the crystal of my life. I can't go on living.","So I want to destroy it. Even at the cost of my own life.","You might laugh at me, thinking that I don't value my life at all. But it doesn't matter, I'm just a useless person who's ridiculed and wastes food while alive anyway.","Please help me deliver another letter to my father. It's fine if you don't give it to him, just throw it away then. He probably wouldn't read it anyway.","That's all. This worthless person is leaving this world now. I'm going to explore another world, if it exists.】","Everyone was speechless after reading this letter. So Liu Xiaonian really did hang himself in the escape room to take revenge on that store.","However, this Liu Xiaonian was quite clever, designing such a complex case that led the police investigation in the direction he wanted.","Mu Mian asked, \"Do we need to reveal the contents of the letter for his father?\""]},{"number":68,"title":"Chapter 68: Ghost House Mystery: Letter to Father","paragraphs":["Fang Rui and Zhang visited Liu Xiaonian's home again.","Upon learning the true reason for Liu Xiaonian's death, Liu Xiaonian's Mother wasn't surprised, as if she had guessed it all along.","Liu Xiaonian's Mother sighed, \"Poor Xiaonian, he lived such a hard life! Ah, it's our fault. We were too concerned about saving face back then, always pushing him to study, never giving him a happy childhood. It's all our fault.\"","Liu's father, however, was shocked: \"How could he commit suicide? He had such thick skin. No matter how much I scolded him, he never reacted. How could someone like him commit suicide?\"","\"Old man, are you still refusing to admit your mistakes? If we hadn't always used oppressive education methods, would Xiaonian have ended up like this? He suffered from depression, do you know that? He had no energy to go out and work, no ability to socialize. This isn't his fault, it's ours. We killed him!\"","Liu's father was left speechless by this rebuke.","Fang Rui handed the letter to his parents, \"This is what Liu Xiaonian asked us to give you.\"","\"Is this Xiaonian's suicide note?\"","\"It should be.\"","Liu Xiaonian's Mother's eyes welled up with tears again as she tremblingly took the letter.","At first, Liu's father stubbornly refused to look at the letter, but when Liu Xiaonian's Mother took out the paper, he turned to look.","\"Oh my, why are there no words?\"","Just as Fang Rui was about to tell them how to make the words appear, Liu's father said, \"These words were written with colorless phenolphthalein. When it dries, the words disappear. To make them reappear, you need to apply an alkaline solution. I taught this to Xiaonian when he was little. We used to do small experiments together back then.\"","Liu's father broke down in tears.","[Dear Dad,","By the time you see this letter, I will have been gone for many days. I don't know if you'll be sad for me. I both hope you will be and hope you won't be. See, I've always been such a contradictory person.","I wonder if you thought of my childhood when you saw this blank paper. You must have remembered, otherwise you might not have been able to see these words.","When I was little, you always did various small experiments with me, telling me all sorts of interesting facts. It was then that I fell in love with solving mysteries and exploring the unknown.","But as I grew up, your expectations for me became higher and higher. I had to work very, very hard to meet your demands. In others' eyes, I was both a top student and a dull, uninteresting study machine. I had no dreams of my own, no hobbies, and wasn't even allowed to have happiness.","I know you love me, but your love was too heavy. Dad, I'm not your appendage. I hope you can understand that my glory won't become your glory, and likewise, my shame won't be your shame. We are separate individuals.","Later, I finally found my own hobby. You might think I was wasting my life on trivial pursuits, but I was truly happy when playing escape rooms. It took me back to my childhood, when we used to explore various problems together. I loved that feeling of excitement when finding the answer.","Dad, I'm leaving this letter not to make you understand me, nor to make you feel guilty. I just want to tell you that the time you saw as a period of degradation was actually the happiest time of my life. During that time, I was truly alive.","Dad, please apologize to Mom for me. She really is the best mother in the world. If there's a next life, I hope I can still be her child. In the next life, I'll work hard to become her pride. There's no chance in this life anymore.","Dad, Mom, you don't need to miss me. Just forget about me. Please scatter my ashes in the sea. I hope the waves can take me to far, far away places. I want to see more unknown worlds.]","Tears kept falling onto the paper, slowly blurring it. But no matter how much they regretted, time couldn't be turned back, and the dead could never return.","\"Edgar Allan Poe's Cabin\" reopened after a few days, launching a brand new scenario. They invited some local internet celebrities for free experiences.","They even used the \"someone hanged themselves here\" incident as a selling point to upgrade the horror factor of the escape room. It quickly became popular again.","The young people who went there to play didn't care much whether someone had died there or not. They even felt it made the experience more thrilling.","After learning the truth about Liu Xiaonian's suicide, Wang Yang and Li Bin both cried their hearts out. Only they could understand why Liu Xiaonian would take his own life.","Wang Yang decided not to open an escape room business anymore. After paying off his debts, he used the remaining money for a down payment on a house and decided to join his brother-in-law in sales. He felt he should live a more practical life now."]},{"number":69,"title":"Chapter 69: Confiscated","paragraphs":["Ever since she got that skeleton, Mu Mian stopped clinging to Fang Rui. The first thing she did every day before work was to take out her maintenance equipment: a delicate brush, and carefully clean the non-existent dust on the skeleton.","\"Mian Mian, there's no dust up there, what are you brushing?\" Chen Xue looked at Mu Mian in disbelief.","\"I'm taking good care of it.\"","Seeing her like this, Chen Xue suddenly envisioned the noble treatment Fang Rui's remains would receive. She even wondered if Mu Mian was treating it as a substitute for Fang Rui's body?","Every time Fang Rui entered Mu Mian's office, he would see that skeleton. Although it had changed into a new set of clothes, Fang Rui still found it an eyesore. The thing was too ugly.","Whenever he saw Mu Mian brushing that skeleton, he had a strong urge to tear it apart.","Fang Rui somewhat regretted giving Mu Mian this gift. The skeleton was seriously affecting Mu Mian's work state.","This couldn't go on, he had to nip Mu Mian's bad habit of slacking off at work in the bud!","\"Boss, look at you, you could have given anything, but you gave her this. Now Mu Mian doesn't even pay attention to you anymore,\" Zhang was making snarky comments on the side, \"Hey, now you're not even as good as a skeleton.\"","Fang Rui glared at him, \"Zhang Xiaoqiang, are you very free?\"","\"Boss, if you and that skeleton fell into the water at the same time, who do you think Comrade Mu Mian would save?\" Zhang asked that classic question.","\"Mu Mian can't swim,\" Fang Rui thought Mu Mian might save the skeleton. But Mu Mian couldn't swim. The result would be that he'd still have to fish out Mu Mian and her precious skeleton, which was annoying just to think about.","\"But don't worry, Boss. The clever Zhang has a good idea.\" Zhang had a \"go on, ask me, ask me\" smug little expression.","\"If you want to say it, just say it quickly.\"","Zhang eagerly shared his great plan.","He didn't like that skeleton either. Every time he went in to find Chen Xue, he felt like that skeleton was staring at him, giving him the creeps.","He had wanted to do something about that skeleton for a long time.","The next day, when Mu Mian opened her office door and took out her little brush from the cabinet as usual, she was surprised to find that the skeleton was gone.","The magic wand made from the radius bone lay lonely on the ground.","Damn it, how dare a thief steal something from a police station! He's too brazen!","Mu Mian was both sad and angry. She quickly sent a message in the large group chat.","Mu Mian: Something terrible happened, a thief broke into my office and stole the gift Fang Rui gave me, a very beautiful resin skeleton. It was wearing a lich wizard's clothes, it was so cool. I need help, everyone please help me catch the thief quickly.","Zhang: Maybe it really turned into a lich wizard and burrowed into the ground?","Mu Mian: Officer Zhang, there's no magic in this world. Besides, lich wizards can only summon corpses and skeleton minions from the ground, they can't burrow into the soil themselves. They would suffocate. Only earth mages can burrow around in the soil.","Zhang: ......","Director Wang Yong: Little Mu, I confiscated your skeleton. The higher-ups are coming for an inspection soon, and having such a thing in your office would seriously affect our city bureau's image.","Mu Mian: Director, but it's not ugly.","Wang of Technical Department: My money tree isn't ugly either, it's beautifully green, but it was also confiscated, saying I was engaging in feudal superstition. It's just called a money tree, it's not like it can actually make me rich.","Old Zhang: My little pixiu was confiscated too, it's just gold-colored, not made of real gold, but they had to say I was flaunting my wealth. I'm so poor I'm jingling, what wealth could I possibly flaunt!","Director Wang Yong: ......","Director Wang Yong: You two have a lot of grievances, huh? Do you need me to do some ideological work with you?","Mu Mian was dumbfounded, so she wasn't the only unlucky one! But that was the first gift Fang Rui had given her! Mu Mian decided to try one more time.","Mu Mian: Director, can you please give it back to me? I promise I won't bring it to the bureau. [Pitiful.jpg]","Director Wang Yong: Little Mu, I'm sorry, if you had said something earlier it would have been fine. It's already been taken away by the garbage collectors. It's probably been buried in the landfill by now, I can't give it back to you.","In the corridor, Wang and Old Zhang looked helplessly at Zhang as he returned their phones to them. \"Thanks for the help, brothers.\"","Wang felt a bit guilty: \"Don't you think this is going too far? Forensic Mu looks really upset, she genuinely liked that creepy thing.\"","\"Didn't you find that creepy thing scary?\" Zhang asked in return.","\"Uh... a bit. One night when I was working overtime, I passed by Forensic Mu's office and accidentally glanced inside. My god, it scared me to death. Zhang, you did very well! I didn't expect you to be so useful this time.\"","\"Haven't I always been useful? It's just that the boss and others are too smart, overshadowing my brilliance.\"","\"Hmm... you're very funny.\"","When Fang Rui entered Mu Mian's office, he saw her hugging the magic wand made from the radius bone, looking very dejected.","Fang Rui held his head, damn it, he forgot to take away that bone!","\"Fang Rui, the first gift you gave me was confiscated by the director. It was taken to the garbage station, and can never be found again.\" Mu Mian's voice was tearful.","Seeing her like this, Fang Rui somewhat regretted listening to Zhang's bad idea. He thought, if worst comes to worst, he could just go down to the storage room and bring that skeleton back to Mu Mian.","\"Fang Rui, I'm sorry, I didn't protect the gift you gave me well.\" Mu Mian felt overwhelmed by immense sadness. Fang Rui had finally given her a gift, and it was confiscated.","\"You care about it because it was a gift from me?\" Fang Rui was a bit surprised. He thought Mu Mian just liked that skeleton.","\"Of course, it was the first gift you gave me, I took very good care of it, maintaining it every day,\" Mu Mian said, \"I used to have many resin skeleton models like that at home, my dad even gave me a real one, but all of them combined weren't as good as the one you gave me.\"","\"I see... Then I'll give you other gifts in the future.\" Fang Rui patted her head.","Mu Mian's eyes immediately lit up, \"Really?\"","\"Yes. But I can't give you this anymore. That skeleton gift wasn't good at all, because every time I saw it, I felt very scared. I think it's quite good that it was confiscated.\"","\"But you weren't afraid of those prop corpses in that escape room store.\"","\"They were just corpses, this was a skeleton, there's a difference.\"","\"Okay. So you're afraid of skeletons.\" Mu Mian felt regretful, bones were so beautiful, yet Fang Rui was afraid of them. She decided not to let Fang Rui see her carefully collected bone specimens in the future.","She was afraid Fang Rui would be scared to death.","\"Fang Rui, next time you give me a gift, can you give me a body donation agreement?\" Mu Mian carefully negotiated with him, \"That would make me happy for many years.\"","Fang Rui neither refused nor agreed, he asked, \"You're not sad anymore now?\"","\"Not sad. If I had known you didn't like it, I wouldn't have taken such good care of it,\" Mu Mian cheered up again, \"You don't know, maintaining it every day was very tiring for me. I was so tired I had no energy for socializing.\"","\"...Do you care that much about the gifts I give you?\"","So Mu Mian liked that skeleton because it was a gift from him.","\"Of course. I cherish every gift I receive. Sister says every gift should be treated well.\" Mu Mian thought of Jiang Yun and quickly added, \"Except for that pink little bag, it was too ugly, I couldn't keep it.\"","\"Who gave it to you?\"","\"Miss Jiang gave it to me. She's the worst gift-giver I've ever met.\" Mu Mian sighed, \"You can't even imagine how ugly that pink bag was.\"","\"......\"","Chen Xue noticed that Mu Mian, who had just looked like the sky was falling, had fully recovered after just a short conversation with Fang Rui.","\"Mu Mian, your lich wizard was confiscated, and you were only sad for such a short while?\" Chen Xue felt a bit sorry for the skeleton lying in the storage room among a pile of miscellaneous items.","Mu Mian's love was too short-lived, it didn't even need time to erode, it was gone in an instant.","\"Fang Rui has agreed to give me a different gift. I asked him to give me a body donation form, and he didn't refuse,\" Mu Mian said with a slightly smug expression.","\"But he didn't agree either!\" Chen Xue had heard their entire conversation clearly, as they hadn't paid any attention to her presence in the office.","\"That's true, so I still need to work on it,\" Mu Mian replied.","\"Well, keep at it then,\" Chen Xue encouraged."]},{"number":70,"title":"Chapter 70: Couple Butchers: Show Affection, Die Fast","paragraphs":["Recently, due to a typhoon making landfall, Jiangzhou City has been experiencing continuous rain and overcast weather. Since yesterday evening, a fine drizzle has been falling incessantly from the sky, making the streets wet and slippery after nightfall.","At the end of a quiet residential area, in an empty abandoned warehouse: Light spills out from a window, and in the thick, damp air, someone is hiding in the shadows...","\"Hello, are you awake?\" A harsh mechanical voice rings out, \"Let's play a game.\"","\"Who are you? No, no... don't kill us... please...\" The girl, realizing her surroundings, tries to shrink back in terror, but she's firmly fixed to the chair, her hands and feet bound with rope, even her head immobilized by a cold metal frame, completely unable to move.","Her suddenly dilated pupils reflect a young man in a white short-sleeved shirt - her boyfriend. His hands and feet are similarly bound with rope, sitting in a chair. He's now slowly opening his eyes.","\"Jie, are you alright?\"","\"Waa, Ah Chen, what's going on, how did we end up here?\"","The young man named Ah Chen struggles violently, \"Who are you? Do you want money? We'll give it to you, if it's not enough, I can call my parents and ask for more.\"","\"Don't you want to play my game?\"","The constant buzzing of electricity makes the girl's scalp tingle.","\"No, we'll play! If... if we win, will you... will you let us go?\"","\"Of course, if you win, I'll let you go,\" a hint of amusement creeps into the distorted voice, \"Now, let's go over the rules of the game...\"","The wail of police sirens breaks the tranquility of Jiangzhou University. Soon, the small woods outside the north gate of Jiangzhou University are cordoned off with yellow police tape.","Jiangzhou University is located in the suburbs and covers a large area. Outside the school gates is a large wooded area, planted with various vegetation, lush and green, with beautiful scenery.","There's also a beautiful artificial lake by the woods, so many people from outside the school often come there for leisure.","At this moment, the edge of the woods is crowded with students, all discussing among themselves.","\"Did you hear? A young couple committed suicide together in these woods. The girl was apparently the beauty queen of the School of Literature.\"","\"From the School of Literature?\"","\"Oh my god, weren't they that famous lovey-dovey couple on campus? Why would they follow the ancients and die together?\"","\"Don't talk nonsense, this isn't a suicide pact, they were robbed by criminals. Oh, it's not right to gossip about the dead!\"","\"That's not right, what kind of robber kills people and then digs a hole to bury the bodies? It must be murder! Maybe the killer is a psychopath who specifically targets couples who like to show off their love.\"","\"All you couples out there should tone it down a bit recently. Be careful, or you might be the killer's next target.\"","\"Come on, stop fear-mongering. I think you single dogs are just spreading rumors because you're jealous of people in relationships.\"","The onlooking students crowd against the police line, all standing on tiptoes to get a better view. Many have taken out their phones to take pictures.","They can see two bodies lying side by side in the muddy pit. The mud obscures their features, but they're wearing matching red hoodies. Their hands are tightly clasped together, each holding a vibrant red rose in their other hand.","The bodies were found in a grove of golden rain trees. The trees are covered in clusters of light purple spherical fruits, looking like beautiful flowers adorning the branches. The ground is also covered in fallen flowers and fruits, giving the scene a romantic beauty.","If one could ignore the pale faces of the deceased, the scene would almost be romantically tragic.","The woods are dense, the ground covered in fallen flowers and fruits. With the heavy rain the night before, the ground is saturated, squelching underfoot. Mu Mian very much dislikes this sensation.","Zhang points at the two bodies in the pit and says, \"We have two victims, one male and one female. This morning, a sanitation worker passing through the woods slipped and noticed a tuft of hair sticking out from the fallen leaves. He felt something was off and quickly brushed away the soil layer, discovering a male corpse. He immediately called the police. During the excavation process, we found another female corpse next to the male...\"","Zhang continues to brief on the case, \"Student IDs found at the scene show that the girl is named Wang Jie, a sophomore from the School of Literature; the boy is Zhang Shuochen, a junior from the School of Law. They were a couple...\"","It's been raining recently, with a particularly heavy downpour last night. The rain has washed away any traces around the dump site, and the police haven't found any suspicious footprints or tire tracks in the vicinity.","The wooded area covers several acres, with no surveillance at the entrances or exits.","The victims' clothes are intact, both wearing red couple hoodies, as if they had been carefully dressed.","The victims' IDs, phones, and valuables haven't been taken. It seems the killer wasn't after money.","Mu Mian conducts a preliminary examination of the external features of both bodies. Both victims show severe corneal clouding, obvious autolysis, and have developed putrefaction blisters.","\"Initial assessment suggests the victims have been dead for 2-3 days. The exact time of death will require further analysis,\" Mu Mian says.","Both victims have slight abrasions on their wrists and ankles, likely caused by rope bindings; the male victim has a bruise on his jaw and back, possibly from resisting; both victims have an oval-shaped wound on their arms. However, Mu Mian doesn't find any fatal injuries on their bodies.","\"Mu Mian, could they have died from suffocation?\" Chen Xue looks at the pit and speculates, \"The victims' bodies don't have severe external injuries, nor signs of poisoning. Could the killer have buried them alive?\"","The killer didn't bury the bodies very deep, and the recent continuous heavy rain had washed away some of the soil, which is how the sanitation worker who came to clean the woods discovered them.","\"It doesn't seem likely,\" Mu Mian looks at the oval-shaped wounds, a theory forming in her mind, \"They might have died from electrocution.\"","\"Electrocution?\"","\"The victims have an oval-shaped wound on their arms, 8mm in diameter, yellowish-brown in color, with a small opening and larger base, depressed center and raised edges, like a volcano crater. This is typical of an electrical burn mark,\" Mu Mian explains, \"However, we'll need to conduct a thorough autopsy on the victims to confirm the cause of death.\"","\"Why would the killer electrocute the victims?\" Chen Xue finds it hard to comprehend. Usually, electrocution deaths are accidental, it's rare for a killer to deliberately electrocute victims.","Moreover, if the killer really did use electrocution to kill the victims, they could have easily disguised it as an accidental electrocution, which would be less likely to arouse police suspicion.","Mu Mian doesn't answer her question, as her attention is drawn to a gelatinous substance on the female victim's scalp. She checks the male victim's hair and finds the same substance on his scalp as well.","Zhang speculates, \"Could it be that the killer was jealous of the two victims, so they tortured them with electrocution? There used to be an interrogation method that used electric shocks to question suspects.\"","Chen Xue thinks Zhang's analysis makes sense: \"That's very possible! In any case, this killer must really hate people who show off their love!\"","Looking at the two victims, Fang Rui suddenly recalls an unsolved major case. Half a year ago, there were two couple murders in Linzhou City, but the killer was never caught."]},{"number":71,"title":"Chapter 71: The Couple Butchers: An Old Case","paragraphs":["Upon returning to the bureau, Fang Rui retrieved the case files for the Linzhou City incident from the archives room.","The crime had occurred six months ago, with the victims' bodies discovered in a wasteland near an industrial zone.","At the time, someone had purchased the wasteland intending to build a warehouse. However, during excavation, bodies were suddenly unearthed from beneath the ground. Four corpses were found at once, shocking the entire Linzhou City.","The four bodies were buried in two separate locations. Initially, the construction crew only uncovered one grave, but after the police conducted a thorough excavation of the entire wasteland, they discovered another pair of bodies in a corner of the area.","In the first grave were two victims, a married couple - one male and one female.","Victim 1: Chen Meiqin, female, 45 years old, seamstress at a furniture factory; Time of death: April-May 2018; Crime scene: Wasteland near the factory area on Changfeng Street, Baixi District, Linzhou City; Scene investigation: Body severely decomposed, no apparent wounds found upon examination, cause of death unknown.","Victim 2: Zhang Mingqiang, male, 47 years old, carpenter at a furniture factory; Time of death: April-May 2018; Crime scene: Wasteland near the factory area on Changfeng Street, Baixi District, Linzhou City; Scene investigation: No apparent wounds found upon examination, body severely decomposed, no obvious injuries detected, cause of death unknown.","The couple had been married for 25 years and had a good relationship. Both victims were known to be kind-hearted and had simple social connections. As a result, the police investigation into the victims' social circles did not yield any suspects. Additionally, due to the severe decomposition of the bodies, it was impossible to determine the exact time of death, so the case remained unsolved.","The second grave contained two female corpses, also severely decomposed but not to the extent of the first two victims. Subsequent investigation revealed that these two female victims were in a same-sex relationship and had been dating for two years with a stable relationship.","Victim 3: Zhang Yawen, female, 28 years old, foreign trade representative; Time of death: September-late October 2018; Crime scene: Wasteland near the factory area on Changfeng Street, Baixi District, Linzhou City; Scene investigation: Victim's hand clutched a withered flower stem, body severely decomposed, no apparent injuries found upon examination, cause of death unknown.","Victim 4: Tian Xin, female, 24 years old, accountant; Time of death: September-late October 2018; Crime scene: Wasteland near the factory area on Changfeng Street, Baixi District, Linzhou City; Scene investigation: Victim's hand clutched a withered flower stem, body severely decomposed, multiple stab wounds on chest and abdomen, suspected cause of death due to massive blood loss from aortic rupture.","All four bodies were discovered at the same location, but the time of death for each couple differed.","All four victims lived and worked in the vicinity of the industrial zone. However, upon investigation, the police found no connection between the two couples, nor did they have any mutual acquaintances. The case made no progress, and the killer remains at large to this day.","\"Boss, look at these two victims holding withered flower stems in their hands. Could they be roses too?\" Zhang, having finished reviewing the case files, also felt that the Linzhou case bore similarities to the one they encountered today. \"Could the perpetrator of these cases be the same person?\"","Fang Rui's instincts told him that these cases were definitely connected.","However, the Linzhou case was not under their jurisdiction. Reopening the investigation for the Linzhou case would require the bureau chief to negotiate with the Linzhou authorities. Therefore, Fang Rui decided not to merge the investigations for now and to focus on investigating the Jiangzhou University case independently.","The victims' identities were quickly confirmed through their student IDs: Wang Jie, a sophomore from the School of Literature, and Zhang Shuochen, a junior from the School of Law. Seven days ago, both victims had requested leave from school, claiming they needed to visit the hospital, and then completely lost contact.","Fang Rui immediately sought out Wang Jie and Zhang Shuochen's roommates and teachers to inquire about the situation.","He first questioned Wang Jie's roommates. Wang Jie lived in a four-person dormitory, and her counselor had called all three of her roommates to the office.","\"Wang Jie was a very kind girl. She could be a bit of a princess sometimes, but she had a warm heart and often helped us,\" said Chen Linlin, Wang Jie's roommate. \"Last Wednesday, she told us she was going to attend an event with her boyfriend, and we haven't been able to contact her since.\"","Fang Rui noticed that when Wang Jie's roommates learned of her death, their expressions showed only shock, not sadness. It seemed that Wang Jie might not have been as kind and friendly as Chen Linlin described, and their roommate relationship didn't appear to be good.","\"Do you know what kind of event it was?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"We're not really sure. Jie said it was an event only couples could attend, and we single dogs could only envy them. But she didn't say where the event was being held or what it was about,\" Chen Linlin said, pursing her lips. \"Maybe there wasn't any event at all. She might have just gone out to play with her boyfriend and didn't want to tell us.\"","\"During the seven days she was on leave, she didn't contact you at all?\"","\"No. After she left the dorm, we never heard from her again. Last Friday, I even sent her a WeChat message asking her to pay the electricity bill, but she didn't reply to us either.\"","\"Didn't you find it strange that she was out of contact for so many days? Didn't you try to reach out to her and ask about her situation?\" Zhang asked, puzzled. Wang Jie's roommates seemed too indifferent!","\"Don't blame us!\" Li Ran, another of Wang Jie's roommates, retorted indignantly. \"We didn't dare to pry into her business. If we asked too much, she might have thought we were interested in her boyfriend and were using her to get information about him. It's ridiculous, Wang Jie treated that garbage boyfriend of hers like a treasure!\"","\"Li Ran, don't talk about Wang Jie like that. She's passed away,\" Jiang Yujue quietly reminded her.","\"Huh, look at you playing the good person!\"","Fang Rui asked, \"How was Wang Jie's relationship with her boyfriend?\"","\"Very good! Jie's boyfriend treated her extremely well, catering to her every whim,\" Chen Linlin's tone was full of envy. \"They were the model couple of our university, even featured in our school's promotional video.\"","\"Always showing off their love online, it's so fake. You guys still think it's sweet. You've had too much artificial sweetener, everything looks sweet to you!\" Li Ran chimed in sarcastically from the side.","Fang Rui turned to Li Ran: \"Li, do you think their relationship wasn't good?\"","\"I didn't say that. What does their relationship have to do with me?\" Li Ran awkwardly averted her gaze, impatiently running her fingers through her short hair. She turned to the counselor and said, \"Counselor, I have some urgent business to attend to. Can I leave now?\"","The counselor looked at Fang Rui hesitantly, and Fang Rui nodded to indicate she could go.","After Li Ran left, Fang Rui asked the remaining two, \"Was Li's relationship with Wang Jie particularly bad?\"","\"Well, their personalities just didn't mesh. Li Ran is more tomboyish, and she couldn't stand Wang Jie's princess attitude. Wang Jie also didn't like Li Ran's boyish ways, so they always rubbed each other the wrong way,\" Chen Linlin paused. \"Also, Li Ran might have had feelings for Zhang Shuochen. They were high school classmates, both from Linzhou No.1 High School next door, and used to be quite close. So that made the conflict even worse.\"","Zhang was speechless. How had this turned into a plot from a teen drama?","\"Did they know anyone outside of school?\" Fang Rui asked.","Chen Linlin thought for a moment, then shook her head. \"I don't know. Wang Jie was hardly ever in the dorm, so we don't know who she might have known.\"","\"Alright, thank you for your cooperation!\""]},{"number":72,"title":"Chapter 72: The Couple Butchers: Mysterious Couple Activities","paragraphs":["Fang Rui went to Zhang Shuochen's dormitory again to question his roommates. Zhang Shuochen lived in a six-person dorm, and when his roommates heard about his death, they all appeared very upset. One roommate even broke down crying.","\"Shuochen was fine when he took leave to attend an event. How did he suddenly pass away?\" someone sighed.","Fang Rui asked, \"Do you know what event he went to participate in?\"","\"Oh, it was because of that clingy girlfriend of his. She insisted on dragging him to some couples' event. If Shuochen had just stayed at school, he wouldn't have ended up dead.\"","\"Do you know what kind of event it was?\"","\"Shuochen said the organizers wouldn't let them reveal the event details. It was supposed to be kept secret. I felt it wasn't some proper event, being all mysterious like that. Shouldn't normal events try to get likes on social media to increase their influence? But this one told participants to keep quiet about it. I advised Shuochen not to go at the time, and he agreed at first, but then he went with his girlfriend anyway,\" Zhang Shuochen's dorm leader explained.","Fang Rui continued, \"How was Zhang Shuochen's relationship with Wang Jie?\"","\"Pretty good. Shuochen had a very good temper and always went along with his drama queen girlfriend. They had their conflicts, but they'd make up within two days every time,\" Zhang Shuochen's roommate said. \"They even opened a joint account to show off their relationship, and it has quite a lot of followers.\"","\"Can you show us the account?\"","\"Sure, just search for 'Little Wang and Little Zhang's Happy Life' in this app. Yes, that's the one with their picture as the profile image. It's all lovey-dovey content, nothing special.\"","Fang Rui briefly looked at the video titles and could see that the two were very much in love. They posted videos of everything from eating meals to taking walks, just to show off.","There were many comments under their videos. The comment section was very harmonious, with most people saying how sweet they were or expressing envy.","\"How long has it been since Zhang Shuochen last contacted you?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"A week. We tried calling him during this time, but no one answered. He's done this before; whenever he's with Wang Jie, he often goes off the grid, so we didn't think much of it. Ah, if only we had reported him missing to the police. Who could have imagined he'd be gone just like that...\"","\"Alright, thank you for your cooperation.\"","\"Boss, they all mentioned that event. Could Wang Jie and Zhang Shuochen's deaths be related to it?\" Zhang speculated. \"But there haven't been any major events specifically for couples in Jiangzhou City recently!\"","\"It might have been privately organized. These kinds of events need to be reported in advance. Can we check if there are any related activities?\" Fang Rui paused, then added, \"However, I suspect the killer might have used this as an excuse to lure them out.\"","\"This killer seems to hate couples so much. Could they have just gone through a breakup and are now jealous of these lovey-dovey couples?\"","At this moment, Fang Rui suddenly stopped in his tracks.","\"Boss, what's wrong?\" Zhang followed his line of sight and saw Bai Jing approaching.","Zhang greeted Bai Jing warmly, \"Miss Bai, what are you doing here?\"","\"Officer Zhang, Officer Fang, what a coincidence to meet you again,\" Bai Jing said, holding a few books in her arms. \"I got into graduate school, so I'm back at the university to continue my studies.\"","\"That's amazing! You managed to get into grad school in less than half a year?\" Zhang marveled. He had felt sorry for Bai Jing before, thinking a graduate from a prestigious university ended up as a community worker in a residential area. He hadn't expected she was just preparing for her graduate school entrance exams.","\"I took the exam at the end of last year and had an interview in April. I didn't expect to actually get in,\" Bai Jing smiled happily. \"And I've also found a part-time job as an assistant in a psychology clinic.\"","Fang Rui looked at Bai Jing, \"Miss Bai, what about those stray cats? Aren't you taking care of them anymore?\"","\"This place isn't far from that residential area. I can still go feed the cats every day. I won't forget my promise.\" Bai Jing glanced at her phone. \"Teacher Shen is urging me to attend her group meeting. I have to go now. Goodbye, Officer Fang, Officer Zhang!\"","\"Goodbye, Bai Jing!\" Zhang waved at her.","Fang Rui's suspicions about Bai Jing deepened. The time she started working as a community worker in that residential area coincided with when Chen Hui began his episodes. And after Chen Hui's case was closed, Bai Jing quickly resigned from that job. These coincidences seemed too convenient.","But if Bai Jing only wanted to take revenge on her father, she should have had many other ways to do so. Why would she choose to cultivate Chen Hui into a serial killer, using such an unpredictable method for revenge? Fang Rui found himself unable to identify Bai Jing's true motive for doing so.","\"Boss, what's wrong? You seem to have some hostility towards Bai Jing,\" Zhang asked, confused. He had a good impression of Bai Jing and believed that girls who liked to feed stray cats were generally kind-hearted.","\"It's nothing. Let's head back!\" Fang Rui said.","Back at the station, Fang Rui examined Wang Jie and Zhang Shuochen's phones. Zhang Shuochen's phone interface was very simple, with only daily-use apps installed. Opening his chat software, it was also straightforward. Apart from his roommates and parents, the person he contacted most frequently was Wang Jie.","Moreover, in his friends list, besides his mother, Wang Jie was the only female contact.","Fang Rui went through his chat history with Wang Jie, which was full of sickeningly sweet exchanges like \"baby\" and \"I love you.\" Nothing out of the ordinary. Fang Rui also couldn't find any chat records with the person in charge of the couples' event.","Fang Rui then checked Wang Jie's phone. Her wallpaper was extremely gaudy, and she had downloaded many strange apps. Fang Rui opened her chat software to find a long list of conversations.","Fang Rui's eyes hurt from reading her chat records, and he couldn't find the person who invited them to participate in the couples' event.","\"Boss, this Wang Jie is a social media monster, a queen of small talk. Look at how many chat records she has,\" Zhang, who had been forced to take on the task of searching through the chat records, said as he went through them one by one. \"How can she chat so much?\"","Li rolled his eyes at Zhang in exasperation: \"Don't you know there's something called a search function? You just need to enter keywords in the chat records, and you can quickly find what you're looking for.\"","Zhang retorted, \"What if they used code words? It's not good to rely too much on technology. If you don't carefully read every chat record, you might miss important clues!\"","Li felt a pang of guilt at Zhang's words. It was his mistake for trying to take shortcuts. He was at fault!","\"Li, what was that thing you just mentioned?\" Zhang mumbled. \"How come when I enter the keyword 'couples event,' it shows no results?\"","\"...That's the limitation of technology! You'll have to slowly go through the chat records manually.\"","Zhang went through all the chat records again but couldn't find the mysterious person who invited Wang Jie and Zhang Shuochen to participate in the couples' event."]},{"number":73,"title":"Chapter 73: Couple Butchers: Electric Torture Killing","paragraphs":["The autopsy report came out quickly, and Mu Mian reported at the morning meeting:","\"Based on the decomposition characteristics of the bodies, we estimate the time of death to be about 2-3 days ago, between October 27th and October 28th.","We found electric current marks and skin metallization on the arms of both victims, indicating their deaths were related to electrocution, but the exact causes differ.","The male victim died from cardiac arrest. The strong electric current passing through his heart disrupted its normal rhythm, leading to sudden cardiac arrest. The female victim died from organ failure. As the current passed through her body, it damaged her internal tissues and organs, resulting in pulmonary edema and pulmonary hemorrhage.","We found abrasions on both victims' wrists and ankles, likely caused by rope bindings. It's reasonable to assume that the killer tied up the victims' hands and feet before electrocuting them.","The skin around the electric current marks is yellowish-brown, indicating that the electrodes in contact with the skin were made of copper.\"","After hearing Mu Mian's report, everyone fell into a brief silence.","\"My God, was this killer really torturing this couple? Electrocuting people to death, how deranged!\" someone exclaimed.","Fang Rui then briefed everyone on a case that occurred in Linzhou City: \"A similar case happened in our neighboring city. The killer also specifically targeted couples, but was never caught.\"","After reviewing the case files, everyone drew a sharp breath.","\"Captain Fang, the wasteland where the bodies were found is right on the edge of our city, very close. Could that killer have already fled to our Jiangzhou City?\" an older officer asked.","Mu Mian looked at the case file. Because the bodies were severely decomposed when discovered, the forensic pathologist at the time only left a vague autopsy report, and the cause of death wasn't determined.","Mu Mian noticed that the victim named Tian Xin was special, as her autopsy report mentioned her cause of death: multiple stab wounds to the chest and abdomen, suspected to have died from massive bleeding due to aortic rupture; while the causes of death for the other three victims were unclear.","\"But this victim named Tian Xin has a different cause of death,\" Mu Mian raised her question, \"She didn't die from electrocution. She was stabbed multiple times and died from massive blood loss.\"","\"Could the killers in these two cases be different people?\" Zhang questioned, \"Otherwise, why would he change his killing method?\"","\"It's possible that something unexpected happened during the crime,\" Mu Mian added, \"For example, he might have lost control of this victim, or some other reason.\"","Fang Rui thought for a moment and said, \"Let's not combine these two cases for now. We'll investigate the case of Wang Jie and Zhang Shuochen independently.\"","Mu Mian was very interested in the bodies from the Linzhou case. She kept pestering Fang Rui to take her to the neighboring city to examine those bodies.","\"Fang Rui, hurry up and drive me to Linzhou. I've checked the map, it only takes three hours to get there.\"","\"Mu Mian, you probably won't be able to autopsy those bodies anymore.\"","\"Why not? The case hasn't been solved, and the killer hasn't been caught. Haven't they kept the bodies frozen?\" Mu Mian felt very disappointed, thinking there should have been many clues on those bodies.","\"The bodies have already been claimed by their families and cremated.\"","\"They're so unprofessional!\"","Mu Mian was upset about this all day. At lunch, she ate with Chen Xue in the cafeteria, and Zhang also came over with his tray.","\"Dr. Mu, what's wrong with you today? Why are you so unhappy?\"","Mu Mian kept her head down, eating. She didn't want to socialize right now.","\"Someone cremated the bodies she wanted to examine, so she's very upset!\" Chen Xue shrugged and explained helplessly.","\"Oh, don't worry, I've already come up with a great plan that will definitely make the killer turn himself in!\" Zhang said mysteriously.","Chen Xue interrupted him disapprovingly, \"Zhang, although I don't know what your plan is, I can already tell from your sleazy expression that it's probably a bad idea.\"","\"Chen Xue...\" Zhang looked at her pitifully, with an expression that said \"let me speak quickly.\"","Chen Xue sighed, \"Fine, go ahead. I promise I won't criticize you!\"","\"This killer must be a psychopath who hates seeing couples show affection, right?\"","\"Isn't that obvious? Get to the point!\"","Zhang put down his chopsticks and said seriously, \"We can find a very loving couple to show affection on TV, every day. This way, the killer will definitely be unable to resist coming out to kill that couple. We just need to wait for him to take the bait!\"","\"This idea is actually not bad.\"","\"Right? I think it's best to collaborate with internet celebrities. They can ride the wave of popularity, and we can catch the killer. It's a win-win situation,\" Zhang added.","Mu Mian thought they were too noisy. She couldn't help but pour cold water on their idea: \"What if they die?\"","\"...\"","Zhang quickly modified his strategy: \"What if people from our department pretend to be a couple? This way, if the killer targets us, we'll have the ability to fight back.\"","\"But who should we choose?\"","Mu Mian looked at Chen Xue, then at Zhang. She felt that Chen Xue had been acting strange lately, like now, playing along with Zhang, and earlier when Chen Xue was smiling stupidly at the corpse for no reason—Chen Xue had been very abnormal recently!","Zhang saw Mu Mian looking at them with a deep expression and thought she was recommending him and Chen Xue. He said reluctantly, \"You want me and Chen Xue to show affection?\"","Chen Xue blushed, \"We might not be suitable, right? If we show affection, the killer probably won't get angry, but might find it funny instead?\"","\"We can use fewer words and more eye contact. Maybe we can really provoke the killer that way,\" Zhang said seriously, \"We can learn from Wang Jie and see how she shows affection.\"","\"But how can we make sure the killer sees us showing affection?\"","\"We can also open an account like Wang Jie and her boyfriend did. We'll call it 'The Beautiful Life of the Little Forensic Pathologist and the Little Police Officer'.\"","\"Great idea!\" Chen Xue nodded in agreement, and then they started enthusiastically discussing the details of their plan.","Mu Mian suddenly realized she had been isolated by the two of them.","She wanted to say something to increase her participation, but was interrupted each time. She could only stare blankly as they shamelessly planned their so-called killer-baiting scheme, which actually had no practical value.","\"Mu Mian, why did you stop eating?\" Chen Xue noticed Mu Mian leaving glumly with her tray and asked.","\"I'm full!\"","Chen Xue wanted to say something more to Mu Mian, but was quickly pulled back into discussing their plan with Zhang.","Mu Mian returned to her office, feeling dejected. She had lost the bodies she really wanted to examine, and Chen Xue not only didn't comfort her but also isolated her along with Zhang. She was very unhappy now!","\"This is for you!\" Fang Rui handed Mu Mian a USB drive, \"It contains autopsy photos and videos of the four victims. I had a hard time getting it from our colleagues in the neighboring city.\"","\"Fang Rui, thank you!\" Mu Mian suddenly cheered up and immediately opened her computer to look at the photos.","\"Where's Chen Xue?\" Fang Rui found it strange. Chen Xue used to stick close to Mu Mian, but lately she had been disappearing every day.","\"She's with Zhang,\" Mu Mian answered distractedly, \"They're discussing the details of their killer-baiting plan. It's boring. I didn't want to listen, so I came back.\"","\"You mean you didn't understand it, right?\"","Mu Mian turned to look at Fang Rui, her expression a bit unhappy, but she nodded: \"Yes! They want to lure out the killer by showing affection. This plan is too impractical.\"","\"Why do you think it's impractical?\" Fang Rui also thought Zhang's idea was quite far-fetched.","\"They're not a real couple, how could they possibly fool the killer?\" Mu Mian explained while watching the autopsy video, \"The killer is after real couples, so he must be able to tell what kind of couple is genuine. Fake couples like Zhang and Chen Xue would be exposed immediately!\"","\"Haven't you noticed that Zhang and Chen Xue are secretly dating?\"","Mu Mian paused the video and looked at Fang Rui in confusion: \"Impossible!\"","\"Why?\"","\"If they're dating, why didn't they tell me?\" Mu Mian was a bit upset. \"I can keep a secret, I wouldn't tell anyone else.\"","\"Maybe they think some things don't need to be said out loud because everyone can see it.\"","\"I didn't see it!\"","\"That's a good thing. This way, you don't have to endure their public displays of affection every day,\" Fang Rui consoled her. \"I'm already fed up with Zhang. Last weekend, he called me in the middle of the night asking what clothes he should wear. How would I know about that? See, you don't have to deal with these kinds of troubles.\"","\"Then I'll just keep pretending I don't know.\"","Mu Mian's words suddenly reminded Fang Rui of something. If the killer was indeed specifically targeting couples, what criteria did they use to select these couples? And how did they learn about these couples in the first place?","\"Fang Rui, look at the teeth of these three victims. They're rose-colored.\""]},{"number":74,"title":"Chapter 74: Couple Butchers: Aphrodite","paragraphs":["\"Rose-colored? Do you mean livor mortis? You suspect they died from asphyxiation?\" Fang Rui asked in surprise.","Mu Mian shook her head, her eyes filled with disappointment. Ah, Fang Rui lacked some basic forensic knowledge.","\"Mu Mian, I'm not a forensic expert. It's normal that I don't know certain things,\" Fang Rui felt that Mu Mian must be secretly criticizing him in her mind again.","\"Yes, it's livor mortis, but it doesn't only appear on bodies that died from asphyxiation,\" Mu Mian explained. \"It can also occur in cases of death by electrocution, hypovolemic shock, and others. So, those three victims could have died from electrocution as well.\"","Livor mortis can be used to determine the cause of death in highly decomposed bodies. Generally, bodies that died from asphyxiation are more likely to show livor mortis.","Fang Rui decided to report this situation to the bureau chief, and if necessary, they could investigate the cases together.","By checking the surveillance cameras around the school, the police discovered that Wang Jie and Zhang Shuochen had left the school by taxi on the afternoon of October 24th, heading to a shopping mall. However, they didn't enter the mall but instead walked towards the parking lot, eventually disappearing from the camera's view.","Fang Rui questioned the mall's security guards and relevant personnel, who all stated that they hadn't planned any activities recently. The mall's surveillance videos also didn't capture Wang Jie and Zhang Shuochen.","They couldn't find the mysterious person who invited Wang Jie and Zhang Shuochen to participate in the activity, nor could they find any information about the couple's activity.","\"Boss, the tech department says that Wang Jie and Zhang Shuochen's chat records from the past few months haven't been deleted, but strangely, we can't find any record related to that couple's activity,\" Zhang said after sifting through the chat records again, his eyes hurting from the effort.","Chen Xue handed Zhang a bottle of eye drops, then took Wang Jie's phone and started helping with the search.","Mu Mian was studying the autopsy report from the Lin Zhou case when she heard Zhang's complaint. She suggested, \"Have you checked her computer? Maybe that person contacted them via email. Some email services don't require real-name registration, making it convenient to hide one's identity.\"","\"Mu Mian, you don't understand our country's situation. We rarely use email,\" Chen Xue said. After thinking for a moment, she added, \"However, when I was in college, I often played games on my computer. Could it be that the killer met and contacted them through a game?\"","They went to ask Wang Jie and Zhang Shuochen's roommates for their computers.","Li from the tech department checked Wang Jie's computer usage records and browser history, quickly finding a website called \"Love Museum.\"","Upon entering the site, a pop-up appeared:","Dear user, congratulations! You have been selected by our website. You will have the opportunity to participate in our website's couple compatibility contest. If you make it to the finals, you'll have a chance to win the grand prize of a seven-day European tour. Click here for details.","After clicking the link, the page redirected to another interface asking users to leave their personal information, including the couple's names, contact information, and email address.","Fang Rui filled in the information as prompted, but after submitting, the page showed a 404 error, indicating that the submission failed.","\"Although this website's design looks nice, its functionality is very chaotic. It's easy to crash if you click around randomly,\" Li explained. \"This is probably a phishing website.\"","\"Can we trace the personal information of the website creator?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"The server for this website is overseas. It's using a public server, so it's difficult for us to trace the IP of the user who created this website.\"","Fang Rui then had Li check Wang Jie's email, and they quickly found an email in her inbox.","The sender was called \"Aphrodite,\" and the email content was:","Miss Wang, congratulations to you and your boyfriend for being selected by our website to participate in the \"Couple Compatibility Challenge.\" The top three couples will win a seven-day, five-day, and three-day European tour respectively, with accommodation and travel expenses covered by us. Fourth to tenth place will receive a 10,000 yuan cash prize. If you agree to participate, please come to the Guodu Building between 3 PM and 5:30 PM on October 24th for on-site registration.","Please check the attachment for competition details.","The attachment was a file that detailed the specifics of the competition.","\"This is obviously fake. How could Wang Jie fall for it?\" Li couldn't help but criticize.","\"Aren't there plenty of college students who get scammed these days?\" Zhang retorted. \"The neighboring anti-fraud department receives calls from college students every day. These students are inexperienced and easy to deceive.\"","Fang Rui asked, \"Li, can you trace the user information of this email?\"","\"No, this email hasn't been verified with real-name authentication,\" Zhang shook his head. \"We can't trace the IP address either. This is an encrypted email service. They use nested addresses to prevent us from tracing the final IP address. It's a common method for anonymizing information.\"","Fang Rui opened the page requiring personal information again and entered Wang Jie and Zhang Shuochen's information, randomly filling in the email and contact details. Surprisingly, the information was submitted successfully.","\"Detective Fang, this must be intentionally designed. It only shows a successful submission if you enter specific names in the couple's name field. If the information is incorrect, it will show a page error,\" Li analyzed. \"Could this website have been specifically designed for Wang Jie and Zhang Shuochen?\"","Although they hadn't obtained the killer's information, the fact that the killer could design a website and knew how to use encrypted email to evade police investigation suggested that they had a high IQ and education level.","Fang Rui couldn't help but wonder if the killer might be a teacher from the school.","But then he thought about the Lin Zhou case. All four victims there worked in a factory. If the killer had a high level of education, how would they have come into contact with those working-class people?","\"Mu Mian, does your hacker friend have a way to help us trace the IP address of the website creator?\"","\"I'm not sure, I'll ask him.\"","Fang Rui then asked, \"Tell him to name his price, I'll reimburse you later.\"","Mu Mian's hacker friend replied quickly. Mu Mian happily said, \"He's not charging me money this time.\"","\"No money? Then what does he want? It's not a body donation form, is it?\"","\"Of course not, he's not interested in your body. He wants a photo of us together. I told him I made a really, really good friend, but he doesn't believe me. He says he needs to see a photo to believe it.\" Mu Mian looked at Fang Rui, \"So we need to take a photo that shows our friendship.\"","Mu Mian took a photo with Fang Rui and sent it over.","The other side quickly replied to Mu Mian.","\"He helped us trace it. The IP of the website creator is from Jiangzhou University. They used a computer in the school's computer room, so we can't pinpoint which specific computer it was,\" Mu Mian added. \"And he complimented me, saying I made a very handsome friend.\"","\"Shouldn't that be a compliment for me?\"","\"You're right! His language skills have improved. He can now compliment two people at once.\" Mu Mian felt gratified. Her friend used to speak in a way that no one could understand, except for Mu Mian who could comprehend his strange speaking logic.","Fang Rui and Zhang went to question the faculty and students of Jiangzhou University again. Some people reported that a while ago, the link to this website frequently appeared in their student group chats. After it was reported, it stopped appearing."]},{"number":75,"title":"Chapter 75: Couple Butchers: Aren't You Going to Fight for It","paragraphs":["As Fang Rui returned home from fieldwork, it was almost dark. He had just parked his car in the parking lot and was about to open the door when he saw a woman holding it shut, trapping him inside.","\"Mom, why are you here again?\" Fang Rui felt a headache coming on.","As a slightly older unmarried young man, he faced the same intense pressure to get married as all single youth. His pressure mainly came from his mother, Mrs. Lu Jianhua.","Fang Rui currently had no plans to marry, as he disliked complications. He felt that if he got married, he'd have to deal with a bunch of trivial family matters and wouldn't be able to focus properly on his work. He was at the age where he should be concentrating on his career.","\"What do you mean 'again'? Do you dislike seeing me that much?\" Lu Jianhua wore a fashionable coat, her hair permed into small curls. When she got angry, the curls seemed to quiver along with her.","\"How could I dare to dislike you? Come on, let's go upstairs and sit. I'll order some takeout for you.\" Fang Rui took the fruit from Lu Jianhua's hands. \"Mom, you know I don't like fruit. Why did you buy so much? It must have been heavy to carry.\"","Mrs. Lu glared at Fang Rui, \"Who said this was for you? It's for the female colleagues at your bureau!\"","\"...\"","Lu Jianhua scolded him, exasperated, \"Just look at yourself! There are so many pretty girls at your bureau, how come you can't find a girlfriend? What a waste of the good looks I gave you, all show and no substance! Look at young Zhang, he's got a girlfriend at such a young age. And look at you, almost thirty and still single! I'm worried sick about you.\"","Fang Rui had always been a worry-free child. When his classmates were having puppy love affairs and getting into fights, Fang Rui studied hard, only occasionally getting into fights, which he always managed to win.","In high school, he suddenly decided he wanted to be a police officer and threw himself into physical training. After graduating from the police academy, he worked at a local police station for two years before quickly being transferred to the City Police Bureau. Lu Jianhua had always thought her son was quite outstanding, until Fang Rui was almost thirty and had never been in a relationship.","In her circle of mothers, having a son without a girlfriend was something to be ashamed of.","\"Lin Sen is over thirty and doesn't have a girlfriend either. Why don't you pressure him to find one? You're his godmother after all. Go find one for him first,\" Fang Rui decided to throw Lin Sen under the bus to divert the conflict.","\"What kind of job does Lin Sen have? He's a criminal psychology expert, how impressive. What about your job? With your work intensity, it's already not bad if you can find anyone at all. How can you compare yourself to Lin Sen? He's single because he chooses to be, not because he can't find anyone...\"","Fang Rui decided to remain silent.","As they reached the elevator, he saw Mu Mian waiting there, holding a large stack of delivery boxes. The boxes were piled so high that they obscured her face.","He wanted to help Mu Mian carry some, but she turned her head to look at the numbers on the elevator, pretending not to know him.","\"This weekend, you must go on a blind date! Don't tell me you have an unsolved case. Even if it's raining knives, you have to go.\" Mrs. Lu finally revealed her true purpose.","Mu Mian heard this and was somewhat surprised. She glanced at Fang Rui, then averted her gaze and continued watching the changing numbers on the elevator.","Suddenly, Mu Mian thought of a terrifying possibility: if Fang Rui got married, even if she had a body donation agreement, she might not be able to get his body. His spouse would certainly not want to give his body to her.","\"Mom, I'm really not lying to you. We're dealing with a big case right now.\" Fang Rui took out his phone and showed Lu Jianhua the news. \"See? The 'Couple Butcher,' specifically targeting couples. I'm busy with the case, how could I have time for blind dates?\"","\"That girl saw your photo and she's quite satisfied with you. You just need to squeeze out a tiny bit of time. If it really doesn't work, I'll bring her to your office and you can have the date after you finish work.\"","Fang Rui was speechless. He guessed that Zhang's lovey-dovey posts on social media must have stimulated his mother. She had never been this forceful before.","After they got into the elevator, seeing that Fang Rui didn't respond, Lu Jianhua scolded again, \"Fang Rui, did you hear me?\"","\"I won't go! Because—\"","Fang Rui took most of the delivery boxes from Mu Mian's hands. He gave Mu Mian a meaningful look, then said to Lu Jianhua, \"I already have a girlfriend!\"","\"Impossible, how could you possibly find a girlfriend on your own?\" Lu Jianhua was shocked. Although she liked to pressure him about marriage, she was just following the usual routine. She wasn't mentally prepared for Fang Rui to actually have a girlfriend.","Fang Rui pointed at Mu Mian, \"Mom, this is my girlfriend, Mu Mian.\"","Mu Mian finally deciphered Fang Rui's eye signal.","Originally, she had no experience in pretending to be a couple, but recently Zhang and Chen Xue had been constantly displaying affection in front of her, so her knowledge in this area had improved dramatically.","\"Yes, I am Fang Rui's girlfriend. Auntie, it's nice to meet you for the first time,\" Mu Mian smiled at Lu Jianhua.","\"Hmm, hello.\"","Lu Jianhua looked at Mu Mian, examining her closely. This girl looked quite young, with a silly and cute appearance, not very smart, probably obedient and well-behaved.","But she felt that Mu Mian and her son didn't look like a couple at all. What kind of girlfriend doesn't greet her boyfriend?","Mu Mian also realized this, so she patched up their lie, \"Auntie, I had a fight with him. I don't want to talk to him right now.\"","\"...\" Then why were you two making eyes at each other in front of me? Lu Jianhua felt that these two didn't seem like a couple, but more like secret agents meeting for a rendezvous.","By this time, the elevator had reached their floor.","Lu Jianhua belatedly realized that Mu Mian lived on the same floor as Fang Rui.","\"You two... you're not living together, are you?\" Mrs. Lu was shocked. Fang Rui had actually brought someone to live with him? Things were moving too fast!","Mu Mian shook her head, \"We're not living together. I'm his neighbor.\"","\"Oh, then come over and chat with auntie for a bit. I happen to have some things I'd like to ask you.\" Mrs. Lu suspected that Fang Rui had colluded with this girl to pretend to be a couple to fool her, but she had no proof.","No matter, if they wanted to put on an act, she would play along and see who slipped up first.","Mu Mian had always been curious about Fang Rui's home, so she excitedly agreed to the invitation: \"Sure.\"","Fang Rui's home was different from what Mu Mian had imagined. The decor was very simple, with little furniture. It wasn't particularly tidy, with instant noodles and biscuits piled on the table.","Seeing Mu Mian curiously examining the room, Lu Jianhua asked, \"Little Mu, is this your first time at Fang Rui's place?\"","\"Yes, my sister said I shouldn't casually go to other people's homes, not even Fang Rui's.\"","What strict upbringing!","Lu Jianhua took out her car keys and handed them to Fang Rui, \"Oh my, I think I left my phone in the car. Fang Rui, can you go get it for me?\"","\"Mom, don't give Mu Mian a hard time.\" Fang Rui could see the bulge of the phone in her pocket. But he couldn't call her out on it, so he had to take the keys and leave.","\"How can you talk to me like that? You're making me sound like an evil mother-in-law.\"","Before leaving, Fang Rui gave Mu Mian a look, signaling her to act well and not give them away. But Fang Rui felt it was probably going to fall apart anyway.","Mu Mian confidently gave him an OK sign. Her lying skills had improved greatly, and she could easily handle something as small as pretending to be Fang Rui's girlfriend.","Fang Rui sighed. It was definitely going to fall apart!","He must have had a brain freeze earlier to ask Mu Mian to pretend to be his girlfriend. It must be because Zhang had been constantly talking about his killer-baiting plan in front of him, causing him to make this rash decision to have Mu Mian pose as his girlfriend.","Lu Jianhua took two bottles of water from the fridge, handed one to Mu Mian, and asked, \"How long have you been with Fang Rui?\"","\"Not very long.\" Mu Mian hadn't coordinated this answer with Fang Rui, so she kept it vague.","\"Why do you like him?\"","\"Because I like his corpse, no, I mean his body.\"","\"...You mean his physique, right? Your Chinese isn't very good, is it?\" Lu Jianhua thought this girl's academic performance probably wasn't great. If they had children in the future, she as the grandmother would have to take charge of their studies.","Mu Mian nodded, \"Yes, I grew up abroad, so I never studied Chinese.\"","\"Little Mu, you might not know about our family situation. I don't think you're suitable for my son.\" Lu Jianhua put on a stern face, playing the role of the evil mother-in-law.","Mrs. Lu had been semi-retired for several years, and with nothing to do each day, she became obsessed with watching Chinese TV dramas about mother-in-law conflicts. However, much to her dismay, Fang Rui had not yet found a partner, so she never had the chance to be a mother-in-law, let alone the villainous type often portrayed in those TV shows.","Today, she was determined to interrogate Mu Mian, and decided to put on her best \"evil mother-in-law\" act to intimidate her.","\"Why aren't you suitable?\" Mu Mian looked at her, puzzled. \"I'm a forensic pathologist, he's a police officer, we make an excellent team. Besides, I'm highly accomplished. I have two doctoral degrees, a high IQ, and my sister says I'm a genius.\"","Feeling these reasons weren't compelling enough, Mu Mian added, \"I'm also very wealthy. I have lots and lots of money. I'm not talking about my meager salary or my practically non-existent savings, but the substantial inheritance my adoptive parents left me.\"","Lu Jianhua was stunned for a moment. Could Fang Rui and Mu Mian actually be dating? This young woman seemed to be quite fond of her son. She even appeared desperate enough to want to lavish money on Fang Rui.","\"It doesn't matter why! I won't allow you to marry my son!\" Lu Jianhua, not yet satisfied with her evil mother-in-law act, continued her performance.","She wanted to know just how much Mu Mian loved her son.","\"That's fine, I don't plan on getting married anyway,\" Mu Mian said nonchalantly. Her sister's friend had once mentioned that people with autism shouldn't get married.","\"Uh... aren't you going to fight for it at all?\"","It seemed she didn't love him that much after all."]},{"number":76,"title":"Chapter 76: Couple Butchers: Corruption","paragraphs":["Mu Mian looked at her sincerely, \"Auntie, if I try hard, will you let me marry Fang Rui?\"","\"Of course not!\"","Mu Mian blinked, \"Then I won't try. You won't agree anyway. Trying is exhausting.\"","Mrs. Lu realized she had underestimated Mu Mian. She didn't seem very smart, but her mind worked quite fast.","\"Mu Mian, I won't beat around the bush with you. Name your price. How much money will it take for you to leave my son?\"","Mu Mian found her question strange and reminded her, \"Auntie, have you forgotten? I have a lot of money myself. I don't need money from others.\"","\"...\"","\"Auntie, I can leave your son. But can you agree to one condition for me?\" Mu Mian looked at her with bright eyes.","\"What condition?\" Lu Jianhua asked and immediately regretted it, wondering how Mu Mian had turned the tables on her.","\"After Fang Rui dies, will you give me his remains? If so, I promise to leave him and never date him again.\" Mu Mian looked at her cautiously, \"Can you agree to this condition?\"","Fang Rui's mother had the right to dispose of his remains, so as long as his mother agreed, she could still get Fang Rui's body. Even if Fang Rui married someone else, she could still obtain it. Chen Xue had said that a daughter-in-law could never defeat a mother-in-law.","\"You only want his remains, that's enough?\"","\"Yes. You won't agree to anything else.\"","\"...Do you love him that much?\" Lu Jianhua looked at Mu Mian in shock. Goodness, this young girl was completely love-brained! Unable to have her son in life, she wanted to possess his remains after death.","Mu Mian didn't understand how she had reached this conclusion, but she nodded anyway.","\"Mu Mian, don't worry, Auntie won't separate you two! Feel free to date Fang Rui. If anyone tries to stop you, I'll fight them myself.\"","Mrs. Lu muttered to herself, \"Who would have thought, with Fang Rui's aloof personality, he could make a young girl love him so desperately. It seems our ancestral graves must be emitting auspicious smoke.\"","Mu Mian stared at her blankly, completely unaware of what had happened.","Was it really so difficult to donate Fang Rui's remains to her? Mrs. Lu would rather compromise and let her marry Fang Rui than give her his remains.","Mu Mian sighed, wondering if Fang Rui's marriage was less important than his remains.","When Fang Rui returned with takeout, he saw them getting along harmoniously. Mrs. Lu was chatting enthusiastically with Mu Mian, who looked like a startled rabbit, unable to escape and tiredly responding.","\"Fang Rui, I need to go home for dinner,\" Mu Mian said upon seeing Fang Rui, as if she'd found a savior. Mrs. Lu was too enthusiastic, and Mu Mian had never met someone like her before, so she didn't know how to interact.","\"Okay.\"","Mu Mian then said to Lu Jianhua, \"Goodbye, Auntie!\"","\"Let's have dinner together another day. Oh, take these fruits with you.\"","\"Thank you, Auntie.\" Mu Mian took the fruits to the door, then turned back and said, \"Auntie, although our communication wasn't very smooth, I still like you very much.\"","Mu Mian actually quite liked enthusiastic people, as it meant she didn't have to work hard to socialize and could get along well with them. Of course, if they were too enthusiastic, she needed time to adjust.","\"Haha, everyone who meets me says that. Mu Mian, you're very cute too, and Auntie enjoys chatting with you. It's just that your Chinese isn't very good, you need to work on it.\"","\"...\" Fang Rui could probably guess why.","After Mu Mian left, Lu Jianhua patted Fang Rui's shoulder, \"You and little Mu were just pretending to be a couple earlier, right? Don't deny it, I know you too well.\"","\"Then I won't go on blind dates! I'm very busy with work.\" Fang Rui knew they would be exposed.","\"No more blind dates, we won't arrange any more! Just date Mu Mian, she's absolutely in love with you. I think you'll never find anyone who loves you more than her in your lifetime.\"","Fang Rui frowned. Mu Mian was in love with him? That was impossible! Mu Mian only loved his remains.","But seeing his mother's expression of \"shipping them,\" he couldn't help but wonder if Mu Mian's feelings for him had changed. Like Zhang and Chen Xue?","Mu Mian's acting was so poor, if it were fake, how could his sharp mother not see through it?","At that moment, Fang Rui received a text message from Mu Mian:","[Fang Rui, wasn't my acting great? Did I manage to fool your mom? Congratulations, you don't have to go on blind dates anymore. But I never want to pretend to be your girlfriend again, it's so tiring! My brain almost short-circuited.]","Fang Rui smiled helplessly.","The next morning, Fang Rui was called to the Director's office.","Because the modus operandi of this case was extremely similar to a case in neighboring Linzhou City, the Director had communicated with the person in charge there and decided to investigate the two cases jointly.","Linzhou City took this case very seriously and formed a special task force overnight, led by their Criminal Investigation Team Leader Sun Guangtian, to come and assist Fang Rui's team in solving the case.","\"Fang Rui, they say they're coming to assist us, but you know, Old Sun has more experience than you, and he's been investigating that case for over half a year. He knows the killer better than you do, so the investigation will still be led by them, understand?\" the Director advised earnestly.","\"I understand! Don't worry, I promise to cooperate well with them to solve the case.\" Although Fang Rui was upset about losing the lead on the case, he wasn't petty and would cooperate as needed.","The Director observed Fang Rui for a moment, \"Fang Rui, judging by your expression, you seem a bit unconvinced.\"","\"How could I be unconvinced! My bad mood is because my mom nagged me for half the day yesterday, so I didn't sleep well.\" Fang Rui explained. He really hadn't slept well last night, as he kept wondering if Mu Mian might have developed feelings for him as a person, beyond just his remains.","\"Old Sun has a bit of a temper, so don't provoke him!\" The Director was quite confident in Fang Rui but still couldn't help reminding him.","\"I promise I won't argue with him!\" Fang Rui took the opportunity to ask for a favor, \"Director, I've written an application to purchase a batch of insulated shoes and gloves. Could you approve it?\"","\"What do you need those for? You're not electricians, do you really need such things?\"","\"Both victims were electrocuted. I suspect the killer might have a stun gun or similar dangerous items. I'm worried about risks during the arrest and want to take precautions.\"","The Director nodded approvingly, \"Alright, I'll definitely approve this. Not bad, you're thinking ahead now, much more steady than before.\"","\"That's all thanks to your good teaching, Director.\"","\"Stop flattering me. If you want anything else, say it all at once.\"","\"Director, you promised to allocate funds to buy an imported autopsy electric saw for Mu Mian. You haven't forgotten, have you?\"","\"I haven't forgotten, but isn't that the Forensic Department's business? Why are you concerned about it?\"","\"Mu Mian is under my management now.\"","\"The process is underway. You won't be shortchanged!\" The Director found it strange. Fang Rui used to dislike Mu Mian, but now he was saying \"she's under my management\"?","\"Please remember to follow up on it! The process is moving too slowly.\"","\"...\"","Upon learning that Linzhou City would send a special task force, Zhang and the others all looked dejected. This was originally their case, but with the task force coming, they would become mere assistants.","\"Everyone, don't have negative emotions. When the expert team arrives, smile brightly and be enthusiastic. Also, make sure all the materials are organized to give to them,\" Fang Rui advised patiently.","Mu Mian nodded and gave Fang Rui an OK gesture. The others weren't so obedient.","\"Boss, this case is ours!\" Li still felt resentful.","\"That's right! We'll have to take orders from them, it's so unfair,\" Zhang grumbled.","\"The case is still ours, we'll continue investigating. Now we just have some criminal investigation experts helping us, understand?\""]},{"number":77,"title":"Chapter 77: Couple Butchers: Task Force","paragraphs":["When Sun Guangtian arrived with the special investigation team, Fang Rui also led his people to greet them at the entrance.","The members of the special team were all renowned criminal investigation experts from Linzhou City, including the experienced Forensic Doctor Cheng, criminal psychology expert Professor Qi, and forensic trace expert Wang Qiang.","Sun Guangtian was a middle-aged man in his forties, with a stern expression on his face.","His deputy was Fang Rui's classmate from the police academy, so as soon as he saw Fang Rui, he greeted him enthusiastically: \"Fang Rui, long time no see!\"","\"Song Haiyang, you've gotten fatter!\"","Fang Rui then greeted Sun Guangtian: \"Captain Sun, I've heard so much about you. My mentor used to tell me about your exploits all the time. I'm finally meeting you today. I hope we can work well together.\"","\"Hmm.\" Sun Guangtian's expression remained cold.","\"Our director said to invite the experts to the reception room to rest first,\" Zhang said, \"Please, this way everyone.\"","\"We haven't solved the case yet, what rest? Always focusing on these unnecessary formalities. Let's have a meeting first to sync up on the progress of the investigation.\" Sun Guangtian interrupted Zhang.","The atmosphere suddenly became awkward.","The forensic experts also felt uncomfortable, knowing Sun Guangtian's domineering personality, and didn't dare to voice any objections.","Wang, Li, and the others felt that Captain Sun was trying to assert his authority on their turf, and their expressions turned sour.","Only Mu Mian kept forcing a bright smile.","Zhang looked helplessly at Fang Rui, and seeing him nod, Zhang said, \"Then let's go directly to the conference room for the meeting.\"","Sun Guangtian glanced at the people Fang Rui had brought, all looking quite young. Their faces all showed defiance, indicating they wouldn't cooperate well.","His piercing gaze fell on Mu Mian; this young girl was smiling brightly, but she didn't look very intelligent.","Mu Mian's face was tired from smiling. Feeling Sun Guangtian's gaze, she quickly forced her smile again.","Song Haiyang pulled Fang Rui aside and explained quietly, \"Fang Rui, don't misunderstand. Captain Sun has a peculiar temper, but he's actually a good person.\"","\"I know that. My mentor used to complain to me about his nasty temper all the time.\" Fang Rui shrugged helplessly.","The conference room was packed. Fang Rui had Zhang distribute case files to each expert, including autopsy results and the clues they had gathered so far.","\"The cause of death for these two victims was actually electrocution?\" Forensic Doctor Cheng frowned as he looked at the autopsy report. \"How could it be electrocution? Where are the victims' bodies? I need to perform a new autopsy.\"","\"I wrote that report. Do you think there's a problem somewhere? I can explain it to you,\" Mu Mian, who happened to be sitting next to him, spoke up.","Forensic Doctor Cheng, a kindly old man with a balding head, looked at Mu Mian in surprise. He had a strong impression of her because she was the one smiling most brightly among that group of young people earlier. He hadn't expected her to be a forensic doctor.","\"Your report is very detailed. I don't have any questions about it. But I'd like to examine the bodies again to see if there are any new clues,\" Forensic Doctor Cheng sighed. \"You know, the bodies from the two previous cases were severely decomposed, and I couldn't find any useful clues.\"","\"Yes, you were quite unlucky. Unlike me, I saw fresh bodies, so I found many useful clues,\" Mu Mian said with a hint of pride in her voice.","\"...\"","\"After the meeting, I can take you to the autopsy room. I can be your assistant,\" Mu Mian remembered Fang Rui's directive: cooperate well with these experts and smile brightly at them.","\"Thank you, young lady.\"","\"Please call me Dr. Mu,\" Mu Mian corrected him.","\"Alright, thank you, Dr. Mu.\"","\"You're welcome!\"","While Mu Mian and Forensic Doctor Cheng were getting along well, the atmosphere between Fang Rui and Sun Guangtian was tense.","\"You didn't find any clues at the crime scene? It was a forest, didn't you find any footprints or similar traces?\" Sun Guangtian looked at Fang Rui's report, his tone very dissatisfied. \"Why did you focus your investigation on the victims' chat records? This is a serial killing case. How can you possibly track down the killer by investigating the victims' social relationships?\"","\"It had been raining heavily in Jiangzhou for days. All traces in the forest were washed away. The body was only discovered because the rain had washed away the top layer of soil,\" Zhang retorted.","\"Our investigation of the victims' chat records wasn't fruitless either. We at least know that the killer created a phishing website. He used that site to contact the two victims and lured them out under the pretense of participating in an activity,\" Li also argued.","\"So has your case made any progress?\"","\"We were about to, but then you guys...\"","Fang Rui interrupted Zhang and the others, \"Captain Sun, what do you think we should investigate first?\"","Sun Guangtian ignored Fang Rui and instead pointed at Mu Mian, his tone sharp: \"And that young girl, how can you still smile with such a serious case? Can't you be more serious during work hours?\"","Suddenly singled out, Mu Mian was stunned for a moment, then became flustered. She looked helplessly at Fang Rui, not knowing what she had done wrong or why Captain Sun was so angry with her.","It was Fang Rui who had told her to smile brightly.","Besides, people die tragically in this world every day. Does that mean she can never smile?","\"Mu Mian, it's okay. He's not talking about you.\"","Fang Rui turned to Sun Guangtian, \"Captain Sun, I've always respected you as a senior, but there's no need for you to try to assert your authority over us like this. If you think our investigation approach is problematic, then you can investigate according to your own methods.\"","\"Of course we'll investigate according to my arrangements.\"","Fang Rui interrupted him: \"We'll also continue investigating according to our own approach. I think it's better if we investigate separately. Mu Mian, Zhang, you guys come with me.\"","Seeing the situation, Song Haiyang tried to ease the tension: \"Fang Rui, don't be rash. Let's talk this through.\"","\"It's fine. You investigate your way, and if you need any information or assistance from our personnel, we'll be generous in sharing with you.\"","Fang Rui knew that even if he was willing to cooperate with Captain Sun, Sun might not appreciate them anyway. It was better for them to investigate on their own. After all, everyone had different investigative approaches, and forcing them to work together might actually affect efficiency.","As for the director, worst case scenario, he'd get a scolding.","Outside the conference room, Mu Mian looked cautiously at Fang Rui: \"Fang Rui, did I mess something up?\"","This was the first time Mu Mian had seen Fang Rui so angry.","\"He was targeting me, it has nothing to do with you,\" Fang Rui patted Mu Mian's head. \"I don't think they need our cooperation anyway.\"","Because of the confrontation with Sun Guangtian, Fang Rui was severely reprimanded by the director, but the director also felt that it wasn't entirely Fang Rui's fault.","He knew this kid Fang Rui well; he was good at handling interpersonal relationships and generally wouldn't fall out with others unless they went too far.","\"Since that's the case, you just investigate according to your own approach. I'll transfer people from other teams to assist them,\" the director was still protective of his own.","\"Thank you, Director.\"","Director Wang then had a talk with Sun Guangtian. They were college classmates, and Sun Guangtian's case-solving ability was much stronger than his. He had become the director, while Sun Guangtian hadn't been promoted, largely due to his temperament.","\"Old Sun, why are you picking fights with a bunch of young people? It looks bad to create such a scene.\"","\"I was just worried I couldn't keep them in line, so I wanted to show them who's boss. Wasn't Fang Rui supposed to be quite level-headed? His mentor used to praise him in front of me all the time. Why is his temper so bad now, exploding at the slightest provocation?\"","\"What did you say to him?\"","\"Nothing much. I just said their investigation approach was problematic, and I scolded a young girl. Then Fang Rui blew up and started arguing with me. This kid's mentality isn't stable enough yet, he still needs more tempering.\"","\"I see why now. Haha, this kid, he's hiding it deep.\"","\"Why? Don't tell me that young girl is his girlfriend? Why didn't you say so earlier? If I had known, I would have picked someone else to scold.\"","\"Old Sun, you need to control your temper. For this case, you might not be able to solve it without their help!\"","\"That's impossible! No one understands that killer better than I do. If I can't catch him, there's no way Fang Rui and his team can!\" Sun Guangtian declared with unwavering confidence."]},{"number":78,"title":"Chapter 78: Couple Butchers: Testing Love","paragraphs":["Stimulated by Sun Guangtian's challenge, everyone's enthusiasm for solving the case actually increased.","Fang Rui called a new case analysis meeting and distributed the materials brought from Linzhou for everyone to review.","The case files they had seen before lacked many details, but this material included a more thorough investigation process.","\"Boss, those two couples from Linzhou also had a social media account to show off their love,\" Zhang said in surprise. \"But they had very few followers, and their videos didn't get many views.\"","\"But the first pair of victims were quite old. The killer probably couldn't have contacted them through the internet,\" Li pointed out.","\"Lin Sen, can you create a criminal profile of the killer now?\" Fang Rui asked.","Lin Sen closed the folder and looked at Mu Mian: \"Dr. Mu, was there a difference in the intensity of electric shocks received by the two victims?\"","\"Yes. The male victim likely only suffered one electric shock, but it was extremely strong, causing cardiac arrest. The female victim, on the contrary, endured multiple shocks. Each shock wasn't very strong, but they still affected her organs, leading to organ failure,\" Mu Mian explained.","\"I suspect he's conducting a test,\" Lin Sen analyzed. \"He might be trying to test these victims' love, and the electric shocks are punishment for failing the test.\"","After Lin Sen finished speaking, everyone fell silent.","\"Is it similar to a lie detector test? Get shocked for lying, but no shock if you tell the truth?\" Zhang speculated. \"But that doesn't make sense either. Why was the male victim only shocked once, but with the highest intensity?\"","\"The shock intensity might be a variable. He might have set up a gradient for shock intensity, with different behavioral outcomes corresponding to different shock intensities,\" Mu Mian said. \"It's like conducting an experiment. For instance, Milgram's obedience experiment used shock intensity as a variable. I suspect he's copying the logic of this classic psychology experiment.\"","Mu Mian's words reminded Lin Sen, who frowned and said: \"The common point among these three couples is that they were all very loving partners; but their ages, marital status, and education levels varied greatly. There was even a same-sex couple among them. He seems to be collecting different types of couples.\"","Fang Rui asked, \"So why is he testing their love? Is he trying to prove the existence of love, or prove that love doesn't exist?\"","Lin Sen shrugged helplessly, \"I can't answer these questions yet.\"","\"Could the killer have designed a device similar to a lie detector? He uses this device to test those couples. All those couples failed his test, so they all died,\" Fang Rui guessed.","\"Not necessarily all of them failed. Do you remember the victim named Tian Xin? She was stabbed to death,\" Lin Sen analyzed. \"I suspect she passed the killer's test. But for some reason, the killer still didn't spare her.\"","Although they had initially analyzed the killer's motive, they still had no leads on how to catch him.","Fang Rui remembered that Mu Mian's hacker friend had discovered that the computer used to set up the website was from the computer lab, so could the killer be from a computer-related major?","Another case occurred in Linzhou, while this case happened in Jiangzhou City, which could suggest that the killer likely had a job transfer in the past two years.","Job transfers among faculty at Jiangzhou University were relatively rare, and the school quickly provided a list that met Fang Rui's requirements. There were more than a dozen people on the list, which wasn't many, but still troublesome to investigate.","Fang Rui soon focused on one person: Zhou Junwei. He was a lecturer in the Computer Science department who had resigned from the neighboring Linzhou Institute of Technology a year ago and joined Jiangzhou University. He was thirty-one years old this year and currently single and living alone.","Coincidentally, he had taken extended leave from the university during the week of the incident, citing attendance at a friend's wedding as the reason.","Fang Rui and Zhang went to Jiangzhou University again. Zhou Junwei had a class in the morning, teaching VB programming to freshmen. Fang Rui and Zhang sat in the back row to listen to his lecture.","Zhou Junwei wore a blue and black checkered shirt, his hair a bit long, half-covering his eyes, making him look lethargic. He lectured with a straight face, his voice monotonous, making people drowsy.","The students in the classroom were either playing with their phones or chatting; almost no one was listening to his lecture. Zhou Junwei didn't seem to care, continuing to recite dry knowledge like a robot.","After class, Fang Rui called out to Zhou Junwei: \"Professor Zhou.\"","Zhou Junwei turned around. Seeing Fang Rui, some emotion flickered in his eyes as he asked, \"You're not one of my students, are you? Do you need something?\"","\"We're from the city police,\" Zhang showed his badge, \"We have some questions for you.\"","\"Alright, go ahead and ask.\"","\"Professor Zhou, is it complicated to create a website?\"","\"That depends on what kind of website you need. If it's a simple website, even first-year students can create one. It's quite easy.\"","\"Where were you last Wednesday, October 24th?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"Why are you asking me this question? That's my privacy, you don't have the right to inquire about that, do you?\" Zhou Junwei looked at Fang Rui warily.","\"We've discovered a fraudulent website, and I suspect it's related to you because the IP was traced to your office computer. So please cooperate with our investigation,\" Fang Rui lied, not telling him the real reason.","\"I don't have time for such things. From October 22nd to 30th, I was on leave. I went to a northern city to attend my friend's wedding. The 24th was actually his wedding day,\" Zhou Junwei said. \"If you don't believe me, you can investigate. Someone must have used my office computer. There are surveillance cameras in my office, you can check those.\"","Fang Rui and Zhang exchanged a glance. Could it be such a coincidence that he was away from Jiangzhou City during the exact time frame of the incident?","Zhang scrutinized Zhou Junwei for a moment, then suddenly reached out towards him. Zhou Junwei seemed to be startled, quickly stepping back. If it weren't for the podium behind him, he might have fallen.","\"Oh, Professor Zhou, there was an insect on your clothes,\" Zhang grabbed a small flying insect from his shoulder and crushed it. \"I've caught it for you.\"","\"...Thank you.\"","After leaving the classroom, Zhang muttered, \"Boss, that Zhou Junwei is strange. He's a grown man, but he has pierced ears.\"","\"Is that so strange? Aren't there quite a few men with pierced ears these days? It's nothing special, is it?\"","\"He was also wearing perfume! When I tried to touch his shoulder, he reacted so strongly,\" Zhang thought for a moment, but still voiced his suspicion, \"Could this Zhou Junwei be gay? I have a cousin who's gay, and he's a bit like him.\"","\"It's possible. But what does that have to do with our case?\" Fang Rui said, \"Let's investigate his alibi first.\"","\"Alright.\"","Based on Zhou Junwei's ID information, they found that Zhou Junwei had flown to Dongcheng in the north at 7 am on the 22nd, and then returned to Jiangzhou City on a flight at 10 pm on the 29th. During this period, his ID hadn't been used to purchase any other tickets.","Dongcheng is over two thousand kilometers away from Jiangzhou City, making it impractical for him to travel back and forth by car or taxi.","Fang Rui also contacted Zhou Junwei's friend, who said that Zhou Junwei had stayed in Dongcheng the entire time, never leaving in between. The hotel he stayed at could also confirm that he had been residing in Dongcheng for those days.","\"Boss, it looks like this lead has also hit a dead end,\" Zhang sighed. \"His alibi is too solid.\"","\"It's okay, we've at least eliminated one option,\" Fang Rui still felt that Zhou Junwei was very suspicious, but he had no evidence. So he decided to adjust the direction of the investigation."]},{"number":79,"title":"Chapter 79: Couple Butchers: Brainwave","paragraphs":["Mu Mian got along very well with Forensic Doctor Cheng. With Mu Mian's assistance, Forensic Doctor Cheng performed another autopsy on the body and reached the same conclusion as Mu Mian.","\"Forensic Doctor Cheng, did you find this kind of dry, gelatinous substance on the four bodies you autopsied?\" Mu Mian took a dandruff-like object from the deceased's scalp, \"Like this?\"","\"What is this?\" Forensic Doctor Cheng examined it carefully for a moment, then muttered, \"This seems to be some kind of gel, in its dried state. When the bodies were discovered, there was sand and mud in their hair. We cleaned it, but my assistant did the cleaning work, so I'm not sure if there was any.\"","\"I see.\" Mu Mian was a bit disappointed. How she wished she could have autopsied those four decomposed bodies herself. She was certain she would have found some clues.","\"Why did you let them cremate those four bodies?\" Mu Mian asked, displeased.","\"The families came to my office every day, crying and making a fuss, demanding to cremate the bodies. I had no choice!\" Forensic Doctor Cheng held out his hand, showing several healed scars on the back, \"Look, they even scratched my hand trying to snatch the bodies away.\"","\"What a coincidence, I've been scratched by a victim's family member too,\" Mu Mian showed her own scar from Ye Zeling's scratch, \"But my scar isn't as deep as yours. I only have three marks, you have four.\"","Chen Xue, who was recording the autopsy, felt speechless. Why were they talking about such things? They were even comparing their scars.","\"Yes, being a forensic doctor can be quite dangerous.\"","Once the conversation started, Forensic Doctor Cheng began sharing his experiences with Mu Mian, such as how to avoid occupational exposure when dealing with AIDS-infected bodies, the need to wear gas masks when autopsying highly decomposed bodies to avoid poisoning, and how to dodge attacks from victims' family members...","Mu Mian frequently showed expressions of \"Wow, I learned something new again!\"","\"Did you notice that three of the four bodies from Linzhou had rose-colored teeth?\" Mu Mian asked.","\"Yes, I did. But that alone can't determine the exact cause of death. We can only guess that the deceased went through a process of suffocation.\"","\"I suspect those three victims also died from electric shock.\"","\"Your guess is very reasonable. Indeed, there have been cases where electrocution victims showed rose-colored teeth,\" Forensic Doctor Cheng agreed.","After the autopsy, Forensic Doctor Cheng left the autopsy room.","Chen Xue whispered, \"Mian Mian, you shouldn't tell Forensic Doctor Cheng all the clues. He's on Captain Sun's side. We're in competition now.\"","\"Why? I was just having an academic exchange with him. We had a very pleasant discussion,\" Mu Mian replied. Although she had a lot of theoretical knowledge, she didn't have as much practical experience as Forensic Doctor Cheng. She felt she had learned a lot.","For instance, she learned that if a victim's family member tries to attack a forensic doctor, one should immediately crouch down, protect their head, and shout for help. This way, they're less likely to get injured if they do get hit.","\"Um... never mind.\" Chen Xue decided it was better not to force those workplace rules on Mu Mian. After all, as long as the case gets solved, does it really matter who solves it?","No, it actually does matter a lot!","During lunch, Mu Mian noticed that Zhang looked dejected, and Chen Xue seemed down as well.","Today's lunch was Kung Pao Chicken. Mu Mian secretly transferred the carrots, cucumbers, and peanuts from her bowl to Fang Rui's, then scooped all the chicken pieces Fang Rui didn't like into her own bowl.","Fang Rui was already used to her little maneuvers and waited patiently for her to finish before starting to eat.","When Mu Mian began to use her chopsticks, Zhang and Chen Xue were still looking unhappy.","Mu Mian finally realized she should say something.","\"Officer Zhang, Chen Xue, why are you unhappy?\"","\"Ah, we've been working hard these past few days for nothing. We thought we had found a suspect, but it turns out he has an alibi.\" Zhang sighed heavily and lowered his voice, \"What's worse, I heard that Captain Sun's team has made progress and seems to have found a suspect.\"","\"Don't worry, I've found a clue too,\" Mu Mian said confidently, tilting her head up.","Fang Rui looked at Mu Mian, \"Did the autopsy reveal anything new?\"","\"Let's eat first. I'll report to you when the results come out this afternoon. Today's Kung Pao Chicken is delicious.\"","Chen Xue glanced at the bowl full of chicken in front of Mu Mian, then at the vegetable medley in Fang Rui's bowl, and couldn't help but say, \"Um... what's in your bowl can only be called 'chicken pieces'.\"","\"...\"","At around 3 PM, the test results finally came out. Fang Rui called another case analysis meeting.","\"I suspect the killer is conducting an experiment,\" Mu Mian held up her drawing, \"He's likely doing an experiment about love.\"","The drawing showed two people sitting opposite each other, with electrodes attached to their arms, connected to long wires. Most importantly, their heads were covered. They were wearing black caps with many holes, each hole connected to a black wire.","\"Are those black caps electrode caps?\" Lin Sen was a bit surprised, \"Are you saying that while testing these couples, he's also collecting their brain wave data?\"","\"Their hair shows signs of being washed, and the same shampoo was used. It was probably the killer who washed it,\" Mu Mian explained, \"But I still found small amounts of a gelatinous substance on their scalps. After testing, it turned out to be dried conductive gel.\"","\"Conductive gel? What's that?\"","Everyone looked confused. Only Lin Sen knew what Mu Mian was talking about. EEG equipment is the most common equipment in psychology labs.","\"When conducting EEG experiments, to reduce scalp resistance, a large amount of conductive gel is applied to the scalp where the electrodes are connected,\" Mu Mian explained, \"That substance is very difficult to clean off. You have to wash your hair for a very long time, and even then, you can't get it all off.\"","Li asked curiously, \"Dr. Mu, do you often do these experiments? You seem very experienced.\"","\"I've never been the experimenter for EEG tests. But I've often been a subject. My dad says I'm a genius and my brain is very valuable for research. So I'm often his research subject,\" Mu Mian said, sounding a bit proud.","Everyone was speechless. No wonder Mu Mian was so fond of studying the human body - it was a family tradition.","Lin Sen said, \"Professional EEG equipment is very expensive. Usually, only university labs or hospitals would purchase them. We can start investigating through the purchasing channels for EEG equipment.\"","\"Based on the distribution of the conductive gel residue, I deduce that his electrode cap has 20 leads, meaning only 20 electrode pads. Such equipment is too outdated and should have been phased out. The latest equipment has 128 leads. So I suspect he's using equipment discarded by labs,\" Mu Mian continued.","Lin Sen frowned, \"That makes it harder to trace.\"","Mu Mian continued, \"But fortunately, based on the component analysis, the conductive gel used on the victims should be an imported brand. Moreover, it's not sold separately, only provided to customers who purchase their EEG equipment. The brand of that equipment is called NeurOne.\"","\"Does this equipment have a distributor in China?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"Yes, it does. It only has one distributor in China, which belongs to the Jiangmiao Group.\""]},{"number":80,"title":"Chapter 80: Lovers Butcher: Jiang Miao Group","paragraphs":["Jiangmiao Group is the largest medical enterprise in Jiangzhou City, owning three private hospitals, a high-end nursing home, and a pharmaceutical company. It is also the authorized dealer for many imported brand-name medical equipment and holds numerous medical-related patents.","Mu Mian voluntarily applied to investigate the sales situation of the brain wave equipment with Fang Rui, as she felt she was quite knowledgeable about these medical devices.","To save time, Fang Rui and Mu Mian went directly to the headquarters of this group. The receptionist was very polite and immediately contacted the sales manager after learning of their intentions.","\"I'm sorry, but this involves customer privacy. We can't provide our sales ledger to you,\" the sales manager said politely but firmly refused to provide the information.","The sales ledger is a company's core confidential information and isn't directly related to the case investigation, so they have the right to refuse to provide it.","\"You can delete the prices and customer contact information,\" Fang Rui said. \"This information will only be used for solving the case and won't be leaked.\"","\"Sorry, we can't provide that.\"","Mu Mian asked, \"The sales of the NeurOne brain wave equipment probably haven't been good in recent years, especially the 20-lead ones, right? There shouldn't be many buyers. Now schools doing research probably prefer near-infrared devices, as they collect data more stably and don't require brain wave gel, which is more convenient.\"","\"Yes, you seem quite knowledgeable,\" the sales manager said. \"We haven't sold this equipment in the past two years.\"","Mu Mian asked, \"Is it only universities without much funding that buy it?\"","\"That's right.\"","\"Has anyone purchased it privately?\" Fang Rui inquired.","\"No. Our users are mainly universities or hospitals in nearby provinces and cities. Who would buy this thing for personal use? One device costs over a hundred thousand yuan, and it takes up a lot of space.\"","\"Can you give me the sales records?\" Mu Mian persisted, asking once more.","\"No!\"","As he refused to provide the sales information, Mu Mian and Fang Rui prepared to leave. Even if they forced them to provide it, they would probably only offer fake sales records.","\"Mu Mian, what are you doing here?\" Jiang Yinian was surprised to see Mu Mian.","Jiangmiao Group was established by his cousin, and after his cousin's death, he inherited all of his assets. Jiang Yinian usually doesn't manage the group's affairs, preferring to focus on research in his laboratory.","Today, he came because someone reported that a high-level executive in the group was embezzling and accepting bribes, so he had to come to deal with it. He didn't expect to encounter Mu Mian.","Mu Mian was stunned for a moment when she saw Jiang Yinian, then silently shrank behind Fang Rui, looking at him warily.","Fang Rui sensed Mu Mian's unusual behavior and turned to ask, \"Mu Mian, do you know him? He didn't bully you in school, did he?\"","Fang Rui didn't like the way Jiang Yinian looked at Mu Mian. It wasn't like looking at a familiar friend, but more like looking at a pet he had raised.","\"He was my father's student. But he had a falling out with my father, and my sister said he might hurt me, so Fang Rui, you need to protect me!\"","Jiang Yinian overheard Mu Mian's conversation with Fang Rui, and his expression seemed hurt. \"Mu Mian, how could I ever hurt you? Don't you remember? You said yourself that I was your best friend!\"","Fang Rui looked at Mu Mian, confused. Didn't she say she had no friends? How did a best friend suddenly appear?","\"Senior Yinian, I never said that. I only said you were ranked first on my friend list, and at that time, you were my only friend,\" Mu Mian clarified. \"My friend list is frequently adjusted. You're no longer number one now.\"","\"Mu Mian, there's some misunderstanding between your sister and me. I hope it doesn't affect our relationship. I was once your only friend, wasn't I? You should trust me.\"","\"My sister wouldn't lie to me!\" Mu Mian carefully considered. Even if her sister was wrong, it didn't matter; she would only lose a friend. But if her sister was right and she didn't listen to her, she might lose her life.","She didn't want to die right now, so she decided to stay away from Jiang Yinian.","\"That's not necessarily true. Mu Mian, haven't you noticed that you don't know your sister at all? Your sister is hiding many things from you. She's slandering me only because she's afraid I'll tell you the truth.\"","\"It's not very ethical to drive a wedge between sisters like that,\" Fang Rui interrupted.","\"Who are you? What right do you have to interfere in my conversation with Mu Mian?\"","Mu Mian didn't want to get entangled with Jiang Yinian anymore. She tugged on Fang Rui's hand, \"Fang Rui, let's go back.\"","\"Alright.\"","Jiang Yinian turned to the sales manager, \"What did they want from you?\"","\"They wanted to check the sales records of the NeurOne brain wave equipment. This is our company's confidential information and involves customer privacy, so we can't provide it to them.\"","\"Mu Mian, didn't you want that sales record? I'll have them give it to you.\"","\"Yes, thank you. Please have them give us the list quickly,\" Mu Mian didn't hesitate, after all, it was Jiang Yinian who volunteered to help her.","The sales manager looked troubled, \"Mr. Jiang, but—\"","\"I don't want to repeat myself.\"","The sales manager immediately went to print those documents.","\"Mu Mian, would you like to work in my laboratory?\" Jiang Yinian looked at Mu Mian. \"I've moved Professor Shen's lab to China. You can do any research you want there.\"","\"I really like my current job.\" Mu Mian didn't like the current Jiang Yinian; she felt he was very unfamiliar. She suddenly realized that since her adoptive parents passed away, many people around her had changed.","Senior ALisa said it was because everyone had grown up after experiencing the accident. Perhaps Senior ALisa was also lying to her.","\"Mu Mian, don't you remember? We spent many happy times in the lab.\"","Fang Rui felt that this Jiang Yinian's words were strange. Mu Mian clearly didn't want to engage with him, so why was he so eager to reminisce with her?","\"Yes, but back then, Dad was also in the lab, along with Senior Fabien, Senior Alisa, and my little squirrel... The squirrel died, and Dad died too. I don't want to go back to that place. I prefer my current job.\" Mu Mian's voice was a bit low.","Jiang Yinian fell silent, his expression becoming serious, as if he too had sunk into great sorrow.","He quickly composed himself, \"Mu Mian, they'll give you that sales list in a moment. I won't stay here with you. Goodbye, Mu Mian!\"","Mu Mian didn't say goodbye to him.","After Jiang Yinian left, Fang Rui asked, \"Did he also use you as a test subject before, to study your brain?\"","\"Of course. Everyone in the lab liked to observe my brain. Who told me to be a genius? I always let them look for free. They were also willing to show me their brain scans, but I wasn't interested in their brains. But Fang Rui, I'm very interested in your brain. Fang Rui, could you...\"","\"Mu Mian, stay away from him in the future.\"","Fang Rui finally understood why Jiang Yinian's gaze was so strange. He looked at Mu Mian as if she were a little white mouse that had escaped his control. No wonder Shen Xiyin told Mu Mian to stay away from him.","Fang Rui even suspected that Mu Mian had always been a little white mouse in that laboratory, being observed and studied by those people. They were likely conducting some kind of autism research, and Mu Mian, having been in that environment for a long time, couldn't detect anything abnormal. She even enjoyed the feeling of being studied.","\"I understand. My sister said the same thing. I've already removed him from my friend list.\"","Fang Rui and Mu Mian looked through the sales records and found that the buyers of this equipment were mostly schools, and all purchases were made seven or eight years ago.","Fang Rui noticed that the Psychology Department of Jiangzhou University had bought two such devices ten years ago.","\"The psychology lab at Jiangzhou University doesn't have these two devices,\" Mu Mian said."]},{"number":81,"title":"Chapter 81: Couple Butchers: Suspect Apprehended","paragraphs":["\"How do you know that?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"My sister is now a lecturer in the Psychology Department at Jiangzhou University. The department head told my sister that the school needed a teacher for psychotherapy, so my sister took on a part-time job there. She's working hard to earn money to support me,\" Mu Mian explained. \"A while ago, my sister took me to visit that school, and I secretly went to see their laboratory. Their lab is so shabby, they're really poor.\"","After lunch, Fang Rui and Mu Mian drove to Jiangzhou University again.","With Shen Xiyin's help, they quickly learned about the whereabouts of those two pieces of equipment. A couple of years ago, the department replaced a batch of psychological experiment equipment, and those two old devices were sold as scrap.","Fang Rui then asked the lab manager about the conductive paste, \"Since you've replaced the equipment, why is your lab still using the previous brand of conductive paste?\"","\"Well... this one works well. The quality of domestic conductive paste is not good, its ability to reduce resistance is weak, and it can easily lead to invalid experimental data.\"","Seeing the manager's embarrassed expression, Fang Rui suspected there might be something fishy going on. Could it be that they were taking kickbacks from medical companies, so they kept purchasing expensive imported products?","\"Who's in charge of purchasing equipment for your lab? We'd like to ask them some questions.\"","\"Director Zhou is responsible for procurement.\"","\"His surname is Zhou?\" Fang Rui suddenly remembered the suspect Zhou Junwei he had investigated earlier. He asked, \"Does this Director Zhou have a son named Zhou Junwei?\"","\"Yes, he does. His son is also a lecturer at our school. If it weren't for old Zhou's connections, how could his son get a teaching job at our school?\" The manager revealed a contemptuous expression. Although he himself was also there due to connections, he just couldn't stand Director Zhou's useless son.","\"Could you please take us to see Director Zhou? I have some questions for him.\"","Director Zhou was in his fifties, wore glasses, and looked refined, but when he saw Fang Rui and the others, his expression was a bit impatient. \"If you have any questions, ask quickly. I'm very busy!\"","\"You purchased two NeurOne EEG devices ten years ago. Where are those two devices now?\"","\"Sold. Those two devices were already scrapped, so we sold them as waste,\" Director Zhou replied impatiently.","\"Which recycling station did you sell them to?\"","\"How would I remember that? Even if I told you, you might not be able to find that recycling station.\"","\"How do you know we can't find it? Please tell us which recycling station you sold them to. The owner would surely remember purchasing such large equipment.\"","Director Zhou had already lost his patience. He said to the manager, \"Can't you handle these trivial matters without bothering me? Deal with them, I'm leaving.\"","\"Director Zhou, I think it's better if you tell me the truth. Otherwise, if we continue investigating, who knows what else we might uncover. Like the matter of you taking kickbacks,\" Fang Rui called out to stop him.","Director Zhou's face instantly turned pale. He asked the manager to leave first, then said to Fang Rui, \"Those two devices were sold off by me. My son helped me sell them, for several thousand yuan. As for who the buyer was, I'm not sure.\"","\"Zhou Junwei helped you sell them?\"","\"Yes. Do you know my son?\"","\"Did he volunteer to help you sell them?\"","\"Yes, he said his classmate's school wanted to buy them. So I let him take the equipment away.\"","\"Alright. Thank you for your cooperation.\" Fang Rui felt that Zhou Junwei was likely the culprit. But strangely, he had an alibi.","Just as they were leaving the Psychology Department office, Fang Rui saw Zhou Junwei staring intently at him and Mu Mian from the stairs not far away.","Noticing Fang Rui looking at him, Zhou Junwei smiled at them, then went upstairs and left.","Zhou Junwei's smile made Fang Rui feel very uncomfortable. It seemed to be mocking, yet also challenging, his eyes seemed to say: You can't catch me.","Fang Rui investigated Zhou Junwei's background further. He was a local from Jiangzhou City. In high school, he had sexually harassed male classmates and was persuaded to leave the school. He was then sent to study in Linzhou for high school and later attended university there as well.","He originally studied medicine in university, but changed his major to computer science in the second semester of his freshman year.","Fang Rui assigned the experienced Old Zhang to keep a 24-hour watch on him. Although there was no evidence yet to prove he was the killer, keeping a close eye on him could prevent him from committing another crime.","Back at the police station, Fang Rui received a text message from Captain Li:","\"Fang Rui, save me! Why is this old geezer Sun Guangtian so difficult to deal with? It's been three days, I haven't been home for three whole days, my wife even suspects I'm having an affair. Find an excuse to get me out of this special task force, please.\"","Fang Rui poured himself a glass of water, but before he could drink it, Zhang rushed over, \"Boss, Captain Sun and his team have caught the killer!\"","\"Who's the suspect?\" Fang Rui asked calmly, taking a sip of water. \"Do they have evidence?\"","\"The suspect is a sanitation worker in his fifties. Captain Sun reviewed a large amount of surveillance footage and finally discovered a vehicle suspected of transporting the victim's body, which led them to identify the suspect.\"","Fang Rui quickly got the details of their investigation from Song Haiyang. It was pretty much as Zhang had described.","Captain Sun discovered through surveillance that the sanitation workers at the entrance of Jiangzhou University cleaned at fixed times: once a day, between 8 PM and 10 PM.","There were surveillance cameras at the university entrance and at an intersection 2000 meters away from the school gate, but the area between these two cameras was a blind spot, and the entrance to that grove happened to be within this blind spot.","On the evening of the 28th, an electric tricycle garbage truck appeared in the intersection camera at 6:11 PM, but it didn't appear at the school gate until 8:43 PM. Then the sanitation worker got off to clean.","Captain Sun keenly noticed that in the intersection camera footage, there were no dead leaves or light purple fruits stuck to the wheels of the vehicle, but in the school gate camera footage, these things were stuck to the wheels—proving that the vehicle had been to that Chinese pistache grove during the time it was out of sight.","The truck bed of the garbage vehicle was fully enclosed, so it wasn't possible to see if anything was hidden inside.","Captain Sun identified the suspect through that vehicle.","Fang Rui thought Captain Sun's analysis made sense, but how could a sanitation worker come up with such a complex method of murder?","\"Haiyang, can I join you in interrogating the suspect?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"Well... I can't make that decision. It's up to Captain Sun.\"","Fang Rui brought a bag of bubble tea and late-night snacks to the special task force's office.","The team members had dark circles under their eyes and messy hair, probably from not resting for many days. Sun Guangtian's dark circles were even more severe; Fang Rui suspected he hadn't closed his eyes for days.","When Captain Li saw Fang Rui arrive, he instantly saw him as a savior. His eyes silently complained about Sun Guangtian's torment.","Captain Li thought Fang Rui was smart for having argued with Sun Guangtian early on and escaping his clutches. Unlike him, who was now firmly in Sun's grasp, being twisted and turned at will.","Fang Rui distributed the food to everyone. They all put down their work, and the atmosphere became more relaxed.","Sun Guangtian gave Fang Rui a cool glance. This kid sure knows how to win people over.","Fang Rui handed Sun Guangtian a cup of bubble tea, \"Captain Sun, you should take care of your health too. It's not good to stay up late so often.\"","\"I don't drink this stuff! Are you implying I'm old, kid?\"","\"Even young people can't handle this kind of all-nighter.\"","The young officers in the office nodded frantically. Captain Li was even more moved to tears, thinking Fang Rui was truly his good brother, daring to confront Sun Guangtian just to bail him out.","Sun Guangtian pulled out a half-empty pack of cigarettes from his pocket. He took one out and offered another to Fang Rui, \"Have one, it'll help you stay alert.\"","\"Sorry, I don't smoke.\"","\"That's a good habit. Smoking should be kept to a minimum.\" Sun Guangtian put the cigarettes back in his pocket. \"So, what do you want from me?\"","\"Captain Sun, can I join you in interrogating the suspect?\"","Sun Guangtian smiled at Fang Rui, \"Don't tell me you've hit a dead end in your investigation and you're here looking for inspiration?\"","\"I suspect that this suspect isn't the real killer,\" Fang Rui said.","Sun Guangtian exhaled a smoke ring and said, \"Alright, you can come with me to interrogate him.\""]},{"number":82,"title":"Chapter 82: Couple Butchers: A Couple","paragraphs":["In the interrogation room, sanitation worker Zhang Guofeng sat nervously on the chair, his eyes darting around, looking guilty as if he had done something wrong.","Sun Guangtian frowned when he saw him.","He exchanged a glance with Fang Rui, and they both had the same thought: this man couldn't be the killer. A serial killer's psychological fortitude couldn't be this poor!","\"Where were you between 6 PM and 8 PM on the 28th?\" Sun Guangtian asked.","\"I was resting at home that day.\"","\"Are you sure?\"","\"Ah, no, I wasn't off that day, I was on shift. I went to clean outside Jiangzhou University's gate.\"","\"You'd better tell the truth.\" Sun Guangtian's tone was a bit impatient.","Zhang Guofeng looked aggrieved: \"I am telling the truth. I'm an honest person, why would I lie? I haven't done anything wrong!\"","\"Your vehicle arrived near the school just after 6 PM, but you didn't start cleaning at the school gate until after 8 PM. What were you doing during that time?\"","\"I...\" Zhang Guofeng hemmed and hawed for a while, finally coming up with an excuse, \"I went to the bathroom. I had an upset stomach that day, so I relieved myself in the woods.\"","\"Where exactly? Take us there now.\"","\"I... I forgot.\"","Seeing his face turn red, Sun Guangtian said, \"Just be honest. Were you gambling or visiting a prostitute?\"","Zhang Guofeng's voice rose a few pitches: \"What prostitute? How can it be called prostitution if I'm visiting my old flame?\"","\"Old flame?\"","\"My wife is extremely strict, so I can only meet my old flame under the pretense of going out to clean. Otherwise, she'd beat me to death.\"","Zhang Guofeng shrank his neck, \"I usually leave early with the garbage truck, then park it at the edge of the small forest. Then I cut through the woods and take a shortcut to my lover's house. I don't dare drive directly to her place, afraid someone might see my vehicle parked under her building and tell my wife. That day I went to her house, she can vouch for me.\"","\"Does anyone else have the keys to that three-wheeled vehicle?\" Sun Guangtian asked.","\"I'm the only one with the keys.\"","\"Do you often go for these trysts?\"","\"What do you mean trysts? I just go there for massages. I go about two or three times a month. Sometimes five or six times when it's more frequent.\"","\"Does anyone know about this habit of yours?\"","\"Nobody knows! Otherwise, my wife would beat me to death. I always sneak off to see her secretly.\"","Sun Guangtian contacted Zhang Guofeng's secret lover, who confirmed that during that time period, Zhang Guofeng was indeed with her.","Surveillance cameras near her house also proved that Zhang Guofeng had jogged all the way to her place. So he didn't have time to dig a hole and bury a body.","His suspicion was temporarily cleared.","After the interrogation, it was already past 11 PM.","Song Haiyang and his team were frustrated that the suspect they had worked so hard to find turned out not to be the killer. They had been reviewing surveillance footage day and night, only to have it turn out to be a false lead.","Someone complained, \"I haven't closed my eyes for days, I'm exhausted, and we didn't find anything.\"","\"Exactly, we're human, not machines. We need rest!\"","Sun Guangtian's face turned ashen. He told everyone, \"You all go home and rest.\"","Everyone immediately packed up and left.","Only Sun Guangtian and Fang Rui remained in the office. He leaned against the window and started smoking again.","Fang Rui saw his state and wanted to comfort him, but was interrupted: \"Fang Rui, you're not staying behind to watch me make a fool of myself, are you?\"","\"Of course not. This is how investigations go. Often you might investigate for half a month and find nothing. Then suddenly you might get a lead and catch the criminal.\"","Fang Rui felt that Sun Guangtian was under a lot of pressure, possibly because the case had been unsolved for over half a year, so he was eager to catch the killer.","\"I don't need your comfort!\" Sun Guangtian cut off Fang Rui's words, \"You think this lead is dead? No, I think that vehicle is definitely suspicious. I suspect someone is using Zhang Guofeng to avoid surveillance cameras. They must know Zhang Guofeng. If we keep investigating, we'll definitely find a clue!\"","\"...\"","He discovered that after Zhang Guofeng left home, a man wearing a helmet followed him on an electric bike. The man was young, wearing sportswear, looking like a college student. Near the school, he took off his helmet, and the surveillance camera captured his face.","There were often college students riding electric bikes around the school area, so initially, Sun Guangtian didn't notice anything unusual about this person.","This man was Zhang Guofeng's son, Zhang Ming, 31 years old, working as an animal trainer at a nearby zoo.","He originally worked at a zoo in Linzhou, but suddenly quit and returned to Jiangzhou City a year ago. The zoo where he worked in Linzhou was also close to the wasteland where the bodies were buried.","Sun Guangtian felt that this person should be the killer.","However, he currently had no evidence of Zhang Ming's crimes, so he didn't bring him to the police station for questioning. Instead, he assigned an experienced detective to follow him to prevent him from committing another crime.","Sun Guangtian sent people to investigate the zoo in Linzhou to see if they could find any clues; he himself went to Zhang Guofeng's home while Zhang Ming was at work to search their house.","He examined Zhang Ming's shoes one by one and found that one pair of sneakers had a faint purple stain on the white sole. The shoes had been washed very clean, with no visible dirt, which made the purple stain stand out.","This could very likely be the color that stained his shoes when he stepped on purple fruits in that forest.","\"Boss, Sun Guangtian has found another suspect,\" Zhang updated with the latest information, \"He's the son of that sanitation worker, Zhang Ming. Sun Guangtian suspects that the son used his father to transport the bodies, then secretly took the vehicle to bury the bodies while his father was having his affair.\"","Fang Rui inquired about the situation from Song Haiyang again. Fang Rui felt that although Zhang Ming was very suspicious, his education level was low. How could he design an experiment to collect brain wave data? And how did he obtain the brain wave equipment?","\"It seems Zhou Junwei might not be the killer after all!\" Zhang sighed, \"Could our investigation approach be wrong?\"","Mu Mian said, \"Maybe the person who designed the experiment and the person who carried it out are not the same? When we conduct experiments, we need assistants. It's very difficult for one person to complete a complex experiment.\"","\"Dr. Mu, since the killer targets couples, he should be single, right? Otherwise, how would he become psychologically twisted due to hating couples?\" Zhang asked.","Li chimed in, \"That's right, if he had a partner, he probably wouldn't be psychologically disturbed.\"","\"Could we be trapped in a psychological blind spot? Zhang, do you remember you once said that Zhou Junwei might be gay? He and Zhang Ming left Linzhou and returned to Jiangzhou City almost at the same time. Could they be a couple?\"","If it was a couple committing the crimes together, everything would make sense.","\"Boss, but Zhang Ming works at a zoo, and Zhou Junwei is a university professor. How could these two completely different people be a couple? The gap in their social status is too big.\"","Fang Rui thought for a moment and said, \"They're about the same age. Could they have been middle school or high school classmates?\"","Fang Rui and Zhang went to investigate at Zhou Junwei's high school. Zhou Junwei was in Jiangzhou City","Teacher Chen was a man in his fifties, looking very stern and serious. When mentioning Zhou Junwei, his face showed an expression of disgust.","\"I have a deep impression of Zhou Junwei as a student. His academic performance was good, but he had psychological problems, a bit perverted. He often harassed their class monitor Chen Yuan'an, and even tried to molest him once.\""]},{"number":83,"title":"Chapter 83: Couple Butchers: New Victims","paragraphs":["\"Is Chen Yuan'an currently in Dongzhou, and did he recently get married?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"Yes, how do you know?\" Teacher Chen was a bit surprised. \"He should be doing well now, right? He was my most promising student.\"","\"Zhou Junwei attended Chen Yuan'an's wedding. If what you're saying is true, how could he have been invited to the wedding?\" Fang Rui noticed a hole in his story.","\"How would I know? I guess Zhou Junwei probably insisted on going, uninvited. That guy is very abnormal.\"","Zhang couldn't help but correct him: \"Teacher Chen, you're an educator after all. It's not right to criticize your students like this. What era are we living in? Homosexuality has been declassified as a mental illness for over a decade. It's not good to discriminate like this.\"","Zhang's cousin had been bullied by classmates and teachers for being gay. Fortunately, his cousin was mentally strong and wasn't crushed by public opinion. Instead, he got into a good university and later studied abroad.","\"He also abused small animals,\" Teacher Chen retorted. \"What normal student would dissect a live rabbit in the classroom? Someone like him will eventually harm society.\"","Zhang fell silent. That was indeed a bit too abnormal.","\"At that time, wasn't Zhou Junwei dating the class monitor?\" Fang Rui asked.","Teacher Chen raised his voice: \"Of course not. Chen Yuan'an personally reported to me that Zhou Junwei had sexually harassed him. Otherwise, I wouldn't have asked his parents to send him to a correction school for behavioral modification.\"","Fang Rui suspected that it was probably the class monitor's betrayal that twisted Zhou Junwei's psychology.","\"Do you know Zhang Ming?\" Fang Rui continued to ask.","\"Zhang Ming?\" Teacher Chen squinted, thought for a moment, then said, \"I think he was in the same grade as Zhou Junwei. He was also a problem student. He was addicted to online games, always skipping classes, with terrible grades. He had been asked to leave school several times, but his mother kept making a fuss at the school, so he wasn't expelled. I heard that to get money for internet cafes, he chased his father with a knife for several blocks. The matter even ended up at the police station. This student will probably be a parasite on society too.\"","\"Did they later transfer to Linzhou City?\"","\"I don't know. In the second semester of their second year of high school, Zhang Ming and Zhou Junwei were sent to a behavioral correction school. Zhou Junwei needed to change his abnormal sexual orientation and his morbid behavior of killing small animals, while Zhang Ming needed to overcome his internet addiction. After the behavioral correction, Zhou Junwei seems to have transferred to a high school in Linzhou City. I don't know about Zhang Ming, he might have dropped out. Zhang Ming's parents didn't care much about him.\"","\"What was the name of that behavioral correction school?\"","\"Green Sprout Psychological Correction School. It's been closed for many years now.\"","After leaving the school, Fang Rui searched for information about this school online.","\"My God, boss, this is too cruel,\" Zhang was also reading related reports. \"Was this a legitimate school? They actually shocked students with electricity and fed them disgusting things. They called this aversion therapy? Could it be that Zhang Ming and Zhou Junwei became psychologically disturbed because of the abuse at this school?\"","After reading those reports, Fang Rui also felt that this school was extremely cruel. The school was run like a military camp, with students only allowed in but not out, and parents were not allowed to visit. A large number of internet-addicted teenagers and students with behavioral problems were sent to this school for correction.","Most of the teachers there had no professional qualifications. Under the guise of psychological treatment, they abused students through electric shocks and forcing them to eat disgusting food, forcibly trying to correct students' bad behaviors.","Although this method achieved some results, such as many internet-addicted teenagers never wanting to touch a computer again after being sent to this school, many of these students developed severe psychological disorders, and some even committed suicide.","Later, a brave undercover journalist exposed the atrocities of this school, which led to its closure and legal punishment for the relevant personnel.","Zhang said, \"Boss, it seems the killers must be Zhang Ming and Zhou Junwei. Zhou Junwei comes up with the ideas, and Zhang Ming is responsible for kidnapping the victims and disposing of the bodies.\"","Back at the bureau, Fang Rui immediately went to the task force's office, intending to report his findings to Captain Sun.","Sun Guangtian was arranging for Song Haiyang to bring Zhang Ming in for a thorough interrogation.","\"Captain Sun, we suspect there are two killers...\"","Sun Guangtian interrupted him: \"Wait until I finish interrogating Zhang Ming, then you can report to me.\"","At this moment, Fang Rui suddenly received a call from the dispatcher.","\"Captain Fang, it's not good. Two students from Jiangzhou Institute of Technology have been missing for a day. Because they are also a couple, their counselor is worried they might have been taken by the 'Couple Killer' that's been spreading online, so they quickly reported it to the police.\"","Sun Guangtian paused upon hearing the phone conversation. What's going on? Zhang Ming was already under his surveillance, how could he kidnap a couple?","Fang Rui contacted Old Zhang, who was tailing Zhou Junwei. Old Zhang reported that Zhou Junwei hadn't shown any unusual behavior in the past few days, so it was impossible for him to have kidnapped a couple.","Sun Guangtian also quickly contacted the officer tailing Zhang Ming, who stated that Zhang Ming had been going to and from work on time and returning home on time in the evenings. It seemed impossible for him to have kidnapped a couple right under their noses.","Fang Rui, Sun Guangtian, Zhang, and the others went to Jiangzhou Institute of Technology to investigate. This school was very close to Jiangzhou University.","The missing student couple was named Qin Lanlan and Li Dongguang. They had left in the morning yesterday and hadn't returned since. They hadn't asked for leave, nor had they told their roommates where they were going. Their phones were unreachable, and all their social media accounts were unresponsive. They were completely out of contact.","Fang Rui checked the school's surveillance footage. Like Wang Jie and Zhang Shuochen, they had also gotten into a taxi at the school gate. Based on the taxi's license plate number, they found the driver.","\"I remember these two college students. They weren't quite right in the head. They asked me to take them to the foot of a mountain, then they just walked off with their backpacks. It was in the middle of nowhere, I don't know what they were going to do there.\"","\"Didn't they say what they were going to do?\"","\"No. They were on their phones the whole time. They didn't talk. I even asked, but they ignored me, so I stopped trying to chat with them.\"","Fang Rui felt a headache coming on. Both suspects were under their surveillance, so how did this couple go missing? Could there be a copycat killer?","They had no choice but to allocate a large amount of police force to this missing persons case. The police even sent out a large number of personnel to search the mountains, determined to find this couple.","They couldn't allow any more victims! Otherwise, many people would be held accountable.","After a busy day with no results, Fang Rui returned to the police station around 10 PM. He found that Mu Mian hadn't left work yet and was having an academic discussion with Forensic Doctor Cheng. Fang Rui noticed that the two of them seemed to be getting along well.","Seeing Fang Rui, Mu Mian yawned and said to Forensic Doctor Cheng, \"Doctor Cheng, I'm tired. I'm going home to sleep.\"","\"Alright, goodbye.\" Forensic Doctor Cheng glanced at Fang Rui with an \"I understand\" expression.","Fang Rui had originally planned to stay and work overtime, but seeing Mu Mian, he decided to send her home first and then come back to work.","He wouldn't be able to sleep anyway until they found that couple.","Fang Rui drove Mu Mian home. As they were passing through a secluded stretch of road, his phone rang. He asked Mu Mian to answer it for him.","On the other end was Captain Li. Usually calm in temperament, his tone was now angry:","\"Fang Rui, we found that couple. I'm about to explode with anger. Guess where they were? They were camping on the mountaintop! Think of how much police resources we wasted. We asked them why they didn't answer their phones, and guess what they said? They said they wanted to quietly enjoy the beauty of nature, so they put their phones on airplane mode. My God, what a waste! They even had the audacity to say we were making a big deal out of nothing. If someone hadn't held me back, I would have given them a good thrashing!\"","\"It's good that they've been found,\" Fang Rui sighed in relief. \"Take everyone out for a late-night snack. Everyone must be tired and hungry after being so busy.\"","\"Absolutely!\"","Mu Mian hung up the phone for Fang Rui.","At this moment, the right front tire suddenly blew out. Fang Rui pulled over to the side of the road and got out to check.","The tire had been punctured by a broken bottle. As Fang Rui pulled out the shard of green glass, he found it strange. How could there be broken bottle pieces on a main road?"]},{"number":84,"title":"Chapter 84: Couple Butchers: Kidnapped","paragraphs":["At that moment, Fang Rui sensed someone approaching from behind. He pretended to continue inspecting the tire, and when the person got close, Fang Rui grabbed their hand and twisted, executing a shoulder throw.","The person landed heavily on the ground, struggling to get up. Fang Rui pinned him down, took out handcuffs from his waist, and cuffed him.","\"It's you?\" Fang Rui finally recognized the attacker as Zhou Junwei. \"We were just about to arrest you, but I didn't expect you to walk right into our trap.\"","Mu Mian noticed the commotion and got out of the car, then she saw another man lunging at Fang Rui from behind.","Fang Rui recognized him as Zhang Ming. Fang Rui and Zhang Ming engaged in close combat, but Zhang Ming was no match for Fang Rui. He was quickly kicked to the ground. Fang Rui grabbed Zhang Ming's collar, intending to handcuff him together with Zhou Junwei.","\"Fang Rui, watch out!\"","Fang Rui suddenly felt something pierce his thigh, and an icy liquid entered his veins. His whole body became paralyzed, and he quickly lost consciousness.","\"Junwei, are you alright?\" Zhang Ming found the handcuff key in Fang Rui's pocket and unlocked the cuffs on Zhou Junwei's wrists. \"He's quite a fighter, good thing we prepared the tranquilizer. It's meant for animals, very potent. He won't wake up for a while.\"","An hour earlier, they had used the same tranquilizer to take down the police officer who was tailing them.","\"Why couldn't you beat him? Now we have to wait for him to wake up. I don't know if we have enough time.\"","Mu Mian watched helplessly as Fang Rui collapsed. She couldn't do anything. But she also couldn't run away - if she did, they would surely kill Fang Rui. Besides, she wouldn't be able to escape anyway.","It had been raining for the past few days, leaving the ground covered with damp soil. Mu Mian secretly used her toe to write a few letters in the dirt. She also quietly dropped the bone pendant her sister had given her on the ground.","Zhou Junwei felt like his internal organs had been shattered. It took him a while to recover. He looked at Mu Mian and said to Zhang Ming, \"Zhang Ming, grab that girl. Don't let her run away.\"","\"She won't run. The person she loves is still here,\" Zhang Ming's voice was low. \"She won't leave him behind.\"","Zhang Ming walked up to Fang Rui, glaring at him viciously. He raised his foot, intending to break Fang Rui's ribs to avenge Zhou Junwei.","\"You can't hurt Fang Rui. You want us to participate in that couple experiment, don't you?\" Mu Mian stepped forward. \"If Fang Rui is injured now, he definitely won't be able to cooperate with your experiment. The police are already onto you, you don't have much time left to conduct this experiment.\"","Zhang Ming lowered his foot. He looked at Mu Mian, seeing panic in her eyes. He thought Mu Mian must really love Officer Fang.","Zhou Junwei said, \"Do you think it's an experiment? I prefer to call it a game.\"","\"Your game is very creative,\" Mu Mian complimented.","\"Do you want to play my game? I want to see what love is like for someone with autism,\" Zhou Junwei's lips twisted into a sinister smile. \"I've seen many people's love stories, but none were interesting. I hope you won't disappoint me.\"","Zhou Junwei had seen Mu Mian at school before. She was Professor Shen's sister, an autistic person with a brain defect like him. He felt it was unfair. Why could Mu Mian have love?","\"I don't have love yet.\"","\"You don't? Then you'll be killed immediately!\" Zhou Junwei said ominously. Behind him, Zhang Ming pulled out a sharp knife, seemingly ready to finish off Mu Mian.","\"I do have love. I love Fang Rui very much,\" Mu Mian quickly corrected herself. She asked, \"If I win your game, will you let us go?\"","\"Of course, if you win the game, I'll let you go.\"","\"Your statement is problematic. It should be 'let you both go'. You need to release both me and Fang Rui at the same time.\" Mu Mian caught his verbal trap.","Zhou Junwei's smile froze. After a moment, he agreed, \"Fine.\"","\"I think someone who can come up with such a creative game wouldn't lie to an autistic person, right?\" Mu Mian sought confirmation again. \"You won't deceive me, will you?\"","\"If you win, I promise I'll let Officer Fang leave with you.\"","Mu Mian extended her hand towards them. \"I'll cooperate with your game, but you must not harm Fang Rui. I love him very much. If he gets hurt, I won't play your game. Then you'll never know what love is like for someone with autism.\"","\"You'll be safe until the game begins,\" Zhou Junwei gave Zhang Ming a look. Zhang Ming took out the tranquilizer gun and injected Mu Mian's arm.","The cold liquid entered Mu Mian's veins, making her feel drowsy. She slowly closed her eyes.","But Mu Mian didn't fall unconscious. She had a high tolerance for anesthetics.","Zhang Ming brought over a silver van. They first carried Fang Rui to the back seat, then lifted Mu Mian in as well. Without even cleaning up the scene, they quickly drove away.","\"Junwei, do you really have to kill them? We've already killed so many people. Why don't we turn ourselves in?\" Zhang Ming suddenly said. \"I'm so tired. Let's run away, go abroad, or hide in some remote mountain where no one will find us for the rest of our lives.\"","\"Zhang Ming, we've already killed so many people. What difference does two more make?\" Zhou Junwei's expression was cold. \"No matter how many more we kill, the punishment will be the same.\"","\"But they're police officers. It's different,\" Zhang Ming seemed hesitant. \"Let's let them go. We can still escape now. Or we could use them as hostages to bargain with the police to let us go.\"","\"It's no different. If you don't want to help me, then get out of the car. I can finish the rest by myself,\" Zhou Junwei coldly looked at Zhang Ming. He thought Zhang Ming was too useless. If he hadn't been desperate for help, he wouldn't have let Zhang Ming be the executor of his game.","\"Junwei, I'll help you,\" Zhang Ming conceded. \"Even if it means going to hell, I'll go with you. Whatever it is, I'll help you. You know I love you very much.\"","\"Zhang Ming, how can you prove your love for me?\"","\"I've killed so many people for you. Isn't that enough to prove my love?\" Zhang Ming's expression was crestfallen.","\"No, it's not. I can't see it. Unless you tell me what your love for me looks like,\" Zhou Junwei focused on driving, his expression somewhat cold. \"I can't feel love, so I only believe in what I can see.\""]},{"number":85,"title":"Chapter 85: Couple Butchers: Rescue","paragraphs":["It was past 11 PM, and Shen Xiyin hadn't seen Mu Mian return home, nor had she received any text messages from her. She tried calling, but no one answered.","Suddenly, she had an ominous feeling. Mu Mian always came home on time, and even if she worked late, she would be home before 11. If she couldn't make it back in time, Mu Mian would always send a text to let her know.","Shen Xiyin tried calling Fang Rui, but he didn't answer either.","Her instincts told her that something had happened to Mu Mian and the others.","Shen Xiyin dialed a number she hadn't called in a long time.","\"What is it?\" The voice on the other end was cold.","\"Lin Sen, do you know where Mu Mian went?\"","\"Forensic Pathologist Mu? Didn't she leave work? I saw her get into Fang Rui's car. Hasn't she made it home yet?\"","\"No.\"","\"Don't worry, I'll call Fang Rui.\" Even over the phone, Lin Sen could sense Shen Xiyin's panic.","\"Captain Fang's phone isn't going through either.\"","\"Are you at home now? I'll drive over to find you. We'll talk when we meet.\"","On his way to Shen Xiyin's house, Lin Sen suddenly spotted Fang Rui's car. He pulled over and found that Fang Rui's car door was open, the right tire was flat, and there were glass shards scattered a few meters behind the car.","He instantly realized that someone had deliberately used glass shards to force Fang Rui's car to stop. Fang Rui and the others were likely in trouble. He immediately contacted Zhang and the team.","Lin Sen found it strange. Given Fang Rui's skills, he shouldn't have been so easily captured by criminals. What exactly had happened?","Fortunately, there was no blood at the scene, so Fang Rui and the others might not have been injured.","Sun Guangtian and Captain Li, who had just finished a late-night snack, quickly rushed to the scene upon hearing the news.","Shen Xiyin had also taken a taxi to arrive. She looked very flustered. Seeing Lin Sen, she anxiously asked, \"Lin Sen, did the serial killer who murders couples kidnap Mu Mian and Fang Rui?\"","\"It's possible.\"","\"Lin Sen, you must help me rescue Mu Mian. I can't lose her.\"","Seeing her like this, Lin Sen suddenly felt a bit jealous of Mu Mian. When she had broken up with him, she had been so calm, but now she was in such a panic. Mu Mian must be much more important to her than he ever was.","Lin Sen comforted her, \"Shen Xiyin, I won't let anything happen to them.\"","\"Lin Sen, I've already lost so many important things. I have almost nothing left. Mu Mian is the only important person I have. I really can't lose her too.\" Shen Xiyin was on the verge of a mental breakdown. \"Lin Sen, you must help me save Mu Mian.\"","\"The killer must have mistaken Mu Mian and Fang Rui for a couple. He won't kill them so quickly.\" Lin Sen reassured her, \"As long as we find the two culprits before he makes his move, they'll be safe.\"","Shen Xiyin controlled her emotions and began searching for clues around the car. Mu Mian was very clever; she must have left some clues.","Soon, she found Mu Mian's bone pendant on the ground. Shen Xiyin also saw three letters scrawled on the ground: SOS.","\"Lin Sen, this is my sister's favorite pendant. She always keeps it in her pocket. She left us a distress signal. She must be in danger.\" Shen Xiyin began to panic again, \"Will Mu Mian die?\"","Lin Sen embraced her, \"No, they're very smart. They'll surely find a way to save themselves. We need to stay calm now and find the killer as quickly as possible.\"","Shen Xiyin tried hard to control her emotions, but she still couldn't overcome the fear. She was too afraid of losing Mu Mian. Since losing her parents, Mu Mian had become her biggest reason to keep living. She couldn't imagine what her life would be like if Mu Mian died.","\"Shen Xiyin, you still have me. No matter what happens, I'll always be by your side.\"","Lin Sen's words gave Shen Xiyin courage.","Perhaps she could still have Lin Sen, no matter what she became.","Lin Sen addressed the group, \"Given Fang Rui's skills, he wouldn't be easily subdued. Unless the perpetrator used special methods, like an electric shock or a tranquilizer dart. In that case, Fang Rui would certainly need some time to regain consciousness.","The killer abducted them to test their love, so he'll wait until Fang Rui wakes up before conducting his test. The time Fang Rui is unconscious is our window for rescue.\"","Zhang said, \"It's unlikely to be an electric shock. The boss has been prepared for that. He wears insulated shoes on missions, so ordinary electric shocks shouldn't affect him.\"","Shen Xiyin said, \"Then the killer must have used a fast-acting sedative to control them. Mu Mian has a high tolerance for sedatives. She must have taken the opportunity to leave us clues.\"","Lin Sen held Shen Xiyin's hand, offering support. Shen Xiyin squeezed his hand back.","Sun Guangtian also assigned tasks to the team. \"Li and Old Zhang, quickly check the nearby surveillance cameras to see if you can find any suspicious vehicles. Song Haiyang and Zhang, each of you take a team to search the areas around Zhang Ming and Zhou Junwei's homes. We must be quick; we need to find them as soon as possible.\"","Everyone sprang into action.","Li and his team quickly found an unusual vehicle from the surveillance footage—a silver van. The intersection camera caught this van passing through a few minutes before Fang Rui's car, but it only appeared in another surveillance video about thirteen minutes later. At normal driving speed, the journey between the two cameras should only take three minutes.","This van kept taking small roads and constantly changing direction, trying to prevent the police from tracking its route. Later, it entered a section of road without surveillance cameras and never reappeared in the traffic monitoring system.","Time ticked by minute by minute, and as the sun rose, it was already daylight. But they still hadn't tracked down where the van had gone.","They didn't have much time left.","Lin Sen said, \"I have a way that might buy us some more time. But we'll need the bureau chief's help.\""]},{"number":86,"title":"Chapter 86: Couple Butchers: The Optimal Solution","paragraphs":["When Fang Rui woke up, he saw Mu Mian sitting across from him, her hands and feet bound, with a black electrode cap on her head.","As his consciousness gradually cleared, he realized he was similarly restrained, likely wearing the same strange device on his head.","Those black wires were connected to electroencephalogram equipment.","They were confined in a warehouse made of sheet metal, dimly lit, with sunlight filtering through high windows indicating it was now morning.","Fang Rui noticed a table to his left with a laptop on it, the screen displaying Zhou Junwei's cold face.","\"Detective Fang, you're finally awake?\" Zhou Junwei revealed an eerie smile, \"I've been waiting for you for quite a while.\"","\"What do you want?\"","\"Isn't it obvious? I want you to play a game. Because I want to know what love is like for people with autism. I hope you can satisfy my curiosity, otherwise your fate might be rather tragic.\"","Fang Rui understood that Zhou Junwei must have mistakenly assumed he and Mu Mian were a couple.","\"Dr. Mu, are you still pretending to be asleep?\" Zhou Junwei looked at Mu Mian, \"We gave you a much smaller dose of anesthetic compared to Detective Fang. He's already awake, so you must have been awake for a while, right? Or do you need me to wake you up with an electric shock?\"","\"That won't be necessary. I'm already awake,\" Mu Mian quickly replied. She had originally intended to feign sleep to buy some time, but her ruse had been discovered.","\"You already know the purpose of your invitation here. Now, let me explain the rules of the game. It's a very simple game. There's a red button beside each of you. The game consists of four rounds. In each round, the person who presses the button first gets to make a choice: shock yourself or shock your lover. If neither of you presses the button or if you press it simultaneously, both of you will receive the shock for that round.","The voltage intensity for each round is randomly determined. I've set up six voltage levels: 30V, 36V, 40V, 220V, 300V, and 450V. They will appear randomly in each round of the game.\"","After hearing the rules, Fang Rui suddenly realized that this game could only end with one person surviving or both dying.","\"You should understand the rules now. Let's start the game,\" Zhou Junwei announced. \"This is the first round. You have one minute to press the button and make your choice. You have plenty of time, so think it through.\"","As soon as Zhou Junwei finished speaking, Fang Rui resolutely pressed the button.","\"Detective Fang, you didn't even take a moment to think?\" Zhou Junwei was a bit surprised. \"In this game, other participants usually hesitate and struggle for a while before the cold-hearted one makes the selfish choice first.\"","Mu Mian stared at Fang Rui in shock. She knew what the optimal solution to this game was, and she also knew what Fang Rui intended to do.","Fang Rui said, \"I choose to shock myself.\"","The countdown on the screen disappeared, replaced by the voltage value: 30V.","\"Detective Fang, you're very lucky. In the first round, you've drawn the lowest voltage. You won't be harmed this time.\"","The second round began, with the countdown for pressing the button and making a choice reduced to 20 seconds.","Fang Rui had his hand practically on the button, so he was again quicker to press it.","\"I still choose to shock myself.\"","This time, the screen displayed a voltage of 40V. Simultaneously, Fang Rui's body began to tremble slightly, his face contorting in pain, which he struggled to suppress.","\"Detective Fang, did you feel the pain of the electric shock? I hope you won't make such a hasty decision in the next round.\"","\"Fang Rui, why do you keep choosing to shock yourself?\" Mu Mian asked.","\"Mu Mian, if only one of us can survive, I want it to be you,\" Fang Rui smiled at her.","\"But why? Fang Rui, you're so young, you surely don't want to die. Why are you giving me the chance to live?\" Mu Mian couldn't understand.","Why indeed? Fang Rui thought it might be because he had fallen in love with Mu Mian.","When did he fall for her?","Fang Rui wasn't sure. At first, he thought Mu Mian was a genius, and he was kind to her to help solve cases more effectively.","But later, his feelings changed.","Perhaps it was when he repeatedly saw Mu Mian carefully disguising herself, thinking she was doing a good job, that he found her both amusing and pitiful, unable to resist the urge to indulge her true self.","Maybe it was when Mu Mian was racking her brains trying to obtain his corpse. Sometimes he couldn't help but think, why not just agree? But then he felt he couldn't, because if he did, he would no longer be important to her.","Or perhaps it was when he gave her that skeleton bride. That day, Mu Mian said she liked him very, very, very much. At that moment, he felt an uncontrollable happiness, even though he knew Mu Mian's \"like\" was no different from her fondness for the skeleton bride.","\"The third round is starting,\" Zhou Junwei reminded them.","\"Mu Mian, don't press that button,\" Fang Rui said to her. \"I promised I would protect you.\"","\"No!\"","But Fang Rui was still faster in pressing the button.","This round's voltage was 300V. Fang Rui convulsed violently for a while, nearly losing consciousness.","Zhou Junwei's tone became a bit excited: \"The fourth round is about to begin. This time you only have five seconds to make your choice.\"","Before the game even started, Mu Mian had her hand pressed firmly on the button.","The optimal solution to this game was for only one person to survive, and now the best outcome would be for Fang Rui to endure the last shock, with Mu Mian being the one to live.","But Mu Mian couldn't think rationally now. She felt she had to do something, even if it meant she would die.","Mu Mian silently apologized to her sister. She had promised her sister she would always be there for her, but now she might not be able to keep that promise.","The screen displayed the voltage: 30V.","The expected shock didn't come.","\"Dr. Mu, congratulations on winning this game. You've survived,\" Zhou Junwei said, sighing as he looked at the unconscious Fang Rui. \"Unfortunately, you've lost your lover.\"","Mu Mian didn't respond to Zhou Junwei.","She stared blankly at the motionless Fang Rui.","Rationally, Mu Mian knew she should be happy because she had finally obtained Fang Rui's body—he had died in a homicide, and as a forensic pathologist, she could follow the procedure to autopsy his corpse.","But grief washed over her like a tidal wave, drowning her. She felt as if she were suffocating, unable to breathe.","Mu Mian's mind went blank, feeling detached from reality, with one message screaming in her ears: Fang Rui was dead.","There would be no one to tell her she could be her true self anymore; no one who happened to like the foods she disliked and was willing to eat them; no one to give her rides to and from work... Without Fang Rui, a large part of her life was missing.","She had obtained Fang Rui's body, but lost a piece of her life's puzzle that could never be replaced.","With a clang, the iron door opened from the outside. Bright sunlight shone into Mu Mian's eyes, giving her a sense of disorientation.","Zhou Junwei and Zhang Ming walked in."]},{"number":87,"title":"Chapter 87: Couple Butchers: Fantasize About You","paragraphs":["Zhou Junwei looked at Mu Mian's blank expression and suddenly felt a strange sense of satisfaction.","They were the same kind of people after all. They couldn't have emotions. Now that Mu Mian had lost the person she loved most, she would never be able to experience the most passionate love again. This was fair.","Zhou Junwei excitedly said, \"Dr. Mu, you've won. I promised you that if you won my game, I would let you go. Now you can leave with Police Officer Fang's body. I'll keep my promise and let you both go.\"","Mu Mian stared at them expressionlessly. In her mind, she imagined a scene of torture. She would lock Zhou Junwei in a specially made cage, where every part could potentially deliver an electric shock. The shocks wouldn't be fatal, but they would cause extreme pain. Zhou Junwei would live in constant fear and agony.","As for Zhang Ming, he would be forced to watch Zhou Junwei's torment from outside the cage. He wouldn't even be able to close his eyes, forced to witness this cruelty and endure mental torture.","Mu Mian regained some of her rationality. She became clearly aware again that Fang Rui was dead.","\"Dr. Mu, you were very clever to find the 'optimal solution' logically. But you didn't love each other enough. If neither of you had pressed the button, the voltage would have remained at 30V. Both of you enduring the shock together would have been the best solution to this game. Unfortunately, I've tested so many couples, and not one has found the right method.\"","Zhou Junwei continued, \"But Dr. Mu, you should thank me. Look, I helped you test how much Police Officer Fang loved you.\"","Zhang Ming walked over to Fang Rui's side, intending to untie the ropes on his body to return his corpse to Mu Mian. He had just bent down to undo the ropes when he realized they were already loose. Before he could be surprised, he felt a punch to his abdomen.","Zhang Ming felt as if his internal organs had been shattered, and he let out a painful groan.","A rope tightened around his hands, and in no time, his hands were tied behind his back, and he was thrown heavily to the ground.","Everything happened so quickly that Zhou Junwei and Mu Mian just stared in shock.","Mu Mian felt as if fireworks were exploding in her brain. Fang Rui... had somehow come back to life. But dead people can't come back to life. Had something gone wrong? Was it her mind?","\"You... why didn't you die from electrocution?\" Zhou Junwei asked in astonishment. \"Were you pretending to be dead earlier? How did you escape the electric shock...\"","Fang Rui didn't answer his questions. Instead, he beat Zhou Junwei up and then tied him together with Zhang Ming.","Zhou Junwei looked at the strange shoes on Fang Rui's feet and finally found the answer - Fang Rui was wearing insulated shoes. Then he noticed that the indicator light on the device that should have been on was actually off - there had been a power outage in the warehouse.","\"You were lying to me! You weren't sacrificing yourself for love at all. What I saw wasn't love. You're a fraud!\" Zhou Junwei flew into a rage, struggling violently to break free from the ropes.","Fang Rui walked over to Mu Mian, untied her ropes, and removed the black electrode cap from her head.","Mu Mian stared at him blankly. Was this a hallucination? Had she started having visions of Fang Rui so soon after his death because she missed him so much?","\"Mu Mian, is this really the time to be spacing out?\"","Mu Mian thought she must be seriously ill if this imaginary figure had started talking to her.","Fang Rui sighed and pulled Mu Mian into an embrace. \"Mu Mian, it's all over now. We're safe.\"","The warm touch made Mu Mian's mind a little clearer. She thought her hallucination must be very advanced to have both tactile sensation and temperature.","Mu Mian couldn't help but speak to this imaginary figure: \"Fang Rui, don't be afraid. I won't seek treatment, so you can stay with me forever as a hallucination.\"","Fang Rui finally realized something was wrong with Mu Mian. He patted her face gently. \"Mu Mian, I'm not dead. I was just pretending earlier to trick them. You haven't gone into shock, have you? You can touch me to see if I'm real.\"","Mu Mian rested her head against Fang Rui's chest, feeling his strong heartbeat - a sign that Fang Rui was still alive.","\"You're... still alive?\"","\"Dr. Mu, you're being very unprofessional. Can't you tell the difference between a dead person and a living one?\"","\"Fang Rui, my brain short-circuited earlier. It was thinking so slowly. I was so scared. I thought you had died, and that I would never see you again.\"","\"But I'm alive now, aren't I? Come on, don't be sad. How about this - I'll give you my body donation agreement later. That should make you feel better, right?\"","\"Fang Rui, stop talking. You're being noisy.\" For some reason, Mu Mian felt irritated. She had always wanted to have Fang Rui's body, but now that she was finally going to get it, why didn't she want it anymore?","Perhaps it was because she now wanted Fang Rui to live, to live for a very long time. She didn't want Fang Rui to die.","Mu Mian suddenly realized she didn't want Fang Rui's body as much as she thought she did.","At that moment, the sound of vehicles and faint footsteps came from outside the warehouse.","Fang Rui let go of Mu Mian.","When everyone rushed into the warehouse, expecting to see a tense and thrilling scene, they were surprised to find that Fang Rui and Mu Mian had already successfully escaped and were waiting for their support.","Zhang burst into tears of joy. \"Boss, Dr. Mu, I knew you'd be alright.\"","Everyone breathed a sigh of relief.","\"Mian,\" Shen Xiyin ran over and hugged Mu Mian, \"I'm so glad you're okay. You scared your big sister to death.\"","Mu Mian hugged Shen Xiyin back.","\"Sister, I'm sorry. I didn't want to be kidnapped by the criminals either, it was just really bad luck. Fang Rui could have protected me, but these two were too despicable. They ambushed Fang Rui, otherwise they wouldn't have been able to overpower him. They almost killed Fang Rui and nearly drove me insane. If Fang Rui had died, I would have had to imagine a Fang Rui to keep me company.\"","Shen Xiyin was stunned. She hadn't realized how important Fang Rui was to Mu Mian.","The others who heard Mu Mian's words were also shocked. They all looked at Fang Rui with knowing glances.","Mu Mian noticed her sister's complex expression and thought Shen Xiyin was unhappy. So she tried to comfort her: \"Sister, if you died, I would imagine a version of you to keep me company too. No, I'd have to imagine two of you - one to deal with all my problems and work hard to make money to support me.\"","Everyone was speechless. So for every person who died, Mu Mian would imagine a replacement. They really couldn't keep up with Mu Mian's train of thought."]},{"number":88,"title":"Chapter 88: The Couple Butchers: Hypocritical Love","paragraphs":["On the way back, Zhang vividly described to Mu Mian and Fang Rui the process of rescuing them.","\"At first, we spotted the suspicious vehicle, a silver van, but it disappeared into a blind spot in the surveillance. When we tracked it down again, the driver had been switched. You have no idea how cunning Zhou Junwei and his accomplices were. They called for a substitute driver and had him drive the car to the suburbs. We spent half a day investigating and almost came up empty-handed. Fortunately, Captain Sun had assigned very detailed tasks, so when one lead went cold, we had others to follow up on.\"","\"We finally managed to pinpoint an abandoned, unfinished warehouse area. It was full of makeshift shelters made of sheet metal. We were dumbfounded – if we had to search them one by one, you would have surely perished by then. Luckily, Miss Shen and Lin Consultant found a small crumpled paper on the ground. When we unfolded it, it had the words 'corpse' written on it.\"","Zhang paused for a moment, \"We knew this must be a clue left by Forensic Pathologist Mu. We followed the path and found several more small paper balls, with the words 'Fang Rui', 'I voluntarily', 'donate' written on them in sequence. Following these paper clues, we finally found you, but—\"","Mu Mian looked at the ground sheepishly, pretending not to hear Zhang's teasing. She urged, \"Officer Zhang, please go tell Chen Xue that I'm alright now.\"","\"I've already told her,\" Zhang continued, \"Forensic Pathologist Mu, I can't believe you carry a body donation agreement with you... Who carries that kind of thing around? But it's a good thing you did, otherwise we wouldn't have had props to leave clues for us.\"","Zhang imagined Mu Mian secretly crumpling paper balls and found it a bit amusing.","Fang Rui, who was driving, warned Zhang, \"Zhang Qiang, I'm the victim here and I have no complaints, so what are you grumbling about?\"","\"Boss, please don't use my full name!\"","Zhang felt something was off. The boss used to favor Mu Mian before, but not so blatantly.","Could it be that after being tormented by that psycho Zhou Junwei, Fang Rui finally realized he had fallen for Forensic Pathologist Mu?","\"Boss, you guys managed to escape successfully this time, thanks to Lin Consultant and the Bureau Chief. You should really thank them properly.\"","Zhang waited for Fang Rui to ask why, but Fang Rui ignored his words and instead said to Mu Mian, \"Mu Mian, my heart is fine, you don't need to check it every ten minutes.\"","\"It's safer to check. Although you were wearing insulating shoes, what if some electric current still passed through your body?\" Mu Mian felt Fang Rui's heart area, and only withdrew her hand after confirming its beating frequency was normal.","Zhang couldn't help but try to make his presence known: \"Zhou Junwei couldn't possibly have electrocuted you guys. Lin Consultant asked the Bureau Chief for help, who in turn asked the power company for assistance, and they cut off electricity to the entire North City District for half an hour. So, Boss, you'll be fine, you weren't actually electrocuted at all.\"","Fang Rui had a sudden realization. He had wondered how these hundred-yuan insulating shoes could be of such good quality that they could protect him from such high voltage without any discomfort. It turned out there was no electricity at all.","Fang Rui suddenly remembered that when he regained consciousness, he noticed the equipment didn't have any red lights on. He had found it strange at the time, but now he realized they simply hadn't been activated.","Zhou Junwei's laptop and that button didn't need to be connected to a power source, and at the time, Zhou Junwei's attention was focused on Mu Mian and him, which is why he didn't notice the power was already cut.","It seems they owe Lin Sen a big thank you.","However, he had just seen Lin Sen and Shen Xiyin leave in the same car. If he wasn't mistaken, Lin Sen should be the one thanking them instead. If Mu Mian hadn't been kidnapped, their relationship would probably have remained stagnant forever—like throwing something into a still pond, causing a slight ripple, but ultimately returning to calmness.","\"Forensic Pathologist Mu, you almost got the Boss's corpse. How did that feel? More excited or more sad?\"","\"Officer Zhang, please be quiet, you're very noisy!\" Mu Mian complained, \"Don't mention the word 'corpse' in front of me anymore. Chen Xue says it's very unlucky.\"","\"Didn't Chen Xue tell you that a long, long time ago?\"","Goodness, is this still the same Forensic Pathologist Mu? Shouldn't she be excited at the mention of corpses? Could Zhou Junwei's electric shock experiment have altered her thinking? Did he somehow remove Mu Mian's love for corpses?","Fang Rui was also a bit surprised. He felt that Mu Mian finally cared a bit about him as a person, rather than just his potential corpse.","After returning to the bureau, Fang Rui and Sun Guangtian took statements from Zhou Junwei and Zhang Ming.","Although there was already evidence proving that Zhang Ming had committed murder and disposed of bodies, they weren't very clear on some details of the case. They also needed to determine who was the main culprit and who was the accomplice.","They interrogated Zhang Ming first.","\"I did everything. I liked Zhou Junwei, so I dragged him into this and forced him to help me.\" Zhang Ming voluntarily took all the blame upon himself.","\"You're saying you're the mastermind?\" Sun Guangtian asked.","\"Yes. I planned all the cases. I came up with the killing methods too. Zhou Junwei is gay, and he currently has a respectable job. His parents are both university professors and wouldn't allow their son to be gay, so I used this to manipulate him, make him have a relationship with me, and help me do things.\"","Zhang Ming began to confess his crimes voluntarily.","\"When I was in Linzhou, I met Zhou Junwei and fell in love with him. But he didn't like me, so I kept pestering him. Later, I discovered that it wasn't that Zhou Junwei didn't like me, he just didn't dare admit he was gay.","To prove the falsity of heterosexual love, I kidnapped the first couple. They worked in the factory area next to the zoo where I worked, and they were a particularly loving married couple. But I knew their love was just a facade. So I made them play that game, watching them reveal their ugly sides as they tried to avoid electric shocks, blaming and cursing each other. I successfully made Zhou Junwei despise heterosexuality.\"","Zhang Ming licked his dry lips and continued his confession, \"I kidnapped the second couple to prove the beauty of homosexual love. The second couple loved each other very much and had overcome societal obstacles to be together. I thought they would pass the game. Zhang Yawen loved Tian Xin so much that she never pressed the button, passively waiting for Tian Xin to make a choice. Tian Xin chose to shock Zhang Yawen all four times.\"","Zhang Ming showed a disdainful smile: \"A traitor like Tian Xin who betrayed her lover doesn't deserve to live. So I took out a sharp knife and stabbed her to death, one stab at a time. Each stab avoided vital areas; I wanted her to die slowly, to avenge the devoted Zhang Yawen.\"","\"Kidnapping the third couple was to prove to Zhou Junwei that love during student years is the most childish and laughable. Because Zhou Junwei's first love got married and invited him, Zhou Junwei was upset and started reminiscing about his youth.","I felt I needed to stop him from continuing to reminisce. I wanted to kill that immature feeling.","So I kidnapped a couple known for their public displays of affection at Jiangzhou University. They were the most ridiculous when playing this game, they seemed to truly treat it as a game, competing with each other for the chance to choose. In the end, they died by each other's choices. Zhou Junwei finally let go of his nostalgia for youth.\"","Zhang Ming continued to confess: \"As for how I disposed of the bodies, you should be quite clear about that already. Although my game revealed the hypocrisy and ridiculousness of their love, I still dressed them in couple outfits and placed roses symbolizing love in their hands, continuing to maintain the illusion of their love. I suppose this was my reward to them for playing my game.\"","Fang Rui asked, \"Was the game your idea too?\"","\"Of course it was. Why do you look so surprised? You think someone like me, who dropped out of high school, couldn't come up with such a sophisticated game?\" Zhang Ming's face showed a mocking smile, \"The internet is so advanced now, you can learn anything by yourself. You don't need to be so shocked.\"","Fang Rui caught his slip: \"Why did you use brain-computer interface equipment to collect the victims' brain wave data?\""]},{"number":89,"title":"Chapter 89: The Couple Butchers: Case Closed","paragraphs":["Zhang Ming was taken aback, then explained, \"I'm collecting love, all kinds of love. The brain is the source of all human emotions, so the brain will present the most authentic state of our emotions. Those brain wave data are their love.\"","\"Since you say the game was designed by you,\" Fang Rui placed a laptop in front of Zhang Ming, \"then write out the program for your game, the one where clicking a button randomly generates voltages. That should be simple, right?\"","Zhang Ming's face changed dramatically, and fine sweat began to form on his forehead. He tried hard to suppress the strong feeling of nausea. But when he put his hands on the keyboard, he suddenly vomited, ruining Zhang's newly acquired laptop.","Zhang looked crestfallen: \"Boss, my computer...\"","\"Look on the bright side, you'll soon get a new computer,\" Fang Rui consoled him.","\"...\" He wasn't really someone who always craved new things.","After Zhang Ming's nausea subsided, he quickly tried to cover up: \"I was previously treated for internet addiction at a Behavioral Correction School. Aversion therapy made me physiologically averse to computers, so I can't use them now. That's why I forced Zhou Junwei to design the program for me. He's studied this and is very professional.\"","Fang Rui and Sun Guangtian took another statement from Zhou Junwei.","\"Everything was done under Zhang Ming's coercion,\" Zhou Junwei accused. \"I'm gay, but I don't like Zhang Ming, yet he kept pestering me relentlessly. Later he threatened me, saying if I didn't help him, he'd reveal that I'm gay. This would not only cost me my job but also ruin my reputation. I had no choice but to help him.\"","\"But murder is a crime, far more serious than a ruined reputation, isn't it?\"","\"At first, he didn't intend to kill. Later, when he didn't get the results he wanted, he started killing. After killing one couple, he couldn't stop. Targeting Dr. Mu and Officer Fang was also Zhang Ming's idea. That day he came to the school to find me and happened to meet Dr. Mu, and he became interested in autism. Later, when he saw that Officer Fang and Dr. Mu were a couple, he became curious about what love is like for people with autism.\"","Zhang Ming took responsibility for all the crimes, while Zhou Junwei insisted that Zhang Ming had coerced him into committing the crimes and that he wasn't the main culprit.","Currently, there was sufficient evidence, and although the case could be closed without confessions, the distinction between principal and accessory offenders was always a complex issue. In this situation, the judge might not necessarily agree that Zhou Junwei was the principal offender.","Fang Rui held a brief meeting to report this situation to everyone and asked Lin Sen if there was any way to drive a wedge between them, make them turn on each other, and clarify who the real mastermind was.","Mu Mian pulled a small bone from her pocket: \"This is a voice recorder. I secretly recorded their conversation in the car.\"","After everyone listened, they were certain that Zhou Junwei was the principal offender. Zhou Junwei seemed to have an emotional disorder, unable to feel emotions. Zhang Ming, on the other hand, was his loyal follower, willing to do anything for Zhou Junwei.","\"It's a pity that the recording can't be used as evidence,\" Mu Mian sighed. \"I originally wanted to record video, but they would have seen me. I could only record audio.\"","Lin Sen looked at Mu Mian, his voice softer than usual: \"Dr. Mu, do you want to get revenge on Zhou Junwei?\"","\"Very much so, but murder is illegal. Keeping someone in a cage and electrocuting them is also illegal,\" Mu Mian sighed.","\"But attacking someone psychologically isn't illegal.\"","Mu Mian's eyes lit up: \"Consultant Lin, please elaborate.\"","Fang Rui looked at Lin Sen, thinking that in the future, he shouldn't casually tease him. Those who study psychology are not to be trifled with.","Zhou Junwei was once again brought to the interrogation room.","This time, Mu Mian and Lin Sen were interrogating him.","Seeing Mu Mian, Zhou Junwei's face darkened. He felt that Mu Mian and Fang Rui had acted together to fool him.","Mu Mian smiled slightly at him, then launched into a merciless critique of Zhou Junwei.","\"Mr. Zhou, your game lacks any creativity. The electric shock test part plagiarizes the experimental logic of Milgram's experiment. Although you made your own innovations, I'm sorry to say that the part you innovated destroyed the essence of the experimental logic.","The EEG part is even worse. You even put the electrode cap on me crooked. I even doubt if you understand what EEG equipment is for. You certainly can't interpret EEG data.\"","Zhou Junwei looked at Mu Mian angrily and shouted, \"Shut up! I won't allow you to insult this game.\"","\"See, you only dare to call it a game. Because you know yourself that your design has no scientific basis, no logic. If you want to study love, you need to first define love, then propose your experimental hypothesis, choose the variables you want to study, control for irrelevant variables...\"","\"Get her out of here! Get her out!\" Zhou Junwei became extremely agitated. \"I won't allow you to insult my design.\"","\"Hmph, I haven't even started insulting you yet, I'm just telling the truth.\"","Lin Sen looked at Mu Mian, a bit helpless. Mu Mian's words had no aggression, just pure sincerity. But this was precisely what broke Zhou Junwei's defenses, probably because what Mu Mian said was true.","\"Mr. Zhou, why are you so agitated? Are you the designer of this game?\" Lin Sen asked.","Zhou Junwei knew they were using reverse psychology to provoke him and gradually regained his composure.","\"Zhang Ming's things are mine. Can't I defend him?\"","Lin Sen looked at Zhou Junwei, \"Mr. Zhou, do you think this case will go down in history?\"","\"Of course it will. Such a creative method and motive for murder will definitely make it into criminology textbooks.\" Zhou Junwei was very satisfied with the case he had committed.","\"Yes. But the protagonist of this case will become Zhang Ming. The perverted one people will curse will be him, and the one called a crime artist will also be him. And you, I estimate, will only be recorded as Zhang Ming's accomplice. Are you content with that?\"","Zhou Junwei's face changed dramatically. He wouldn't allow his most proud design to become Zhang Ming's, even if it would reduce his crime.","Lin Sen said, \"All of this is clearly your achievement, why give the chance for fame to Zhang Ming?\"","\"I want to see Officer Fang. I confess.\" Zhou Junwei didn't want to see Lin Sen anymore. Although he knew Lin Sen was deliberately provoking him, he couldn't help but fall for it.","Facing Fang Rui and Sun Guangtian again, Zhou Junwei confessed the truth.","\"I am the mastermind behind this series of cases. Zhang Ming was just my assistant,\" Zhou Junwei stated. \"I wanted to know what love is, so I captured those people and made them play my game. Their results were very unsatisfactory to me, so I had Zhang Ming kill them.\"","Zhou Junwei said, \"I can't feel emotions, so I needed to observe their love through their EEG data. I didn't intend to kill at first, but they didn't take my game seriously. Later, I started to incorporate the electric shock element, which could both create a dangerous situation to amplify their love and punish those who didn't respect love.\"","Zhou Junwei described the process of the crime, which was similar to Zhang Ming's description. Only the motive for the crime was different.","With this, the case finally came to a close, and Zhou Junwei and Zhang Ming would soon face legal punishment."]},{"number":90,"title":"Chapter 90: Couple Butchers: Deprived Emotions (Side Story)","paragraphs":["Zhang Ming had once wondered if he would have become a normal person, living a normal life, if he hadn't met Zhou Junwei. But he realized there was no such possibility. It was precisely because he was abnormal that he met Zhou Junwei in that hellish Behavior Correction Room.","After Zhang Ming chased his father with a knife for several blocks, he was labeled with many tags: \"internet-addicted youth\", \"antisocial personality\", \"unfilial son\", \"social outcast\". Then he was sent to that Behavioral Correction School.","That's where he met Zhou Junwei.","Zhou Junwei was so different from the others. While everyone else was sent there to overcome internet addiction, gambling addiction, or violent behavior - having harmed their families and society to some degree - Zhou Junwei was the only one sent there to correct his sexual orientation. He seemed completely harmless.","In that era, people had a very low acceptance of homosexuality. So Zhou Junwei was isolated. Everyone was afraid of being liked by Zhou Junwei and becoming another homosexual.","Zhou Junwei was a very unlikable person, even the therapists didn't like him. Because the treatment on him yielded no results - no matter how much they electrocuted Zhou Junwei, there was no correction effect.","Zhang Ming was puzzled. If Zhou Junwei just said he wouldn't like men anymore, or showed disgust at those male photos, those people would stop electrocuting him. But Zhou Junwei refused to give in.","One day, Zhang Ming was assigned to clean the treatment room. He saw Zhou Junwei on the floor, his lips pale, his muscles still trembling even though the electrocution had stopped long ago. He was in great pain.","Zhang Ming couldn't help but ask, \"Zhou Junwei, why don't you pretend you've been cured?\"","\"Because my brain is free. I'm free to love anyone, anything,\" Zhou Junwei gave a weak smile, \"No one can deprive me of my right to love. I can't surrender to them.\"","Zhang Ming found Zhou Junwei interesting. He looked so thin and small, yet his willpower was so strong.","\"This isn't surrendering, it's strategy. We pretend to be cured, so we can get out. We'll be labeled as 'normal people',\" Zhang Ming reminded him.","\"And then what after we get out? Do we keep pretending? For how long? If we keep pretending forever, doesn't that mean we've actually been cured by them? Are we still ourselves then?\"","Zhang Ming was stunned by the series of questions. He wasn't that smart and never thought about such complex issues.","\"Zhou Junwei, I don't know either. Sometimes I wonder if I'm just pretending, or if I've really been cured,\" Zhang Ming suddenly realized he hadn't touched a computer for many days. He felt sick just looking at computers.","Zhou Junwei recognized Zhang Ming. He was a notorious problem student in the school, rumored to have chased his father with a knife all over the street for money to go online. Zhou Junwei was a bit scared of him.","\"Zhou Junwei, you dissected a rabbit in the classroom, you must be very brave. Why are you afraid of me?\"","\"I didn't dissect that rabbit. It was Chen Yuan'an who did it. He was curious if a rabbit's internal organs looked the same as in the biology textbook. I didn't want him to be seen as a psychopath, so I took the blame. I love small animals, I wouldn't hurt them. Actually, I'd like to work in a zoo. I think the animal world would be simpler. But my dad wouldn't agree. He wants me to become a doctor.\"","\"Eh, rumors are terrifying. You must have heard rumors about me too. But they're also false. I chased my dad with a knife because I saw him bringing a woman home, having an affair in our house. I was furious, so I chased him with a knife. Sometimes I really wanted to kill him.","Later, my dad felt the truth would make him lose face, so he spread the rumor that I was chasing him for internet cafe money. I tried hard to clarify, but no one believed me, including my mom. They all thought I was a loser addicted to online games. Funny, isn't it?\"","Zhang Ming continued, \"My internet addiction is also fake. I didn't go to internet cafes to play games, I went to learn computer skills. I want to become a hacker when I grow up. But I can't get into college, so I can only learn by myself in internet cafes. I want to live in the virtual world in the future. The real world is too complicated and boring.\"","Zhou Junwei looked at Zhang Ming with surprise. He suddenly felt they were of the same kind. Because of their introverted personalities, everyone assumed the worst about them. When in fact, they had done nothing wrong.","\"Zhou Junwei, be my friend. I don't seem to have any friends.\"","\"Okay. Zhang Ming, you're my friend from now on. You're my only friend.\"","Zhang Ming was quite comfortable in this correction school. He didn't have internet addiction to begin with, and he was good at pretending. Whenever those psychologists treated him, he would vomit or show pain, so they would quickly end the treatment.","They were very satisfied with Zhang Ming's treatment results.","Zhou Junwei wasn't so lucky. The therapists had tried almost every method, but they still couldn't change Zhou Junwei's cognition. Zhou Junwei would still be interested in male photos, and he would still say he liked men.","Zhou Junwei didn't want to pretend he was cured. He wasn't sick, he didn't need to be cured.","\"Looks like we need to bring out our trump card,\" Zhang Ming overheard those therapists say viciously, \"No behavior is beyond correction once they enter our place.\"","Zhang Ming made a plan to escape from the correction school. He even drew a map and stole the principal's gold watch and all the cash in the drawer from the office. He planned to escape with Zhou Junwei that night.","But he was one step too late.","That night, Zhou Junwei was taken away. Zhang Ming didn't know what those people did to Zhou Junwei, and Zhou Junwei wouldn't say. Zhou Junwei had a new scar on his forehead, and from that day on, Zhou Junwei changed. He no longer liked men, but he didn't like women either. He wouldn't like anyone or anything.","Zhou Junwei was finally cured, but he seemed to have lost his emotions.","He remembered everything, remembered Zhang Ming was his friend, remembered his parents, even remembered he once loved Chen Yuan'an, but he didn't know what love felt like. He couldn't experience emotions, he couldn't even recall emotions.","Later, Zhang Ming recovered and left the correction school. His parents didn't want to take care of him, so he went to do odd jobs, living day by day. But he never touched computers again, and forgot about his dream of becoming a hacker.","After drifting for a few years, he went to work at a zoo. He remembered Zhou Junwei liked animals, but now Zhou Junwei couldn't like anything anymore. Zhang Ming felt he could like animals on Zhou Junwei's behalf.","Shortly after Zhang Ming left, Zhou Junwei also recovered. His parents were relieved that their son had finally become normal, and much more likable than before. Zhou Junwei could face anything calmly and would say things that adults liked to hear. He had finally learned to pretend, as Zhang Ming had said.","He studied in a new school, got good grades, and was admitted to a decent university. At first, he followed his father's arrangement and chose clinical medicine as his major, but he would vomit uncontrollably at the sight of bloody scenes and couldn't complete the anatomy course.","So he chose to change his major. He didn't know what major he should study because he didn't like anything. But he thought of Zhang Ming, his only friend. He remembered Zhang Ming wanted to be a hacker, but Zhang Ming didn't like to touch computers anymore. Zhou Junwei thought, well, let's study computer science then.","Zhou Junwei couldn't like anything, but he still remembered he once liked animals. One day he went to the zoo to see animals, recalling the feelings he had for animals in his memory, and then he met Zhang Ming again.","Zhang Ming had changed a lot. He had become an animal trainer at the zoo, got along well with his colleagues, and looked nothing like the gloomy teenager he once was. Zhou Junwei thought it was good that Zhang Ming had become a normal person in everyone's eyes.","Zhang Ming was very happy to see him. Even though Zhang Ming now had many friends, he still cared about Zhou Junwei the most.","After reconnecting, Zhang Ming frequently sought him out. They would do many things together.","Later, Zhang Ming told him that he had fallen in love with him.","Zhou Junwei was perplexed; he didn't know what love felt like. He used to not care about whether he could feel emotions, but now he suddenly wanted to know what it felt like.","He began watching a lot of romantic movies, reading love stories, and would go out to the streets to observe couples on dates. He even started spying on couples during intimate moments. He desperately wanted to understand what love was.","But the more he observed, the more confused he became. He still couldn't grasp what love looked like - people's expressions, body language, accelerated heartbeats... all these things related to love were unstable.","Later, he finally found an answer. The human brain is the source of all emotions, so if he wanted to see what love looked like, he could only do so by observing people's brains.","So he designed a game. He set up dangerous situations to induce and amplify couples' love, then observed what changes occurred in their brains.","At first, he recruited a large number of couples to participate in this game under the guise of a sociological experiment. He collected a lot of brain wave data from the couples. However, during the game, those couples were not serious at all. They didn't respect his game and instead engaged in various mockeries and jokes.","He decided he needed to enhance the immersive experience of this game.","He chose...","They loved each other so much, but during the game, in order to fight for the chance to survive, they attacked each other, venting years of resentment towards their partners. This wasn't the result he wanted, so he directly used the highest level of voltage he had set up to electrocute them to death.","Later, Zhou Junwei became curious about what same-sex love would look like.","Zhou Junwei originally wanted to find a gay male couple. But after observing for a long time, he found that most gay men didn't have fixed partners, and they seemed to care more about physical needs than emotional ones.","Later, on his way to the zoo, Zhou Junwei encountered a lesbian couple. They looked very much in love. But that was only how it appeared.","Zhang Yawen was willing to sacrifice herself for her partner, giving her the choice; Tian Xin, however, chose to electrocute her partner to death in order to seize the chance to survive.","It turned out that love could also be one-sided.","Just like how Zhang Ming felt about him.","Zhou Junwei stabbed Tian Xin to death with a knife. After killing them, Zhou Junwei stopped his frenzied actions. He felt that the love he had seen wasn't beautiful, and he didn't want to see any more. Perhaps, not being able to feel love wasn't such a regrettable thing after all.","Later, Chen Yuan'an was getting married. He apologized to Zhou Junwei, saying he had hurt him when they were younger and hoped he could forgive him.","Zhou Junwei remembered that he had once liked Chen Yuan'an.","He wanted to play that game again.","Zhang Ming loved him very much and was willing to do anything for him.","This time, their luck was very bad. The bodies were buried too shallow, and with the heavy rain washing over them, the police quickly discovered the corpses.","Zhou Junwei wasn't actually afraid of being caught by the police. When he saw Mu Mian at school again, he felt that he wanted to play that game one more time.","He had seen Mu Mian at school before; she was Teacher Shen's sister, an autistic person. He knew she was also someone with a deficient brain, and he thought she would be like him, unable to feel any emotions.","When he saw Mu Mian again, he realized he was wrong. She came to the school with Police Officer Fang. Their interactions reminded him of the love movies he had watched.","So even autistic people could have love.","He really wanted to see what Mu Mian's love would look like.","When he saw that Police Officer Fang was willing to exchange his own death for Mu Mian's life, he felt a bit envious of Mu Mian. Why could she have love?","At this moment, he heard Zhang Ming say to him: \"Zhou Junwei, I would also die for you without hesitation.\"","Zhou Junwei remembered that he seemed to have love too, but he just couldn't feel it. If he could like anything, he thought, he would love Zhang Ming.","But he could never love anyone.","So, Zhang Ming was just a tool he used to kill people.","On the day he was sent to prison, Zhang Ming saw Zhou Junwei for the last time.","If he could, Zhang Ming would want to go back to the day before Zhou Junwei was taken away. He would take Zhou Junwei and escape from that Behavioral Correction School, go anywhere they wanted. Zhou Junwei could like anyone or anything.","At that time, Zhou Junwei would have liked Zhang Ming, and they would have walked hand in hand on the streets."]},{"number":91,"title":"Chapter 91: I Want to Become Strong","paragraphs":["After Fang Rui realized he liked Mu Mian, he decided to confess directly. He didn't want to play games with hints and ambiguity, because Mu Mian might not pick up on his signals at all.","The next day, Fang Rui waited outside Mu Mian's door as usual to go to work together.","Mu Mian opened the door, carrying a huge luggage bag, stumbling as she walked out. She nearly fell over.","Fang Rui steadied her. \"Mu Mian, I like you,\" he said, his voice a bit nervous.","\"Fang Rui, thank you for liking me. I like you too. I'm so tired right now. If you could help me get this bag into the car, I'd like you even more.\" Mu Mian put the bag on the ground and took a few deep breaths to recover. The bag was so heavy!","Fang Rui felt a bit helpless. His first confession had failed so miserably; Mu Mian might not have even realized he was confessing.","\"Why are you bringing so much stuff? Mu Mian, you're going to work, not on vacation.\" Fang Rui picked up the bag. It was quite heavy, and from the bulging shape, it seemed to contain a variety of items.","\"Self-defense tools. Better safe than sorry.\"","Self-defense tools? Fang Rui paused. He opened the bag to find various restricted items: a stun gun, hammer, machete, chainsaw, electric drill, anti-wolf spray, several bottles of unknown substances...","Seeing Fang Rui open her emergency kit, Mu Mian looked a bit embarrassed. She had originally thought Fang Rui could protect her, but she realized that as a bodyguard, he had significant limitations. So she had to rely on herself.","Fang Rui read the disdain in Mu Mian's expression and quickly clarified, \"Mu Mian, that time was an accident. They ambushed me. Otherwise, even if there were ten of them, I could have taken them on.\"","\"Fang Rui, I believe you would protect me, and I know you're great at fighting. But sorry, I'm afraid there might be more... accidents in the future,\" Mu Mian tried to phrase it delicately. \"Fighting isn't just about brute force; sometimes you need to use your brain too.\"","\"Mu Mian, you think I don't have a brain?\"","\"No, I'm just worried the bad guys are too cunning,\" Mu Mian consoled Fang Rui. \"Chen Xue says nowadays criminals are very clever. Their brains work exceptionally well when it comes to committing crimes, making them hard to guard against.\"","Fang Rui was irritated by her lack of trust. He reached out and messed up Mu Mian's hair.","\"Fang Rui, I want to be able to protect you too.\"","Fang Rui was stunned. Had he become so important to Mu Mian that she wanted to protect him?","\"Protect my sister, Chen Xue, Zhang...\" Mu Mian looked at him earnestly with her disheveled hair. \"I don't want to helplessly watch bad guys take you away and not be able to do anything. That feeling is awful.\"","Fang Rui smiled wryly. He was important enough to be listed alongside Zhang. But he quickly let it go, because he was also listed alongside Shen Xiyin, and even came before her.","Mu Mian clenched her fists and said passionately, \"Fang Rui, I want to become strong!\"","\"That's a good idea. How about I teach you some self-defense techniques?\"","\"No.\" Mu Mian instantly deflated like a punctured balloon. \"Fang Rui, I'm not physically coordinated. I can't learn those things. You'll laugh at me if I can't learn. Besides, learning self-defense is so tiring. I don't want to learn; I just want to take shortcuts. Can I use physical power-ups to get stronger?\"","Fang Rui was speechless. Mu Mian had the desire to get stronger but lacked the motivation to act on it. However, given Mu Mian's small frame, not resisting would probably be safer than resisting if she encountered criminals.","\"But you can't have so many power-ups,\" Fang Rui pointed at the bag full of dangerous tools. \"You have decision paralysis. Criminals won't give you time to choose a suitable weapon.\"","In the end, Mu Mian only brought one self-defense item - the anti-wolf spray. Her reasoning was sound: it was small, cute, easy to carry, discreet, and required no physical effort to use.","After the couple murder case was closed, it was time for the special task force to return home.","The Director held a farewell party for them.","The party was held in a small auditorium with a few tables set up, offering barbecue, snacks, and milk tea. It was simple, but thanks to the social butterflies Zhang and Wang, the atmosphere was exceptionally lively.","The Director had intended to say a few words, but he was interrupted by Sun Guangtian after just two sentences.","\"Old Wang, stop speaking so pompously and wasting time. Just get to the point.\"","Zhang and the others were stunned. Captain Sun... dared to interrupt the Director? The Director hated being interrupted the most. It turned out that when Sun Guangtian first arrived, he wasn't targeting them specifically; he just liked to challenge people.","Surprisingly, the Director didn't seem upset. After all, he had gotten used to Sun Guangtian's provocations during their college years. The Director simply announced the start of the farewell party.","Everyone ate, drank, and the atmosphere was very harmonious.","Forensic Doctor Cheng handed Mu Mian a simple, elegant notebook. \"Little Forensic Doctor Mu, I didn't have much to do these past few days, so I wrote down my years of experience in this notebook. I'm giving it to you now, hoping it will be helpful.\"","\"Thank you for the gift. I love it. I promise I'll read it carefully.\" Mu Mian was delighted to receive the gift.","She really liked Forensic Doctor Cheng because he reminded her of her father. Her father had also patiently taught her knowledge, even when she didn't need such detailed instruction. She could understand most things after reading them once, but she still liked hearing her father explain them again. Occasionally, when it came to topics her father excelled in, she would pretend not to understand, so her father would first frown, then happily explain it to her again.","Mu Mian hadn't thought about her father for a long time, but Forensic Doctor Cheng's presence awakened that part of her memory.","\"Little Forensic Doctor Mu, you're an excellent forensic doctor. I have high hopes for your career development.\"","\"Thank you for the compliment. I'll become even better.\"","Forensic Doctor Cheng glanced at Fang Rui, who was talking to Sun Guangtian not far away, and whispered to Mu Mian, \"Captain Fang is very outstanding. If you like him, you should act quickly. A young lady from our task force has taken a liking to him and even asked your Director to help introduce them.\"","Mu Mian didn't quite understand his meaning. She agreed that Fang Rui was outstanding, and she liked him very much, but she didn't understand why she needed to chase after Fang Rui - he wasn't going to run away. And why did it matter to her if someone else liked Fang Rui? Why tell her this? Did they want her to help persuade Fang Rui to go on a blind date?","Mu Mian's expression turned serious. \"I'm sorry, I can't help. Fang Rui doesn't like blind dates. I can't force him.\"","\"Little Forensic Doctor Mu, let me have that notebook back for a moment. I just remembered I left out some things.\" Forensic Doctor Cheng realized he had written too little about social skills and relationships. He should expand the section on dating experience.","Sun Guangtian stood by the window smoking, out of place in the lively, harmonious atmosphere.","\"Captain Sun, you should smoke less. It's bad for your health,\" Fang Rui reminded him.","\"I know, but I'm too old to quit now,\" Sun Guangtian extinguished his cigarette. \"Don't learn from me, kid.\"","Looking at Fang Rui, Sun Guangtian was reminded of his younger self - motivated and full of a sense of justice.","\"Old Wang kept praising you to me before. I thought he was exaggerating. Your investigative skills are indeed quite good.\" Sun Guangtian patted Fang Rui's shoulder. \"Apologize to your girlfriend for me. I didn't mean to be harsh to her that day.\"","\"Mm.\"","Sun Guangtian was a bit surprised. \"So Forensic Doctor Mu really is your girlfriend? I thought they were just spreading rumors.\"","Fang Rui smiled at him. \"Not yet. But I think she will be soon.\""]},{"number":92,"title":"Chapter 92: Lost Her: Blood Curse","paragraphs":["Perhaps due to the approaching New Year, the crime rate had recently plummeted, and the Special Crime Unit hadn't received a case in over half a month.","On this day, the bureau chief called Fang Rui and Captain Li from the neighboring Criminal Investigation Unit Two into his office, assigning them a special task with a grave tone.","The chief's expression was very serious: \"I have a case for you two to investigate, but the investigation must be kept completely confidential from outsiders, understand? Not even our internal staff can know about it.\"","Captain Li frowned and asked, \"Chief, has something happened to some big shot?\"","Fang Rui thought this was unlikely, because if a VIP was involved, they would surely set up a special task force for the investigation. The fact that the chief hadn't asked Mu Mian to investigate with him proved there was no deceased victim. Seeing the chief still beating around the bush without getting to the point, it probably wasn't an urgent case either.","\"Do you know Su Momo?\" the chief asked.","Captain Li replied, \"No... Is she some female leader?\"","Fang Rui thought for a moment, there shouldn't be any such big shot in Jiangzhou City.","\"She's not a leader, she's our city's big money-maker,\" the chief said, slapping a newspaper down in front of Fang Rui and Captain Li.","The newspaper headline read: Su Momo Boosts Jiangzhou City's Tourism Revenue by 1.7 Billion in Half a Month.","Fang Rui thought she must be some female entrepreneur. Only after carefully reading the news did he realize that Su Momo was a famous actress who had starred in many hit dramas. She had recently filmed a popular idol drama called \"Secrets of the Deep Sea,\" which was a massive hit. The drama's real locations were shot in Jiangzhou City, consequently causing the city's tourism industry to explode, raking in countless profits.","\"Our city is about to host a large-scale tourism festival, and the tourism bureau has invited Su Momo to shoot a promotional video. However, during the filming process, a cursed doll was suddenly discovered in her hotel room. Your task is to find out who placed that cursed doll there. Before finding that person, you also need to ensure her safety.\"","Su Momo was staying at the Jiangzhou International Hotel. This was the largest five-star hotel in Jiangzhou City, with excellent security measures and strong privacy, making it a favorite among many celebrities.","She originally stayed in suite 808 on the eighth floor, but after discovering the terrifying cursed doll, she was frightened and moved to suite 606.","The hotel manager first took Fang Rui and Captain Li to the eighth floor, explaining the situation: \"Last night around 10 PM, Miss Su returned from work and was about to go to bed. When she lifted the blanket, she saw that horrifying doll, and the blanket was covered in blood.\"","Seeing the room number, Captain Li couldn't help but comment, \"Su Momo seems very superstitious about numerology, look at this room number, how auspicious.\"","\"Miss Su is actually very nice, she never acts like a diva and doesn't have many demands for her living conditions. It's her assistant who's troublesome, always having a bunch of requirements when booking hotels, insisting that room numbers must include 8 or 6, and can't have 1, 4, or 7. What right does a mere assistant have to act so high and mighty? Once, she even gave Miss Su attitude. Well, it's only because Miss Su is so kind that she wasn't fired...\"","The hotel suite was very spacious, with three rooms and a kitchen. Su Momo stayed in the room with windows facing south. Her room had a large floor-to-ceiling window, and standing by it, one could see the blue ocean.","\"After discovering the cursed doll, we immediately sealed off this room to preserve the scene as much as possible.\"","Fang Rui saw that the middle of the bed sheet had been dyed dark red with blood, and a blood-stained cotton doll lay on it.","The doll was about the size of a palm, not looking particularly scary. It had delicate features and smooth hair, wearing pretty clothes. At first glance, the doll looked very much like Su Momo.","It was covered in needle holes, with a red thread sewn into a scar on its hand. It looked exactly like a scar left after a wrist-cutting suicide attempt. On its chest, the name \"Su Momo\" was embroidered crookedly.","The doll seemed to have been soaked in blood, becoming stiff after drying, with a strong stench. However, the blood didn't look like human blood, appearing darker in color.","Fang Rui put on gloves and felt the doll. Besides the clumped cotton inside, there seemed to be something else. He put the doll in an evidence bag, planning to ask Mu Mian to help examine whether the blood on it was human.","Fang Rui also checked the doors and windows but found no signs of forced entry.","The room was carpeted with white plush, and no suspicious footprints were found on it.","Fang Rui and Captain Li then went to the sixth floor to take Su Momo's statement.","The door was opened by a very beautiful girl. Seeing her wearing the latest designer coat worth over a hundred thousand yuan, Captain Li almost thought she was Su Momo. But her face didn't quite match.","Seeing Fang Rui and his colleague, she frowned slightly, looking at them warily, \"Who are you?\"","Fang Rui and Captain Li showed their badges and explained why they were there.","Her expression remained impatient, \"You can tell me whatever it is. Momo isn't available to see visitors.\"","\"Yaying, I called them here,\" Su Momo said from inside. \"Please let them in.\"","Fang Rui and Captain Li entered the room to see Su Momo half-lying on the sofa. She was wearing thick, fluffy pajamas, no makeup, with her hair casually tied up. Her looks could only be described as pretty in a girl-next-door way, not stunning, and not even as beautiful as the girl who had opened the door.","She was watching TV with her legs crossed, holding a large bag of chips, not looking at all like someone who had just experienced a fright.","\"Hello, officers. I'm Su Momo,\" she said, pointing to the beautiful girl. \"This is my assistant, Liu Yaying.\"","Captain Li thought that if their identities were swapped, it would look more reasonable. Obviously, Liu Yaying's attire and appearance were more like a celebrity's, while Su Momo looked more like a small-time assistant.","\"Officers, please, you must help me catch the person who cursed me!\" Su Momo excitedly threw the chip bag onto the coffee table, rubbing her fingers to get rid of the chip crumbs stuck to them.","\"Of all the curses they could choose, they cursed me to commit suicide by cutting my wrists. Me, Su Momo, with my money and career, how could I possibly commit suicide! So you must help me find that person. I want to ask the one who cursed me, why be so vicious!\"","Fang Rui asked, \"When you were staying in 808, besides the hotel staff, who else had a keycard to your room?\"","\"Myself, Yaying, and my life assistant Qi Fang, the three of us all had keycards,\" Su Momo said, then added after thinking, \"They're both my own people, they couldn't possibly do such a thing. I suspect that one of the hotel staff is my anti-fan, and they took advantage of their work to sneak into my room and deliberately place this doll to upset me.\"","\"Did you stay in that room the night before last?\"","Su Momo nodded, \"Yes, I stayed in that room the night before last, but I didn't notice anything unusual.\"","There was a surveillance camera in the hallway outside room 808, facing directly at the room door. Fang Rui retrieved the surveillance video from the day of the incident.","That morning around 7:30, Su Momo, assistant Liu Yaying, and life assistant Qi Fang all left the hotel suite together. At 10:43 PM, Su Momo and Qi Fang returned to the hotel. Shortly after, Qi Fang ran out of the suite screaming, then the hotel manager appeared in the surveillance footage.","Due to Su Momo's special status, her room was not cleaned by hotel staff, but by her life assistant Qi Fang.","In other words, that day, apart from the three of them, no outsiders had entered the room."]},{"number":93,"title":"Chapter 93: She Disappeared: Best Friend or Frenemy","paragraphs":["Fang Rui returned to the police station with the cursed doll and the hotel corridor surveillance footage. Meanwhile, Captain Li stayed at the hotel to protect Su Momo's safety.","Fang Rui first went to Mu Mian's office to find her.","Mu Mian was studying the forensic manual given to her by Forensic Doctor Cheng. Mu Mian found the technical parts easy to understand, but she struggled with the sections on interpersonal relationships. She still couldn't comprehend complex human interactions.","\"Fang Rui, where did you go today? I haven't seen you all day. Did you secretly go investigate a case?\" Mu Mian leaned in and sniffed around Fang Rui, \"It's the smell of blood, some kind of animal blood, not very fresh.\"","\"You have quite the keen nose.\" Fang Rui handed the evidence bag containing the cursed doll to Mu Mian, \"I also don't think it's human blood. Mu Mian, can you help examine what kind of blood is on this doll?\"","\"Fang Rui, you really did go investigate a case. Was there no victim? Why didn't you take me along?\" Mu Mian was a bit displeased.","\"It's a small case. But the chief said it needs to be kept confidential.\"","\"Alright then.\"","Mu Mian put on gloves and carefully examined the blood stains on the cursed doll. She used an anti-human hemoglobin colloidal test paper, which came back negative, confirming that the blood on the doll was indeed not human.","\"This is some kind of animal blood. Based on its smell, color, and consistency, we can rule out pig blood, duck blood, sheep blood, and chicken blood, but to determine exactly what kind of blood it is, we'll need to analyze its components. I suspect it might be dog blood.\"","Mu Mian squeezed the doll, feeling that the cotton inside had clumped together, becoming hard. She also felt something strange inside, long and slightly elastic when squeezed.","Curious about what was inside, Mu Mian turned to Fang Rui and asked, \"Can I open up this doll to examine it? I feel there's something unusual inside.\"","\"Go ahead, I was planning to open it up and see what's inside anyway.\"","Mu Mian carefully cut open the doll along its seams and removed the clumped cotton inside. There was a yellowish-brown, elongated piece of flesh, wrinkled, about 10cm long and three fingers wide.","Mu Mian picked it up with tweezers for closer inspection, \"This looks like a fetus, judging by its size, it's probably about three months old.\"","\"Are you sure it's a human fetus?\" Fang Rui thought of Chen Hui's case, wondering if there could be a connection between the two cases.","\"Yes, and it's been dried.\"","Mu Mian also found a yellow paper ball wedged in the cotton, soaked in blood and crumpled. Strange characters were outlined in gold on the paper.","\"These characters are very odd, I've never seen them before. They don't seem to follow any pattern, so they're probably not a code. They might be some kind of mystical symbols, possibly related to religion.\" Mu Mian felt these weren't letters, but more like some kind of symbols.","Mu Mian wasn't interested in mystical things and rarely read about such topics, so she couldn't identify what the symbols were.","Fang Rui guessed, \"This must be a talisman with spells written on it.\"","The combination of a talisman and a dried fetus strongly resembled some kind of black magic. Fang Rui suspected that whoever made this cursed doll wasn't just trying to scare Su Momo, but actually believed the curse could work.","So the question was, why would the perpetrator want to curse Su Momo to commit suicide by slitting her wrists?","Fang Rui thought of Su Momo's assistant, who seemed very superstitious. Could she be involved in this?","Fang Rui watched all the video footage of Su Momo since she checked into the hotel. Su Momo was often out early and back late, rarely staying in the hotel during the day. Her life assistant, Qi Fang, was always by her side, while Liu Yaying's schedule was more flexible, allowing her to move about freely most of the time.","Fang Rui noticed some suspicious points. Su Momo and her assistant Liu Yaying had a strange relationship. When they talked, they seemed to get along very well. But whenever Su Momo turned her back, Liu Yaying's expression would instantly change, glaring at Su Momo with intense hatred.","Liu Yaying seemed to despise Su Momo.","Yet Su Momo treated Liu Yaying extremely well, even giving her expensive gifts from brand sponsors, nearly offending the sponsors in the process.","On the first day Su Momo checked in, she was carrying a spotted dog. The dog could be seen walking in the corridor on the second and third days. But after the fourth day, the dog was never seen again in the surveillance footage.","Fang Rui focused his investigation on the relationship between Su Momo and Liu Yaying.","They were both students in the acting department at Film University, in the same year but different classes. They had been close friends since their freshman year.","During their university years, Liu Yaying far surpassed Su Momo in both looks and acting ability. In every performance showcase, Liu Yaying always played the lead role, while Su Momo could only get minor roles with few lines.","In their senior year, Liu Yaying started dating a rich second-generation heir and lost interest in acting, turning down many roles. She passed on a TV drama script she didn't think much of to Su Momo, and recommended Su Momo to the director for the unpopular lead role.","Unexpectedly, the low-budget TV drama became a hit, and Su Momo rose from being an extra to instant stardom.","Liu Yaying's fortunes, however, took a sharp downturn. Her wealthy boyfriend quickly tired of her and abandoned her while she was pregnant. She also offended industry insiders by breaking contracts and was essentially blacklisted. These consecutive blows left Liu Yaying physically and mentally exhausted, nearly driving her to attempt suicide by slitting her wrists.","Later, Su Momo, grateful for Liu Yaying's help in the past, hired the destitute Liu Yaying as her assistant and provided her with various forms of financial support. This gradually helped Liu Yaying emerge from the shadows of her past and regain her spirit.","Fang Rui found Liu Yaying very suspicious. She had a strong motive for the crime.","Fang Rui reviewed all surveillance footage featuring Liu Yaying. He noticed that the day before the cursed doll appeared, Liu Yaying was carrying an LV bag that was bulging oddly, as if concealing some living creature.","Fang Rui went back to Jiangzhou International Hotel. He first questioned Su Momo: \"Miss Su, do you know where your spotted dog is?\"","\"You mean Bugu? Its hind legs were injured, so it was sent to the pet hospital for surgery.\" Mentioning her beloved dog, Su Momo's expression turned sad, \"It ran out and got cut by some glass, so I had Yaying take it to the hospital.\"","\"Can we inquire about your dog's condition at the hospital?\"","\"You'll have to ask Yaying about that. She's the one who contacted the pet hospital, only she has their information.\"","Fang Rui and Captain Li found Liu Yaying for questioning.","\"Miss Liu, how would you describe your relationship with Su Momo?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"Momo and I are best friends. We've known each other since freshman year and are very close.\"","\"Are you sure your relationship is that good?\"","Fang Rui produced a stack of photos showing Liu Yaying rolling her eyes at Su Momo, glaring at her fiercely, and even making a choking gesture behind her back...","The numerous photos all pointed to one conclusion: Liu Yaying harbored intense hatred towards Su Momo."]},{"number":94,"title":"Chapter 94: The Vanished: Do You Want an Autograph","paragraphs":["\"No, that's not it. The expression on my face wasn't because I hated Momo, but because I was angry. I didn't want her to follow in my...\" Liu Yaying thought of something and swallowed the words she was about to say.","\"Miss Liu, where is the spotted dog?\" Fang Rui asked.","\"It's receiving treatment at the pet hospital.\"","\"Could you please contact the doctor? We have some questions for him.\"","Liu Yaying stammered, \"Well... the vet is very busy. I'll contact him after he gets off work.\"","Captain Li saw through her lie and exposed her, \"You've already killed that dog, haven't you? You used its blood to soak that cursed doll. The dog isn't at the pet hospital at all, so you can't make that call.\"","\"No, Bugu isn't dead. I gave it away. That person left Jiangzhou City, and I can't contact her anymore.\"","Fang Rui asked, \"You made that cursed doll, didn't you?\"","Liu Yaying immediately shook her head in denial, \"That's not a cursed doll, it's... I didn't put it on Momo's bed. I don't know how it ended up there.\"","\"There was a dried fetus corpse inside that doll,\" Fang Rui looked at Liu Yaying, deciding to bluff her, \"Is that fetus from your abortion?\"","\"No, it's not,\" Liu Yaying's face instantly turned pale, \"That doll has nothing to do with me.\"","She was obviously lying.","Fang Rui said, \"Then please cooperate with us for a DNA test. If that fetal corpse matches your DNA, then you can't deny your connection to this cursed doll.\"","\"I didn't make it, I really didn't put it on Momo's bed.\"","Fang Rui caught the loophole in her words, \"Are you admitting that you made this doll?\"","\"I admit it, I had a master make it for me, but it's not a cursed doll, it's... it's for holding my child's soul. I don't know why it appeared in Momo's room.\"","\"If it's for holding your child's soul, why was the doll made to look like Su Momo?\" Fang Rui felt her story was full of holes.","\"I...\"","Captain Li didn't want to hear Liu Yaying lie anymore, he interrupted her defense, \"Miss Liu, intimidating others with a cursed doll is also against the law. We need to detain you first.\"","\"Can you not tell Momo about this...\" Liu Yaying looked at them pitifully, \"I don't want to lose Momo as a friend.\"","\"Of course not. Whether you go to jail or not depends on whether Miss Su will pursue legal action against you. We must inform her of this. Besides, if you consider Su Momo a friend, why would you do something to hurt her? Is this what friends do?\" Captain Li said angrily.","Liu Yaying's face turned even paler. She tried to defend herself but ultimately gave up.","Fang Rui conducted a DNA test between the fetal corpse and Liu Yaying, and the results showed a blood relation.","This basically confirmed that Liu Yaying had made the cursed doll.","When Su Momo heard that the person who cursed her had been found, she wrapped herself up tightly, wore sunglasses, and secretly came to the police station. Her life assistant, Qi Fang, also came with her.","\"Why is it you?\" The moment she saw Liu Yaying, Su Momo was stunned as if struck by lightning, \"Yaying, why did it have to be you? I've been so good to you, why would you do this?\"","Liu Yaying's lips quivered, her face full of struggle. She seemed to want to explain, but perhaps feeling she couldn't, she remained silent.","\"Liu Yaying, explain yourself! Give me a reason why you did this.\"","\"Momo, I have no explanation. I can't explain.\"","Su Momo's tears kept flowing, ruining her makeup.","\"Liu Yaying, tell me why you did that. Why did you curse me to commit suicide by cutting my wrists? You know my mother died by cutting her wrists, you know how much of a shock this is to me, why would you curse me like this?\"","Su Momo became increasingly hysterical, \"Liu Yaying, we were best friends, we accompanied each other through the toughest times. You took care of me when I was sick. Now that we've finally started living good lives, why did you betray me?\"","\"I didn't curse you to commit suicide, that doll was...\"","\"Enough, Liu Yaying, I've had enough of you! Let's end our friendship here. I won't pursue legal action against you this time, I'll bail you out. But you're fired, you're no longer my employee, and no longer my friend. Take care of yourself from now on.\"","\"Momo...\"","Su Momo left without looking back. Qi Fang glanced at Liu Yaying, who was also in tears, and smiled at her, \"Sister Yaying, don't worry, I'll take good care of Momo from now on.\"","\"Qi Fang, Momo's health isn't good. Remember to have her checked regularly, please take extra care of her.\"","\"I will. You don't need to worry about her anymore. Sister Yaying, you need to worry about yourself now.\"","Su Momo practically ran out, and at the corner of the corridor, she bumped into Chen Xue.","Chen Xue rubbed her sore shoulder, and when she realized who had bumped into her, her face lit up with joy, \"Are you... Su Momo?\"","Su Momo stopped crying and denied it, \"I'm not.\"","\"But... you... oh, I understand. I'm sorry, I must have mistaken you for someone else.\"","Seeing that Chen Xue was so understanding, Su Momo said, \"Give me your notebook and pen.\"","\"What?\"","\"You recognized me even though I'm all wrapped up like this, you must be a die-hard fan. You want an autograph, right? I'll sign for you.\"","\"Mian, quick, get the pen and notebook!\"","Mu Mian thought Chen Xue needed to record an autopsy for another forensic scientist. They hadn't had any cases recently and were often borrowed by other departments. When they had nothing to do, they occasionally helped the neighboring traffic police department with autopsies — of course, these were all voluntarily requested by Mu Mian. She even begged others to let her examine their corpses.","Mu Mian brought Chen Xue her autopsy record book.","Chen Xue was stunned. How could she let her favorite idol sign on this? But then she thought, why not?","\"You're female forensic scientists? That's amazing,\" Su Momo praised them after learning their profession, \"I happen to have a role where I play a forensic scientist, could you give me some pointers?\" Su Momo looked at Chen Xue, \"Little fan, let's add each other on WeChat.\"","Chen Xue nodded frantically, her hands shaking throughout the entire process of adding contacts.","\"Um, little fan, are you sure you want me to sign here?\" Su Momo looked at the notebook, somewhat hesitant.","Chen Xue nodded vigorously.","\"Alright then.\" Su Momo thought for a moment, then signed her name in the victim's name column. Su Momo's handwriting was beautiful, each stroke powerful, unlike the flamboyant signatures of other celebrities.","Mu Mian noticed a long scar on the inside of her right wrist, seemingly a knife wound. The scar was covered by her diamond watch, but it was visible when she raised her hand.","Mu Mian was surprised. Had she attempted suicide by cutting her wrists?","Chen Xue, having obtained the autograph, was overjoyed. As expected of her favorite idol, she was so unique.","Su Momo noticed Mu Mian staring at her and thought Mu Mian was also a fan, \"Would you like an autograph too?\"","Mu Mian nodded excitedly.","Just as Su Momo was about to ask Mu Mian where she wanted the signature, Mu Mian took Chen Xue's record book, flipped to a blank page, found the victim column, and quickly signed her own name.","\"...\"","Mu Mian praised her, \"This is the first time I've seen someone sign their own name in the victim column. I couldn't resist signing one too.\"","\"...I just randomly picked a spot to sign.\"","Long after Su Momo had left, Chen Xue was still standing there, clutching her autograph in a daze.","Mu Mian stood with her. Recently, there had been no corpses for Mu Mian to examine, so she was very bored. Sometimes she would join Chen Xue in doing boring and meaningless things that made Chen Xue happy, like watching \"Secrets of the Deep Sea\" together.","\"Mu Mian, what are you doing?\" Fang Rui saw the two in the corridor and asked, puzzled.","\"Fang Rui, I want to know what Chen Xue is looking at,\" Mu Mian rubbed her eyes, \"But I can't see anything. Do you know what she's looking at?\"","\"No idea.\"","It seems they've been too idle lately, to the point of developing problems.","Fang Rui reported the investigation results of the cursed doll to the bureau chief. This matter was considered satisfactorily resolved. However, the chief was still uneasy and assigned Captain Li and Fang Rui to protect Su Momo until she finished filming that promotional video.","\"Fang Rui, you look quite displeased with my arrangement!\"","Captain Li tried to ease the tension: \"Fang Rui, this task is too simple. We just need to follow her around. It's not like anyone's going to assassinate her.\"","The bureau chief and Fang Rui simultaneously turned to look at Captain Li.","\"What's wrong?\"","\"Nothing. Let's just hope your jinxing words don't come true this time.\""]},{"number":95,"title":"Chapter 95: The Vanished: A Murder Case Without a Corpse","paragraphs":["Fang Rui and Captain Li had been following Su Momo on set for three days, and finally, the promotional video was finished, marking the end of their bodyguard duty.","Before leaving, Su Momo insisted on giving each of them a signed poster. They weren't interested in such things and were about to refuse, but Su Momo forced them to accept, threatening to complain to the Director if they didn't.","\"Officers, I am a big star after all. You don't have to be so disrespectful,\" she said.","Fang Rui initially wanted to throw it away but felt it would be disrespectful. He decided to take it back, thinking he could use it to cover a patch of peeling paint on the wall in the forensics office, adding a touch of decoration.","Back at the station, Mu Mian approached Fang Rui and sniffed him carefully. \"No smell of blood. But there's a faint scent of perfume. I've smelled this on Chen Xue's idol before. Fang Rui, is your case related to her?\"","Fang Rui sniffed his own clothes but couldn't smell any perfume. He had no idea how Mu Mian could detect it. He figured it must have rubbed off on him from being on set for so long.","\"Yes, you're right, but that case is over now. We caught the person who made the curse doll,\" Fang Rui said, handing the poster to Mu Mian. \"Doesn't Chen Xue like Su Momo? Why don't you give her this autograph?\"","\"Your gift is too late. Chen Xue already has her autograph,\" Mu Mian said, taking the poster and glancing at it. She still thought the signature in her autopsy record book looked better.","\"...\" So, did Su Momo give out autographs to everyone she met?","\"Fang Rui, you shouldn't keep secrets from me next time. See, I always find out in the end,\" Mu Mian said smugly. \"Your ability to keep secrets is a bit lacking.\"","\"The Director insisted I keep it confidential. I don't even know why it needed to be a secret,\" Fang Rui noticed Mu Mian's heavy dark circles and asked, \"Mu Mian, there haven't been any cases lately. Why are you still staying up late? You're not lying awake thinking about corpses, are you?\"","\"That was a few days ago. I'm not thinking about corpses now. I've been studying the occult lately. I realized I lack common knowledge in that area and need to learn. I've read many books, but I can't understand their logic, so I've been losing sleep. You can't imagine how many strange black magic practices exist in this world, and how many people believe in them.\"","\"Any results?\" Fang Rui thought of the talisman paper. Mu Mian must have felt frustrated about not being able to decipher its secret, which sparked her interest in the subject.","\"Of course. That talisman is a type of Thai black magic, usually used with fetal mummies. It absorbs the good luck of people around it through the fetus's yin energy, allowing the user to reach peak luck in a short time.\"","Fang Rui frowned, \"You mean that doll isn't a curse doll, but instead brings good luck to its owner?\"","\"Yes. But the doll had extra needle holes and dog blood on it. Proper black magic practices don't include these things, nor do they embroider names on the dolls. It needs to be nourished with its owner's blood. After multiple tests, I detected human blood in the fabric of the doll's head. It must have been nourished for some time.\"","Fang Rui suddenly realized something. Could the person who made the doll and the one who placed it in the room be different people?","\"So, we shouldn't call it a curse doll,\" Mu Mian corrected Fang Rui.","Mu Mian gave the poster Fang Rui had given her to Chen Xue.","\"Mian Mian, this poster is a limited edition, very hard to buy, and it even has an autograph! How much did you spend on this? Mian Mian, I love you so much. I've decided to keep you company during overtime every day from now on.\"","\"Don't forget, okay? I've already recorded it,\" Mu Mian took out her bone-shaped voice recorder. She decided to hide the truth so Chen Xue would voluntarily keep her company during overtime.","Just as Fang Rui was debating whether to reinvestigate the curse doll case, his phone rang.","\"Captain Fang, we've received a report of a suspected homicide in a dressing room at Jiangzhou TV Station...\"","Fang Rui and his team immediately rushed to the crime scene.","Jiangzhou TV Station was holding its first rehearsal for the New Year's Eve concert. The station had spent a fortune inviting a large number of popular stars and veteran artists to boost ratings and advertising revenue. The entrance of the TV station was crowded with fans of various celebrities, and Fang Rui's team had to struggle a bit to squeeze through.","The waiting area and various corridors were also packed with people.","To speed up the makeup process and avoid disturbing the artists, the TV station provided independent dressing rooms for high-profile celebrities.","The entire makeup area had no surveillance cameras. The outermost area was a public makeup room where extras crowded to apply their makeup. Further in, there were several rooms side by side, assigned as dressing rooms for higher-status artists. The dressing room where the incident occurred was the innermost one.","As soon as they entered the dressing room, they were hit by a strong smell of blood.","The scene was chaotic. The makeup table had been shifted, various cosmetics were scattered on the floor, and the clothes rack had fallen over, with expensive gowns on it stained with blood.","There was a large amount of blood in the room. Near the dressing table, there was a pool of blood on the floor, with darker edges and a lighter center. There were also small splatter patterns of blood on the floor and walls.","\"Preliminary judgment suggests this is human blood,\" Mu Mian said, collecting blood samples from various parts of the blood pool, as well as from the splatter patterns on the walls and floor, planning to conduct DNA tests back at the lab.","Mu Mian searched for a long time but couldn't find a body. However, if all the blood on the floor belonged to one person, that person would be in grave danger.","\"There's at least 500-600 milliliters of blood on the floor. We must find the injured person, or they'll likely be in critical condition,\" Chen Xue said.","\"Boss, it's strange. If someone was injured, where could they have gone? If they're already dead, why did the killer remove the body? Wouldn't it be easy to get caught transporting a body in such a crowded place?\" Zhang asked, puzzled.","Zhang had voiced everyone's confusion.","The person who reported the case was Zhang Dawei, the program's director. He described how he discovered the crime scene.","\"Around 4 PM, I came to the dressing room to discuss program details with Su Momo. I knocked on the door for a long time and called Su Momo many times, but there was no answer. I called her assistant, who had gone out to buy her milk tea and didn't know the situation either.","I felt something was wrong and quickly tried to break down the door. It turned out the door wasn't locked, and I fell to the ground. My hand felt something wet, and when I looked closely, I saw a large bloodstain on the floor. So I immediately called the police.\"","Fang Rui asked, \"Is this dressing room assigned to Su Momo?\"","\"Yes. This dressing room was specifically for her use.\"","Fang Rui remembered the curse doll, which was also covered in blood. Could the killer have left that doll as a murder announcement?","If the killer intended to commit murder, where had Su Momo's body gone?","Fang Rui turned to Zhang Dawei, \"Has anyone been able to contact Su Momo?\"","\"No one can reach her. Her manager has called her many times, but the calls still don't go through. We fear she might be dead. We don't know where the killer might have hidden her body.\"","Just then, a phone rang in the room, playing a Japanese song. Fang Rui and his team followed the sound and found a phone under the leg of the makeup table.","The phone was vibrating, with the caller ID showing: \"Heartless Manager Sister Sun.\"","\"This Sister Sun is Su Momo's manager,\" Zhang Dawei said. \"This should be Su Momo's phone. I remember her phone case was also red with the words 'Get Rich' written on it, very similar to this one.\""]},{"number":96,"title":"Chapter 96: The Vanished: A Prank","paragraphs":["Fang Rui answered the phone, and the person on the other end said angrily, \"Su Momo, you finally picked up. It's just singing a song at the New Year's Eve gala, why are you hiding and not answering your phone? Can you stop being so childish? Do you remember how you became famous? Without me, you're nothing!\"","The voice on the phone belonged to Su Momo's agent, Sun Qin, who was extremely frustrated at the moment. Su Momo was at the peak of her popularity, and any negative news would undoubtedly affect her career.","\"Hello, we're the police. We suspect that Su Momo has gone missing. Please come down to assist with our investigation.\"","\"She's missing? Don't worry, she's probably just hiding to avoid performing at the event. She's done this before. She'll come back on her own in a few days.\" Sun Qin paused, then added, \"Officers, I'm sorry you've wasted a trip. I hope you can keep this confidential and not let this information leak out.\"","Fang Rui reminded her, \"We found a large amount of blood in her dressing room. I think it would be better if you came down.\"","\"Blood? What's going on? She hasn't really come to harm, has she?\"","\"We're still investigating.\"","\"I'm sorry, I'm out of town and can't get there right away. But I'm booking a flight now and will fly over as soon as possible.\"","At that moment, Su Momo's assistant Qi Fang returned with bubble tea. When she saw the blood all over the floor, the drink fell from her hands with a splat.","\"What happened?\" Qi Fang asked quietly, her lips trembling as she looked at the blood on the floor. \"Who's hurt? It's not Momo, is it?\"","Fang Rui turned to Qi Fang, \"We're not sure yet. Miss Qi, we have some questions for you.\"","Fang Rui suspected that Qi Fang might be the one who placed the cursed doll, as only three people had entered that room. If it wasn't Liu Yaying, then Qi Fang was the most suspicious.","By getting rid of Liu Yaying, Qi Fang would have a chance to be favored, otherwise she would always be overshadowed by Liu Yaying.","\"Alright, go ahead and ask,\" Qi Fang replied cooperatively.","Qi Fang was average-looking with many freckles on her face, but she had a pleasant voice and seemed very gentle.","\"What time did you arrive at this dressing room?\"","\"A little after three. We were worried about traffic, so we left half an hour early, but there was no traffic jam, so we arrived more than an hour ahead of schedule. The makeup artist we booked wasn't due until 4:30, so Momo was bored and asked me to go out and buy her some bubble tea.","I could have come back quickly, but then I received a message from Momo. She asked me to go to I-PINK to buy her a brownie. That store is far from the TV station, so I had to take a taxi there.\"","\"What time did you receive the message?\"","\"Just a moment, let me check the chat history,\" Qi Fang hurriedly opened her phone and looked. \"4:16 PM.\"","\"Do you know Su Momo's phone password?\"","\"Well...\" Qi Fang hesitated for a moment, \"Yes. Sometimes when Momo is filming, she asks me to keep her phone for her.\"","Qi Fang helped unlock Su Momo's phone. It had many game and video apps downloaded, and the wallpaper was an anime cartoon.","The chat history on her social media apps had been cleared, with the most recent message being from her agent at 4:45 PM.","The earliest message was around 4:31 PM, when Qi Fang sent her a photo asking if she could substitute another cake since the brownie was sold out. But Su Momo hadn't replied.","Fang Rui also checked her call log, which had also been deleted. The list only showed dozens of missed calls from Zhang Dawei, Qi Fang, and Sun Qin. The earliest missed call was at 4:35 PM.","After taking Qi Fang's statement, Fang Rui questioned people in the public dressing area if they had noticed anything unusual.","As Zhang was leaving, he accidentally stepped on the spilled bubble tea. While wiping his shoe with a tissue, he noticed the tea was ice cold.","\"Boss, that Qi Fang might be lying. The bubble tea in her hand was freezing cold. Chen Xue often drinks that brand, and it can only be made hot. The tea being so cold doesn't seem like it was just bought,\" Zhang muttered.","\"Go ask her where she bought the bubble tea and verify the information.\"","\"Got it.\"","Fang Rui questioned the performers in the public dressing area.","One dancer said, \"I'm a fan of Su Momo. I was planning to ask for her autograph, but when I got to her dressing room door, I heard people arguing inside. It sounded like Su Momo and another woman.\"","Another backup dancer added, \"That woman might have been Su Momo's former assistant Liu Yaying. I saw her go into that dressing room. At first, Su Momo didn't want to let her in, but she kept begging, so Su Momo let her in.\"","Fang Rui asked, \"Are you sure the person you saw was Su Momo?\"","Fang Rui suspected this might be a prank. Su Momo might have deliberately set up this scene to confuse everyone and make them think she had been harmed. The motive could be to scare her agent or to avoid performing at the New Year's Eve gala.","\"Of course it was. I'm Su Momo's die-hard fan. Even if she was in disguise, I'd recognize her. I couldn't possibly be mistaken.\"","\"Around what time did Liu Yaying go in?\"","\"Close to 4 PM, because it was almost our turn to go on stage. We started rehearsing at 4:05 PM.\"","An assistant from the dressing room next to Su Momo's said, \"When I first arrived, I saw a man lurking suspiciously outside Su Momo's dressing room. As soon as I approached, he slipped away. I didn't get a clear look at his face. He was wearing a black jacket and was rather short.\"","\"After Su Momo entered the dressing room, did any of you see her come out?\"","\"No, I don't think so. We didn't see her leave.\"","The police suppressed the news of Su Momo's disappearance, but with so many people at the scene, many backup dancers and extras learned about it. Various rumors immediately spread like wildfire online.","#SuMomoMysterious Death#","#SuMomoMissing#","#SuMomoMurderedByAssistant,BodyVanished#","#SuMomoFilmWorksMontage#","Several hashtags quickly topped the trending list, and several major media platforms focusing on celebrity gossip crashed.","Some netizens speculated that Su Momo had committed suicide due to work pressure and frequent cyberbullying by anti-fans. Others guessed that she had been killed by her unscrupulous agent, who had also seized all her assets. Even more outlandishly, some said Su Momo wasn't dead at all, but had faked her death to escape her company's control...","The current focus of the investigation was to first determine whose blood it was. Could the injured person be Su Momo?","Mu Mian and Chen Xue went to Su Momo's room to collect DNA samples.","Chen Xue felt very heavy-hearted. Just the day before, she had been chatting with her idol, and now Su Momo's fate was unknown.","\"Mian, do you think Su Momo is already dead?\" Chen Xue sighed.","\"If that blood belongs to Su Momo and was shed in a short period of time, then she's most likely dead,\" Mu Mian said, then realizing she might have been too blunt, added comfortingly, \"Chen Xue, everyone dies eventually. Don't be too sad. You can find another celebrity to follow.\"","\"If Captain Fang's corpse disappeared, would you find another corpse to like?\" Chen Xue suddenly realized that since being kidnapped, Mu Mian had never mentioned the word \"corpse\" again."]},{"number":97,"title":"Chapter 97: The Vanished Her: Good Person","paragraphs":["\"Chen Xue, don't say such unlucky things! Fang Rui won't be gone, I can protect him. Besides, I couldn't find a more perfect corpse than him, he's already the most perfect,\" Mu Mian said.","Chen Xue thought that Fang Rui and Mu Mian's relationship had made significant progress, but judging from Mu Mian's attitude, she didn't seem to have noticed this change in herself.","Chen Xue said, \"Mian Mian, I won't like any other celebrities either.\"","Mu Mian seemed to understand the irreplaceability of Su Momo as an idol for Chen Xue.","Su Momo's room had many traces of her life. There was fallen hair on the bed, which, judging from the color and texture, should be hers; there was also hair on the comb; minute oral epithelial tissue was detected on the toothbrush; and there were cut fingernails in the trash can. Mu Mian collected all of these as samples for DNA testing.","The police also notified Su Momo's father, informing him that Su Momo was missing. At first, Su's Father appeared very indifferent, saying that Su Momo's life or death had nothing to do with him. Later, when he learned that DNA testing was required and that Su Momo might already be dead, he immediately changed his tune, saying he would definitely cooperate with the police's work.","\"Officers, you must find my daughter's body as soon as possible!\" Su's Father choked out a few dry sobs, but his voice was still full of vigor and devoid of emotion. \"My poor daughter, I want her to rest in peace quickly. Officers, you must notify me immediately if you have any news.\"","Fang Rui corrected him, \"Mr. Su, we haven't confirmed whether your daughter is dead or not yet.\"","\"In any case, you must notify me first if there's any news! By the way, how will my daughter's assets be handled? I'm her biological father, I have the right to dispose of her inheritance, right? That manager of hers is very bad and extremely cunning, she hurt me terribly before. I'm worried she might swindle away all of my daughter's inheritance...\"","Fang Rui was speechless. Su Momo's father didn't care about his daughter's life at all, only her property.","He specifically investigated Su Momo's father. When Su Momo was in high school, Su's Father had absconded with the family's wealth and eloped with his mistress. Su Momo's mother couldn't handle the shock, developed mental problems, and soon after committed suicide by slitting her wrists at home.","After Su Momo became famous, Su's Father shamelessly came back asking for money. When he didn't get it, he threatened to spread rumors and smear Su Momo as unfilial. Later, it was Su Momo's manager who used tough measures to warn Su's Father, and he never dared to trouble Su Momo again.","Fang Rui somewhat regretted contacting Su's Father. If something really happened to Su Momo, letting such a scumbag get the inheritance would be too infuriating.","Fang Rui quickly found out that his worry was unnecessary. Su Momo's lawyer said she had made a will. 60% of her estate would be donated to charity organizations, 20% would be given to Liu Yaying, 10% would be given to her manager Sun Qin's daughter Sun Miaomiao, and the remaining 10% would be set up as a fund to regularly send money to the rural schools she had been supporting.","Even though Su Momo had fallen out with Liu Yaying, she still hadn't told her lawyer to modify the will.","Fang Rui asked Li to retrieve the surveillance footage from near the crime scene.","To protect privacy and prevent unauthorized filming, there were no cameras installed in the entire makeup area. However, there was a camera installed at the entrance of the makeup area - a long corridor.","The camera faced the corridor entrance, and anyone entering this corridor would have their face captured by the camera.","Fang Rui and his team obtained the surveillance footage from the day of the incident.","The footage showed that around 3:21 PM, a woman who was wrapped up tightly and suspected to be Su Momo appeared in the frame. She was accompanied by Qi Fang and two bodyguards wearing black jackets.","The woman was wearing a gray coat, a mask, and a baseball cap, with her eyes hidden behind large sunglasses. If you only looked at her face, it was hard to tell who this person was.","So Fang Rui asked Su Momo's manager and assistant to help identify her.","\"This is Momo,\" Su Momo's manager Sun Qin said confidently. \"This coat is a limited edition from V brand, and in China, only Momo, as the brand ambassador, has this coat. The appearance and figure are very similar. And look at her wrist, that diamond watch is Momo's favorite watch. Unless she's filming, she never takes it off.\"","Qi Fang also agreed: \"Sister Momo was wearing these clothes when she went out. And there's me and two bodyguards beside her, it must be her in the surveillance footage.\"","The surveillance showed Su Momo entering the makeup area, but it didn't capture her leaving.","This meant that Su Momo was either still in the makeup area, or had already been taken out by the killer in some way.","Fang Rui led a team to conduct a thorough search of the entire makeup area, but they didn't find Su Momo or any suspicious traces.","Logically, an injured person moving around would inevitably leave traces.","It would also be difficult for the killer to move a corpse out without attracting attention from others.","The next afternoon, the DNA test results came out.","\"The blood found at the scene belongs to the same person, and it's highly likely to be Su Momo's,\" Mu Mian said.","The samples found from Su Momo's home belonged to the same person, and those samples matched the blood samples collected from the scene, belonging to the same person. Moreover, Su Momo's father's DNA sample also matched the blood samples collected from the scene, showing a parent-child relationship. These could prove that the blood at the scene was very likely Su Momo's.","Mu Mian continued: \"Based on the analysis of the blood pool area and blood viscosity, there was about 800-900 milliliters of blood at the scene.\"","\"This amount of blood loss is definitely life-threatening. It's been a day now, if Su Momo didn't receive treatment, she should be dead by now,\" Chen Xue analyzed, her expression a bit sad. \"But where could Su Momo's body be? Why would the killer go to such lengths to hide the body?\"","Mu Mian reconstructed the crime scene situation on the whiteboard:","A person was lying flat on the ground, both of her wrists were cut, and blood flowed out forming a pool.","Mu Mian reported: \"Based on the blood situation at the scene, she was lying flat on the ground, the arteries on both wrists were cut open, and blood flowed out from the wounds on both hands.\"","Looking at Mu Mian's drawing, Fang Rui suddenly remembered that cursed doll. That cursed doll was also covered in blood, with a scar on each wrist.","\"Fang Rui, doesn't this way of dying seem a bit similar to that doll?\" Mu Mian reminded.","Everyone looked at Fang Rui and Mu Mian. Chen Xue asked curiously, \"What doll?\"","The matter of Su Momo definitely couldn't be kept secret anymore, so Fang Rui decided to tell everyone: \"Previously, someone placed a cursed doll covered in dog blood on Su Momo's bed. The chief thought she might be in danger, so he sent Captain Li and me to investigate.\""]},{"number":98,"title":"Chapter 98: The Vanishing Her: The Scumbag","paragraphs":["Mu Mian clicked on the screen, opening a folder filled with photos of that rag doll. She opened one of them, and when everyone saw it, they all gasped.","The doll looked almost identical to Su Momo, with black and red bloodstains making it look eerie and terrifying. It was laid flat on the ground, very similar to the corpse Mu Mian had drawn.","Zhang analyzed, \"So did the killer murder based on this cursed doll? Or did they leave the cursed doll as a death notice, telling us that they would kill in this manner?\"","Fang Rui said, \"Captain Li and I had already found the person who made this doll. She's Su Momo's assistant, Liu Yaying. But Mu Mian and I have uncovered some new leads, and we suspect that someone else placed the doll there.\"","\"But Liu Yaying also went to that makeup room yesterday afternoon. Could it be such a coincidence? What was she doing there?\"","Fang Rui decided to bring Liu Yaying in for questioning. However, they discovered that Liu Yaying had also disappeared. Her phone was unreachable, no one was at her home, and all her social media accounts were unresponsive.","The makeup area's surveillance footage showed her leaving at 4:15 PM yesterday. From her back view, she didn't seem to be in good spirits, keeping her head down the entire time and occasionally wiping tears with her hand.","Concerned for her safety, Fang Rui asked Old Zhang and his team to investigate Liu Yaying's whereabouts.","The most important task now was to find Su Momo or her body.","Mu Mian found it strange that the killer tried to stage the crime scene as a wrist-cutting suicide, yet hid Su Momo's body. These two actions seemed very contradictory. Mu Mian couldn't figure out the killer's motive for doing this.","The technical department recovered Su Momo's deleted chat history.","\"Boss, why didn't the killer just take the phone away and destroy it? Doesn't the killer know that deleted messages can be recovered?\" Li thought this killer wasn't very smart.","Fang Rui had the same question. He even suspected that the killer intentionally left the phone behind, wanting them to investigate certain information.","Fang Rui looked through Su Momo's phone and found that she frequently chatted with someone saved as \"Egg Melon Kid.\"","From the chat content, it appeared they were a couple of over three years who were recently breaking up. The reason was that the man was cheating with several women simultaneously. Su Momo had even threatened him, saying she had evidence of his infidelity and wanted to expose him, ruining his reputation.","The man initially begged her not to expose him, but later he started threatening Su Momo, saying if she dared to expose him, she wouldn't have a good time either.","The technical department also recovered a large number of photos and a deleted audio recording.","The photos were of Su Momo and a man together. They looked very intimate. This person was likely Su Momo's boyfriend.","The content of the audio recording was as follows:","[Su Momo: Liang Guangyu, what exactly is your relationship with Li Yushan? Why did she come to our home and sleep in our bed? Don't you even have money for a hotel room?","Liang Guangyu: Momo baby, I'm sorry, I, I was drunk that day, I don't know what happened.","Su Momo: Shut up, don't call me that anymore, it makes me sick. What about that model? Was she also someone you brought back when you were drunk? You like drinking so much, why haven't you drunk yourself to death!","Liang Guangyu: Momo baby, I love you, I love you so, so much. What would you do if I drank myself to death? I don't like those women, I was just playing around with them. You're too busy, you don't have time to accompany me. I was just too lonely, that's why I made mistakes. I just made the mistake that all men in the world would make.","Su Momo: Get lost! If you cheated, just admit it like a man. Don't try to blame it on me, you're so impressive. To be honest, I don't care much about your cheating, I've wanted to dump a useless scumbag like you for a long time. But you actually slept with Liu Yaying, if I wasn't curious about why Liu Yaying wanted to curse me, I wouldn't even have known about this. You two, a scumbag man and a cheap woman, I must have been blind to be so good to you both.","Liang Guangyu, I already have all the evidence of your cheating, just you wait, I'm going to ruin your reputation.","Liang Guangyu: Momo baby, don't be so impulsive! Please forgive me. Don't expose me, what about my career? What about your career? We'll both suffer reputation damage.","Liang Guangyu: Su Momo, if you dare to expose me, I'll drag you down with me! If you push me too far, I'm capable of anything!","Liang Guangyu: Su Momo, you can't afford to mess with my management company, you'd better keep your mouth shut!]","After listening to the recording, Zhang said, \"This Liang Guangyu used to be a top celebrity. He and Su Momo once starred in a popular xianxia drama together, and many people shipped them as a couple. Who would have thought they actually got together? And even more surprising that Liang Guangyu turned out to be such a scumbag.\"","Li said, \"This Liang Guangyu also cheated with Liu Yaying. What's going on, why is Liu Yaying involved again?\"","They then looked through Su Momo's chat history with Liu Yaying.","Two days before Su Momo's disappearance, she suddenly sent Liu Yaying this message:","Su Momo: Liu Yaying, you're something else, you've really done it! You could sleep with anyone, but you had to sleep with Liang Guangyu. You knew how much I loved him, yet you did this to me. I've been so good to you both, and this is how you repay me?","Liu Yaying replied: Momo, he didn't just sleep with me, you know. That bed in your house has seen plenty of other women. That's what you get for falling in love with such a scumbag!","Then Liu Yaying sent Su Momo many photos. The photos were very clear, mostly bedroom shots of Liang Guangyu with different women.","She also sent Su Momo screenshots of some chat records, showing that Liang Guangyu not only hired escorts but also flirted with underage fans.","If these pieces of evidence were exposed, Liang Guangyu's entertainment career would likely be over.","Zhang analyzed, \"Liang Guangyu also went to Jiangzhou TV Station for rehearsal that day. Could this case be related to him? Did he do it together with Liu Yaying?\"","Fang Rui decided to find Liang Guangyu to understand the situation.","Liang Guangyu was still in Jiangzhou City for the New Year's Eve gala recording and was staying at the Jiangzhou International Hotel. His room number was 603, on the same floor as Su Momo.","Fang Rui had already explained the situation to his manager in advance. His manager was initially uncooperative and refused to communicate, but quickly changed her tune after learning that Fang Rui and his team had obtained a large amount of evidence of Liang Guangyu's infidelity.","\"Please come directly to the hotel for the record. Guangyu's identity is quite special, going to a place like the police station would cause controversy. Please be accommodating and come to the hotel, we promise to cooperate with your investigation.\"","As soon as Fang Rui arrived at the hotel, the hotel manager from last time was already waiting for them at the entrance.","\"Originally, Mr. Liang was staying on the 8th floor, but we found a fly in his room, so we changed his room to the 6th floor at his request,\" the hotel manager said, trying to ease the tense atmosphere with small talk.","\"When did he change rooms?\"","\"Six days ago, the same day the scary doll was found in Su Momo's room. Our hotel was particularly unlucky that day, suddenly receiving complaints from two VIP guests.\""]},{"number":99,"title":"Chapter 99: Her Disappearance: The Fermentation of Public Opinion","paragraphs":["When they arrived at room 603, Liang Guangyu's agent Li Hui quickly ushered them in.","Liang Guangyu was pacing restlessly around the room. Upon seeing Fang Rui and his team, he immediately said, \"Officers, you absolutely must not release those photos to the public! You have to keep this confidential for me, otherwise my lawyer will sue you for defamation.\"","\"Liang Guangyu, shut up!\" Li Hui was about to cry from this man's stupidity. The police had so much evidence, and he still wanted to sue them for defamation? Was he trying to get the police to expose all his dirty laundry? Liang Guangyu's brain seemed to have been squeezed by a door, as dull as a pig. If it weren't for his handsome face, she would have stopped representing him long ago.","\"Mr. Liang, what is your relationship with Su Momo?\"","\"Just friends...\" Seeing Fang Rui frown, Liang Guangyu quickly confessed, \"No, she's my ex-girlfriend. We dated for two or three years, but she suddenly broke up with me a couple of days ago.\"","Liang Guangyu irritably ran his fingers through his hair. \"Officers, haven't you already figured everything out? Is there really a need to keep asking?\"","\"What is your relationship with Liu Yaying?\"","\"You mean Su Momo's assistant? I just slept with her once, but she kept pestering me and even tried to force me to break up with Momo. She's mentally unstable, there's something wrong with her head.\"","\"Where were you yesterday between 4 and 5 PM?\"","\"I was in the makeup room. My makeup artist and assistant can confirm that. I have nothing to do with Momo's death. I didn't kill her.\"","Zhang retorted, \"We never said Su Momo was dead.\"","\"But with all that blood on the ground, how could she not be dead?\" Upon hearing the news of Su Momo's death, Liang Guangyu breathed a sigh of relief, but Li Hui poured cold water on him. If Su Momo was really dead, once the police investigated, their secrets would be exposed instead. Liang Guangyu instantly became as startled as a frightened bird.","Zhang reminded him, \"Mr. Liang, we've found that you may be involved in prostitution. My colleagues will contact you later, and we hope you'll honestly confess to your crimes.\"","Prostitution was a matter for the vice squad next door, so Fang Rui had already transferred the evidence to his colleagues.","Liang Guangyu's face instantly turned ashen. Li Hui also realized that Liang Guangyu probably couldn't be saved.","After questioning Liang Guangyu, Fang Rui and Zhang left. When they reached the hotel lobby, they found the entrance crowded with reporters. The hotel security was trying hard to maintain order, but many reporters were still pushing in with their cameras.","\"Is Liang Guangyu staying at this hotel?\"","\"Is he really with Su Momo?\"","\"Is Su Momo's disappearance related to him?\"","Although Liang Guangyu himself wasn't present, the reporters were still pestering the hotel staff for information.","Fang Rui frowned. How did the reporters know about Liang Guangyu and Su Momo's relationship? He opened his phone and received a notification:","According to inside sources from the police, Su Momo's disappearance is suspected to be related to Liang Guangyu. Su Momo had been dating Liang Guangyu for three years, but Liang Guangyu had cheated on her multiple times and was also suspected of hooking up and flirting with female fans...","The article also included photos of Liang Guangyu's infidelity.","Fang Rui found that Liang Guangyu was dominating the trending topics on various platforms:","#Yu-Mo CP is actually real#","#Yu-Mo CP video compilation#","#Liang Guangyu Su Momo audio recording#","#Momo baby I'm sorry#","#Liang Guangyu juggling multiple women#","#Liang Guangyu the big player#","Multiple trending topics about Liang Guangyu quickly dominated the charts. At first, Liang Guangyu's company hired a large number of internet trolls to try to suppress the negative news with dating rumors, and his fans also tried hard to clean up the comment sections. It worked well initially. However, due to the high interest in Su Momo's disappearance, curious onlookers quickly pushed #Liang Guangyu scumbag# to the top of the trending list.","Most netizens believed that Su Momo's disappearance must be related to Liang Guangyu. They thought it was very likely that Liang Guangyu had killed her to cover up his misdeeds.","Fang Rui looked at Zhang.","Zhang immediately denied it, \"Boss, it wasn't me who leaked it. Although Chen Xue is Su Momo's fan and she hates Liang Guangyu, we still separate our personal and professional lives. We would never leak case details to the public.\"","\"I didn't say it was you. I'm asking you to investigate and see where the information source came from. You're better at investigating gossip news.\"","\"Then don't look at me like you're interrogating a suspect.\" Zhang felt very wronged.","Fang Rui felt that this situation wasn't so simple. Although the news about Liang Guangyu was explosive, talent agencies usually monitor their artists' public opinion. If it was a small-scale exposure, Liang Guangyu's company would definitely be able to control the narrative. But for this situation to escalate so quickly, there must be someone pulling strings behind the scenes.","As public opinion fermented, Liang Guangyu became a scumbag reviled by thousands.","Dozens of Liang Guangyu's female fans gathered at the police station entrance with signs, making a big fuss. They claimed the police were irresponsible and had released false information, damaging their brother's reputation. They demanded that the case officers come out and make a statement to clear their brother's name.","The chief ordered people to disperse the fans. But they were a group of young girls who were very emotional, and not only were they not dispersed, but the people sent to disperse them were scratched.","\"The police officer who leaked the information must be fired! We want to file a complaint against the police for unfair law enforcement.\"","\"The public security organs should keep the investigation process strictly confidential. Why was evidence from the investigation leaked? We must be given an explanation.\"","\"Please have the relevant personnel clarify the rumors for Liang Guangyu and restore his innocence.\"","Mu Mian went out to pick up a package and saw the large-scale protest at the entrance.","She found it a bit noisy and thought about getting the package later, but the package contained her favorite medical journal.","Mu Mian ultimately couldn't resist the temptation.","She carefully tried to avoid them, planning to slip through the edge of the crowd and the gap in the iron gate.","But then someone said something, and the crowd became agitated. A girl pushed forward forcefully, and Mu Mian lost her balance, hitting her head on the iron gate.","Fresh blood slowly trickled down Mu Mian's forehead.","Mu Mian was very angry. She said to the girl, \"You pushed me. You need to apologize.\"","The girl saw Mu Mian's appearance and was startled. Blood kept flowing from Mu Mian's wound, and her face was covered in blood.","\"You... you...\"","Others who saw Mu Mian in this state were also shocked and started to leave. After all, shouting a few words at the police station entrance was nothing, as the law doesn't punish the masses, but if someone died, they could go to jail.","The blood flowed into Mu Mian's mouth. It tasted salty, and only then did she realize she had a wound on her head.","It hurt a little.","Fang Rui had just returned from outside and saw Mu Mian standing at the entrance, her face covered in blood.","\"Mu Mian, who hurt you like this?\" Fang Rui quickly ran to Mu Mian's side. \"Are you okay? Why is there so much blood?\"","\"I'm fine, the wound isn't serious, it's just a scrape. But I have a blood clotting disorder, so it takes longer to stop bleeding.\" Mu Mian's expression was very calm. She pressed a tissue to her wound and was about to go back to put on a band-aid.","Fang Rui picked up Mu Mian. \"We're going to the hospital.\"","Mu Mian protested, \"Fang Rui, I'm really fine. I don't want to go to the hospital. The wound is so small, I can treat it myself.\"","The hospital was nearby, and Fang Rui ignored Mu Mian's protests, carrying her towards the hospital.","\"Fang Rui, I don't want to go to the hospital. Look, the wound is already clotting.\"","\"Fang Rui, are you deaf? Can't you hear me talking?\"","\"Fang Rui, I'm afraid of heights. Don't carry me so high.\"","Fang Rui finally reacted and adjusted his hold on her.","Mu Mian finally realized that Fang Rui was angry. But she didn't know why he was angry. She was the one who got hurt, shouldn't she be the one who's angry?","Zhang anxiously followed behind Fang Rui, thinking Mu Mian was seriously injured.","\"Officer Zhang, could you please help me pick up my package? I'll send you the pickup code. Please bring my journal to the hospital, otherwise I'll be very bored.\"","\"...Alright.\" Zhang breathed a sigh of relief. If Mu Mian still had the energy to read journals, her injury probably wasn't too serious."]},{"number":100,"title":"Chapter 100: The Vanishing Her: A New Suicide","paragraphs":["The nurse cleaned Mu Mian's wound and found it was very small, just a minor abrasion. She glanced at the sweating Fang Rui, feeling a bit exasperated. Was it necessary to be so anxious over such a minor injury?","\"Can I choose a SpongeBob bandage?\" Mu Mian asked with a frown.","\"No, only the pediatric department has cartoon bandages.\"","\"Fine. You should offer more choices. This white bandage is depressing.\"","\"We'll take that into consideration. But no patient comes to the ER just to get a bandage.\"","\"Nurse, is that all you're going to do for her?\" Fang Rui looked at the bandage disapprovingly. \"She's badly hurt, and you're just putting on a bandage?\"","\"What else? It's just a small scratch. If her blood clotting wasn't slightly impaired, causing slower healing, this wound would have healed on its own without needing a bandage.\"","Mu Mian paused while flipping through a medical journal, nodding in agreement. She quietly complained to the nurse, \"That's what I said too, but Fang Rui wouldn't believe me. He really lacks basic medical knowledge.\"","The nurse couldn't help but smile, \"It's because your boyfriend cares about you so much. He's afraid something might happen to you.\"","Mu Mian, focused on the journal, forgot to correct the nurse's assumption. She was at an interesting part and couldn't multitask.","The nurse turned to Fang Rui and asked, \"How did your girlfriend get injured?\"","Fang Rui was busy searching \"Can minor bumps cause concussions?\" and didn't respond to the nurse.","Zhang, who was standing nearby, explained, \"Liang Guangyu's fans were causing trouble at our door and bumped into her.\"","The nurse became angry upon hearing this. \"That scumbag Liang Guangyu is bad enough, but his fans are just as disgusting. Su Momo is such a kind girl, how did she end up with such a jerk? I hope she wasn't really kidnapped by that scumbag Liang Guangyu. I hope the police find her soon.\"","Zhang excitedly asked, \"Are you a fan of Su Momo too?\"","\"Yes, I absolutely adore Su Momo. Her career is so inspiring. Can you imagine, before she became famous, she worked as an extra for three years, even playing corpses? When she was broke, she lived in a crowded room in an urban village.","She's actually from our Jiangzhou City, but her father ran off with the family's money, leaving her mother with a huge debt. At such a young age, she had to pay off debts, yet she still pursued her dream of being an actress...","Finally, she got a leading role and became famous overnight. Even after becoming famous, she remained dedicated to her craft and did a lot of charity work. She's very down-to-earth... I saw her at the hospital not long ago, but unfortunately didn't get her autograph. A nurse from another department did though...\"","\"Su Momo really has had it tough!\" Zhang exclaimed.","\"Yes, I'm surprised she has male fans too.\"","\"I'm not her fan, my girlfriend is. She loves Su Momo.\"","\"Your girlfriend has great taste.\"","\"Of course, that's why she's with me.\"","\"...\"","Fang Rui realized that Su Momo's fans seemed to be everywhere. Was she really that famous?","Fang Rui asked, \"Did Su Momo come to the hospital for treatment?\"","\"I think so, but I'm not sure what for exactly.\"","\"Which department did she go to?\"","\"I believe it was Endocrinology.\"","Fang Rui signaled Zhang to go find out exactly what illness Su Momo had.","Still worried about Mu Mian's injury, Fang Rui called for Dr. Li, the best neurosurgeon in the hospital and his uncle. Dr. Li was doing rounds and would need some time to arrive.","While waiting for Dr. Li, Fang Rui discussed the case with Mu Mian, \"Mu Mian, do you think Su Momo might still be alive?\"","\"Anything is possible until we find a body! We only found blood at the scene. If someone had received a bone marrow transplant from Su Momo, their blood DNA could match hers; or if someone collected small amounts of her blood daily and saved it up... Even people who lose over 1000cc of blood can survive for 12 hours without treatment if they're lucky.\" Mu Mian proposed several possibilities.","\"We can rule out that last possibility. The person who lost 1000cc of blood had drunk a large amount of water beforehand, diluting their blood. The blood found at the crime scene wasn't diluted,\" Mu Mian added.","\"So Su Momo might have faked her death?\" Fang Rui analyzed, \"Her purpose might be to get revenge on her ex-boyfriend, to ruin his reputation.\"","Mu Mian questioned, \"But couldn't she just expose her ex-boyfriend directly to ruin his reputation?\"","Fang Rui thought Mu Mian had a point. With Su Momo's popularity, if she exposed him online, even Liang Guangyu's powerful agency couldn't suppress the news.","So why did Su Momo or her body disappear? Where could she be?","They waited a while before Dr. Li arrived. He was in his fifties with thick, fluffy hair reminiscent of Einstein. He smiled kindly at Mu Mian.","Dr. Li turned to Fang Rui, \"Fang Rui, your mother told me all about your girlfr-\"","Fang Rui interrupted him, \"Dr. Li, please examine her wound quickly.\"","Dr. Li glared at Fang Rui, \"What's with calling me Dr. Li? Can't even greet your uncle properly? You're being ridiculous!\"","\"It's common sense to use professional titles at work,\" Mu Mian whispered.","\"...\"","Dr. Li carefully examined Mu Mian's wound, \"Fang Rui, you can take her home now.\"","\"Doesn't she need a brain CT and MRI?\"","\"No need.\"","\"Let's do them anyway,\" Fang Rui insisted.","\"Fang Rui, who's the doctor here, you or me? I've been doing this for years. Can't I even assess an injury properly?\" Dr. Li felt irritated at having his professional ability questioned.","Fang Rui finally relaxed. He asked the nurse for some medicine and bandages, and re-dressed Mu Mian's wound himself.","Mu Mian touched the thick bandage on her head and complained, \"Fang Rui, this bandage makes me look stupid.\"","\"You bumped into a door while picking up a package. Aren't you already stupid?\"","\"I object! That just proves I'm unlucky. This year has been terrible. I keep getting caught by criminals, and now I've hit my head.\"","\"...You are quite unlucky.\"","Mu Mian was soon discharged. Zhang had gathered information and was waiting for them at the hospital entrance.","\"Captain Fang, Su Momo did come to the hospital. She had some severe endocrine disorders causing skin inflammation. She was supposed to be hospitalized, but she didn't have time, so the doctor just prescribed some medication,\" Zhang paused, \"But she still needs to do blood tests every few days. Her assistant, Qi Fang, brings the blood samples.\"","Zhang speculated, \"Boss, could Qi Fang have secretly collected Su Momo's blood and poured it at the crime scene to fake her death?\"","\"If that's the case, couldn't Mu Mian detect it?\" Fang Rui looked at Mu Mian.","Mu Mian sighed, \"If they just poured blood on the ground, we'd definitely spot the discrepancy. But if the perpetrator mimicked the blood flow pattern of a suicide, it would be much harder to distinguish. The blood spatter at the crime scene is consistent with what we'd expect from a wrist-cutting suicide.\"","Mu Mian remembered the scars on Su Momo's wrists. She didn't seem like someone who would commit suicide. Why would she cut her wrists?","When they returned to the station, Mu Mian heard a rumor.","\"Did you hear? Forensic Mu deliberately hit her head on the door to drive away those protesting fans. Her face was covered in blood.\"","\"Was it real blood? Not fake?\"","\"Of course it was real! Why else would Captain Fang rush her to the hospital so anxiously?\"","\"Not necessarily. Last time when Forensic Mu choked on water, Captain Fang was just as panicked...\"","Mu Mian wanted to clarify that she had just lost her balance and hit the door, not deliberately hurt herself to drive people away.","Fang Rui stopped her, \"Mu Mian, I think it's better if you don't clarify.\"","\"Why not?\"","\"Because the truth makes you look more foolish than the rumors they've made up.\"","\"...\"","Since they had discovered that Su Momo might have faked her death, finding out how she left the makeup area became crucial.","Fang Rui remembered that one of the backup dancers had mentioned that Liu Yaying had visited the makeup room around 4 o'clock. Liu Yaying would certainly know whether the person in the makeup room at that time was Su Momo or not.","But Liu Yaying had disappeared. Just as Fang Rui was about to call Old Zhang and his team to ask if they had found Liu Yaying, Old Zhang called him.","\"Chief Fang, we've found Liu Yaying. She's in a rented apartment. She attempted suicide by slitting her wrists and lost a lot of blood, but she's still alive. We're about to take her to the hospital for emergency treatment.\""]}]);
